e. Customizable, multilingual, production-ready."},"features":{"zh":["自动学习和语义搜索","支持Slack集成和A2A API","多语言支持","自定义功能","生产就绪","基于Anthropic Claude、Go和pgvector构建"],"ja":["自動学習とセマンティック検索","Slackとの統合とA2A APIをサポート","多言語対応","カスタマイズが可能","本番環境対応","Anthropic Claude、Go、pgvectorを使用して構築"],"ko":["자동 학습 및 의미 검색","Slack 통합 및 A2A API 지원","다국어 지원","커스텀 기능","생산 준비","Anthropic Claude, Go, pgvector로 구축"],"es":["Búsqueda semántica y autoaprendizaje","Integración con Slack y API A2A","Personalizable y multilingüe","Listo para producción","Captura de conocimiento institucional"],"fr":["Recherche sémantique et auto-apprentissage","Intégration avec Slack et API A2A","Personnalisable et multilingue","Prêt pour la production","Capture des connaissances institutionnelles"],"de":["Semantische Suche und Auto-Lernen","Integration mit Slack und A2A-API","Anpassbar und mehrsprachig","Produktionsbereit","Erfassung von institutionellem Wissen"],"pt":["Auto-aprendizado e busca semântica","Integração com Slack ou API A2A","Construído com Anthropic Claude, Go e pgvector","Captura automática de conhecimento institucional","Personalizável e multilíngue"],"ru":["Автономное обучение и семантический поиск","Интеграция с Slack или API A2A","Построен на основе Anthropic Claude, Go и pgvector","Автоматическая захват корпоративных знаний","Настраиваемый и многоязычный"],"ar":["التعلم الذاتي والبحث الدلالي","التوافق مع Slack أو API A2A","مبني على Anthropic Claude و Go و pgvector","التقاط تلقائي للمعرفة المؤسسية","قابل للتعديل ومتعدد اللغات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能代理","自动化知识管理","语义搜索","Slack集成","A2A API","多语言支持","自定义功能","生产就绪","Anthropic Claude","Go","pgvector"],"ja":["AIエージェント","自動学習","セマンティック検索","Slack統合","A2A API","多言語対応","カスタマイズ","本番環境対応","Anthropic Claude","Go","pgvector"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","자동 학습","의미 검색","Slack 통합","A2A API","다국어 지원","커스텀 기능","생산 준비","Anthropic Claude","Go","pgvector"],"es":["cómo usar agentes de IA","qué es un agente de IA","alternativas a agentes de IA","agentes de IA vs herramientas de automatización","instalación de agentes de IA","guía de configuración de agentes de IA","desarrollo de agentes de IA","herramientas de IA para desarrolladores"],"fr":["comment utiliser les agents IA","qu''est-ce qu''un agent IA","alternatives aux agents IA","agents IA vs outils d''automatisation","installation des agents IA","guide de configuration des agents IA","développement des agents IA","outils de IA pour les développeurs"],"de":["wie man KI-Agents verwendet","was ist ein KI-Agent","Alternativen zu KI-Agents","KI-Agents vs Automatisierungstools","Installation von KI-Agents","Konfigurationsanleitung für KI-Agents","Entwicklung von KI-Agents","KI-Tools für Entwickler"],"pt":["como usar agente de IA","o que é agente de IA","ferramentas de agente de IA","release vs outros agentes de IA","guia de instalação do release","configuração do release"],"ru":["как использовать ИИ агент","что такое ИИ агент","инструменты ИИ агента","release vs другие ИИ агенты","руководство по установке release","настройка release"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","ما هو وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","أدوات وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","release مقابل وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي الآخرون","دليل تثبيت release","إعداد release"]}},"owner":"freepik-company","repo":"knowledge-agent","repoPath":"freepik-company/knowledge-agent","stars":5,"forks":2,"updatedAt":"2026-02-23T09:49:59Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"release","description":"Create a professional release using GitHub CLI (gh). Generate SemVer version, clear release notes, and ready-to-run command.","bodyPreview":"Act as a Release Manager + Senior Engineer with experience in professional release workflows and production repositories.\n\nYour goal is to create a release of the current repository using GitHub CLI (`gh`), in a safe, clear, and reproducible way.\n\nInput:\n- $ARGUMENTS can be:\n  - \"major\", \"minor\", or \"patch\" (SemVer)\n  - An explicit version (e.g., v1.4.2)\n  - Empty → automatically infer the correct bump\n\nProcess to follow:\n\n1) Initial validations\n- Verify the repo is a clean Git repository (no un","body":"Act as a Release Manager + Senior Engineer with experience in professional release workflows and production repositories.\n\nYour goal is to create a release of the current repository using GitHub CLI (`gh`), in a safe, clear, and reproducible way.\n\nInput:\n- $ARGUMENTS can be:\n  - \"major\", \"minor\", or \"patch\" (SemVer)\n  - An explicit version (e.g., v1.4.2)\n  - Empty → automatically infer the correct bump\n\nProcess to follow:\n\n1) Initial validations\n- Verify the repo is a clean Git repository (no uncommitted changes).\n- Check that `gh` is installed and authenticated.\n- Detect the latest existing tag (SemVer).\n- Flag if there are no previous tags or if versioning is inconsistent.\n\n2) Version determination\n- Use SemVer strictly.\n- If the argument is:\n  - major → increment MAJOR\n  - minor → increment MINOR\n  - patch → increment PATCH\n  - explicit version → validate format (vX.Y.Z)\n- If no argument:\n  - Analyze commits since the last tag:\n    - BREAKING CHANGE → major\n    - feat → minor\n    - fix / perf / refactor → patch\n- Clearly explain why you choose that version.\n\n3) Release notes generation\n- Summarize changes since the last tag.\n- Group into sections:\n  - 🚀 Features\n  - 🐛 Fixes\n  - 🛠 Refactors / Maintenance\n  - ⚠️ Breaking Changes (if applicable)\n- Use clear and technical language.\n- Avoid noise (trivial commits, formatting, etc.).\n\n4) Risk review\n- Flag:\n  - Potentially breaking changes\n  - Required migrations\n  - Flags, configs, or manual post-release steps\n- If high risks detected, warn explicitly before continuing.\n\n5) Tag and Release creation\n- Generate the exact `gh release create` command:\n  - Include tag, title, and notes\n  - Use `--draft` by default\n  - **IMPORTANT**: `gh release create` automatically creates the Git tag when executed\n- Example:\n  gh release create vX.Y.Z --title \"vX.Y.Z\" --notes \"<release notes>\" --draft\n\nDO NOT execute the command.\nDeliver the command ready to copy/paste.\n\nNote: The tag will be created automatically when the release is published (or when draft is created if using `--draft`).\n\nOutput format:\n\nA) SUMMARY\n- Last version:\n- Proposed new version:\n- Release type:\n- Risk: Low / Medium / High\n\nB) RELEASE NOTES\n<full text>\n\nC) GH COMMAND\n<exact command>\n\nD) TAG CREATION\nExplain that the tag (vX.Y.Z) will be created automatically when running the gh command above.\n\nRules:\n- Don''t publish the release automatically (use --draft).\n- Don''t invent changes: if there are doubts, indicate them.\n- Prioritize clarity and safety over speed.\n- Always explain that the Git tag will be created automatically by gh release create.\n- Include verification step: after creating draft, user should verify tag was created with `git tag -l`."},"lastSynced":"2026-02-26T08:37:37.098Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agents like AutoGPT, LangChain, or Claude Code needing automated semantic versioning and release management capabilities.","zh":"适合于像 AutoGPT、LangChain 或 Claude Code 这样的 AI Agents，它们需要自动的语义版本控制和发布管理能力。","ja":"AutoGPT、LangChain、または Claude Code のような AI エージェントに適しています。自動的なセマンティック バージョニングとリリース管理機能が必要です。","ko":"AutoGPT, LangChain 또는 Claude Code와 같은 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다. 자동화된 시맨틱 버저닝 및 릴리스 관리 기능이 필요합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA como AutoGPT, LangChain o Claude Code que necesitan capacidades de control de versiones semánticas y administración de lanzamientos automatizados.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA comme AutoGPT, LangChain ou Claude Code nécessitant des capacités de gestion de version sémantique et de publication automatisées.","de":"Ideal für KI-Agents wie AutoGPT, LangChain oder Claude Code, die automatisierte semantische Versionsverwaltung und Release-Management-Funktionen benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA como AutoGPT, LangChain, ou Claude Code que precisam de capacidades de controle de versão semântica automatizado e gerenciamento de lançamento.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, таких как AutoGPT, LangChain или Claude Code, которые требуют автоматизированных возможностей семантического управления версиями и управления выпусками.","ar":"مثالية للوكلاء الذكيين مثل AutoGPT و LangChain أو Claude Code الذين يحتاجون إلى إمكانيات إدارة الإصدارات الدلالية الآلية وإدارة الإصدار."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage releases using GitHub CLI, supporting SemVer bumping with ''major'', ''minor'', or ''patch'' versions, and integrates with tools like Slack or A2A API for multi-agent systems, leveraging technologies such as Anthropic Claude, Go, and pgvector.","zh":"赋予代理使用 GitHub CLI 管理发布的能力，支持 SemVer 的主要、次要或补丁版本，并与 Slack 或 A2A API 等工具集成，利用诸如 Anthropic Claude、Go 和 pgvector 的技术。","ja":"エージェントが GitHub CLI を使用してリリースを管理する機能を提供します。SemVer のメジャー、ミノー、またはパッチ バージョンのバンプをサポートし、Slack または A2A API などのツールと統合します。Anthropic Claude、Go、pgvector などのテクノロジーを活用します。","ko":"에이전트가 GitHub CLI를 사용하여 릴리스를 관리할 수 있는 능력을 제공하며 SemVer의 주요, 보조 또는 패치 버전을 지원하며 Slack 또는 A2A API와 같은 도구와 통합하여 Anthropic Claude, Go 및 pgvector와 같은 기술을 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar lanzamientos mediante GitHub CLI, con soporte para incrementos de SemVer con versiones ''major'', ''minor'' o ''patch'', e integra con herramientas como Slack o A2A API para sistemas de multiagentes, aprovechando tecnologías como Anthropic Claude, Go y pgvector.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer les publications à l''aide de GitHub CLI, en prenant en charge les incrémentations de SemVer avec des versions ''major'', ''minor'' ou ''patch'', et intègre des outils tels que Slack ou A2A API pour les systèmes multi-agents, en exploitant des technologies telles qu''Anthropic Claude, Go et pgvector.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, Releases mithilfe von GitHub CLI zu verwalten, mit Unterstützung für SemVer-Inkrementierungen mit ''major''-, ''minor''- oder ''patch''-Versionen und integriert mit Tools wie Slack oder A2A API für Multi-Agent-Systeme, indem es Technologien wie Anthropic Claude, Go und pgvector nutzt.","pt":"Permite que os agentes gerenciem lançamentos usando o GitHub CLI, com suporte a incremento de versão SemVer com versões ''major'', ''minor'' ou ''patch'', e integra-se com ferramentas como Slack ou A2A API para sistemas de vários agentes, aproveitando tecnologias como Anthropic Claude, Go e pgvector.","ru":"Позволяет агентам управлять выпусками с помощью GitHub CLI, поддерживая SemVer-бампинг с версиями ''major'', ''minor'' или ''patch'', и интегрируется с инструментами, такими как Slack или A2A API, для систем с несколькими агентами, используя технологии, такие как Anthropic Claude, Go и pgvector.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من إدارة الإصدارات باستخدام GitHub CLI، مع دعم زيادة إصدار SemVer بإصدارات ''major'' أو ''minor'' أو ''patch''، ويتكامل مع أدوات مثل Slack أو A2A API لنظم متعددة الوكلاء، مستفيداً من تقنيات مثل Anthropic Claude و Go و pgvector."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating release workflows with GitHub CLI","Generating version bumps based on SemVer","Integrating release management with Slack or A2A API"],"zh":["使用 GitHub CLI 自动化发布工作流","根据 SemVer 生成版本升级","将发布管理与 Slack 或 A2A API 集成"],"ja":["GitHub CLI を使用してリリース ワークフローを自動化する","SemVer に基づいてバージョン バンプを生成する","リリース管理を Slack または A2A API と統合する"],"ko":["GitHub CLI를 사용하여 릴리스 워크플ロー 자동화","SemVer를 기준으로 버전 업그레이드 생성","릴리스 관리를 Slack 또는 A2A API와 통합"],"es":["Automatizar flujos de trabajo de lanzamiento con GitHub CLI","Generar incrementos de versión en función de SemVer","Integrar la administración de lanzamientos con Slack o A2A API"],"fr":["Automatiser les flux de travail de publication avec GitHub CLI","Générer des incrémentations de version en fonction de SemVer","Intégrer la gestion de publication avec Slack ou A2A API"],"de":["Automatisierung von Release-Workflows mit GitHub CLI","Erzeugen von Versionsinkrementierungen basierend auf SemVer","Integration von Release-Management mit Slack oder A2A API"],"pt":["Automatizar fluxos de trabalho de lançamento com GitHub CLI","Gerar aumentos de versão com base em SemVer","Integrar gerenciamento de lançamento com Slack ou A2A API"],"ru":["Автоматизировать рабочие процессы выпуска с помощью GitHub CLI","Генерировать версионные бампы на основе SemVer","Интегрировать управление выпусками с Slack или A2A API"],"ar":["تأتمة تدفقات العمل الخاصة بالإصدار باستخدام GitHub CLI","توليد زيادات الإصدار على أساس SemVer","دمج إدارة الإصدار مع Slack أو A2A API"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires clean Git repository","Needs GitHub CLI installed","Limited to GitHub repositories"],"zh":["需要干净的 Git 仓库","需要安装 GitHub CLI","仅限 GitHub 仓库"],"ja":["クリーンな Git リポジトリが必要","GitHub CLI のインストールが必要","GitHub リポジトリのみ"],"ko":["깨끗한 Git 저장소 필요","GitHub CLI 설치 필요","GitHub 저장소만 해당"],"es":["Requiere un repositorio Git limpio","Necesita GitHub CLI instalado","Limitado a repositorios de GitHub"],"fr":["Nécessite un référentiel Git propre","Nécessite GitHub CLI installé","Limité aux référentiels GitHub"],"de":["Benötigt ein sauberes Git-Repository","Benötigt GitHub CLI installiert","Begrenzt auf GitHub-Repositorys"],"pt":["Requer repositório Git limpo","Necessita GitHub CLI instalado","Limitado a repositórios GitHub"],"ru":["Требует чистого репозитория Git","Требует установленного GitHub CLI","Ограничен репозиториями GitHub"],"ar":["يتطلب مخزن Git نظيف","يحتاج إلى تثبيت GitHub CLI","محدود بمخازن GitHub"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"216215d6b4bd2079f2af2082e92670dc883d51c004ac8db2699e1a48d99d1eb4","qualityScore":29}');
