ータ構造はAIエージェントの開発の基礎です。このスキルは包括的なリファレンス資料を提供し、開発者の開発効率を上げます","ko":"GoF 디자인 패턴과 데이터 구조는 AI 에이전트 개발의 기초입니다. 이 스킬은 개발자에게 개발 효율성을 높일 수 있는 포괄적인 참조 자료를 제공합니다","es":"Referencia completa de patrones de diseño GoF y estructuras de datos para desarrollar Agentes de IA con Claude Code","fr":"Référence complète des modèles de conception GoF et des structures de données pour développer des Outils d''IA avec Claude Code","de":"Umfassende Referenz für GoF-Entwurfsmuster und Datenstrukturen für die Entwicklung von KI-Agents mit Claude Code","pt":"Referência abrangente sobre padrões de design GoF e estruturas de dados para desenvolvedores de Ferramentas de IA","ru":"Комплексная справка по шаблонам GoF и структурам данных для разработчиков ИИ Агентов","ar":"مرجع شامل لنماط تصميم GoF والهياكل البيانية لمطوري الوكلاء الذكية","en":"Comprehensive GoF design patterns and data structures reference skill for Claude   Code"},"definition":{"en":"Comprehensive GoF design patterns and data structures reference skill for Claude   Code"},"features":{"zh":["综合的GoF设计模式参考资料","数据结构和算法实现","AI智能开发最佳实践","提高开发效率和代码质量","支持多种编程语言"],"ja":["包括的なGoFデザインパターンのリファレンス資料","データ構造とアルゴリズムの実装","AIエージェントの開発ベストプラクティス","開発効率とコード品質の向上","複数のプログラミング言語をサポート"],"ko":["포괄적인 GoF 디자인 패턴 참조 자료","데이터 구조와 알고리즘 구현","AI 에이전트 개발 beste 프랙티스","개발 효율성과 코드 품질 향상","다수의 프로그래밍 언어 지원"],"es":["Patrones de diseño GoF para Agentes de IA","Estructuras de datos para Claude Code","Desarrollo de Agentes de IA efectivos","Mejora de la eficiencia en el desarrollo de IA","Integración con Claude Code"],"fr":["Modèles de conception GoF pour Outils d''IA","Structures de données pour Claude Code","Développement d''Outils d''IA efficaces","Amélioration de l''efficacité dans le développement d''IA","Intégration avec Claude Code"],"de":["GoF-Entwurfsmuster für KI-Agents","Datenstrukturen für Claude Code","Entwicklung von KI-Agents mit hoher Effizienz","Verbesserung der Effizienz bei der Entwicklung von KI","Integration mit Claude Code"],"pt":["Padrões de criação","Padrões de estrutura","Padrões de comportamento","Estruturas de dados eficientes","Implementação de algoritmos"],"ru":["Шаблоны создания","Шаблоны структуры","Шаблоны поведения","Эффективные структуры данных","Реализация алгоритмов"],"ar":["نماط الإنشاء","نماط الهيكلة","نماط السلوك","هياكل بيانات فعالة","تنفيذ الخوارزميات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能开发","GoF设计模式","数据结构","AI开发工具","如何使用GoF设计模式","GoF设计模式与AI开发","AI开发最佳实践","提高开发效率","代码质量优化"],"ja":["AIエージェントの開発","GoFデザインパターン","データ構造","AI開発ツール","GoFデザインパターンの使用方法","GoFデザインパターンとAI開発","AI開発ベストプラクティス","開発効率の向上","コード品質の向上"],"ko":["AI 에이전트 개발","GoF 디자인 패턴","데이터 구조","AI 개발 도구","GoF 디자인 패턴 사용 방법","GoF 디자인 패턴과 AI 개발","AI 개발 beste 프랙티스","개발 효율성 향상","코드 품질 최적화"],"es":["patrones de diseño GoF","Agentes de IA","desarrollo de IA","Claude Code","estructuras de datos","how to use GoF patrones","qué es un Agente de IA","alternativas a Claude Code"],"fr":["modèles de conception GoF","Outils d''IA","développement d''IA","Claude Code","structures de données","comment utiliser les modèles GoF","qu''est-ce qu''un Outil d''IA","alternatives à Claude Code"],"de":["GoF-Entwurfsmuster","KI-Agents","Entwicklung von KI","Claude Code","Datenstrukturen","wie man GoF-Muster verwendet","was ist ein KI-Agents","Alternativen zu Claude Code"],"pt":["padrões de design GoF","desenvolvimento de Ferramentas de IA","estruturas de dados","algoritmos de programação","como usar padrões de design","Ferramentas de IA alternativas"],"ru":["шаблоны GoF","разработка ИИ Агентов","структуры данных","алгоритмы программирования","как использовать шаблоны GoF","ИИ Агенты альтернативы"],"ar":["نماط تصميم GoF","تطوير الوكلاء الذكية","هياكل البيانات","خوارزميات البرمجة","كيفية استخدام نمط تصميم GoF","بديل الوكلاء الذكية"]}},"owner":"grndlvl","repo":"software-patterns","repoPath":"grndlvl/software-patterns","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.912Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"gof-patterns","description":"Gang of Four design patterns reference. Use this skill when implementing, discussing, or choosing object-oriented design patterns. Auto-activates for architecture decisions, refactoring, and decoupling concerns. Comprehensive coverage of all 23 GoF patterns with pseudocode examples.","bodyPreview":"# GoF Design Patterns Reference\n\nA comprehensive reference for the Gang of Four design patterns. This skill provides language-agnostic guidance with pseudocode examples that can be translated to any programming language.\n\n## When This Skill Activates\n\nThis skill automatically activates when you:\n- Ask about or need to implement a design pattern\n- Need to choose between patterns for a design problem\n- Are refactoring code and considering structural improvements\n- Discuss architecture, decoupling,","body":"# GoF Design Patterns Reference\n\nA comprehensive reference for the Gang of Four design patterns. This skill provides language-agnostic guidance with pseudocode examples that can be translated to any programming language.\n\n## When This Skill Activates\n\nThis skill automatically activates when you:\n- Ask about or need to implement a design pattern\n- Need to choose between patterns for a design problem\n- Are refactoring code and considering structural improvements\n- Discuss architecture, decoupling, or extensibility\n- Mention specific patterns: factory, singleton, observer, decorator, etc.\n\n## Quick Pattern Reference\n\n### Creational Patterns (Object Creation)\n| Pattern | Intent | Use When |\n|---------|--------|----------|\n| [Abstract Factory](gof-creational/abstract-factory.md) | Create families of related objects | Need platform/theme independence |\n| [Builder](gof-creational/builder.md) | Construct complex objects step-by-step | Object has many optional parts |\n| [Factory Method](gof-creational/factory-method.md) | Let subclasses decide which class to instantiate | Don''t know concrete types ahead of time |\n| [Prototype](gof-creational/prototype.md) | Clone existing objects | Object creation is expensive |\n| [Singleton](gof-creational/singleton.md) | Ensure single instance | Need exactly one shared instance |\n\n### Structural Patterns (Composition)\n| Pattern | Intent | Use When |\n|---------|--------|----------|\n| [Adapter](gof-structural/adapter.md) | Convert interface to expected interface | Integrating incompatible interfaces |\n| [Bridge](gof-structural/bridge.md) | Separate abstraction from implementation | Need to vary both independently |\n| [Composite](gof-structural/composite.md) | Treat individual and groups uniformly | Have tree structures |\n| [Decorator](gof-structural/decorator.md) | Add responsibilities dynamically | Need flexible extension |\n| [Facade](gof-structural/facade.md) | Simplified interface to subsystem | Complex subsystem needs simple API |\n| [Flyweight](gof-structural/flyweight.md) | Share common state efficiently | Many similar objects needed |\n| [Proxy](gof-structural/proxy.md) | Control access to object | Need lazy loading, access control, logging |\n\n### Behavioral Patterns (Communication)\n| Pattern | Intent | Use When |\n|---------|--------|----------|\n| [Chain of Responsibility](gof-behavioral/chain-of-responsibility.md) | Pass request along handler chain | Multiple handlers, unknown which handles |\n| [Command](gof-behavioral/command.md) | Encapsulate request as object | Need undo, queue, or log operations |\n| [Interpreter](gof-behavioral/interpreter.md) | Define grammar and interpret sentences | Have a simple language to parse |\n| [Iterator](gof-behavioral/iterator.md) | Sequential access without exposing internals | Need to traverse collections |\n| [Mediator](gof-behavioral/mediator.md) | Centralize complex communications | Many objects communicate in complex ways |\n| [Memento](gof-behavioral/memento.md) | Capture and restore object state | Need undo/snapshot functionality |\n| [Observer](gof-behavioral/observer.md) | Notify dependents of state changes | One-to-many dependency |\n| [State](gof-behavioral/state.md) | Alter behavior when state changes | Object behavior depends on state |\n| [Strategy](gof-behavioral/strategy.md) | Encapsulate interchangeable algorithms | Need to swap algorithms at runtime |\n| [Template Method](gof-behavioral/template-method.md) | Define skeleton, let subclasses fill in | Algorithm structure fixed, steps vary |\n| [Visitor](gof-behavioral/visitor.md) | Add operations without changing classes | Need to add many operations to stable structure |\n\n## Decision Guide\n\nSee [Pattern Selection Guide](pattern-selection.md) for help choosing the right pattern.\n\n## How to Use This Reference\n\n1. **Choosing a pattern**: Start with the decision guide or tables above\n2. **Learning a pattern**: Read the full documentation with examples\n3. **Quick reminder**: Use the tables above for at-a-glance reference\n4. **Implementation**: Follow the pseudocode, adapt to your language\n\n## Language Translation Notes\n\nThe pseudocode in this reference uses these conventions:\n- `class` for type definitions\n- `function` for methods/functions\n- `->` for method calls on objects\n- `//` for comments\n- Type hints shown as `name: Type`\n\nTranslate to your language:\n- **PHP**: `class`, `function`, `->`, `//`, type hints in docblocks or PHP 8+\n- **JavaScript/TypeScript**: `class`, `function`/arrow, `.`, `//`, TS types\n- **Python**: `class`, `def`, `.`, `#`, type hints\n- **Java/C#**: Direct mapping with `new`, generics\n\n---\n\n*Based on concepts from \"Design Patterns: Elements of Reusable Object-Oriented Software\" by Gamma, Helm, Johnson, and Vlissides (Gang of Four), 1994.*\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:21:38.898Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Code Generation Agents like Claude Code needing comprehensive guidance on Gang of Four design patterns","zh":"适合于需要全面指导的Gang of Four设计模式的代码生成代理，如Claude Code","ja":"Gang of Four設計パターンに関する包括的なガイダンスが必要なコード生成エージェントであるClaude Codeのようなエージェントに適しています","ko":"포괄적인 지침이 필요한 Gang of Four 디자인 패턴의 코드 생성 에이전트인 Claude Code와 같은 에이전트에 적합합니다","es":"Ideal para agentes de generación de código como Claude Code que necesitan una guía exhaustiva sobre patrones de diseño de Gang of Four","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de génération de code comme Claude Code nécessitant une guidance complète sur les modèles de conception de Gang of Four","de":"Ideal für Code-Generierungsagenten wie Claude Code, die eine umfassende Anleitung zu Gang-of-Four-Designmustern benötigen","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Geração de Código como Claude Code que necessitam de orientação abrangente sobre padrões de design Gang of Four","ru":"Идеально для агентов генерации кода, таких как Claude Code, которым требуется всестороннее руководство по шаблонам проектирования Gang of Four","ar":"مثالي لعميل توليد الكود مثل Claude Code الذي يحتاج إلى إرشادات شاملة حول أنماط تصميم Gang of Four"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to implement pseudocode examples of GoF design patterns, providing language-agnostic guidance for structural improvements, refactoring, and architecture discussions, utilizing pseudocode that can be translated into various programming languages","zh":"赋予代理实现GoF设计模式的伪代码示例，提供语言无关的指导以改进结构、重构和架构讨论，利用可以翻译成各种编程语言的伪代码","ja":"GoF設計パターンの疑似コード例を実装するエージェントを可能にし、構造の改善、リファクタリング、アーキテクチャの議論に言語に依存しないガイダンスを提供することで、さまざまなプログラミング言語に翻訳できる疑似コードを利用する","ko":"GoF 디자인 패턴의 의사 코드 예제를 구현할 수 있는 에이전트를 강화하여 구조, 리팩토링, 아키텍처 논의를 개선하고, 다양한 프로그래밍 언어로 번역할 수 있는 의사 코드를 사용하여 언어에 종속되지 않는 지침을 제공한다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a implementar ejemplos de pseudocódigo de patrones de diseño de GoF, proporcionando una guía independiente del lenguaje para mejoras estructurales, refactorización y discusiones de arquitectura, utilizando pseudocódigo que se puede traducir a varios lenguajes de programación","fr":"Permet aux agents d''implémenter des exemples de pseudocode de modèles de conception de GoF, fournissant une guidance indépendante du langage pour les améliorations structurelles, la refactorisation et les discussions d''architecture, en utilisant un pseudocode qui peut être traduit dans différents langages de programmation","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Pseudocode-Beispiele von GoF-Designmustern zu implementieren, und bietet sprachunabhängige Anleitung für strukturelle Verbesserungen, Refactoring und Architekturdiskussionen, wobei Pseudocode verwendet wird, der in verschiedene Programmiersprachen übersetzt werden kann","pt":"Habilita os agentes a implementar exemplos de pseudocódigo de padrões de design GoF, fornecendo orientação independente de linguagem para melhorias estruturais, refatoração e discussões de arquitetura, utilizando pseudocódigo que pode ser traduzido para várias linguagens de programação","ru":"Позволяет агентам реализовывать псевдокодовые примеры шаблонов проектирования GoF, обеспечивая языково-независимое руководство для структурных улучшений, рефакторинга и обсуждений архитектуры, используя псевдокод, который может быть переведен на различные языки программирования","ar":"تمكن الوكيل من تنفيذ أمثلة من الكود الزائف لأنماط تصميم GoF، وتوفير توجيه مستقل عن اللغة للتحسينات الهيكلية وإعادة هيكلة ومناقشات الهندسة المعمارية، باستخدام الكود الزائف الذي يمكن翻ترته إلى عدة لغات برمجة"},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing design patterns for complex software problems","Refactoring code for improved maintainability and scalability","Choosing between design patterns for optimal solution architecture","Discussing and implementing decoupling strategies"],"zh":["为复杂软件问题实现设计模式","为了提高可维护性和可扩展性而重构代码","在最佳解决方案架构中选择设计模式","讨论和实现解耦策略"],"ja":["複雑なソフトウェア問題の設計パターンを実装する","メンテナンス性とスケーラビリティを高めるためにコードをリファクタリングする","最適なソリューションアーキテクチャのための設計パターンを選択する","切り離し戦略を議論し実装する"],"ko":["복잡한 소프트웨어 문제를 위한 디자인 패턴 구현","유지 보수성 및 확장성을 개선하기 위한 코드 리팩토링","최적의 솔루션 아키텍처를 위한 디자인 패턴 선택","결합 해제 전략에 대한 토론 및 구현"],"es":["Implementar patrones de diseño para problemas de software complejos","Refactorizar código para mejorar su mantenibilidad y escalabilidad","Elegir entre patrones de diseño para una arquitectura de solución óptima","Discutir e implementar estrategias de desacoplamiento"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre des modèles de conception pour des problèmes de logiciel complexes","Réfactorer du code pour améliorer sa maintenabilité et sa scalabilité","Choisir entre des modèles de conception pour une architecture de solution optimale","Discuter et mettre en œuvre des stratégies de découplage"],"de":["Implementieren von Designmustern für komplexe Softwareprobleme","Refactoring von Code für verbesserte Wartbarkeit und Skalierbarkeit","Wählen zwischen Designmustern für eine optimale Lösungsarchitektur","Diskutieren und Implementieren von Entkopplungsstrategien"],"pt":["Implementar padrões de design para problemas de software complexos","Refatorar código para melhor manutenibilidade e escalabilidade","Escolher entre padrões de design para arquitetura de solução óptima","Discutir e implementar estratégias de desacoplamento"],"ru":["Реализация шаблонов проектирования для сложных проблем программного обеспечения","Рефакторинг кода для улучшения поддерживаемости и масштабируемости","Выбор между шаблонами проектирования для оптимальной архитектуры решения","Обсуждение и реализация стратегий декуплинга"],"ar":["تنفيذ أنماط التصميم لمشاكل البرمجيات المعقدة","إعادة هيكلة الكود لتحسين الصيانة والتماسك","اختيار بين أنماط التصميم لهندسة الحل الأمثل","مناقشة وتنفيذ استراتيجيات الفصل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Language-agnostic, may require translation of pseudocode examples","Limited to Gang of Four design patterns"],"zh":["语言无关，可能需要翻译伪代码示例","仅限于Gang of Four设计模式"],"ja":["言語に依存しないが、疑似コード例の翻訳が必要になる場合がある","Gang of Four設計パターンに限定される"],"ko":["언어에 종속되지 않지만 의사 코드 예제의 번역이 필요할 수 있음","Gang of Four 디자인 패턴에만 제한됨"],"es":["Independiente del lenguaje, puede requerir la traducción de ejemplos de pseudocódigo","Limitado a patrones de diseño de Gang of Four"],"fr":["Indépendant du langage, peut nécessiter la traduction d''exemples de pseudocode","Limité aux modèles de conception de Gang of Four"],"de":["Sprachunabhängig, kann die Übersetzung von Pseudocode-Beispielen erfordern","Begrenzt auf Gang-of-Four-Designmuster"],"pt":["Independente de linguagem, pode requerer tradução de exemplos de pseudocódigo","Limitado a padrões de design Gang of Four"],"ru":["Языково-независимый, может требовать перевода примеров псевдокода","Ограничен шаблонами проектирования Gang of Four"],"ar":["مستقل عن اللغة، قد يتطلب ترجمة أمثلة الكود الزائف","محدود لأنماط تصميم Gang of Four"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"90627ded5fee2428f28030d5ca82e7f35088d0344c2ca36b4ba7c20cccd17f55","qualityScore":29}');
