elligent","Écrit en Rust pour garantir la stabilité et les performances","Idéal pour les développeurs qui cherchent à améliorer leur productivité","Compatibilité avec plusieurs shells et systèmes d''exploitation","Facile à installer et à configurer"],"de":["Schneller und intelligenter Shell-Autocomplete-Motor","Geschrieben in Rust für Stabilität und Leistung","Ideal für Entwickler, die ihre Produktivität steigern möchten","Kompatibilität mit mehreren Shells und Betriebssystemen","Einfach zu installieren und zu konfigurieren"],"pt":["Motor de conclusão de shell rápido e inteligente","Escrito em Rust para performance e segurança","Automatização de tarefas de desenvolvimento","Integração com ferramentas de desenvolvimento populares","Suporte a múltiplos ambientes de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Быстрый и интеллектуальный движок автозаполнения","Написан на Rust для производительности и безопасности","Автоматизация задач разработки","Интеграция с популярными инструментами разработки","Поддержка нескольких сред разработки"],"ar":["محرك استكمال شل سريع وذكي","مكتوب بلغة الرست لتحسين الأداء والأمان","تحسين كفاءة المطورين من خلال التutomatización","التكامل مع أدوات التطوير الشهيرة","دعم بيئات التطوير المتعددة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用beads-workflow","什么是beads-workflow","beads-workflow替代品","beads-workflow vs 其他工具","beads-workflow安装","beads-workflow设置指南","Rust开发工具","智能shell完成引擎"],"ja":["beads-workflowの使い方","beads-workflowとは","beads-workflowの代替","beads-workflow vs 他のツール","beads-workflowのインストール","beads-workflowの設定ガイド","Rust開発ツール","インテリジェントシェル完了エンジン"],"ko":["beads-workflow 사용 방법","beads-workflow란","beads-workflow 대안","beads-workflow vs 다른 도구","beads-workflow 설치","beads-workflow 설정 가이드","Rust 개발 도구","지능형 셸 완료 엔진"],"es":["herramientas de inteligencia artificial","beads-workflow","motor de autocompletado de shell","Rust","desarrollo de software","productividad","guias de instalación","alternativas a beads-workflow"],"fr":["outils d''agents IA","beads-workflow","moteur d''autocomplétion de shell","Rust","développement de logiciels","productivité","guides d''installation","alternatives à beads-workflow"],"de":["KI-Tools","beads-workflow","Shell-Autocomplete-Motor","Rust","Software-Entwicklung","Produktivität","Installationsanleitungen","Alternativen zu beads-workflow"],"pt":["como usar beads-workflow","o que é beads-workflow","beads-workflow vs outros motores de conclusão","instalar beads-workflow","guias de configuração do beads-workflow","ferramentas de desenvolvimento em Rust","automatização de tarefas de desenvolvimento","melhores práticas de desenvolvimento com beads-workflow"],"ru":["как использовать beads-workflow","что такое beads-workflow","beads-workflow vs другие движки автозаполнения","установка beads-workflow","руководства по настройке beads-workflow","инструменты разработки на Rust","автоматизация задач разработки","лучшие практики разработки с beads-workflow"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام beads-workflow","ما هو beads-workflow","beads-workflow مقابل محركات استكمال أخرى","تثبيت beads-workflow","دليل إعداد beads-workflow","أدوات التطوير بلغة الرست","تحسين كفاءة المطورين","أفضل الممارسات للتطوير مع beads-workflow"]}},"owner":"jbabin91","repo":"autocomplete-rs","repoPath":"jbabin91/autocomplete-rs","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.925Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"beads-workflow","description":"Converts markdown plans into beads (tasks with dependencies) and polishes them until implementation-ready. The bridge between planning and agent team execution. Use when converting a plan to beads, polishing bead descriptions, adding test coverage beads, reviewing bead dependencies, or preparing tasks for parallel agent team execution.","version":"1.1","bodyPreview":"# Beads Workflow\n\nBeads are epics, tasks, and subtasks with dependency structure, optimized for AI coding agents. They function like Jira or Linear but designed for machines. This skill covers the full lifecycle: converting markdown plans into beads, iteratively polishing them across multiple rounds and models, and coordinating parallel execution via Claude Code agent teams. Use this when you have a markdown plan and need to produce self-contained, implementation-ready tasks. Do not use this for","body":"# Beads Workflow\n\nBeads are epics, tasks, and subtasks with dependency structure, optimized for AI coding agents. They function like Jira or Linear but designed for machines. This skill covers the full lifecycle: converting markdown plans into beads, iteratively polishing them across multiple rounds and models, and coordinating parallel execution via Claude Code agent teams. Use this when you have a markdown plan and need to produce self-contained, implementation-ready tasks. Do not use this for the planning phase itself; use a planning skill for that.\n\n> **Core Principle:** \"Check your beads N times, implement once\" -- where N is as many as you can stomach.\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Workflow             | What It Does                                                   | Key Detail                                                              |\n| -------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Plan to beads        | Converts a markdown plan into granular beads with dependencies | Use the full or short conversion prompt with `bd` tool                  |\n| Polish beads         | Iteratively reviews and improves bead quality                  | Run 6-9 rounds until steady-state; use full or standard prompt          |\n| Fresh session        | Breaks out of polishing plateaus                               | Start new session, re-establish context, then resume polishing          |\n| Cross-model review   | Gets alternative perspectives on bead quality                  | Run final pass with a different model (Codex, Gemini CLI)               |\n| Add test coverage    | Creates unit test and e2e test beads                           | Use the test coverage prompt to audit and fill gaps                     |\n| bd CLI basics        | Create, update, depend, close beads                            | Always use `bd` tool; never run bare `bv` (interactive TUI)             |\n| Robot mode           | Machine-readable bv output for agents                          | `bv --robot-triage`, `--robot-next`, `--robot-plan`, `--robot-insights` |\n| Agent team execution | Coordinate parallel bead execution via Claude Code agent teams | Beads = persistent truth; team tasks = ephemeral dispatch               |\n\n## Common Mistakes\n\n| Mistake                                                  | Correct Pattern                                                                                                |\n| -------------------------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Oversimplifying bead descriptions to short bullet points | Beads must be verbose and self-documenting with background, reasoning, and considerations                      |\n| Stopping after one polish round                          | Keep polishing until steady-state (typically 6-9 rounds); start a fresh session if progress flatlines          |\n| Omitting test coverage beads                             | Every feature bead should have associated unit test and e2e test beads with detailed logging                   |\n| Not making all blocking relationships explicit           | Use `bd depend` to declare every dependency; agents cannot infer implicit ordering                             |\n| Losing features from the original plan                   | Cross-check every plan section against beads; everything must be embedded so the plan is never consulted again |\n| Running bare `bv` without flags                          | Always use `bv --robot-*` flags; bare `bv` launches an interactive TUI that blocks agents                      |\n| Teammates editing the same files                         | Assign exclusive file ownership per teammate; work same-file beads sequentially                                |\n\n## Delegation\n\n- **Create initial beads from a markdown plan**: Use `Task` agent with the plan-to-beads prompt and `bd` tool access\n- **Polish beads across multiple rounds**: Use `Task` agent with the standard polish prompt, repeating until steady-state\n- **Review bead graph for cycles and missing dependencies**: Use `Explore` agent to run `bv --robot-insights` and validate the dependency structure\n- **Add test coverage beads**: Use `Task` agent with the test coverage prompt\n- **Execute beads in parallel**: Use agent teams -- lead discovers parallel tracks via `bd ready`/`bv --robot-plan`, spawns teammates with bead-scoped prompts, verifies and closes beads after completion\n\n## References\n\n- [Plan to Beads](references/plan-to-beads.md) -- Converting markdown plans into beads, exact prompts, what gets created\n- [Polishing Workflow](references/polishing-workflow.md) -- Polishing protocol, fresh session technique, cross-model review, quality checklist\n- [Agent Integration](references/agent-integration.md) -- bd CLI commands, robot mode, agent team execution, test coverage beads\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:28:09.835Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Coding Agents needing advanced task management and workflow optimization capabilities, particularly those utilizing Rust and markdown plans.","zh":"Perfect for AI Coding Agents needing advanced task management and workflow optimization capabilities, particularly those utilizing Rust and markdown plans.","ja":"Perfect for AI Coding Agents needing advanced task management and workflow optimization capabilities, particularly those utilizing Rust and markdown plans.","ko":"Perfect for AI Coding Agents needing advanced task management and workflow optimization capabilities, particularly those utilizing Rust and markdown plans.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de codificación de IA que necesitan capacidades de gestión de tareas avanzadas y optimización de flujos de trabajo, particularmente aquellos que utilizan Rust y planes de markdown.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de codage IA nécessitant une gestion de tâches avancée et une optimisation des flux de travail, en particulier ceux utilisant Rust et des plans markdown.","de":"Perfekt für AI-Coding-Agenten, die erweiterte Aufgabenverwaltungs- und Workflow-Optimierungsfunktionen benötigen, insbesondere solche, die Rust und Markdown-Pläne verwenden.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Codificação de IA que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de gerenciamento de tarefas e otimização de fluxo de trabalho, particularmente aqueles que utilizam Rust e planos em markdown.","ru":"Идеально для агентов кодирования ИИ, которым необходимы расширенные возможности управления задачами и оптимизации рабочего процесса, особенно тех, кто использует Rust и планы в markdown.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات الترميز الذكية التي تحتاج إلى إدارة متقدمة للمهام وتحسين سير العمل، خاصة تلك التي تستخدم Rust وخطط Markdown."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to convert markdown plans into optimized beads with dependency structures, facilitating iterative polishing and parallel execution via Claude Code agent teams, while leveraging intelligent shell completion engines and Rust for enhanced performance.","zh":"Empowers agents to convert markdown plans into optimized beads with dependency structures, facilitating iterative polishing and parallel execution via Claude Code agent teams, while leveraging intelligent shell completion engines and Rust for enhanced performance.","ja":"Empowers agents to convert markdown plans into optimized beads with dependency structures, facilitating iterative polishing and parallel execution via Claude Code agent teams, while leveraging intelligent shell completion engines and Rust for enhanced performance.","ko":"Empowers agents to convert markdown plans into optimized beads with dependency structures, facilitating iterative polishing and parallel execution via Claude Code agent teams, while leveraging intelligent shell completion engines and Rust for enhanced performance.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a convertir planes de markdown en cuentas optimizadas con estructuras de dependencia, lo que facilita el pulido iterativo y la ejecución paralela a través de equipos de agentes de Claude Code, al tiempo que aprovecha los motores de completado de shell inteligentes y Rust para un rendimiento mejorado.","fr":"Permet aux agents de convertir des plans markdown en perles optimisées avec des structures de dépendance, facilitant le polissage itératif et l''exécution parallèle via des équipes d''agents de Claude Code, tout en exploitant les moteurs de complétion de shell intelligents et Rust pour des performances améliorées.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Markdown-Pläne in optimierte Perlen mit Abhängigkeitsstrukturen umzuwandeln, wodurch iteratives Polieren und parallele Ausführung über Claude Code-Agententeams sowie die Nutzung intelligenter Shell-Vervollständigungsmotoren und Rust für verbesserte Leistung ermöglicht werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a converter planos em markdown em contas otimizadas com estruturas de dependência, facilitando o polimento iterativo e a execução paralela via equipes de agentes Claude Code, aproveitando ainda motores de conclusão de shell inteligentes e Rust para desempenho aprimorado.","ru":"Позволяет агентам преобразовывать планы в markdown в оптимизированные бусины с структурами зависимостей, облегчая итеративную полировку и параллельное выполнение через команды агентов Claude Code, используя при этом интеллектуальные движки завершения shell и Rust для повышения производительности.","ar":"تمكّن العميل من تحويل خطط Markdown إلى حبات محسّنة ذات بنية تعتمد على الإعتماد، ويسهّل التلميع التكراري والتنفيذ المتوازي عبر فرق عميل كلود كود، مستفيدا من محركات إكمال شل ذكية وروست لتعزيز الأداء."},"useCases":{"en":["Converting markdown plans into implementation-ready tasks with dependency management","Iteratively polishing beads across multiple rounds and models for refined workflow optimization","Coordinating parallel execution of tasks via Claude Code agent teams for efficient project management"],"zh":["Converting markdown plans into implementation-ready tasks with dependency management","Iteratively polishing beads across multiple rounds and models for refined workflow optimization","Coordinating parallel execution of tasks via Claude Code agent teams for efficient project management"],"ja":["Converting markdown plans into implementation-ready tasks with dependency management","Iteratively polishing beads across multiple rounds and models for refined workflow optimization","Coordinating parallel execution of tasks via Claude Code agent teams for efficient project management"],"ko":["Converting markdown plans into implementation-ready tasks with dependency management","Iteratively polishing beads across multiple rounds and models for refined workflow optimization","Coordinating parallel execution of tasks via Claude Code agent teams for efficient project management"],"es":["Conversión de planes de markdown en tareas listas para la implementación con gestión de dependencias","Pulido iterativo de perlas en varias rondas y modelos para una refinada optimización del flujo de trabajo","Coordinación de la ejecución paralela de tareas a través de equipos de agentes de Claude Code para una gestión de proyectos eficiente"],"fr":["Conversion de plans markdown en tâches prêtes à l''implémentation avec gestion de dépendances","Polissage itératif de perles à travers plusieurs rounds et modèles pour une optimisation affinée du flux de travail","Coordination de l''exécution parallèle de tâches via des équipes d''agents de Claude Code pour une gestion de projet efficace"],"de":["Umwandlung von Markdown-Plänen in implementierungsbereite Aufgaben mit Abhängigkeitsverwaltung","Iteratives Polieren von Perlen über mehrere Runden und Modelle für eine verfeinerte Workflow-Optimierung","Koordination der parallelen Ausführung von Aufgaben über Claude Code-Agententeams für eine effiziente Projektverwaltung"],"pt":["Converte planos em markdown em tarefas prontas para implementação com gerenciamento de dependência","Pule contas em várias rodadas e modelos para otimização de fluxo de trabalho refinada","Coordena a execução paralela de tarefas via equipes de agentes Claude Code para gerenciamento de projeto eficiente"],"ru":["Преобразует планы в markdown в задачи, готовые к реализации, с управлением зависимостями","Итеративно полирует бусины в нескольких раундах и моделях для уточнения оптимизации рабочего процесса","Координирует параллельное выполнение задач через команды агентов Claude Code для эффективного управления проектами"],"ar":["تحويل خطط Markdown إلى مهام جاهزة للتطبيق مع إدارة الإعتماد","تلميع حبات متكرر عبر عدة جولات ونماذج لتحسين سير العمل المتنقّح","تنسيق التنفيذ الموازي للمهام عبر فرق عميل كلود كود لإدارة مشروع فعالة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires markdown plan as input","Designed specifically for machine-based workflows, not human-centric project management like Jira or Linear"],"zh":["Requires markdown plan as input","Designed specifically for machine-based workflows, not human-centric project management like Jira or Linear"],"ja":["Requires markdown plan as input","Designed specifically for machine-based workflows, not human-centric project management like Jira or Linear"],"ko":["Requires markdown plan as input","Designed specifically for machine-based workflows, not human-centric project management like Jira or Linear"],"es":["Requiere un plan de markdown como entrada","Diseñado específicamente para flujos de trabajo basados en máquina, no para gestión de proyectos humanocéntrica como Jira o Linear"],"fr":["Nécessite un plan markdown comme entrée","Conçu spécifiquement pour des flux de travail basés sur la machine, et non pour une gestion de projet humanocentrique comme Jira ou Linear"],"de":["Benötigt einen Markdown-Plan als Eingabe","Speziell für maschinenbasierte Workflows und nicht für humanzentrierte Projektmanagement wie Jira oder Linear konzipiert"],"pt":["Requer plano em markdown como entrada","Projetado especificamente para fluxos de trabalho baseados em máquina, não para gerenciamento de projeto humanocêntrico como Jira ou Linear"],"ru":["Требует плана в markdown в качестве входных данных","Разработан специально для машинных рабочих процессов, а не для управления проектами, ориентированного на человека, как Jira или Linear"],"ar":["يتطلب خططا في Markdown كمدخل","تم تصميمه خصيصا لأنظمة سير العمل الآلية، وليس لإدارة المشاريع الموجهة إلى الإنسان مثل Jira أو Linear"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"4aa1183739ca667e61e394959269df4080be184c2f88bc5522b422d11a404366","qualityScore":29}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('nyaomaru/is-kit/prettier-format', 'community', 'nyaomaru', 'is-kit', 'nyaomaru/is-kit', 'prettier-format', 0, 0, 29, '2026-03-02T01:56:10.953Z', '2026-03-02T02:44:38.134Z', 'ba1303dc5ada8c9e822ada5dd44e00d7f833b6367d6f62b9cf2c38d0d51a7338', '{"id":"nyaomaru/is-kit/prettier-format","name":"prettier-format","description":{"zh":"prettier-format是一个轻量级、零依赖的TypeScript类型守卫构建工具，提供运行时安全、组合性和人体工程学","ja":"prettier-formatは、ランタイムセーフ、組み合わせ可能、エRGノミクスのTypeScriptのisFooスタイルタイプガードビルダーです","ko":"prettier-format는 런타임 안전, 조합 가능 및 인간 공학을 제공하는 TypeScript 타입 가드 빌더입니다","es":"Prettier es una herramienta de formato de código ligera y sin dependencias para TypeScript, que ofrece comprobaciones de tipo en tiempo de ejecución y composición","fr":"Prettier est un outil de formatage de code léger et sans dépendances pour TypeScript, offrant des vérifications de type à l''exécution et une composition","de":"Prettier ist ein leichtes und abhängigkeitsfreies Code-Formatierungstool für TypeScript, das Laufzeit-Typüberprüfungen und Zusammensetzung bietet","pt":"O prettier-format é uma ferramenta leve e segura para construir type guards em TypeScript, com funcionalidades de tempo de execução seguras e compostas.","ru":"Prettier-format - это легкий и безопасный инструмент для построения type guards в TypeScript, с функциями безопасного времени выполнения и композиции.","ar":"prettier-format هو أداة خفيفة وآمنة لإنشاء.type guards في TypeScript، مع ميزات زمن تشغيل آمن ومتكامل.","en":"Lightweight, zero-dependency toolkit for building `isFoo` style type guards in TypeScript. Runtime-safe 🛡️, composable 🧩, and ergonomic ✨. npm -> https://www.npmjs.com/package/is-kit"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI工具prettier-format：TypeScript类型守卫构建工具","ja":"AIエージェントprettier-format：TypeScriptのisFooスタイルタイプガードビルダー","ko":"AI 에이전트 prettier-format: TypeScript 타입 가드 빌더","es":"Herr