es a handy search feature and the ability to invite collaborators for..."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Inertia React 开发 AIエージェント","ja":"Inertia React 開発 AIエージェント","ko":"Inertia React 개발 AI 에이전트","es":"Desarrollo de Inertia con React y herramientas de AI Agent","fr":"Développement Inertia-React avec outils d''Agent IA","de":"Inertia-React-Entwicklung mit AI-Tools und Agenten","pt":"Ferramentas de IA: Inertia React Development","ru":"ИИ Агенты: Inertia React Разработка","ar":"أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي: تطور إنيرتيا رياكت","en":"inertia-react-development"},"description":{"zh":"Inertia React 开发 AI エージェント，提供 Laravel 翻译管理的简单解决方案","ja":"Inertia React で AIエージェントを開発して、Laravel の翻訳管理を簡素化する","ko":"Inertia React로 AI 에이전트를 개발하여 Laravel 번역 관리를 간소화하는 방법","es":"Inertia-React es un paquete de interfaz de usuario para gestionar traducciones en Laravel, que simplifica tareas como agregar, editar y eliminar traducciones","fr":"Inertia-React est un package d''interface utilisateur pour gérer les traductions dans Laravel, qui simplifie les tâches telles que l''ajout, la modification et...","de":"Inertia-React ist ein Benutzeroberflächen-Paket zur Verwaltung von Übersetzungen in Laravel, das Aufgaben wie Hinzufügen, Bearbeiten und Löschen von Übersetz...","pt":"Inertia React Development é uma ferramenta de gerenciamento de traduções para aplicações Laravel, com recursos como adição, edição e exportação de traduções","ru":"ИИ Агенты Inertia React Разработка - это инструмент для управления переводами в приложениях Laravel, с функциями добавления, редактирования и экспорта переводов","ar":"تطوير إنيرتيا رياكت هو أداة لإدارة الترجمات في التطبيقات لارافيل، مع ميزات مثل إضافة وتصحيح وتصدير الترجمات","en":"Laravel Translations UI package provides a user-friendly interface for managing translations in your Laravel application. It simplifies tasks such as adding,..."},"definition":{"en":"Laravel Translations UI package provides a user-friendly interface for managing translations in your Laravel application. It simplifies tasks such as adding, editing, deleting, and exporting translations. The package also includes a handy search feature and the ability to invite collaborators for easy translation management"},"features":{"zh":["简单的翻译管理界面","支持添加、编辑、删除和导出翻译","内置搜索功能","支持邀请协作者"],"ja":["翻訳管理のユーザーインターフェース","翻訳の追加、編集、削除、エクスポートのサポート","検索機能の内蔵","コラボレーターの招待のサポート"],"ko":["간단한 번역 관리 인터페이스","번역 추가, 편집, 삭제,导出 지원","내장 검색 기능","협력자 초대 지원"],"es":["Interfaz de usuario para gestionar traducciones","Búsqueda y filtrado de traducciones","Invitación de colaboradores para la gestión de traducciones","Exportación de traducciones","Integración con Laravel"],"fr":["Interface utilisateur pour gérer les traductions","Recherche et filtrage de traductions","Invitation de collaborateurs pour la gestion des traductions","Exportation de traductions","Intégration avec Laravel"],"de":["Benutzeroberfläche zur Verwaltung von Übersetzungen","Suche und Filterung von Übersetzungen","Einladung von Mitarbeitern zur Verwaltung von Übersetzungen","Export von Übersetzungen","Integration mit Laravel"],"pt":["Interface amigável para gerenciamento de traduções","Adição, edição e exportação de traduções","Pesquisa e convite de colaboradores","Integração com aplicações Laravel"],"ru":["Удобный интерфейс для управления переводами","Добавление, редактирование и экспорт переводов","Поиск и приглашение сотрудников","Интеграция с приложениями Laravel"],"ar":["واجهة مستخدم友ية لإدارة الترجمات","إضافة وتصحيح وتصدير الترجمات","بحث و邀اء للمساهمين","التكامل مع التطبيقات لارافيل"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Inertia React 开发 AI エージェント","Laravel 翻译管理","AI エージェント是什么","如何使用 Inertia React","Inertia React vs React","Inertia React 安装"],"ja":["Inertia React で AIエージェントを開発する","Laravel の翻訳管理","AIエージェントとは","Inertia React の使い方","Inertia React と React の違い","Inertia React のインストール"],"ko":["Inertia React로 AI 에이전트를 개발하는 방법","Laravel 번역 관리","AI 에이전트란","Inertia React 사용법","Inertia React와 React의 차이","Inertia React 설치 가이드"],"es":["herramientas de AI Agent","desarrollo de Inertia","gestión de traducciones en Laravel","Inertia-React","traducciones en Laravel","alternativas a Inertia-React","instalación de Inertia-React","guía de configuración de Inertia-React"],"fr":["outils d''Agent IA","développement Inertia","gestion des traductions dans Laravel","Inertia-React","traductions dans Laravel","alternatives à Inertia-React","installation d''Inertia-React","guide de configuration d''Inertia-React"],"de":["AI-Tools","Inertia-Entwicklung","Verwaltung von Übersetzungen in Laravel","Inertia-React","Übersetzungen in Laravel","Alternativen zu Inertia-React","Installation von Inertia-React","Konfigurationsanleitung für Inertia-React"],"pt":["como usar Inertia React Development","o que é Inertia React Development","Inertia React Development vs Laravel Translations","instalar Inertia React Development","guia de configuração Inertia React Development","alternativas ao Inertia React Development"],"ru":["как использовать ИИ Агенты Inertia React Разработка","что такое ИИ Агенты Inertia React Разработка","ИИ Агенты Inertia React Разработка vs Laravel Переводы","установить ИИ Агенты Inertia React Разработка","руководство по настройке ИИ Агенты Inertia React Разработка","альтернативы ИИ Агенты Inertia React Разработка"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام تطور إنيرتيا رياكت","ما هو تطور إنيرتيا رياكت","تطوير إنيرتيا رياكت مقابل ترجمات لارافيل","تثبيت تطور إنيرتيا رياكت","دليل إعداد تطور إنيرتيا رياكت","بديل لتطوير إنيرتيا رياكت"]}},"owner":"MohmmedAshraf","repo":"laravel-translations","repoPath":"MohmmedAshraf/laravel-translations","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:11.014Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"inertia-react-development","description":">-","bodyPreview":"# Inertia React Development\n\n## When to Apply\n\nActivate this skill when:\n\n- Creating or modifying React page components for Inertia\n- Working with forms in React (using `<Form>` or `useForm`)\n- Implementing client-side navigation with `<Link>` or `router`\n- Using v2 features: deferred props, prefetching, or polling\n- Building React-specific features with the Inertia protocol\n\n## Documentation\n\nUse `search-docs` for detailed Inertia v2 React patterns and documentation.\n\n## Basic Usage\n\n### Page C","body":"# Inertia React Development\n\n## When to Apply\n\nActivate this skill when:\n\n- Creating or modifying React page components for Inertia\n- Working with forms in React (using `<Form>` or `useForm`)\n- Implementing client-side navigation with `<Link>` or `router`\n- Using v2 features: deferred props, prefetching, or polling\n- Building React-specific features with the Inertia protocol\n\n## Documentation\n\nUse `search-docs` for detailed Inertia v2 React patterns and documentation.\n\n## Basic Usage\n\n### Page Components Location\n\nReact page components should be placed in the `resources/js/pages` directory.\n\n### Page Component Structure\n\n<code-snippet name=\"Basic React Page Component\" lang=\"react\">\n\nexport default function UsersIndex({ users }) {\n    return (\n        <div>\n            <h1>Users</h1>\n            <ul>\n                {users.map(user => <li key={user.id}>{user.name}</li>)}\n            </ul>\n        </div>\n    )\n}\n\n</code-snippet>\n\n## Client-Side Navigation\n\n### Basic Link Component\n\nUse `<Link>` for client-side navigation instead of traditional `<a>` tags:\n\n<code-snippet name=\"Inertia React Navigation\" lang=\"react\">\n\nimport { Link, router } from ''@inertiajs/react''\n\n<Link href=\"/\">Home</Link>\n<Link href=\"/users\">Users</Link>\n<Link href={`/users/${user.id}`}>View User</Link>\n\n</code-snippet>\n\n### Link with Method\n\n<code-snippet name=\"Link with POST Method\" lang=\"react\">\n\nimport { Link } from ''@inertiajs/react''\n\n<Link href=\"/logout\" method=\"post\" as=\"button\">\n    Logout\n</Link>\n\n</code-snippet>\n\n### Prefetching\n\nPrefetch pages to improve perceived performance:\n\n<code-snippet name=\"Prefetch on Hover\" lang=\"react\">\n\nimport { Link } from ''@inertiajs/react''\n\n<Link href=\"/users\" prefetch>\n    Users\n</Link>\n\n</code-snippet>\n\n### Programmatic Navigation\n\n<code-snippet name=\"Router Visit\" lang=\"react\">\n\nimport { router } from ''@inertiajs/react''\n\nfunction handleClick() {\n    router.visit(''/users'')\n}\n\n// Or with options\nrouter.visit(''/users'', {\n    method: ''post'',\n    data: { name: ''John'' },\n    onSuccess: () => console.log(''Success!''),\n})\n\n</code-snippet>\n\n## Form Handling\n\n### Form Component (Recommended)\n\nThe recommended way to build forms is with the `<Form>` component:\n\n<code-snippet name=\"Form Component Example\" lang=\"react\">\n\nimport { Form } from ''@inertiajs/react''\n\nexport default function CreateUser() {\n    return (\n        <Form action=\"/users\" method=\"post\">\n            {({ errors, processing, wasSuccessful }) => (\n                <>\n                    <input type=\"text\" name=\"name\" />\n                    {errors.name && <div>{errors.name}</div>}\n\n                    <input type=\"email\" name=\"email\" />\n                    {errors.email && <div>{errors.email}</div>}\n\n                    <button type=\"submit\" disabled={processing}>\n                        {processing ? ''Creating...'' : ''Create User''}\n                    </button>\n\n                    {wasSuccessful && <div>User created!</div>}\n                </>\n            )}\n        </Form>\n    )\n}\n\n</code-snippet>\n\n### Form Component With All Props\n\n<code-snippet name=\"Form Component Full Example\" lang=\"react\">\n\nimport { Form } from ''@inertiajs/react''\n\n<Form action=\"/users\" method=\"post\">\n    {({\n        errors,\n        hasErrors,\n        processing,\n        progress,\n        wasSuccessful,\n        recentlySuccessful,\n        clearErrors,\n        resetAndClearErrors,\n        defaults,\n        isDirty,\n        reset,\n        submit\n    }) => (\n        <>\n            <input type=\"text\" name=\"name\" defaultValue={defaults.name} />\n            {errors.name && <div>{errors.name}</div>}\n\n            <button type=\"submit\" disabled={processing}>\n                {processing ? ''Saving...'' : ''Save''}\n            </button>\n\n            {progress && (\n                <progress value={progress.percentage} max=\"100\">\n                    {progress.percentage}%\n                </progress>\n            )}\n\n            {wasSuccessful && <div>Saved!</div>}\n        </>\n    )}\n</Form>\n\n</code-snippet>\n\n### Form Component Reset Props\n\nThe `<Form>` component supports automatic resetting:\n\n- `resetOnError` - Reset form data when the request fails\n- `resetOnSuccess` - Reset form data when the request succeeds\n- `setDefaultsOnSuccess` - Update default values on success\n\nUse the `search-docs` tool with a query of `form component resetting` for detailed guidance.\n\n<code-snippet name=\"Form with Reset Props\" lang=\"react\">\n\nimport { Form } from ''@inertiajs/react''\n\n<Form\n    action=\"/users\"\n    method=\"post\"\n    resetOnSuccess\n    setDefaultsOnSuccess\n>\n    {({ errors, processing, wasSuccessful }) => (\n        <>\n            <input type=\"text\" name=\"name\" />\n            {errors.name && <div>{errors.name}</div>}\n\n            <button type=\"submit\" disabled={processing}>\n                Submit\n            </button>\n        </>\n    )}\n</Form>\n\n</code-snippet>\n\nForms can also be built using the `useForm` helper for more programmatic control. Use the `search-docs` tool with a query of `useForm helper` for guidance.\n\n### `useForm` Hook\n\nFor more programmatic control or to follow existing conventions, use the `useForm` hook:\n\n<code-snippet name=\"useForm Hook Example\" lang=\"react\">\n\nimport { useForm } from ''@inertiajs/react''\n\nexport default function CreateUser() {\n    const { data, setData, post, processing, errors, reset } = useForm({\n        name: '''',\n        email: '''',\n        password: '''',\n    })\n\n    function submit(e) {\n        e.preventDefault()\n        post(''/users'', {\n            onSuccess: () => reset(''password''),\n        })\n    }\n\n    return (\n        <form onSubmit={submit}>\n            <input\n                type=\"text\"\n                value={data.name}\n                onChange={e => setData(''name'', e.target.value)}\n            />\n            {errors.name && <div>{errors.name}</div>}\n\n            <input\n                type=\"email\"\n                value={data.email}\n                onChange={e => setData(''email'', e.target.value)}\n            />\n            {errors.email && <div>{errors.email}</div>}\n\n            <input\n                type=\"password\"\n                value={data.password}\n                onChange={e => setData(''password'', e.target.value)}\n            />\n            {errors.password && <div>{errors.password}</div>}\n\n            <button type=\"submit\" disabled={processing}>\n                Create User\n            </button>\n        </form>\n    )\n}\n\n</code-snippet>\n\n## Inertia v2 Features\n\n### Deferred Props\n\nUse deferred props to load data after initial page render:\n\n<code-snippet name=\"Deferred Props with Empty State\" lang=\"react\">\n\nexport default function UsersIndex({ users }) {\n    // users will be undefined initially, then populated\n    return (\n        <div>\n            <h1>Users</h1>\n            {!users ? (\n                <div className=\"animate-pulse\">\n                    <div className=\"h-4 bg-gray-200 rounded w-3/4 mb-2\"></div>\n                    <div className=\"h-4 bg-gray-200 rounded w-1/2\"></div>\n                </div>\n            ) : (\n                <ul>\n                    {users.map(user => (\n                        <li key={user.id}>{user.name}</li>\n                    ))}\n                </ul>\n            )}\n        </div>\n    )\n}\n\n</code-snippet>\n\n### Polling\n\nAutomatically refresh data at intervals:\n\n<code-snippet name=\"Polling Example\" lang=\"react\">\n\nimport { router } from ''@inertiajs/react''\nimport { useEffect } from ''react''\n\nexport default function Dashboard({ stats }) {\n    useEffect(() => {\n        const interval = setInterval(() => {\n            router.reload({ only: [''stats''] })\n        }, 5000) // Poll every 5 seconds\n\n        return () => clearInterval(interval)\n    }, [])\n\n    return (\n        <div>\n            <h1>Dashboard</h1>\n            <div>Active Users: {stats.activeUsers}</div>\n        </div>\n    )\n}\n\n</code-snippet>\n\n### WhenVisible (Infinite Scroll)\n\nLoad more data when user scrolls to a specific element:\n\n<code-snippet name=\"Infinite Scroll with WhenVisible\" lang=\"react\">\n\nimport { WhenVisible } from ''@inertiajs/react''\n\nexport default function UsersList({ users }) {\n    return (\n        <div>\n            {users.data.map(user => (\n                <div key={user.id}>{user.name}</div>\n            ))}\n\n            {users.next_page_url && (\n                <WhenVisible\n                    data=\"users\"\n                    params={{ page: users.current_page + 1 }}\n                    fallback={<div>Loading more...</div>}\n                />\n            )}\n        </div>\n    )\n}\n\n</code-snippet>\n\n## Common Pitfalls\n\n- Using traditional `<a>` links instead of Inertia''s `<Link>` component (breaks SPA behavior)\n- Forgetting to add loading states (skeleton screens) when using deferred props\n- Not handling the `undefined` state of deferred props before data loads\n- Using `<form>` without preventing default submission (use `<Form>` component or `e.preventDefault()`)\n- Forgetting to check if `<Form>` component is available in your Inertia version"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:09:43.541Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents specializing in React development and needing seamless integration with Inertia protocol for efficient client-side navigation and form handling.","zh":"非常适合专门从事React开发的前端代理，并需要与Inertia协议进行无缝集成，以实现高效的客户端导航和表单处理。","ja":"React開発を専門とするフロントエンドエージェントに最適であり、Inertiaプロトコルとのシームレスな統合が必要となるクライアントサイドナビゲーションとフォームハンドリングの効率化に役立ちます。","ko":"React 개발을 전문으로 하는 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합하며, 효율적인 클라이언트 측 탐색 및 양식 처리를 위해 Inertia 프로토콜과 무결점 통합이 필요한 경우에 유용합니다.","es":"Perfect for Frontend Agents specializing in React development and needing seamless integration with Inertia protocol for efficient client-side navigation and form handling.","fr":"Perfect for Frontend Agents specializing in React development and needing seamless integration with Inertia protocol for efficient client-side navigation and form handling.","de":"Perfect for Frontend Agents specializing in React development and needing seamless integration with Inertia protocol for efficient client-side navigation and form handling.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend especializados em desenvolvimento React e que necessitam de integração transparente com o protocolo Inertia para navegação e manipulação de formulários eficientes no lado do cliente.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, специализирующихся на разработке React и требующих бесшовной интеграции с протоколом Inertia для эффективной навигации и обработки форм на стороне клиента.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأماميين المتخصصين في تطوير React والذين يحتاجون إلى تكامل متوافق مع بروتوكول Inertia للتنقل الفعال ومعالجة النماذج على جانب العميل."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build robust React applications with Inertia, leveraging features like deferred props, prefetching, and polling, while streamlining tasks such as creating, modifying, and managing React page components, forms, and client-side navigation with <Link> or router.","zh":"赋予代理构建强大的React应用程序的能力，利用Inertia的特性，如deferred props、预取和轮询，同时简化创建、修改和管理React页面组件、表单和客户端导航的任务，使用<Link>或路由器。","ja":"エージェントはInertiaを利用して堅牢なReactアプリケーションを構築し、遅延プロパティ、事前取得、ポーリングなどの機能を活用し、<Link>またはルーターを使用してReactページコンポーネント、フォーム、クライアントサイドナビゲーションの作成、変更、管理などのタスクを効率化できます。","ko":"에이전트가 Inertia를 사용하여 강력한 React 애플리케이션을 구축할 수 있도록 해주며, 지연된 속성, 사전 가져오기, 폴링 등의 기능을 활용하여 React 페이지 컴포넌트, 양식, 클라이언트 측 탐색의 생성, 수정 및 관리 등의 태스크를 간소화합니다.","es":"Empowers agents to build robust React applications with Inertia, leveraging features like deferred props, prefetching, and polling, while streamlining tasks such as creating, modifying, and managing React page components, forms, and client-side navigation with <Link> or router.","fr":"Empowers agents to build robust React applications with Inertia, leveraging features like deferred props, prefetching, and polling, while streamlining tasks such as creating, modifying, and managing React page components, forms, and client-side navigation with <Link> or router.","de":"Empowers agents to build robust React applications with Inertia, leveraging features like deferred props, prefetching, and polling, while streamlining tasks such as creating, modifying, and managing React page components, forms, and client-side navigation with <Link> or router.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a construir aplicações React robustas com Inertia, aproveitando recursos como props adiados, pré-carregamento e polling, enquanto simplifica tarefas como criar, modificar e gerenciar componentes de página React, formulários e navegação do lado do cliente com <Link> ou router.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать прочные приложения React с Inertia, используя функции seperti отложенные свойства, предварительная загрузка и опрос, в то же время упрощая задачи, такие как создание, изменение и управление компонентами страниц React, формами и навигацией на стороне клиента с <Link> или router.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من بناء تطبيقات React قوية مع Inertia، مستفيدة من الميزات مثل الخصائص المؤجلة، وتحميل المسبق، وعمليات الاستطلاع، في حين تبسط المهام مثل إنشاء وتعديل وإدارة مكونات صفحة React والاستمارات والتنقل على جانب العميل مع <Link> أو router."},"useCases":{"en":["Building React-specific features with the Inertia protocol","Implementing client-side navigation with <Link> or router","Creating or modifying React page components for Inertia","Working with forms in React using <Form> or useForm"],"zh":["使用Inertia协议构建React特定功能","使用<Link>或路由器实现客户端导航","为Inertia创建或修改React页面组件","在React中使用<Form>或useForm处理表单"],"ja":["Inertiaプロトコルを使用してReact固有の機能を構築する","<Link>またはルーターを使用してクライアントサイドナビゲーションを実装する","Inertia用にReactページコンポーネントを作成または変更する","Reactで<Form>またはuseFormを使用してフォームを処理する"],"ko":["Inertia 프로토콜을 사용하여 React 특정 기능을 구축하는こと","<Link> 또는 라우터를 사용하여 클라이언트 측 탐색을 구현하는 것","Inertia용 React 페이지 컴포넌트를 생성하거나 수정하는 것","React에서 <Form> 또는 useForm를 사용하여 양식을 처리하는 것"],"es":["Building React-specific features with the Inertia protocol","Implementing client-side navigation with <Link> or router","Creating or modifying React page components for Inertia","Working with forms in React using <Form> or useForm"],"fr":["Building React-specific features with the Inertia protocol","Implementing client-side navigation with <Link> or router","Creating or modifying React page components for Inertia","Working with forms in React using <Form> or useForm"],"de":["Building React-specific features with the Inertia protocol","Implementing client-side navigation with <Link> or router","Creating or modifying React page components for Inertia","Working with forms in React using <Form> or useForm"],"pt":["Construir recursos específicos do React com o protocolo Inertia","Implementar navegação do lado do cliente com <Link> ou router","Criar ou modificar componentes de página React para Inertia","Trabalhar com formulários no React usando <Form> ou useForm"],"ru":["Создание функций, специфичных для React, с протоколом Inertia","Реализация навигации на стороне клиента с <Link> или router","Создание или изменение компонентов страниц React для Inertia","Работа с формами в React с помощью <Form> или useForm"],"ar":["بناء ميزات محددة لReact مع بروتوكول Inertia","تطبيق التنقل على جانب العميل مع <Link> أو router","إنشاء أو تعديل مكونات صفحة React لInertia","العمل مع الاستمارات في React باستخدام <Form> أو useForm"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Inertia v2 features knowledge","Specific to React development","Needs understanding of Inertia protocol and its integration with React"],"zh":["需要Inertia v2功能知识","仅限React开发","需要了解Inertia协议及其与React的集成"],"ja":["Inertia v2機能の知識が必要","React開発専用","InertiaプロトコルとそのReactとの統合についての理解が必要"],"ko":["Inertia v2 기능에 대한 지식이 필요합니다","React 개발 전용","Inertia 프로토콜 및 React와의 통합에 대한 이해가 필요합니다"],"es":["Requires Inertia v2 features knowledge","Specific to React development","Needs understanding of Inertia protocol and its integration with React"],"fr":["Requires Inertia v2 features knowledge","Specific to React development","Needs understanding of Inertia protocol and its integration with React"],"de":["Requires Inertia v2 features knowledge","Specific to React development","Needs understanding of Inertia protocol and its integration with React"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento de recursos do Inertia v2","Específico para desenvolvimento React","Necessita compreensão do protocolo Inertia e sua integração com React"],"ru":["Требует знания функций Inertia v2","Специфичен для разработки React","Требует понимания протокола Inertia и его интеграции с React"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة بميزات Inertia v2","محدد لتطوير React","يحتاج إلى فهم بروتوكول Inertia وتكاملها مع React"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"57d99997545f761d70f79d133db3b708f168e6134e88e8bfb2885950809e280e","qualityScore":29}');
