草稿 PR、コードレビューなどを含む","ko":"GitHub PR 스킬은 코드 리뷰와 자동화 워크플로의 솔루션을 제공하며 PR 생성, 초안 PR, 코드 리뷰 등을 포함","es":"El agente PR ofrece automatización de flujo de trabajo de Git y GitHub con tres operaciones core: crear, draft y revisar PR","fr":"L''agent PR propose une automatisation du workflow Git et GitHub avec trois opérations de base : créer, ébaucher et examiner les PR","de":"Der PR-Agent bietet eine Automatisierung des Git- und GitHub-Workflows mit drei Kernoperationen: Erstellen, Entwurf und Überprüfen von PR","pt":"Otimização do fluxo de trabalho do GitHub com PR para desenvolvedores, incluindo criação e revisão de pull requests","ru":"Автоматизация рабочего процесса GitHub с помощью PR для разработчиков, включая создание и проверку запросов на вытягивание","ar":"تحسين تدفق العمل على GitHub مع PR للمطورين، بما في ذلك إنشاء ومراجعة طلبات السحب","en":"Context manager for all agents"},"definition":{"en":"Context manager for all agents"},"features":{"zh":["创建 PR","草稿 PR","代码审查","GitHub CLI 命令集成"],"ja":["PR の作成","草稿 PR","コードレビュー","GitHub CLI コマンドの統合"],"ko":["PR 생성","초안 PR","코드 리뷰","GitHub CLI 명령어 통합"],"es":["Creación de PR con descripciones completas","PR de draft para trabajo en progreso","Revisión de código con calificaciones de gravedad","Integración con GitHub CLI","Automatización de flujo de trabajo de Git y GitHub"],"fr":["Création de PR avec des descriptions complètes","PR de brouillon pour les travaux en cours","Examen de code avec des évaluations de gravité","Intégration avec GitHub CLI","Automatisation du workflow Git et GitHub"],"de":["Erstellung von PR mit umfassenden Beschreibungen","PR-Entwurf für Arbeit in Bearbeitung","Code-Überprüfung mit Schweregrad-Bewertungen","Integration mit GitHub CLI","Automatisierung des Git- und GitHub-Workflows"],"pt":["Criação de PRs regulares com descrições abrangentes","Criação de rascunhos de PRs sem revisão automática","Revisão de PRs com análise de código e classificação de gravidade","Uso de comandos CLI do GitHub para visualizar e criar PRs","Integração com fluxos de trabalho do Git e GitHub"],"ru":["Создание регулярных PR с подробными описаниями","Создание черновиков PR без автоматической проверки","Проверка PR с анализом кода и рейтингом серьезности","Использование команд CLI GitHub для просмотра и создания PR","Интеграция с рабочими процессами Git и GitHub"],"ar":["إنشاء PRs منتظمة مع описات شاملة","إنشاء مسودات PR بدون مراجعة آلية","مراجعة PRs مع تحليل الكود وتقييم الجدية","استخدام أوامر CLI من GitHub لعرض وإنشاء PRs","التكامل مع تدفقات العمل على Git و GitHub"]},"keywords":{"zh":["GitHub PR","代码审查","自动化工作流","Git 工作流","GitHub CLI"],"ja":["GitHub PR","コードレビュー","自動化ワークフロー","Git ワークフロー","GitHub CLI"],"ko":["GitHub PR","코드 리뷰","자동화 워크플로","Git 워크플로","GitHub CLI"],"es":["automatización de flujo de trabajo","Git y GitHub","PR","colaboración","desarrollo de software","GitHub CLI","automatización de código"],"fr":["automatisation du workflow","Git et GitHub","PR","collaboration","développement de logiciels","GitHub CLI","automatisation de code"],"de":["Automatisierung des Workflows","Git und GitHub","PR","Zusammenarbeit","Software-Entwicklung","GitHub CLI","Automatisierung von Code"],"pt":["GitHub","PR","fluxo de trabalho","automação","desenvolvedores","Git","CLI","revisão de código","análise de código"],"ru":["GitHub","PR","рабочий процесс","автоматизация","разработчики","Git","CLI","проверка кода","анализ кода"],"ar":["GitHub","PR","تدفق العمل","تأتمة","مطورين","Git","CLI","مراجعة الكود","تحليل الكود"]}},"owner":"udecode","repo":"dotai","repoPath":"udecode/dotai","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.876Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"pr","description":"Comprehensive GitHub pull request management - create regular/draft PRs with descriptions and commits, review PRs with severity ratings. Triggers on create a PR, make a draft PR, review PR, or any PR workflow task.","bodyPreview":"Expert Git and GitHub workflow automation with three core operations:\n\n## Operations\n\n1. **Create PR** - Regular PRs with comprehensive descriptions\n2. **Draft PR** - WIP PRs without automatic review\n3. **Review PR** - Code analysis with severity ratings\n\n## Common GitHub CLI Commands\n\n```bash\n# PR info\ngh pr view [number]                    # View PR\ngh pr list                             # List PRs\ngh pr diff [number]                    # Get diff\n\n# PR creation\ngh pr create --title \"\" --body","body":"Expert Git and GitHub workflow automation with three core operations:\n\n## Operations\n\n1. **Create PR** - Regular PRs with comprehensive descriptions\n2. **Draft PR** - WIP PRs without automatic review\n3. **Review PR** - Code analysis with severity ratings\n\n## Common GitHub CLI Commands\n\n```bash\n# PR info\ngh pr view [number]                    # View PR\ngh pr list                             # List PRs\ngh pr diff [number]                    # Get diff\n\n# PR creation\ngh pr create --title \"\" --body \"\"      # Regular PR\ngh pr create --draft --title \"\" --body \"\"  # Draft PR\n\n# PR updates\ngh pr edit --body \"\"                   # Update description\ngh pr comment [number] --body \"\"       # Add comment\ngh pr ready [number]                   # Mark draft ready\n\n# Reviews\ngh pr review [number] --approve --body \"\"\ngh pr review [number] --request-changes --body \"\"\ngh pr view [number] --comments         # View comments\n\n# Git commands\ngit branch --show-current              # Current branch\ngit status                             # Check changes\ngit diff [--cached]                    # View changes\ngit log --oneline -n 5                 # Recent commits\n```\n\n## Workflow Selection\n\nDetermine operation from user request:\n\n- **\"Create a PR\"** → Read [references/create.md](references/create.md)\n- **\"Create a draft PR\"** or **\"Draft PR\"** → Read [references/draft.md](references/draft.md)\n- **\"Review PR\"** or **\"Review this PR\"** → Read [references/review.md](references/review.md)\n\nEach reference file contains complete workflow, templates, and best practices for that operation.\n\n## Branch Naming Conventions\n\n- `feature/description` - New features\n- `fix/bug-description` - Bug fixes\n- `refactor/component-name` - Code refactoring\n- `docs/update-readme` - Documentation\n- `test/add-unit-tests` - Test additions\n\n## Commit Message Conventions\n\n- `feat:` - New features\n- `fix:` - Bug fixes\n- `refactor:` - Code refactoring\n- `docs:` - Documentation\n- `test:` - Tests\n- `chore:` - Maintenance\n- `style:` - Formatting\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:07:12.723Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing streamlined GitHub workflow automation through context management","zh":"非常适合需要通过上下文管理简化 GitHub 工作流自动化的开发代理","ja":"GitHub のワークフロー自動化をコンテキスト管理を通じてストリームライン化する必要がある開発エージェントに最適","ko":"GitHub 작업 흐름 자동화를 컨텍스트 관리를 통해 간소화해야 하는 개발 에이전트에게 적합","es":"Perfect for Development Agents needing streamlined GitHub workflow automation through context management","fr":"Perfect for Development Agents needing streamlined GitHub workflow automation through context management","de":"Perfect for Development Agents needing streamlined GitHub workflow automation through context management","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que necessitam de automação de fluxo de trabalho do GitHub simplificada por meio de gerenciamento de contexto","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, которым требуется упрощенная автоматизация рабочего процесса GitHub посредством управления контекстом","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء النموزجيين الذين يحتاجون إلى تسهيل تدفق عمل GitHub من خلال إدارة السياق"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate Git and GitHub workflows using GitHub CLI commands, enabling efficient creation, drafting, and review of pull requests with comprehensive descriptions and severity ratings","zh":"赋予代理自动化 Git 和 GitHub 工作流的能力，使用 GitHub CLI 命令，实现高效的创建、草稿和审查拉取请求，具有全面描述和严重性评级","ja":"GitHub CLI コマンドを使用して Git と GitHub のワークフローを自動化する能力をエージェントに与え、プルリクエストの作成、下書き、レビューを効率よく行い、包括的な説明と重大度評価を付与する","ko":"GitHub CLI 명령을 사용하여 Git 및 GitHub 작업 흐름을 자동화할 수 있는 능력을 에이전트에게 부여하여, 효율적으로 풀 리퀘스트를 생성, 초안 작성 및審查하고, 포괄적인 설명 및 심각도 평가지정","es":"Empowers agents to automate Git and GitHub workflows using GitHub CLI commands, enabling efficient creation, drafting, and review of pull requests with comprehensive descriptions and severity ratings","fr":"Empowers agents to automate Git and GitHub workflows using GitHub CLI commands, enabling efficient creation, drafting, and review of pull requests with comprehensive descriptions and severity ratings","de":"Empowers agents to automate Git and GitHub workflows using GitHub CLI commands, enabling efficient creation, drafting, and review of pull requests with comprehensive descriptions and severity ratings","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar fluxos de trabalho do Git e do GitHub usando comandos da interface de linha de comando do GitHub, permitindo a criação eficiente, elaboração e revisão de solicitações de pull com descrições abrangentes e classificações de gravidade","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать рабочие процессы Git и GitHub с помощью команд GitHub CLI, обеспечивая эффективное создание, выработку и рассмотрение запросов на включение с всесторонними описаниями и рейтингами严ности","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تutomatisation تدفق عمل Git و GitHub باستخدام أوامر واجهة سطر الأوامر GitHub ، مما يتيح إنشاء كفء ، وكتابة ، ومراجعة طلبات السحب معوصافات شاملة وتقييمات خطورة"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating regular PR creation with detailed descriptions","Drafting WIP PRs without triggering automatic reviews","Reviewing code with severity ratings for improved quality control"],"zh":["自动创建带有详细描述的定期 PR","草稿 WIP PR 而不触发自动审查","使用严重性评级审查代码以提高质量控制"],"ja":["詳細な説明を付けた定期の PR を自動作成する","自動レビューをトリガーしない WIP PR を草稿化する","重大度評価を使用してコードをレビューし、品質管理を強化する"],"ko":["상세한 설명이 포함된 정기적인 PR을 자동으로 생성","자동審查를 트리거하지 않는 WIP PR을 초안 작성","심각도 평지를 사용하여 코드를審查하고 품질 관리를 개선"],"es":["Automating regular PR creation with detailed descriptions","Drafting WIP PRs without triggering automatic reviews","Reviewing code with severity ratings for improved quality control"],"fr":["Automating regular PR creation with detailed descriptions","Drafting WIP PRs without triggering automatic reviews","Reviewing code with severity ratings for improved quality control"],"de":["Automating regular PR creation with detailed descriptions","Drafting WIP PRs without triggering automatic reviews","Reviewing code with severity ratings for improved quality control"],"pt":["Automatização da criação regular de PR com descrições detalhadas","Elaboração de PRs em andamento sem acionar revisões automáticas","Revisão de código com classificações de gravidade para controle de qualidade aprimorado"],"ru":["Автоматизация регулярного создания PR с подробными описаниями","Создание черновых PR без запуска автоматических обзоров","Просмотр кода с рейтингами严ности для улучшенного контроля качества"],"ar":["التautomatisation إنشاء طلبات السحب المنتظمة معوصافات مفصلة","إنشاء مشاريع请求ات السحب قيد التنفيذ دون تشغيل المراجعات التلقائية","مراجعة الكود مع تقييمات خطورة لمراقبة الجودة المحسّنة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires GitHub CLI installation","Limited to GitHub workflows"],"zh":["需要安装 GitHub CLI","仅限 GitHub 工作流"],"ja":["GitHub CLI のインストールが必要","GitHub ワークフローに限定"],"ko":["GitHub CLI 설치가 필요","GitHub 작업 흐름에만 제한"],"es":["Requires GitHub CLI installation","Limited to GitHub workflows"],"fr":["Requires GitHub CLI installation","Limited to GitHub workflows"],"de":["Requires GitHub CLI installation","Limited to GitHub workflows"],"pt":["Requer instalação do GitHub CLI","Limitado a fluxos de trabalho do GitHub"],"ru":["Требуется установка GitHub CLI","Ограничен рабочими процессами GitHub"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت واجهة سطر الأوامر GitHub","محدود بتدفق عمل GitHub"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"b3e99f829bcd4a08ea6bcf4c8c9156d77acc1017e6e5efeec01ec132410dc007","qualityScore":28}');
