e l''identité unique en Rust"],"de":["Modellierung von Domains mit einem wissensbasierten Ansatz","Identifizierung von Entitäten und Wertobjekten in Rust","Definition von Invarianten und Aggregatgrenzen","Zuweisung von Rust-Mustern für Domain-Konzepte","Verwaltung von Eigentum und eindeutiger Identität in Rust"],"pt":["Modelagem de domínio com clareza","Orientação para desenvolvedores Rust","Identificação de entidades e objetos de valor","Definição de invariáveis e limites de agregação","Mapeamento de conceitos de domínio para padrões Rust","Gerenciamento de propriedade e identidade única"],"ru":["Четкая модель домена","Руководство для разработчиков Rust","Идентификация сущностей и объектов значения","Определение инвариантов и границ агрегации","Сопоставление концепций домена с шаблонами Rust","Управление собственностью и уникальной идентичностью"],"ar":["بناء نموذج متوافق بوضوح","توجيه لمطوري رست","تحديد الكيانات والأجسام القيمة","تحديد الثوابت وحدود التجميع","تعيين مفاهيم المتوافق مع أنماط رست","إدارة الملكية والهوية الفريدة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Rust领域建模","元问题驱动","知识索引","实体","值对象","不变量","聚合边界","Rust模式","所有权"],"ja":["Rustドメインモデリング","メタ問題駆動","ナレッジインデックス","エンティティ","値オブジェクト","不変量","集約境界","Rustパターン","所有権"],"ko":["Rust 도메인 모델링","메타 문제 驱动","지식 색인","엔티티","값 객체","불변량","집합 경계","Rust 패턴","소유권"],"es":["desarrollo de Rust","asistencia de desarrollo de IA","modelado de dominios","conocimiento dirigido por problemas","entidades y objetos de valor","invariantes y límites de agregación","patrones de Rust"],"fr":["développement de Rust","assistance de développement de l''IA","modélisation de domaines","connaissance dirigée par des problèmes","entités et objets de valeur","invariants et limites d''agrégation","modèles Rust"],"de":["Rust-Entwicklung","Entwicklungssystem für künstliche Intelligenz","Modellierung von Domains","wissensbasierter Ansatz","Entitäten und Wertobjekte","Invarianten und Aggregatgrenzen","Rust-Muster"],"pt":["desenvolvimento Rust","modelagem de domínio","sistema de assistência","padrões Rust","entidades e objetos de valor","invariáveis e limites de agregação","gerenciamento de propriedade","identidade única"],"ru":["разработка на Rust","моделирование домена","система помощи","шаблоны Rust","сущности и объекты значения","инварианты и границы агрегации","управление собственностью","уникальная идентичность"],"ar":["تطوير رست","بناء نموذج متوافق","نظام مساعدة","أنماط رست","الكيانات والأجسام القيمة","الثوابت وحدود التجميع","إدارة الملكية","الهوية الفريدة"]}},"owner":"actionbook","repo":"rust-skills","repoPath":"actionbook/rust-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.880Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"m09-domain","description":"CRITICAL: Use for domain modeling. Triggers: domain model, DDD, domain-driven design, entity, value object, aggregate, repository pattern, business rules, validation, invariant, 领域模型, 领域驱动设计, 业务规则","bodyPreview":"# Domain Modeling\n\n> **Layer 2: Design Choices**\n\n## Core Question\n\n**What is this concept''s role in the domain?**\n\nBefore modeling in code, understand:\n- Is it an Entity (identity matters) or Value Object (interchangeable)?\n- What invariants must be maintained?\n- Where are the aggregate boundaries?\n\n---\n\n## Domain Concept → Rust Pattern\n\n| Domain Concept | Rust Pattern | Ownership Implication |\n|----------------|--------------|----------------------|\n| Entity | struct + Id | Owned, unique ident","body":"# Domain Modeling\n\n> **Layer 2: Design Choices**\n\n## Core Question\n\n**What is this concept''s role in the domain?**\n\nBefore modeling in code, understand:\n- Is it an Entity (identity matters) or Value Object (interchangeable)?\n- What invariants must be maintained?\n- Where are the aggregate boundaries?\n\n---\n\n## Domain Concept → Rust Pattern\n\n| Domain Concept | Rust Pattern | Ownership Implication |\n|----------------|--------------|----------------------|\n| Entity | struct + Id | Owned, unique identity |\n| Value Object | struct + Clone/Copy | Shareable, immutable |\n| Aggregate Root | struct owns children | Clear ownership tree |\n| Repository | trait | Abstracts persistence |\n| Domain Event | enum | Captures state changes |\n| Service | impl block / free fn | Stateless operations |\n\n---\n\n## Thinking Prompt\n\nBefore creating a domain type:\n\n1. **What''s the concept''s identity?**\n   - Needs unique identity → Entity (Id field)\n   - Interchangeable by value → Value Object (Clone/Copy)\n\n2. **What invariants must hold?**\n   - Always valid → private fields + validated constructor\n   - Transition rules → type state pattern\n\n3. **Who owns this data?**\n   - Single owner (parent) → owned field\n   - Shared reference → Arc/Rc\n   - Weak reference → Weak\n\n---\n\n## Trace Up ↑\n\nTo domain constraints (Layer 3):\n\n```\n\"How should I model a Transaction?\"\n    ↑ Ask: What domain rules govern transactions?\n    ↑ Check: domain-fintech (audit, precision requirements)\n    ↑ Check: Business stakeholders (what invariants?)\n```\n\n| Design Question | Trace To | Ask |\n|-----------------|----------|-----|\n| Entity vs Value Object | domain-* | What makes two instances \"the same\"? |\n| Aggregate boundaries | domain-* | What must be consistent together? |\n| Validation rules | domain-* | What business rules apply? |\n\n---\n\n## Trace Down ↓\n\nTo implementation (Layer 1):\n\n```\n\"Model as Entity\"\n    ↓ m01-ownership: Owned, unique\n    ↓ m05-type-driven: Newtype for Id\n\n\"Model as Value Object\"\n    ↓ m01-ownership: Clone/Copy OK\n    ↓ m05-type-driven: Validate at construction\n\n\"Model as Aggregate\"\n    ↓ m01-ownership: Parent owns children\n    ↓ m02-resource: Consider Rc for shared within aggregate\n```\n\n---\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| DDD Concept | Rust Pattern | Example |\n|-------------|--------------|---------|\n| Value Object | Newtype | `struct Email(String);` |\n| Entity | Struct + ID | `struct User { id: UserId, ... }` |\n| Aggregate | Module boundary | `mod order { ... }` |\n| Repository | Trait | `trait UserRepo { fn find(...) }` |\n| Domain Event | Enum | `enum OrderEvent { Created, ... }` |\n\n## Pattern Templates\n\n### Value Object\n\n```rust\nstruct Email(String);\n\nimpl Email {\n    pub fn new(s: &str) -> Result<Self, ValidationError> {\n        validate_email(s)?;\n        Ok(Self(s.to_string()))\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### Entity\n\n```rust\nstruct UserId(Uuid);\n\nstruct User {\n    id: UserId,\n    email: Email,\n    // ... other fields\n}\n\nimpl PartialEq for User {\n    fn eq(&self, other: &Self) -> bool {\n        self.id == other.id  // Identity equality\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### Aggregate\n\n```rust\nmod order {\n    pub struct Order {\n        id: OrderId,\n        items: Vec<OrderItem>,  // Owned children\n        // ...\n    }\n\n    impl Order {\n        pub fn add_item(&mut self, item: OrderItem) {\n            // Enforce aggregate invariants\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Common Mistakes\n\n| Mistake | Why Wrong | Better |\n|---------|-----------|--------|\n| Primitive obsession | No type safety | Newtype wrappers |\n| Public fields with invariants | Invariants violated | Private + accessor |\n| Leaked aggregate internals | Broken encapsulation | Methods on root |\n| String for semantic types | No validation | Validated newtype |\n\n---\n\n## Related Skills\n\n| When | See |\n|------|-----|\n| Type-driven implementation | m05-type-driven |\n| Ownership for aggregates | m01-ownership |\n| Domain error handling | m13-domain-error |\n| Specific domain rules | domain-* |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:08:10.976Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Rust Developer Agents needing advanced domain modeling and meta-problem-driven knowledge indexing capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级领域建模和元问题驱动知识索引能力的Rust开发者代理。","ja":"Rust開発者エージェントが高度なドメインモデリングとメタ問題駆動のナレッジインデックス機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"고급 도메인 모델링 및 메타 문제 주도식 지식 색인 기능이 필요한 Rust 개발자 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Desarrollo de Rust que necesitan modelado de dominio avanzado y capacidades de indexación de conocimiento impulsadas por metaproblemas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement Rust nécessitant un modelage de domaine avancé et des capacités d''indexation de connaissances à base de métaproblèmes.","de":"Perfekt für Rust-Entwicklungsagenten, die erweitertes Domänenmodellieren und metaproblemgetriebene Wissensindexierungsfähigkeiten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvedores Rust que precisam de modelagem de domínio avançada e capacidades de indexação de conhecimento orientadas a metaproblemas.","ru":"Идеально для агентов разработчиков Rust, которым требуются продвинутые возможности моделирования домена и индексирования знаний, ориентированные на метазадачи.","ar":"مثالي لعميل مطور الرست الذي يحتاج إلى نمذجة مجال متقدمة وقدرات فهرسة المعرفة الموجهة بالمشكلات الفرعية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to design robust domain models using Rust patterns, maintaining invariants and aggregate boundaries, and leveraging concepts like Entities and Value Objects with ownership implications.","zh":"赋予代理设计使用Rust模式的强健域模型的能力，维护不变量和聚合边界，并利用实体和值对象等概念，同时考虑所有权的影响。","ja":"エージェントがRustパターンを使用して堅牢なドメインモデルを設計する能力を付与し、不変性と集約境界を維持し、所有権の影響を考慮してエンティティや値オブジェクトなどの概念を活用します。","ko":"에이전트가 러스트 패턴을 사용하여 강력한 도메인 모델을 설계할 수 있는 기능을 부여하며, 불변성과 집계 경계를 유지하고, 소유권의 영향을 고려하여 엔티티 및 값 객체 등의 개념을 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a diseñar modelos de dominio robustos utilizando patrones de Rust, manteniendo invariantes y límites de agregados, y aprovechando conceptos como Entidades y Objetos de Valor con implicaciones de propiedad.","fr":"Permet aux agents de concevoir des modèles de domaine robustes en utilisant des modèles Rust, en maintenant les invariants et les limites d''agrégats, et en exploitant des concepts tels que les Entités et les Objets de Valeur avec des implications de propriété.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, robuste Domänenmodelle unter Verwendung von Rust-Mustern zu entwerfen, Invarianten und Aggregatgrenzen beizubehalten und Konzepte wie Entitäten und Wertobjekte mit Eigentumsimplikationen zu nutzen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a projetar modelos de domínio robustos usando padrões Rust, mantendo invariantes e limites de agregados, e aproveitando conceitos como Entidades e Objetos de Valor com implicações de propriedade.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проектировать прочные модели домена с помощью шаблонов Rust, сохраняя инварианты и границы агрегатов, и использует концепции, такие как Сущности и Объекты-значения с последствиями владения.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تصميم نماذج مجال قوية باستخدام أنماط الرست، مع الحفاظ على الثوابت وحدود التجميع، وتعزيز مفاهيم مثل الكيانات وأجسام القيمة مع آثاره على الملكية."},"useCases":{"en":["Modeling complex domains with interchangeable Value Objects","Defining aggregate boundaries for data consistency","Implementing entity identification with unique identifiers"],"zh":["使用可交换的值对象建模复杂域","为数据一致性定义聚合边界","使用唯一标识符实现实体标识"],"ja":["交換可能な値オブジェクトを使用して複雑なドメインをモデリングする","データの一貫性のために集約境界を定義する","一意の識別子を使用してエンティティ識別を実装する"],"ko":["교환 가능한 값 객체를 사용하여 복잡한 도메인을 모델링하는 것","데이터 일관성을 위해 집계 경계를 정의하는 것","고유 식별자를 사용하여 엔티티 식별을 구현하는 것"],"es":["Modelado de dominios complejos con Objetos de Valor intercambiables","Definición de límites de agregados para la consistencia de los datos","Implementación de identificación de entidades con identificadores únicos"],"fr":["Modélisation de domaines complexes avec des Objets de Valeur interchangeables","Définition des limites d''agrégats pour la cohérence des données","Mise en œuvre de l''identification d''entités avec des identificateurs uniques"],"de":["Modellieren komplexer Domänen mit austauschbaren Wertobjekten","Definieren von Aggregatgrenzen für Datenkonsistenz","Implementieren der Entitätenidentifizierung mit eindeutigen Identifikatoren"],"pt":["Modelagem de domínios complexos com Objetos de Valor intercambiáveis","Definição de limites de agregados para consistência de dados","Implementação de identificação de entidades com identificadores únicos"],"ru":["Моделирование сложных доменов с взаимозаменяемыми Объектами-значениями","Определение границ агрегатов для согласованности данных","Реализация идентификации сущностей с уникальными идентификаторами"],"ar":["نمذجة مجالات معقدة مع أجسام قيمة قابلة للتبادل","تحديد حدود التجميع للاتساق البياناتي","تنفيذ تحديد الكيانات مع معرفات فريدة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of Rust programming language","Limited to domain modeling and knowledge indexing","Needs careful consideration of ownership implications"],"zh":["需要理解Rust编程语言","仅限于领域建模和知识索引","需要仔细考虑所有权的影响"],"ja":["Rustプログラミング言語の理解が必要","ドメインモデリングとナレッジインデックスに限定される","所有権の影響について慎重に考慮する必要がある"],"ko":["러스트 프로그래밍 언어를 이해해야 함","도메인 모델링 및 지식 색인에만限定됨","소유권의 영향을 신중하게 고려해야 함"],"es":["Requiere comprensión del lenguaje de programación Rust","Limitado al modelado de dominios y la indexación de conocimiento","Necesita una cuidadosa consideración de las implicaciones de propiedad"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension du langage de programmation Rust","Limité au modélisation de domaines et à l''indexation des connaissances","Nécessite une considération minutieuse des implications de propriété"],"de":["Erfordert Verständnis der Rust-Programmiersprache","Begrenzt auf Domänenmodellierung und Wissensindexierung","Benötigt sorgfältige Berücksichtigung der Eigentumsimplikationen"],"pt":["Requer conhecimento da linguagem de programação Rust","Limitado à modelagem de domínio e indexação de conhecimento","Necessita de consideração cuidadosa das implicações de propriedade"],"ru":["Требует понимания языка программирования Rust","Ограничен моделированием домена и индексированием знаний","Требует тщательного учета последствий владения"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة لغة البرمجة الرست","محدود بنمذجة المجال وفهرسة المعرفة","يحتاج إلى اعتبار دقيق لآثار الملكية"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"a05f32b475b01d630d54a38a4b9942499b8ea873bc6d2627144fcd8b85b8b53a","qualityScore":28}');
