sverwaltung für Flutter - asyncredux-pe...","pt":"Ferramentas de IA: asyncredux-persistence para Flutter","ru":"ИИ Агенты: asyncredux-persistence для Flutter","ar":"أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي: asyncredux-persistence ل Flutter","en":"asyncredux-persistence"},"description":{"zh":"AsyncRedux Persistence是Flutter应用的强大状态管理工具，提供高效的数据持久化和恢复功能。","ja":"AsyncRedux PersistenceはFlutterアプリの強力なステート管理ツールであり、効率的なデータ永続化と復元機能を提供します。","ko":"AsyncRedux Persistence는 Flutter 애플리케이션의 강력한 상태 관리 도구로, 효율적인 데이터 지속性와 복원 기능을 제공합니다.","es":"asyncredux-persistence es una poderosa herramienta de gestión de estado para Flutter. Obtenga más información en asyncredux.com","fr":"asyncredux-persistence est un outil puissant de gestion d''état pour Flutter. En savoir plus sur asyncredux.com","de":"asyncredux-persistence ist ein leistungsfähiges Tool für die Zustandsverwaltung in Flutter. Weitere Informationen auf asyncredux.com","pt":"asyncredux-persistence é uma ferramenta poderosa para gerenciar estados em aplicações Flutter. Confira a documentação em https://asyncredux.com","ru":"asyncredux-persistence - это мощный инструмент для управления состоянием в приложениях Flutter. Документация: https://asyncredux.com","ar":"asyncredux-persistence هو أداة قوية لإدارة الحالات في تطبيقات Flutter. استكشف الوثائق على https://asyncredux.com","en":"Powerful State Management for Flutter. Docs: https://asyncredux.com"},"definition":{"en":"Powerful State Management for Flutter. Docs: https://asyncredux.com"},"features":{"zh":["高效的数据持久化","自动数据恢复","支持Flutter应用","易于集成和使用","提高开发效率"],"ja":["効率的なデータ永続化","自動データ復元","Flutterアプリのサポート","簡単な統合と使用","開発効率の向上"],"ko":["효율적인 데이터 지속성","자동 데이터 복원","Flutter 애플리케이션 지원","쉬운 통합과 사용","개발 효율성 향상"],"es":["Gestión de estado asincrónica","Integración con Flutter","Documentación detallada en asyncredux.com","Mejora del rendimiento de la aplicación","Facilidad de uso y configuración"],"fr":["Gestion d''état asynchrone","Intégration avec Flutter","Documentation détaillée sur asyncredux.com","Amélioration des performances de l''application","Facilité d''utilisation et de configuration"],"de":["Asynchrone Zustandsverwaltung","Integration mit Flutter","Detaillierte Dokumentation auf asyncredux.com","Leistungsverbesserung der Anwendung","Einfache Bedienung und Konfiguration"],"pt":["Gerenciamento de estados eficiente","Integração com Flutter","Documentação completa em https://asyncredux.com","Suporte a desenvolvedores","Código-fonte aberto"],"ru":["Эффективное управление состоянием","Интеграция с Flutter","Полная документация на https://asyncredux.com","Поддержка разработчиков","Открытый исходный код"],"ar":["إدارة الحالات بفعالية","التكامل مع Flutter","وثائق شاملة على https://asyncredux.com","دعم المطورين","مصدر مفتوح"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AsyncRedux Persistence","Flutter状态管理","数据持久化","AI工具","如何使用AsyncRedux","AsyncReduxPersistence安装","AsyncRedux Persistence教程"],"ja":["AsyncRedux Persistence","Flutterステート管理","データ永続化","AIエージェント","AsyncReduxの使用方法","AsyncRedux Persistenceのインストール","AsyncRedux Persistenceのチュートリアル"],"ko":["AsyncRedux Persistence","Flutter 상태 관리","데이터 지속성","AI 에이전트","AsyncRedux 사용법","AsyncRedux Persistence 설치","AsyncRedux Persistence 튜토리얼"],"es":["herramientas de estado asincrónico","gestión de estado en Flutter","asyncredux-persistence","cómo usar asyncredux-persistence","alternativas a asyncredux-persistence","asyncredux-persistence vs Redux","instalación de asyncredux-persistence","guía de configuración de asyncredux-persistence"],"fr":["outils d''état asynchrone","gestion d''état dans Flutter","asyncredux-persistence","comment utiliser asyncredux-persistence","alternatives à asyncredux-persistence","asyncredux-persistence vs Redux","installation d''asyncredux-persistence","guide de configuration d''asyncredux-persistence"],"de":["asynchrone Zustandsverwaltungstools","Zustandsverwaltung in Flutter","asyncredux-persistence","wie man asyncredux-persistence verwendet","Alternativen zu asyncredux-persistence","asyncredux-persistence vs Redux","Installation von asyncredux-persistence","Konfigurationsanleitung für asyncredux-persistence"],"pt":["como usar asyncredux-persistence","o que é asyncredux-persistence","asyncredux-persistence vs outras bibliotecas","instalar asyncredux-persistence","guia de configuração do asyncredux-persistence","desenvolvimento de aplicações Flutter","gerenciamento de estados em Flutter","ferramentas de IA para desenvolvedores"],"ru":["как использовать asyncredux-persistence","что такое asyncredux-persistence","asyncredux-persistence vs другие библиотеки","установить asyncredux-persistence","руководство по настройке asyncredux-persistence","разработка приложений Flutter","управление состоянием в Flutter","инструменты ИИ для разработчиков"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام asyncredux-persistence","ما هو asyncredux-persistence","asyncredux-persistence مقابل مكتبات أخرى","تثبيت asyncredux-persistence","دليل إعداد asyncredux-persistence","تطوير تطبيقات Flutter","إدارة الحالات في Flutter","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للمطورين"]}},"owner":"marcglasberg","repo":"async_redux","repoPath":"marcglasberg/async_redux","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.896Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"asyncredux-persistence","description":"Implement local state persistence using Persistor. Covers creating a custom Persistor class, implementing `readState()`, `persistDifference()`, `deleteState()`, using LocalPersist helper, throttling saves, and pausing/resuming persistence with app lifecycle.","bodyPreview":"## Overview\n\nAsyncRedux provides state persistence by passing a `persistor` object to the Store. This maintains app state on disk, enabling restoration between sessions.\n\n## Store Initialization with Persistor\n\nAt startup, read any existing state from disk, create default state if none exists, then initialize the store:\n\n```dart\nvar persistor = MyPersistor();\n\nvar initialState = await persistor.readState();\n\nif (initialState == null) {\n  initialState = AppState.initialState();\n  await persistor.","body":"## Overview\n\nAsyncRedux provides state persistence by passing a `persistor` object to the Store. This maintains app state on disk, enabling restoration between sessions.\n\n## Store Initialization with Persistor\n\nAt startup, read any existing state from disk, create default state if none exists, then initialize the store:\n\n```dart\nvar persistor = MyPersistor();\n\nvar initialState = await persistor.readState();\n\nif (initialState == null) {\n  initialState = AppState.initialState();\n  await persistor.saveInitialState(initialState);\n}\n\nvar store = Store<AppState>(\n  initialState: initialState,\n  persistor: persistor,\n);\n```\n\n## The Persistor Abstract Class\n\nThe `Persistor<St>` base class defines these methods:\n\n```dart\nabstract class Persistor<St> {\n  /// Read persisted state, or return null if none exists\n  Future<St?> readState();\n\n  /// Delete state from disk\n  Future<void> deleteState();\n\n  /// Save state changes. Provides both newState and lastPersistedState\n  /// so you can compare them and save only the difference.\n  Future<void> persistDifference({\n    required St? lastPersistedState,\n    required St newState\n  });\n\n  /// Convenience method for initial saves\n  Future<void> saveInitialState(St state) =>\n    persistDifference(lastPersistedState: null, newState: state);\n\n  /// Controls save frequency. Return null to disable throttling.\n  Duration get throttle => const Duration(seconds: 2);\n}\n```\n\n## Creating a Custom Persistor\n\nExtend the abstract class and implement the required methods:\n\n```dart\nclass MyPersistor extends Persistor<AppState> {\n\n  @override\n  Future<AppState?> readState() async {\n    // Read state from disk (e.g., from SharedPreferences, file, etc.)\n    return null;\n  }\n\n  @override\n  Future<void> deleteState() async {\n    // Delete state from disk\n  }\n\n  @override\n  Future<void> persistDifference({\n    required AppState? lastPersistedState,\n    required AppState newState,\n  }) async {\n    // Save state to disk.\n    // You can compare lastPersistedState with newState to save only changes.\n  }\n\n  @override\n  Duration get throttle => const Duration(seconds: 2);\n}\n```\n\n## Throttling\n\nThe `throttle` getter controls how often state is saved. All changes within the throttle window are collected and saved in a single call. The default is 2 seconds.\n\n```dart\n// Save at most every 5 seconds\n@override\nDuration get throttle => const Duration(seconds: 5);\n\n// Disable throttling (save immediately on every change)\n@override\nDuration? get throttle => null;\n```\n\n## Forcing Immediate Save\n\nDispatch `PersistAction()` to save immediately, bypassing the throttle:\n\n```dart\nstore.dispatch(PersistAction());\n```\n\n## Pausing and Resuming Persistence\n\nControl persistence with these store methods:\n\n```dart\nstore.pausePersistor();           // Pause saving\nstore.persistAndPausePersistor(); // Save current state, then pause\nstore.resumePersistor();          // Resume saving\n```\n\n## App Lifecycle Integration\n\nPause persistence when the app goes to background and resume when it becomes active. Create an `AppLifecycleManager` widget:\n\n```dart\nclass AppLifecycleManager extends StatefulWidget {\n  final Widget child;\n\n  const AppLifecycleManager({\n    Key? key,\n    required this.child,\n  }) : super(key: key);\n\n  @override\n  _AppLifecycleManagerState createState() => _AppLifecycleManagerState();\n}\n\nclass _AppLifecycleManagerState extends State<AppLifecycleManager>\n    with WidgetsBindingObserver {\n\n  @override\n  void initState() {\n    super.initState();\n    WidgetsBinding.instance.addObserver(this);\n  }\n\n  @override\n  void dispose() {\n    WidgetsBinding.instance.removeObserver(this);\n    super.dispose();\n  }\n\n  @override\n  void didChangeAppLifecycleState(AppLifecycleState lifecycle) {\n    store.dispatch(ProcessLifecycleChange_Action(lifecycle));\n  }\n\n  @override\n  Widget build(BuildContext context) => widget.child;\n}\n```\n\nCreate an action to handle lifecycle changes:\n\n```dart\nclass ProcessLifecycleChange_Action extends ReduxAction<AppState> {\n  final AppLifecycleState lifecycle;\n\n  ProcessLifecycleChange_Action(this.lifecycle);\n\n  @override\n  Future<AppState?> reduce() async {\n    if (lifecycle == AppLifecycleState.resumed ||\n        lifecycle == AppLifecycleState.inactive) {\n      store.resumePersistor();\n    } else if (lifecycle == AppLifecycleState.paused ||\n        lifecycle == AppLifecycleState.detached) {\n      store.persistAndPausePersistor();\n    } else {\n      throw AssertionError(lifecycle);\n    }\n    return null;\n  }\n}\n```\n\nWrap your app with the lifecycle manager:\n\n```dart\nStoreProvider<AppState>(\n  store: store,\n  child: AppLifecycleManager(\n    child: MaterialApp( ... ),\n  ),\n)\n```\n\n## LocalPersist Helper\n\nThe `LocalPersist` class simplifies disk operations for Android/iOS. It works with simple object structures containing only primitives, lists, and maps.\n\n```dart\nimport ''package:async_redux/local_persist.dart'';\n\n// Create instance with a file name\nvar persist = LocalPersist(\"myFile\");\n\n// Save data\nList<Object> simpleObjs = [\n  ''Hello'',\n  42,\n  true,\n  [100, 200, {\"name\": \"John\"}],\n];\nawait persist.save(simpleObjs);\n\n// Load data\nList<Object> loaded = await persist.load();\n\n// Append data\nList<Object> moreObjs = [''more'', ''data''];\nawait persist.save(moreObjs, append: true);\n\n// File operations\nint length = await persist.length();\nbool exists = await persist.exists();\nawait persist.delete();\n\n// JSON operations for single objects\nawait persist.saveJson(simpleObj);\nObject? simpleObj = await persist.loadJson();\n```\n\n**Note:** `LocalPersist` only supports simple objects. For complex nested structures or custom classes, you need to implement serialization yourself (e.g., using JSON encoding with `toJson`/`fromJson` methods).\n\n## References\n\nURLs from the documentation:\n- https://asyncredux.com/sitemap.xml\n- https://asyncredux.com/flutter/miscellaneous/persistence\n- https://asyncredux.com/flutter/basics/store\n- https://asyncredux.com/flutter/miscellaneous/database-and-cloud\n- https://asyncredux.com/flutter/intro\n- https://asyncredux.com/flutter/testing/mocking\n- https://asyncredux.com/flutter/advanced-actions/redux-action\n- https://asyncredux.com/flutter/about\n- https://asyncredux.com/flutter/testing/store-tester\n- https://asyncredux.com/flutter/miscellaneous/advanced-waiting\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:10:45.193Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Flutter Agents requiring robust state management and persistence capabilities.","zh":"适用于需要强大的状态管理和持久化能力的Flutter Agents。","ja":"ロバストな状態管理と永続化能力を必要とするFlutter Agentsに適しています。","ko":"강력한 상태 관리 및 지속성 기능이 필요한 Flutter 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Flutter que requieren una gestión de estado y capacidades de persistencia robustas.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents Flutter nécessitant une gestion d''état et des capacités de persistance robustes.","de":"Ideal für Flutter-Agents, die eine robuste Zustandsverwaltung und Persistenzfähigkeiten erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agents Flutter que exigem gerenciamento de estado robusto e capacidades de persistência.","ru":"Идеально для агентов Flutter, требующих надежного управления состоянием и возможностей сохранения.","ar":"مثالي لموكلات Flutter التي تتطلب إدارة حالة قوية وقدرات استمرار."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to maintain app state on disk using a persistor object, enabling seamless restoration between sessions with AsyncRedux and Dart.","zh":"使得代理能够使用持久化对象在磁盘上维护应用程序状态，实现AsyncRedux和Dart之间的会话间无缝还原。","ja":"AsyncReduxとDartを使用してセッション間でシームレスに復元できるように、持続化オブジェクトを使用してアプリの状態をディスクに保持することができます。","ko":"AsyncRedux와 Dart를 사용하여 세션 간에 무중단으로 복원할 수 있도록 영속 객체를 사용하여 디스크에 앱 상태를 유지할 수 있습니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes para mantener el estado de la aplicación en disco utilizando un objeto persistor, lo que permite una restauración sin problemas entre sesiones con AsyncRedux y Dart.","fr":"Permet aux agents de maintenir l''état de l''application sur disque à l''aide d''un objet persistor, ce qui permet une restauration transparente entre les sessions avec AsyncRedux et Dart.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, den Applikationszustand auf der Festplatte mit einem Persistor-Objekt zu speichern, was eine nahtlose Wiederherstellung zwischen den Sitzungen mit AsyncRedux und Dart ermöglicht.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a manter o estado do aplicativo no disco usando um objeto persistor, permitindo restauração sem problemas entre sessões com AsyncRedux e Dart.","ru":"Позволяет агентам сохранять состояние приложения на диске с помощью объекта сохранения, обеспечивая бесшовное восстановление между сессиями с AsyncRedux и Dart.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من الحفاظ على حالة التطبيق على القرص باستخدام كائن منشئ الاستمرار، مما يسمح بالاستعادة دون مشاكل بين الجلسات مع AsyncRedux و Dart."},"useCases":{"en":["Initializing stores with persisted state","Restoring app state between sessions","Managing state persistence with custom persistor objects"],"zh":["使用持久化状态初始化存储","在会话之间恢复应用程序状态","使用自定义持久化对象管理状态持久性"],"ja":["永続化された状態を使用してストアを初期化する","セッション間でアプリケーションの状態を復元する","カスタムの永続化オブジェクトを使用して状態の永続性を管理する"],"ko":["영속성 상태를 사용하여 저장소를 초기화하는 것","세션 간에 앱 상태를 복원하는 것","사용자 지정 영속성 객체를 사용하여 상태 영속성을 관리하는 것"],"es":["Inicialización de tiendas con estado persistente","Restauración del estado de la aplicación entre sesiones","Gestión de la persistencia del estado con objetos persistor personalizados"],"fr":["Initialisation des magasins avec un état persistant","Restauration de l''état de l''application entre les sessions","Gestion de la persistance de l''état avec des objets persistor personnalisés"],"de":["Initialisierung von Stores mit persistiertem Zustand","Wiederherstellung des Applikationszustands zwischen den Sitzungen","Verwaltung der Zustandspersistenz mit benutzerdefinierten Persistor-Objekten"],"pt":["Inicializar lojas com estado persistido","Restaurar estado do aplicativo entre sessões","Gerenciar persistência de estado com objetos de persistor personalizados"],"ru":["Инициализация магазинов с сохраненным состоянием","Восстановление состояния приложения между сессиями","Управление сохранением состояния с помощью пользовательских объектов сохранения"],"ar":["ت.Initialize مخازن مع حالة مستمرة","استعادة حالة التطبيق بين الجلسات","إدارة استمرار الحالة باستخدام كائنات منشئ الاستمرار المخصصة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires AsyncRedux and Dart setup","Persistence limited to disk storage"],"zh":["需要AsyncRedux和Dart设置","仅限于磁盘存储的持久性"],"ja":["AsyncReduxとDartの設定が必要","永続性はディスクストレージに限定される"],"ko":["AsyncRedux 및 Dart 설정이 필요","영속성은 디스크 저장소에만 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere configuración de AsyncRedux y Dart","La persistencia está limitada al almacenamiento en disco"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration AsyncRedux et Dart","La persistance est limitée au stockage sur disque"],"de":["Benötigt AsyncRedux- und Dart-Setup","Die Persistenz ist auf die Festplattenspeicherung beschränkt"],"pt":["Exige configuração do AsyncRedux e Dart","Persistência limitada ao armazenamento em disco"],"ru":["Требует настройки AsyncRedux и Dart","Ограниченность сохранения только до хранилища на диске"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد AsyncRedux و Dart","الاستمرار مقيد بتخزين القرص"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"ac2c47d0f707b4154d017975f237601f43ff2093e2d0b078bfa67ee84bf3cc89","qualityScore":28}');
