P","Entwicklung von benutzerdefinierten Arbeitsabläufen","Unterstützung für mehrere Plattformen","Erweiterte Sicherheit und Authentifizierung","Überwachung und Analyse der Leistung"],"pt":["Automação de tarefas com Python","Integração com o React","Suporte ao Node.js","Interface de linha de comando (CLI)","Agentes de IA personalizados"],"ru":["Автоматизация задач с помощью Python","Интеграция с React","Поддержка Node.js","Интерфейс командной строки (CLI)","Пользовательские ИИ Агенты"],"ar":["التأتمتة المهام باستخدام Python","التكامل مع React","دعم Node.js","واجهة سطر الأوامر (CLI)","وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي المخصصة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Atlassian MCP AI智能代理","Orient平台开发","AI工具","Atlassian MCP alternative","Atlassian MCP vs Jira","Atlassian MCP安装","Atlassian MCP设置指南","如何使用Atlassian MCP","什么是Atlassian MCP"],"ja":["Atlassian MCP AIエージェント","Orientプラットフォーム開発","AIエージェント","Atlassian MCPの代替","Atlassian MCP vs Jira","Atlassian MCPのインストール","Atlassian MCPの設定ガイド","Atlassian MCPの使い方","Atlassian MCPとは"],"ko":["Atlassian MCP AI 에이전트","Orient 플랫폼 개발","AI 에이전트","Atlassian MCP 대체","Atlassian MCP vs Jira","Atlassian MCP 설치","Atlassian MCP 설정 가이드","Atlassian MCP 사용 방법","Atlassian MCP란"],"es":["cómo usar agentes de IA","qué es un agente de IA","alternativas a Atlassian MCP","Atlassian MCP vs Jira","instalación de agentes de IA","guía de configuración de agentes de IA","desarrollo de flujos de trabajo con agentes de IA"],"fr":["comment utiliser les agents d''IA","qu''est-ce qu''un agent d''IA","alternatives à Atlassian MCP","Atlassian MCP vs Jira","installation d''agents d''IA","guide de configuration d''agents d''IA","développement de flux de travail avec des agents d''IA"],"de":["wie man AI-Agents verwendet","was ist ein AI-Agent","Alternativen zu Atlassian MCP","Atlassian MCP vs Jira","Installation von AI-Agents","Konfigurationsanleitung für AI-Agents","Entwicklung von Arbeitsabläufen mit AI-Agents"],"pt":["como usar atlassian mcp","o que é agente de ia","atlassian mcp alternativa","atlassian mcp vs jira","instalar atlassian mcp","guia de configuração do atlassian mcp"],"ru":["как использовать atlassian mcp","что такое ии агент","atlassian mcp альтернатива","atlassian mcp vs jira","установить atlassian mcp","руководство по настройке atlassian mcp"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام atlassian mcp","ما هو وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي","atlassian mcp بديل","atlassian mcp مقابل jira","تثبيت atlassian mcp","دليل إعداد atlassian mcp"]}},"owner":"orient-bot","repo":"orient","repoPath":"orient-bot/orient","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.896Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"atlassian-mcp","description":"Use the Atlassian MCP Server to interact with JIRA from coding agents (Cursor, Claude Code). This skill documents how to use the official Atlassian MCP server for JIRA and Confluence operations. Enable this MCP server in your Cursor/Claude Code settings for JIRA access.","bodyPreview":"# Atlassian MCP Server for JIRA\n\nThe Atlassian MCP Server provides direct access to JIRA and Confluence from coding agents. This is the supported way to access Atlassian data from Cursor or Claude Code.\n\n## Setup\n\n### In Cursor\n\nThe Atlassian MCP Server is already configured globally. To enable it:\n\n1. Open Cursor Settings\n2. Go to Tools & MCP\n3. Enable \"Atlassian-MCP-Server\"\n\nConfiguration location: `~/.cursor/mcp.json`\n\n```json\n{\n  \"mcpServers\": {\n    \"Atlassian-MCP-Server\": {\n      \"url\": \"ht","body":"# Atlassian MCP Server for JIRA\n\nThe Atlassian MCP Server provides direct access to JIRA and Confluence from coding agents. This is the supported way to access Atlassian data from Cursor or Claude Code.\n\n## Setup\n\n### In Cursor\n\nThe Atlassian MCP Server is already configured globally. To enable it:\n\n1. Open Cursor Settings\n2. Go to Tools & MCP\n3. Enable \"Atlassian-MCP-Server\"\n\nConfiguration location: `~/.cursor/mcp.json`\n\n```json\n{\n  \"mcpServers\": {\n    \"Atlassian-MCP-Server\": {\n      \"url\": \"https://mcp.atlassian.com/v1/sse\"\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### In Claude Code\n\nAdd to your Claude Code MCP settings:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"mcpServers\": {\n    \"Atlassian-MCP-Server\": {\n      \"url\": \"https://mcp.atlassian.com/v1/sse\"\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Available Tools\n\nWhen enabled, the Atlassian MCP Server provides these tools:\n\n### Issue Operations\n\n| Tool                                     | Description                     |\n| ---------------------------------------- | ------------------------------- |\n| `mcp_Atlassian_getJiraIssue`             | Get details of a specific issue |\n| `mcp_Atlassian_createJiraIssue`          | Create a new issue              |\n| `mcp_Atlassian_editJiraIssue`            | Update an existing issue        |\n| `mcp_Atlassian_transitionJiraIssue`      | Change issue status             |\n| `mcp_Atlassian_searchJiraIssuesUsingJql` | Search issues with JQL          |\n\n### Comments\n\n| Tool                                  | Description                |\n| ------------------------------------- | -------------------------- |\n| `mcp_Atlassian_addCommentToJiraIssue` | Add a comment to an issue  |\n| `mcp_Atlassian_getJiraIssueComments`  | Get comments from an issue |\n\n### Confluence (if enabled)\n\n| Tool                                 | Description              |\n| ------------------------------------ | ------------------------ |\n| `mcp_Atlassian_createConfluencePage` | Create a Confluence page |\n| `mcp_Atlassian_getConfluencePage`    | Get a Confluence page    |\n| `mcp_Atlassian_searchConfluence`     | Search Confluence        |\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Get Issue Details\n\n```\nUse mcp_Atlassian_getJiraIssue with issueKey: \"PROJ-123\"\n```\n\n### Search for Issues\n\n```\nUse mcp_Atlassian_searchJiraIssuesUsingJql with:\n  jql: \"project = YOUR_PROJECT AND component = ''YOUR_COMPONENT'' AND status = ''In Progress''\"\n```\n\n### Create an Issue\n\n```\nUse mcp_Atlassian_createJiraIssue with:\n  project: \"YOUR_PROJECT\"\n  issueType: \"Story\"\n  summary: \"Implement new feature\"\n  description: \"Description of the feature\"\n  components: [\"YOUR_COMPONENT\"]\n```\n\n### Transition Issue Status\n\n```\nUse mcp_Atlassian_transitionJiraIssue with:\n  issueKey: \"PROJ-123\"\n  transition: \"In Progress\"\n```\n\n### Add Comment\n\n```\nUse mcp_Atlassian_addCommentToJiraIssue with:\n  issueKey: \"PROJ-123\"\n  comment: \"Started working on this issue\"\n```\n\n## JQL Quick Reference\n\nCommon JQL queries for the Orient Task Force:\n\n```jql\n# All issues for YOUR_COMPONENT\nproject = YOUR_PROJECT AND component = \"YOUR_COMPONENT\"\n\n# In Progress issues\nproject = YOUR_PROJECT AND component = \"YOUR_COMPONENT\" AND status = \"In Progress\"\n\n# Blockers\nproject = YOUR_PROJECT AND component = \"YOUR_COMPONENT\" AND (priority = Blocker OR labels = blocked)\n\n# Recent issues (last 7 days)\nproject = YOUR_PROJECT AND component = \"YOUR_COMPONENT\" AND created >= -7d\n\n# My issues\nproject = YOUR_PROJECT AND component = \"YOUR_COMPONENT\" AND assignee = currentUser()\n\n# Sprint issues\nproject = YOUR_PROJECT AND component = \"YOUR_COMPONENT\" AND sprint in openSprints()\n```\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### \"Tool not found\" Error\n\nMake sure the Atlassian MCP Server is enabled in your IDE settings. The tools won''t appear until the server is connected.\n\n### Authentication Issues\n\nThe Atlassian MCP Server uses OAuth. If you''re not authenticated:\n\n1. The tool will prompt you to authenticate\n2. Follow the OAuth flow in your browser\n3. Grant the necessary permissions\n\n### Rate Limits\n\nThe Atlassian MCP Server is subject to Atlassian''s rate limits. If you hit limits:\n\n- Reduce query frequency\n- Use more specific JQL to reduce result sets\n- Cache results when appropriate\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:10:45.435Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Coding Agents like Cursor or Claude Code needing direct access to JIRA and Confluence data via the Atlassian MCP Server","zh":"适合于像 Cursor 或 Claude Code 这样的编码代理，需要直接访问 JIRA 和 Confluence 数据通过 Atlassian MCP Server","ja":"Cursor または Claude Code のようなコーディングエージェントに適しています。JIRA と Confluence のデータに直接アクセスする必要があり、Atlassian MCP Server を介してアクセスします","ko":"Cursor 또는 Claude Code와 같은 코딩 에이전트에 적합합니다. JIRA 및 Confluence 데이터에 직접 액세ス해야 하며 Atlassian MCP Server를 통해 액세스합니다","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Codificación como Cursor o Claude Code que necesitan acceso directo a los datos de JIRA y Confluence a través del servidor Atlassian MCP","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de codage comme Cursor ou Claude Code ayant besoin d''un accès direct aux données JIRA et Confluence via le serveur Atlassian MCP","de":"Perfekt für Coding-Agents wie Cursor oder Claude Code, die direkten Zugriff auf JIRA- und Confluence-Daten über den Atlassian-MCP-Server benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Codificação como Cursor ou Claude Code que precisam de acesso direto aos dados do JIRA e Confluence via o Servidor Atlassian MCP","ru":"Идеально подходит для Кодировочных Агентов, таких как Cursor или Claude Code, требующих прямого доступа к данным JIRA и Confluence через Сервер Atlassian MCP","ar":"مثالي لعمليات التشفير مثل Cursor أو Claude Code التي تحتاج إلى الوصول المباشر إلى بيانات JIRA و Confluence عبر خادم Atlassian MCP"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to directly integrate with Atlassian tools using the MCP protocol, enabling seamless data exchange between JIRA, Confluence, and coding agents, with configuration stored in JSON files like `mcp.json`","zh":"赋予代理直接使用 MCP 协议集成 Atlassian 工具的能力，实现 JIRA、Confluence 和编码代理之间的无缝数据交换，配置存储在 JSON 文件中，如 `mcp.json`","ja":"MCP プロトコルを使用して Atlassian ツールを直接統合する能力をエージェントに与え、JIRA、Confluence、コーディング エージェント間のシームレスなデータ交換を可能にし、設定は JSON ファイルに保存されます。例: `mcp.json`","ko":"MCP 프로토콜을 사용하여 Atlassian 도구를 직접 통합할 수 있는 능력을 에이전트에게 부여하여 JIRA, Confluence 및 코딩 에이전트 간의 무шов한 데이터 교환을 가능하게 하며, 구성은 JSON 파일에 저장됩니다. 예: `mcp.json`","es":"Habilita a los agentes a integrarse directamente con las herramientas de Atlassian utilizando el protocolo MCP, lo que permite un intercambio de datos sin problemas entre JIRA, Confluence y agentes de codificación, con la configuración almacenada en archivos JSON como `mcp.json`","fr":"Permet aux agents d''intégrer directement avec les outils Atlassian en utilisant le protocole MCP, ce qui permet un échange de données sans rupture entre JIRA, Confluence et les agents de codage, avec la configuration stockée dans des fichiers JSON comme `mcp.json`","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, sich direkt mit Atlassian-Tools über das MCP-Protokoll zu integrieren, wodurch ein nahtloser Datenaustausch zwischen JIRA, Confluence und Coding-Agents ermöglicht wird, mit Konfigurationen in JSON-Dateien wie `mcp.json` gespeichert","pt":"Habilita os agentes a se integrarem diretamente com as ferramentas da Atlassian usando o protocolo MCP, permitindo uma troca de dados transparente entre JIRA, Confluence e agentes de codificação, com configuração armazenada em arquivos JSON como `mcp.json`","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью直接 интегрироваться с инструментами Atlassian с помощью протокола MCP, обеспечивая бесшовный обмен данными между JIRA, Confluence и кодировочными агентами, с конфигурацией, хранящейся в файлах JSON, таких как `mcp.json`","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من التكامل المباشر مع أدوات Atlassian باستخدام بروتوكول MCP، وتمكين تبادل البيانات السلس بين JIRA و Confluence ووكلاء التشفير، مع تخزين التكوين في ملفات JSON مثل `mcp.json`"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating JIRA issue tracking","Generating Confluence reports","Debugging Atlassian data integrations"],"zh":["自动化 JIRA 문제 추적","生成 Confluence 보고서","调试 Atlassian 데이터集成"],"ja":["JIRA の問題追跡の自動化","Confluence のレポートの生成","Atlassian データ統合のデバッグ"],"ko":["JIRA 이슈 추적 자동화","Confluence 보고서 생성","Atlassian 데이터 통합 디버깅"],"es":["Automatización del seguimiento de problemas de JIRA","Generación de informes de Confluence","Depuración de integraciones de datos de Atlassian"],"fr":["Automatisation du suivi des problèmes JIRA","Génération de rapports Confluence","Débogage des intégrations de données Atlassian"],"de":["Automatisierung der Fehlerverfolgung in JIRA","Erstellung von Confluence-Berichten","Fehlerbehebung bei Atlassian-Dateneinbindungen"],"pt":["Automatizar o acompanhamento de problemas do JIRA","Gerar relatórios do Confluence","Depurar integrações de dados da Atlassian"],"ru":["Автоматизация отслеживания проблем JIRA","Генерация отчетов Confluence","Отладка интеграций данных Atlassian"],"ar":["أتمتة تتبع مشاكل JIRA","إصدار تقارير Confluence","تصحيح أخطاء دمج البيانات في Atlassian"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Atlassian MCP Server setup","Configuration stored in `~/.cursor/mcp.json`","Specific to Atlassian tools"],"zh":["需要 Atlassian MCP Server 设置","配置存储在 `~/.cursor/mcp.json`","特定于 Atlassian 工具"],"ja":["Atlassian MCP Server の設定が必要","設定は `~/.cursor/mcp.json` に保存される","Atlassian ツールに特有"],"ko":["Atlassian MCP Server 설정이 필요","구성은 `~/.cursor/mcp.json`에 저장","Atlassian 도구에 특정"],"es":["Requiere configuración del servidor Atlassian MCP","Configuración almacenada en `~/.cursor/mcp.json`","Específico para herramientas de Atlassian"],"fr":["Nécessite la configuration du serveur Atlassian MCP","Configuration stockée dans `~/.cursor/mcp.json`","Spécifique aux outils Atlassian"],"de":["Benötigt die Einrichtung des Atlassian-MCP-Servers","Konfiguration in `~/.cursor/mcp.json` gespeichert","Spezifisch für Atlassian-Tools"],"pt":["Requer configuração do Servidor Atlassian MCP","Configuração armazenada em `~/.cursor/mcp.json`","Específico para ferramentas da Atlassian"],"ru":["Требует настройки Сервера Atlassian MCP","Конфигурация хранится в `~/.cursor/mcp.json`","Конкретно для инструментов Atlassian"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد خادم Atlassian MCP","التكوين المخزن في `~/.cursor/mcp.json`","محدد لأدوات Atlassian"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"bcbbf0c70289a046e14596f6d4bedb6367ee80f8ccfd0823e9ed03b0f045f809","qualityScore":28}');
