fica avançadas","Integração com Node.js para desenvolvimento de aplicações"],"ru":["Анализ научных данных с помощью Python","Интеграция с React для визуализации данных","Поддержка CLI для выполнения команд","Продвинутые инструменты научных исследований","Интеграция с Node.js для разработки приложений"],"ar":["تحليل البيانات العلمية باستخدام Python","التكامل مع React لتصور البيانات","دعم CLI لتشغيل الأوامر","أدوات متقدمة للبحث العلمي","التكامل مع Node.js لتطوير التطبيقات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用matchms","matchms是什么","matchms替代品","matchms与其他工具的比较","matchms安装","matchms设置指南","科学研究工具","AI智能工具","数据分析工具"],"ja":["matchmsの使い方","matchmsとは","matchmsの代替品","matchmsと他のツールの比較","matchmsのインストール","matchmsの設定ガイド","科学研究ツール","AIエージェント","データ分析ツール"],"ko":["matchms 사용법","matchms是什么","matchms 대체품","matchms와 다른 도구의 비교","matchms 설치","matchms 설정 가이드","과학 연구 도구","AI 에이전트","데이터 분석 도구"],"es":["cómo usar matchms","herramientas de investigación científica","matchms vs otros agentes de inteligencia artificial","instalación de matchms","guía de configuración de matchms","investigación científica con inteligencia artificial"],"fr":["comment utiliser matchms","outils de recherche scientifique","matchms vs d''autres agents d''intelligence artificielle","installation de matchms","guide de configuration de matchms","recherche scientifique avec intelligence artificielle"],"de":["wie man matchms verwendet","wissenschaftliche Forschungstools","matchms vs andere KI-Agents","Installation von matchms","Konfigurationsanleitung für matchms","wissenschaftliche Forschung mit künstlicher Intelligenz"],"pt":["como usar matchms","o que é matchms","matchms alternativa","matchms vs outras ferramentas","instalar matchms","guia de configuração do matchms","ferramentas de pesquisa científica","desenvolvimento de aplicações com matchms"],"ru":["как использовать matchms","что такое matchms","matchms альтернатива","matchms vs другие инструменты","установить matchms","руководство по настройке matchms","инструменты научных исследований","разработка приложений с matchms"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام matchms","ما هو matchms","بديل matchms","matchms مقابل أدوات أخرى","تثبيت matchms","دليل إعداد matchms","أدوات البحث العلمي","تطوير التطبيقات مع matchms"]}},"owner":"sanand0","repo":"scientific-research","repoPath":"sanand0/scientific-research","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.896Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"matchms","description":"Mass spectrometry analysis. Process mzML/MGF/MSP, spectral similarity (cosine, modified cosine), metadata harmonization, compound ID, for metabolomics and MS data processing.","bodyPreview":"# Matchms\n\n## Overview\n\nMatchms is an open-source Python library for mass spectrometry data processing and analysis. Import spectra from various formats, standardize metadata, filter peaks, calculate spectral similarities, and build reproducible analytical workflows.\n\n## Core Capabilities\n\n### 1. Importing and Exporting Mass Spectrometry Data\n\nLoad spectra from multiple file formats and export processed data:\n\n```python\nfrom matchms.importing import load_from_mgf, load_from_mzml, load_from_msp,","body":"# Matchms\n\n## Overview\n\nMatchms is an open-source Python library for mass spectrometry data processing and analysis. Import spectra from various formats, standardize metadata, filter peaks, calculate spectral similarities, and build reproducible analytical workflows.\n\n## Core Capabilities\n\n### 1. Importing and Exporting Mass Spectrometry Data\n\nLoad spectra from multiple file formats and export processed data:\n\n```python\nfrom matchms.importing import load_from_mgf, load_from_mzml, load_from_msp, load_from_json\nfrom matchms.exporting import save_as_mgf, save_as_msp, save_as_json\n\n# Import spectra\nspectra = list(load_from_mgf(\"spectra.mgf\"))\nspectra = list(load_from_mzml(\"data.mzML\"))\nspectra = list(load_from_msp(\"library.msp\"))\n\n# Export processed spectra\nsave_as_mgf(spectra, \"output.mgf\")\nsave_as_json(spectra, \"output.json\")\n```\n\n**Supported formats:**\n- mzML and mzXML (raw mass spectrometry formats)\n- MGF (Mascot Generic Format)\n- MSP (spectral library format)\n- JSON (GNPS-compatible)\n- metabolomics-USI references\n- Pickle (Python serialization)\n\nFor detailed importing/exporting documentation, consult `references/importing_exporting.md`.\n\n### 2. Spectrum Filtering and Processing\n\nApply comprehensive filters to standardize metadata and refine peak data:\n\n```python\nfrom matchms.filtering import default_filters, normalize_intensities\nfrom matchms.filtering import select_by_relative_intensity, require_minimum_number_of_peaks\n\n# Apply default metadata harmonization filters\nspectrum = default_filters(spectrum)\n\n# Normalize peak intensities\nspectrum = normalize_intensities(spectrum)\n\n# Filter peaks by relative intensity\nspectrum = select_by_relative_intensity(spectrum, intensity_from=0.01, intensity_to=1.0)\n\n# Require minimum peaks\nspectrum = require_minimum_number_of_peaks(spectrum, n_required=5)\n```\n\n**Filter categories:**\n- **Metadata processing**: Harmonize compound names, derive chemical structures, standardize adducts, correct charges\n- **Peak filtering**: Normalize intensities, select by m/z or intensity, remove precursor peaks\n- **Quality control**: Require minimum peaks, validate precursor m/z, ensure metadata completeness\n- **Chemical annotation**: Add fingerprints, derive InChI/SMILES, repair structural mismatches\n\nMatchms provides 40+ filters. For the complete filter reference, consult `references/filtering.md`.\n\n### 3. Calculating Spectral Similarities\n\nCompare spectra using various similarity metrics:\n\n```python\nfrom matchms import calculate_scores\nfrom matchms.similarity import CosineGreedy, ModifiedCosine, CosineHungarian\n\n# Calculate cosine similarity (fast, greedy algorithm)\nscores = calculate_scores(references=library_spectra,\n                         queries=query_spectra,\n                         similarity_function=CosineGreedy())\n\n# Calculate modified cosine (accounts for precursor m/z differences)\nscores = calculate_scores(references=library_spectra,\n                         queries=query_spectra,\n                         similarity_function=ModifiedCosine(tolerance=0.1))\n\n# Get best matches\nbest_matches = scores.scores_by_query(query_spectra[0], sort=True)[:10]\n```\n\n**Available similarity functions:**\n- **CosineGreedy/CosineHungarian**: Peak-based cosine similarity with different matching algorithms\n- **ModifiedCosine**: Cosine similarity accounting for precursor mass differences\n- **NeutralLossesCosine**: Similarity based on neutral loss patterns\n- **FingerprintSimilarity**: Molecular structure similarity using fingerprints\n- **MetadataMatch**: Compare user-defined metadata fields\n- **PrecursorMzMatch/ParentMassMatch**: Simple mass-based filtering\n\nFor detailed similarity function documentation, consult `references/similarity.md`.\n\n### 4. Building Processing Pipelines\n\nCreate reproducible, multi-step analysis workflows:\n\n```python\nfrom matchms import SpectrumProcessor\nfrom matchms.filtering import default_filters, normalize_intensities\nfrom matchms.filtering import select_by_relative_intensity, remove_peaks_around_precursor_mz\n\n# Define a processing pipeline\nprocessor = SpectrumProcessor([\n    default_filters,\n    normalize_intensities,\n    lambda s: select_by_relative_intensity(s, intensity_from=0.01),\n    lambda s: remove_peaks_around_precursor_mz(s, mz_tolerance=17)\n])\n\n# Apply to all spectra\nprocessed_spectra = [processor(s) for s in spectra]\n```\n\n### 5. Working with Spectrum Objects\n\nThe core `Spectrum` class contains mass spectral data:\n\n```python\nfrom matchms import Spectrum\nimport numpy as np\n\n# Create a spectrum\nmz = np.array([100.0, 150.0, 200.0, 250.0])\nintensities = np.array([0.1, 0.5, 0.9, 0.3])\nmetadata = {\"precursor_mz\": 250.5, \"ionmode\": \"positive\"}\n\nspectrum = Spectrum(mz=mz, intensities=intensities, metadata=metadata)\n\n# Access spectrum properties\nprint(spectrum.peaks.mz)           # m/z values\nprint(spectrum.peaks.intensities)  # Intensity values\nprint(spectrum.get(\"precursor_mz\")) # Metadata field\n\n# Visualize spectra\nspectrum.plot()\nspectrum.plot_against(reference_spectrum)\n```\n\n### 6. Metadata Management\n\nStandardize and harmonize spectrum metadata:\n\n```python\n# Metadata is automatically harmonized\nspectrum.set(\"Precursor_mz\", 250.5)  # Gets harmonized to lowercase key\nprint(spectrum.get(\"precursor_mz\"))   # Returns 250.5\n\n# Derive chemical information\nfrom matchms.filtering import derive_inchi_from_smiles, derive_inchikey_from_inchi\nfrom matchms.filtering import add_fingerprint\n\nspectrum = derive_inchi_from_smiles(spectrum)\nspectrum = derive_inchikey_from_inchi(spectrum)\nspectrum = add_fingerprint(spectrum, fingerprint_type=\"morgan\", nbits=2048)\n```\n\n## Common Workflows\n\nFor typical mass spectrometry analysis workflows, including:\n- Loading and preprocessing spectral libraries\n- Matching unknown spectra against reference libraries\n- Quality filtering and data cleaning\n- Large-scale similarity comparisons\n- Network-based spectral clustering\n\nConsult `references/workflows.md` for detailed examples.\n\n## Installation\n\n```bash\nuv pip install matchms\n```\n\nFor molecular structure processing (SMILES, InChI):\n```bash\nuv pip install matchms[chemistry]\n```\n\n## Reference Documentation\n\nDetailed reference documentation is available in the `references/` directory:\n- `filtering.md` - Complete filter function reference with descriptions\n- `similarity.md` - All similarity metrics and when to use them\n- `importing_exporting.md` - File format details and I/O operations\n- `workflows.md` - Common analysis patterns and examples\n\nLoad these references as needed for detailed information about specific matchms capabilities.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:11:19.366Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Scientific Research Agents needing advanced mass spectrometry data analysis capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级质谱数据分析能力的科学研究代理。","ja":"科学研究エージェントが高度な質量分析データ分析機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"고급 질량 분석 데이터 분석 기능이 필요한 과학 연구 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de investigación científica que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de análisis de datos de espectrometría de masas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de recherche scientifique ayant besoin de capacités avancées d''analyse de données de spectrométrie de masse.","de":"Perfekt für wissenschaftliche Forschungsagenten, die erweiterte Fähigkeiten zur Datenanalyse der Massenspektrometrie benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Pesquisa Científica que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de análise de dados de espectrometria de massa.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов научных исследований, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности анализа данных масс-спектрометрии.","ar":"مناسب تمامًا للوكلاء البحث العلمي الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات متقدمة لتحليل بيانات مطياف الكتلة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to import and process mass spectrometry data from various formats like MGF, MZML, and MSP, calculate spectral similarities, and build reproducible analytical workflows using Python.","zh":"赋予代理导入和处理来自各种格式（如MGF、MZML和MSP）的质谱数据、计算光谱相似性以及使用Python构建可重复的分析工作流的能力。","ja":"エージェントがさまざまな形式（MGF、MZML、MSPなど）の質量分析データをインポートおよび処理し、スペクトル類似性を計算し、Pythonを使用して再現可能な分析ワークフローを構築する機能を提供します。","ko":"에이전트가 다양한 형식(MGF, MZML, MSP 등)의 질량 분석 데이터를 가져오고 처리하고 스펙트럼 유사성을 계산하고 Python을 사용하여 재현 가능한 분석 워크플ロー를 구축할 수 있는 능력을 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a importar y procesar datos de espectrometría de masas desde varios formatos como MGF, MZML y MSP, calcular similitudes espectrales y construir flujos de trabajo analíticos reproducibles utilizando Python.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''importer et de traiter des données de spectrométrie de masse à partir de différents formats tels que MGF, MZML et MSP, calculer des similarités spectrales et construire des flux de travail analytiques reproductibles en utilisant Python.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Massenspektrometriedaten aus verschiedenen Formaten wie MGF, MZML und MSP zu importieren und zu verarbeiten, spektrale Ähnlichkeiten zu berechnen und reproduzierbare analytische Workflows mit Python zu erstellen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a importar e processar dados de espectrometria de massa de vários formatos como MGF, MZML e MSP, calcular semelhanças espectrais e criar fluxos de trabalho analíticos reprodutíveis usando Python.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью импортировать и обрабатывать данные масс-спектрометрии из различных форматов, таких как MGF, MZML и MSP, рассчитывать спектральные подобия и создавать воспроизводимые аналитические рабочие процессы с использованием Python.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من استيراد ومعالجة بيانات مطياف الكتلة من صيغ مختلفة مثل MGF و MZML و MSP، وحساب الشبه بين الطيفي، وإنشاء سير عمل تحليلية قابلة للتكرار باستخدام Python."},"useCases":{"en":["Importing and standardizing mass spectrometry data from multiple file formats","Filtering peaks and calculating spectral similarities for comparative analysis","Building reproducible analytical workflows for mass spectrometry data"],"zh":["导入和标准化来自多种文件格式的质谱数据","过滤峰值并计算光谱相似性以进行比较分析","使用Python构建可重复的分析工作流以分析质谱数据"],"ja":["さまざまなファイル形式からの質量分析データをインポートおよび標準化する","ピークをフィルタリングし、スペクトル類似性を計算して比較分析を行う","Pythonを使用して質量分析データの再現可能な分析ワークフローを構築する"],"ko":["여러 파일 형식에서 질량 분석 데이터를 가져오고 표준화하는 것","피크를 필터링하고 스펙트럼 유사성을 계산하여 비교 분석을 수행하는 것","Python을 사용하여 질량 분석 데이터의 재현 가능한 분석 워크플ロー 구축"],"es":["Importación y estandarización de datos de espectrometría de masas desde múltiples formatos de archivo","Filtrado de picos y cálculo de similitudes espectrales para análisis comparativo","Creación de flujos de trabajo analíticos reproducibles para datos de espectrometría de masas"],"fr":["Importation et normalisation de données de spectrométrie de masse à partir de plusieurs formats de fichiers","Filtrage des pics et calcul des similarités spectrales pour l''analyse comparative","Création de flux de travail analytiques reproductibles pour les données de spectrométrie de masse"],"de":["Import und Standardisierung von Massenspektrometriedaten aus mehreren Dateiformaten","Filtern von Peaks und Berechnen von spektralen Ähnlichkeiten für den Vergleichsanalyse","Erstellung von reproduzierbaren analytischen Workflows für Massenspektrometriedaten"],"pt":["Importação e padronização de dados de espectrometria de massa de vários formatos de arquivo","Filtragem de picos e cálculo de semelhanças espectrais para análise comparativa","Criação de fluxos de trabalho analíticos reprodutíveis para dados de espectrometria de massa"],"ru":["Импорт и стандартизация данных масс-спектрометрии из нескольких форматов файлов","Фильтрация пиков и расчет спектральных подобий для сравнительного анализа","Создание воспроизводимых аналитических рабочих процессов для данных масс-спектрометрии"],"ar":["استيراد وتمييز بيانات مطياف الكتلة من صيغ ملفات متعددة","filtration القمم وحساب الشبه بين الطيفي للتحليل المقارن","إنشاء سير عمل تحليلية قابلة للتكرار لبيانات مطياف الكتلة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Python environment","Limited to mass spectrometry data formats like MGF, MZML, and MSP"],"zh":["需要Python环境","仅限于MGF、MZML和MSP等质谱数据格式"],"ja":["Python環境が必要","MGF、MZML、MSPなどの質量分析データ形式に限られる"],"ko":["Python 환경이 필요","MGF, MZML, MSP 등의 질량 분석 데이터 형식에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere entorno de Python","Limitado a formatos de datos de espectrometría de masas como MGF, MZML y MSP"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement Python","Limité aux formats de données de spectrométrie de masse tels que MGF, MZML et MSP"],"de":["Benötigt eine Python-Umgebung","Begrenzt auf Massenspektrometriedatenformate wie MGF, MZML und MSP"],"pt":["Requer ambiente Python","Limitado a formatos de dados de espectrometria de massa como MGF, MZML e MSP"],"ru":["Требуется среда Python","Ограничен форматами данных масс-спектрометрии, такими как MGF, MZML и MSP"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة Python","محدود بصيغ بيانات مطياف الكتلة مثل MGF و MZML و MSP"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"159851a4767d12348bc41aa3e26b1a843776c4e86818ac198a2cc84d5080c129","qualityScore":28}');
