ientas de AI para correo electrónico","boletines de correo electrónico personalizados","automatización de tareas de correo electrónico"],"fr":["comment utiliser Payload CMS","alternatives à Mailchimp","Payload CMS vs Sendinblue","installation de Payload CMS","guide de configuration de Payload CMS","outils IA pour courrier électronique","newsletters personnalisées","automatisation des tâches de courrier électronique"],"de":["wie man Payload CMS verwendet","Alternativen zu Mailchimp","Payload CMS vs Sendinblue","Installation von Payload CMS","Konfigurationsanleitung für Payload CMS","KI-Tools für E-Mail","personalisierte E-Mail-Newsletter","Automatisierung von E-Mail-Aufgaben"],"pt":["como usar o plugin Payload CMS","o que é um plugin de IA para newsletters","Payload CMS alternativa","Payload CMS vs Mailchimp","instalar plugin Payload CMS","guia de configuração do plugin Payload CMS","ferramentas de IA para marketing","como criar newsletters personalizadas"],"ru":["как использовать плагин Payload CMS","что такое плагин ИИ для email-рассылки","Плагин Payload CMS альтернатива","Плагин Payload CMS vs Mailchimp","установить плагин Payload CMS","руководство по настройке плагина Payload CMS","инструменты ИИ для маркетинга","как создать персонализированные email-рассылки"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام ملحق Payload CMS","ما هو ملحق الذكاء الاصطناعي لبريد الإخبارية","ملحق Payload CMS بديل","ملحق Payload CMS مقابل Mailchimp","تثبيت ملحق Payload CMS","دليل إعداد ملحق Payload CMS","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للتسويق","كيفية إنشاء بريد إخبارية مخصص"]}},"owner":"aniketpanjwani","repo":"payload-plugin-email-newsletter","repoPath":"aniketpanjwani/payload-plugin-email-newsletter","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.936Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"payload-v3-endpoints","description":"Provides correct Payload CMS v3 endpoint patterns and logger API usage. Use when writing or fixing REST API endpoints, custom handlers, or when encountering TypeScript errors with req.data, req.cookies, or logger calls.","bodyPreview":"<objective>\nEnsure all Payload v3 endpoints and logger calls follow the correct patterns to avoid runtime errors and TypeScript issues.\n</objective>\n\n<critical_patterns>\n\n<pattern name=\"request-body-access\">\n**WRONG (Payload v2 pattern):**\n```typescript\nhandler: async (req, res) => {\n  const data = req.data  // undefined in v3!\n  res.status(200).json({ success: true })\n}\n```\n\n**CORRECT (Payload v3 pattern):**\n```typescript\nhandler: async (req) => {\n  const data = await req.json()\n  return Respon","body":"<objective>\nEnsure all Payload v3 endpoints and logger calls follow the correct patterns to avoid runtime errors and TypeScript issues.\n</objective>\n\n<critical_patterns>\n\n<pattern name=\"request-body-access\">\n**WRONG (Payload v2 pattern):**\n```typescript\nhandler: async (req, res) => {\n  const data = req.data  // undefined in v3!\n  res.status(200).json({ success: true })\n}\n```\n\n**CORRECT (Payload v3 pattern):**\n```typescript\nhandler: async (req) => {\n  const data = await req.json()\n  return Response.json({ success: true }, { status: 200 })\n}\n```\n\nAlternative using helper:\n```typescript\nimport { addDataAndFileToRequest } from ''payload''\n\nhandler: async (req) => {\n  await addDataAndFileToRequest(req)\n  const data = req.data  // now available\n  return Response.json({ success: true })\n}\n```\n</pattern>\n\n<pattern name=\"response-format\">\n**WRONG:**\n```typescript\nres.status(200).json({ message: ''success'' })\nres.json({ message: ''success'' })\n```\n\n**CORRECT:**\n```typescript\nreturn Response.json({ message: ''success'' }, { status: 200 })\nreturn Response.json({ message: ''success'' })  // defaults to 200\n```\n\nError responses:\n```typescript\nreturn Response.json({ error: ''Not found'' }, { status: 404 })\nreturn Response.json({ error: ''Unauthorized'' }, { status: 401 })\n```\n</pattern>\n\n<pattern name=\"cookie-access\">\n**WRONG:**\n```typescript\nconst token = req.cookies.token  // undefined in v3!\n```\n\n**CORRECT:**\n```typescript\nconst cookieHeader = req.headers.get(''cookie'')\nconst cookies = parseCookies(cookieHeader)\nconst token = cookies.token\n```\n</pattern>\n\n<pattern name=\"handler-signature\">\n**WRONG:**\n```typescript\nhandler: async (req, res) => { ... }\n```\n\n**CORRECT:**\n```typescript\nhandler: async (req) => { ... }\n// or with PayloadRequest type\nhandler: async (req: PayloadRequest) => { ... }\n```\n</pattern>\n\n<pattern name=\"logger-api\">\nPayload uses pino logger. The signature is: `logger.info(object, message)` NOT `logger.info(message, object)`\n\n**WRONG:**\n```typescript\nreq.payload.logger.info(''User created'', { userId: 123 })\nreq.payload.logger.error(''Failed to save:'', error)\n```\n\n**CORRECT:**\n```typescript\nreq.payload.logger.info({ userId: 123 }, ''User created'')\nreq.payload.logger.error({ error: String(error) }, ''Failed to save'')\n```\n\nFor simple messages (no object):\n```typescript\nreq.payload.logger.info(''Operation completed'')  // This is fine\n```\n</pattern>\n\n<pattern name=\"endpoint-definition\">\nComplete endpoint example:\n```typescript\nimport type { Endpoint, PayloadRequest } from ''payload''\n\nexport const myEndpoint: Endpoint = {\n  path: ''/my-endpoint'',\n  method: ''post'',\n  handler: async (req: PayloadRequest) => {\n    try {\n      const data = await req.json()\n\n      // Access payload\n      const result = await req.payload.find({\n        collection: ''users'',\n        where: { email: { equals: data.email } }\n      })\n\n      req.payload.logger.info({ count: result.totalDocs }, ''Found users'')\n\n      return Response.json({\n        success: true,\n        data: result\n      })\n    } catch (error) {\n      req.payload.logger.error({ error: String(error) }, ''Endpoint failed'')\n      return Response.json({ error: ''Internal error'' }, { status: 500 })\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n</pattern>\n\n</critical_patterns>\n\n<common_errors>\n| Error | Cause | Fix |\n|-------|-------|-----|\n| `req.data is undefined` | Using v2 pattern | Use `await req.json()` |\n| `req.cookies is undefined` | Using v2 pattern | Parse from `req.headers.get(''cookie'')` |\n| `res.json is not a function` | Handler has wrong signature | Return `Response.json()` |\n| `TS2769: No overload matches` on logger | Wrong argument order | Put object first, message second |\n| `Type ''string \\| string[]'' not assignable` | relationTo can be array | Use `Array.isArray(x) ? x[0] : x` |\n</common_errors>\n\n<quick_reference>\n```typescript\n// Request body\nconst data = await req.json()\n\n// Response\nreturn Response.json({ data }, { status: 200 })\n\n// Logger\nreq.payload.logger.info({ key: value }, ''Message'')\nreq.payload.logger.error({ error: String(e) }, ''Error message'')\n\n// Handler signature\nhandler: async (req: PayloadRequest) => { ... }\n```\n</quick_reference>\n\n<success_criteria>\n- All endpoints use `await req.json()` for body access\n- All responses use `Response.json()`\n- All logger calls have object first, message second\n- Handler signature is `(req)` not `(req, res)`\n- TypeScript compiles without errors\n</success_criteria>\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:34:51.037Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for TypeScrypt Agents needing compatibility with Payload v3 endpoints for robust email newsletter creation.","zh":"非常适合需要与Payload v3端点兼容以创建强大的电子邮件新闻稿的TypeScrypt Agents。","ja":"Payload v3エンドポイントとの互換性が必要な強力な電子メールニュースレターの作成に適したTypeScrypt Agentsに最適です。","ko":"Payload v3 엔드포인트와의 호환성이 필요한 강력한 이메일 뉴스레터 생성에 적합한 TypeScrypt 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes TypeScrypt que necesitan compatibilidad con los puntos de conexión de Payload v3 para la creación robusta de boletines de noticias por correo electrónico.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents TypeScrypt qui ont besoin de compatibilité avec les points de terminaison Payload v3 pour la création robuste de newsletters par e-mail.","de":"Perfekt für TypeScrypt-Agents, die Kompatibilität mit Payload-v3-Endpunkten für die robuste Erstellung von E-Mail-Newslettern benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes TypeScrypt que necessitam de compatibilidade com endpoints da Payload v3 para criação robusta de newsletters de e-mail.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов TypeScrypt, которым нужна совместимость с конечными точками Payload v3 для надежного создания рассылок по электронной почте.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء TypeScrypt الذين يحتاجون إلى توافق مع نهايات Payload v3 لإنشاء رسائل إخبارية بالبريد الإلكتروني بشكل قوي."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to correctly access request bodies using async/await with req.json(), ensuring seamless interaction with Payload CMS Plugin and avoiding TypeScript issues, while following the correct logger call patterns to prevent runtime errors.","zh":"赋予代理正确访问请求正文的能力，使用async/await和req.json()，确保与Payload CMS插件的无缝交互，并避免TypeScript问题，同时遵循正确的记录器调用模式以防止运行时错误。","ja":"async/awaitとreq.json()を使用して、エージェントが要求本文に正しくアクセスできるようにし、Payload CMSプラグインとのシームレスな相互作用を確実にし、TypeScriptの問題を回避し、ランタイムエラーを防ぐために正しいロガーコールパターンに従う。","ko":"async/await 및 req.json()를 사용하여 에이전트가 요청 본문에 올바르게 액세스할 수 있도록 하여 Payload CMS 플러그인과 무결점 상호 작용을 보장하고 TypeScript 문제를 방지하며 런타임 오류를 방지하기 위해 올바른 로거 호출 패턴을 따릅니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes para acceder correctamente a los cuerpos de las solicitudes usando async/await con req.json(), asegurando una interacción fluida con el complemento de Payload CMS y evitando problemas de TypeScript, mientras sigue los patrones de llamadas de registrador correctos para prevenir errores de tiempo de ejecución.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''accéder correctement aux corps de requête à l''aide d''async/await avec req.json(), garantissant une interaction fluide avec le plugin Payload CMS et évitant les problèmes de TypeScript, tout en suivant les modèles d''appel de journalisation corrects pour prévenir les erreurs d''exécution.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, auf die Anforderungskörper mithilfe von async/await mit req.json() zuzugreifen, wodurch eine nahtlose Interaktion mit dem Payload-CMS-Plugin gewährleistet und TypeScript-Probleme vermieden werden, während die richtigen Protokollaufrufmuster befolgt werden, um Laufzeitfehler zu vermeiden.","pt":"Permite que os agentes acessem corretamente os corpos de solicitação usando async/await com req.json(), garantindo interação sem problemas com o Plugin do Payload CMS e evitando problemas do TypeScript, seguindo os padrões de chamada de registrador corretos para prevenir erros de tempo de execução.","ru":"Позволяет агентам правильно получать доступ к телам запросов, используя async/await с req.json(), обеспечивая бесперебойное взаимодействие с плагином Payload CMS и избегая проблем с TypeScript, при этом следуя правильным шаблонам вызова журнала, чтобы предотвратить ошибки во время выполнения.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من الوصول بشكل صحيح إلى أجسام الطلبات باستخدام async/await مع req.json()، مما يضمن التفاعل السلس مع إضافة Payload CMS وتجنب مشاكل TypeScript، مع اتباع أنماط الاتصال السجلة الصحيحة لتجنب الأخطاء وقت التشغيل."},"useCases":{"en":["Debugging incorrect request body access patterns in Payload v3","Validating TypeScript compatibility for Payload v3 endpoints","Generating email newsletters with correct logger calls"],"zh":["调试Payload v3中的不正确的请求正文访问模式","验证Payload v3端点的TypeScript兼容性","使用正确的记录器调用生成电子邮件新闻稿"],"ja":["Payload v3の不正確な要求本文アクセスパターンのデバッグ","Payload v3エンドポイントのTypeScriptの互換性の検証","正しいロガーコールを使用して電子メールニュースレターを生成する"],"ko":["Payload v3의 잘못된 요청 본문 액세스 패턴 디버깅","Payload v3 엔드포인트에 대한 TypeScript 호환성 검증","올바른 로거 호출을 사용하여 이메일 뉴스레터 생성"],"es":["Depuración de patrones de acceso incorrectos al cuerpo de la solicitud en Payload v3","Validación de la compatibilidad de TypeScript para puntos de conexión de Payload v3","Generación de boletines de noticias por correo electrónico con llamadas de registrador correctas"],"fr":["Débogage des modèles d''accès incorrects au corps de la requête dans Payload v3","Validation de la compatibilité de TypeScript pour les points de terminaison de Payload v3","Génération de newsletters par e-mail avec des appels de journalisation corrects"],"de":["Fehlerbehebung bei fehlerhaften Anforderungskörperzugriffsmustern in Payload v3","Validierung der TypeScript-Kompatibilität für Payload-v3-Endpunkte","Erstellung von E-Mail-Newslettern mit korrekten Protokollaufrufen"],"pt":["Depuração de padrões de acesso incorretos ao corpo da solicitação na Payload v3","Validação da compatibilidade do TypeScript para endpoints da Payload v3","Geração de newsletters de e-mail com chamadas de registrador corretas"],"ru":["Отладка неправильных шаблонов доступа к телам запросов в Payload v3","Проверка совместимости TypeScript с конечными точками Payload v3","Генерация рассылок по электронной почте с правильными вызовами журнала"],"ar":["تصحيح أنماط الوصول غير الصحيحة إلى جسم الطلب في Payload v3","تحقق من توافق TypeScript مع نهايات Payload v3","إنشاء رسائل إخبارية بالبريد الإلكتروني مع مكالمات سجلة صحيحة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of Payload v3 endpoint patterns","TypeScript compatibility required","Specific to Payload CMS Plugin for email newsletters"],"zh":["需要知识Payload v3端点模式","需要TypeScript兼容性","仅限Payload CMS插件用于电子邮件新闻稿"],"ja":["Payload v3エンドポイントのパターンに関する知識が必要","TypeScriptの互換性が必要","電子メールニュースレター用のPayload CMSプラグインに限定"],"ko":["Payload v3 엔드포인트 패턴에 대한 지식이 필요합니다.","TypeScript 호환성이 필요합니다.","이메일 뉴스레터용 Payload CMS 플러그인에만 해당"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de los patrones de puntos de conexión de Payload v3","Se requiere compatibilidad con TypeScript","Específico del complemento de Payload CMS para boletines de noticias por correo electrónico"],"fr":["Nécessite une connaissance des modèles de points de terminaison de Payload v3","La compatibilité de TypeScript est requise","Spécifique du plugin Payload CMS pour les newsletters par e-mail"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse der Endpunktmuster von Payload v3","TypeScript-Kompatibilität erforderlich","Spezifisch für das Payload-CMS-Plugin für E-Mail-Newsletters"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento dos padrões de endpoints da Payload v3","Compatibilidade do TypeScript é necessária","Específico para o Plugin do Payload CMS para newsletters de e-mail"],"ru":["Требуется знание шаблонов конечных точек Payload v3","Требуется совместимость TypeScript","Относится только к плагину Payload CMS для рассылок по электронной почте"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة الأنماط النموذجية لنهايات Payload v3","مطلوب توافق TypeScript","محدد لإضافة Payload CMS لرسائل الإخبار بالبريد الإلكتروني"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"462a9d1d3a0991144ec31c1f2f70a77337d61988391f67a2f8d70363a9e1d064","qualityScore":28}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('hw-native-sys/pypto/github-pr', 'community', 'hw-native-sys', 'pypto', 'hw-native-sys/pypto', 'github-pr', 0, 0, 28, '2026-03-02T01:56:10.936Z', '2026-03-02T02:34:51.923Z', '0c2aa6732a895231102b6c7f1a18925388d3f350613b8f2d5c0a32b7fe421acc', '{"id":"hw-native-sys/pypto/github-pr","name":"github-pr","description":{"zh":"GitHub PR AI工具是一种社区驱动的Python实现，用于简化GitHub Pull Request的管理","ja":"GitHub PR AIエージェントは、GitHub Pull Requestの管理を簡素化するためのコミュニティ駆動のPython実装です","ko":"GitHub PR AI 에이전트는 GitHub Pull Request의 관리를 단순화하기 위한 커뮤니티 주도적인 Python 구현입니다","es":"github-pr es una implementación de pypto impulsada por la comunidad, diseñada para desarrolladores","fr":"github-pr est une implémentation de pypto pilotée par la communauté, conçue pour les développeurs","de":"github-pr ist eine communitygetriebene pypto-Implementierung, entwickelt für Entwickler","pt":"O github-pr é uma implementação pypto baseada na comunidade, projetada para desenvolvedores.","ru":"github-pr - это реализация pypto, управляемая сообществом, предназначенная для разработчиков.","ar":"github-pr هو تنفيذ pypto مدعوم من المجتمع، مصمم لمطوري البرمجيات.","en":"A community-driven pypto implementation "},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"GitHub PR AI工具 - 社区驱动的Python实现","ja":"GitHub PR AIエージェント - コミュニティ駆動のPython実装","ko":"GitHub PR AI 에이전트 - 커뮤니티 주도적인 Python 구현","es":"Herramientas de AI: github-pr, implementación de pypto","fr":"Outils IA : github-pr, implémentation de pypto","de":"KI-Tools: github-pr, pypto-Implementierung","pt":"Ferramentas de IA: github-pr, implementação pypto","ru":"ИИ Агенты: github-pr, реализация pypto","ar":"أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي: github-pr، تنفيذ pypto","en":"github-pr"},"description":{"zh":"GitHub PR AI工具是一种社区驱动的Python实现，用于简化GitHub Pull Request的管理","ja":"GitHub PR AIエージェントは、GitHub Pull Requestの管理を簡素化するためのコミュニティ駆動のPython実装です","ko":"GitHub PR AI 에이전트는 GitHub Pull Request의 관리를 단순화하기 위한 커뮤니티 주도적인 Python 구현입니다","es":"github-pr es una implementación de pypto impulsada por la comunidad, diseñada para desarrolladores","fr":"github-pr est une implémentation de pypto pilotée par la communauté, conçue pour les développeurs","de":"github-pr ist eine communitygetriebene pypto-Implementierung, entwickelt für Entwickler","pt":"O github-pr é uma implementação pypto baseada na comunidade, projetada para desenvolvedores.","ru":"github-pr - это реализация pypto, управляемая сообществом, предназначенная для разработчиков.","ar":"github-pr هو تنفيذ pypto مدعوم من المجتمع، مصمم لمطوري البرمجيات.","en":"A community-driven pypto implementation "},"definition":{"en":"A community-driven pypto implementation "},"features":{"zh":["社区驱动的Python实现","自动化GitHub Pull Request的管理","支持多种GitHub API","可自定义的工作流","高可扩展性和可维护性"],"ja":["コミュニティ駆動のPython実装","GitHub Pull Requestの管理を自動化","複数のGitHub APIをサポート","カスタマイズ可能なワークフロー","高可拡張性とメンテナンス性"],"ko":["커뮤니티 주도적인 Python 구현","GitHub Pull Request의 관리를 자동화","다수의 GitHub API를 지원","사용자 정의 가능한 워크플로","높은 확장성과 유지보수성"],"es":["Implementación de pypto","Impulsada por la comunidad","Diseñada para desarrolladores","Integración con GitHub","Compatibilidad con Python"],"fr":["Implémentation de pypto","Pilotée par la communauté","Conçue pour les développeurs","Intégration avec GitHub","Compatibilité avec Python"],"de":["pypto-Implementierung","Communitygetrieben","Entwickelt für Entwickler","Integration mit GitHub","Kompatibilität mit Python"],"pt":["Implementação pypto","Comunidade ativa","Ferramentas de desenvolvimento","Integração com github","Código aberto"],"ru":["Реализация pypto","Активное сообщество","Инструменты разработки","Интеграция с github","Открытый код"],"ar":["تنفيذ pypto","مجتمع نشط","أدوات تطوير","التكامل مع github","كود مفتوح"]},"keywords":{"zh":["GitHub PR AI工具","Python实现","自动化GitHub Pull Request","GitHub API","工作流自动化","如何使用GitHub PR AI工具","GitHub PR AI工具安装指南","GitHub PR AI工具替代品"],"ja":["GitHub PR AIエージェント","Python実装","GitHub Pull Requestの自動化","GitHub API","ワークフローの自動化","GitHub PR AIエージェントの使い方","GitHub PR AIエージェントのインストールガイド","GitHub PR AIエージェントの代替品"],"ko":["GitHub PR AI 에이전트","Python 구현","GitHub Pull Request의 자동화","GitHub API","워크플로의 자동화","GitHub PR AI 에이전트의 사용법","GitHub PR AI 에이전트의 설치 가이드","GitHub PR AI 에이전트의 대안"],"es":["herramientas de AI","implementación de pypto","github-pr","desarrollo de software","integración con GitHub","cómo usar github-pr","alternativas a github-pr"],"fr":["outils IA","implémentation de pypto","github-pr","développement de logiciels","intégration avec GitHub","comment utiliser github-pr","alternatives à github-pr"],"de":["KI-Tools","pypto-Implementierung","github-pr","Software-Entwicklung","Integration mit GitHub","wie man github-pr verwendet","Alternativen zu github-pr"],"pt":["github-pr","pypto","ferramentas de ia","desenvolvimento de software","como usar github-pr","o que é pypto","github-pr vs gitlab","instalar github-pr"],"ru":["github-pr","pypto","ИИ агенты","разработка программного обеспечения","как использовать github-pr","что такое pypto","github-pr vs gitlab","установить github-pr"],"ar":["github-pr","pypto","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","تطوير البرمجيات","كيفية استخدام github-pr","ما هو pypto","github-pr vs gitlab","تثبيت github-pr"]}},"owner":"hw-native-sys","repo":"pypto","repoPath":"hw-native-sys/pypto","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.936Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"github-pr","description":"Create a GitHub pull request after committing, rebasing, and pushing changes. Use when the user asks to create a PR, submit changes for review, or open a pull request.","bodyPreview":"# PyPTO GitHub Pull Request Workflow\n\n## Workflow Steps\n\n1. **Prepare branch and commit** (if on main or uncommitted changes)\n2. Check for existing PR (exit if found)\n3. Fetch upstream changes\n4. Rebase onto upstream/main\n5. Resolve conflicts if needed\n6. Push to fork with `--force-with-lease`\n7. Create PR using gh CLI\n\n## Step 1: Prepare Branch and Commit\n\n**Check current state:**\n\n```bash\nBRANCH_NAME=$(git branch --show-current)\ngit status --porcelain                              # Check for u","body":"# PyPTO GitHub Pull Request Workflow\n\n## Workflow Steps\n\n1. **Prepare branch and commit** (if on main or uncommitted changes)\n2. Check for existing PR (exit if found)\n3. Fetch upstream changes\n4. Rebase onto upstream/main\n5. Resolve conflicts if needed\n6. Push to fork with `--force-with-lease`\n7. Create PR using gh CLI\n\n## Step 1: Prepare Branch and Commit\n\n**Check current state:**\n\n```bash\nBRANCH_NAME=$(git branch --show-current)\ngit status --porcelain                              # Check for uncommitted changes\ngit fetch upstream 2>/dev/null || git fetch origin  # Fetch latest\nif git rev-parse --verify upstream/main >/dev/null 2>&1; then\n  BASE_REF=upstream/main\nelse\n  BASE_REF=origin/main\nfi\ngit rev-list HEAD --not \"$BASE_REF\" --count         # Commits ahead of base\n```\n\nA branch \"needs a new branch\" when it is effectively on main — either the branch name is `main`/`master`, **or** it has zero commits ahead of upstream/main (e.g., a local branch that was never diverged).\n\n**Decision logic:**\n\n| Needs new branch? | Uncommitted changes? | Action |\n| ----------------- | -------------------- | ------ |\n| Yes | Yes | Create new branch, then commit via `/git-commit` |\n| Yes | No | Error — nothing to PR. Tell user to make changes first |\n| No | Yes | Commit on current branch via `/git-commit` |\n| No | No | Skip — already committed on a feature branch |\n\n**If a new branch is needed:**\n\n1. Auto-generate a branch name with a meaningful prefix (`feat/`, `fix/`, `refactor/`, `chore/`, `docs/`, `test/`) based on the changes — do NOT ask the user\n2. Create and switch to the new branch:\n\n```bash\ngit checkout -b <branch-name>\n```\n\n1. Commit via `/git-commit` skill (mandatory — runs code review, testing, linting)\n\n**If on an existing feature branch with uncommitted changes:**\n\nCommit via `/git-commit` skill before proceeding.\n\n## Step 2: Check for Existing PR\n\n```bash\nBRANCH_NAME=$(git branch --show-current)\ngh pr list --head \"$BRANCH_NAME\" --state open\n```\n\n**If PR exists**: Display with `gh pr view` and exit immediately.\n\n## Step 3: Fetch Upstream\n\n```bash\ngit remote add upstream https://github.com/hw-native-sys/pypto.git  # If needed\ngit fetch upstream\n```\n\n## Step 4: Rebase\n\n```bash\ngit rebase upstream/main  # Or user-specified branch\n```\n\n**On conflicts**:\n\n```bash\ngit status                     # View conflicts\n# Edit files, remove markers\ngit add path/to/resolved/file\ngit rebase --continue\n# If stuck: git rebase --abort\n```\n\n## Step 5: Push\n\n```bash\n# First push\ngit push --set-upstream origin BRANCH_NAME\n\n# After rebase (use --force-with-lease, NOT --force)\ngit push --force-with-lease origin BRANCH_NAME\n```\n\n⚠️ **Use `--force-with-lease`** - safer than `--force`, fails if remote has unexpected changes.\n\n## Step 6: Create PR\n\n**Check gh CLI**:\n\n```bash\ngh auth status\n```\n\n**If gh NOT available**: Report to user and provide manual URL: `https://github.com/hw-native-sys/pypto/compare/main...BRANCH_NAME`\n\n**If gh available**:\n\n```bash\ngh pr create \\\n  --title \"Brief description of changes\" \\\n  --body \"$(cat <<''EOF''\n## Summary\n- Key change 1\n- Key change 2\n\n## Testing\n- [ ] All tests pass\n- [ ] Code review completed\n- [ ] Documentation updated\n\n## Related Issues\nFixes #ISSUE_NUMBER (if applicable)\nEOF\n)\"\n```\n\n**PR Title/Body**: Auto-extracted from commit messages since upstream/main.\n\n**Important**:\n\n- ❌ Do NOT add footers like \"🤖 Generated with Claude Code\" or similar branding\n- ✅ Keep PR descriptions professional and focused on technical content only\n\n## Common Issues\n\n| Issue | Solution |\n| ----- | -------- |\n| PR already exists | `gh pr view` then exit |\n| Merge conflicts | Resolve, `git add`, `git rebase --continue` |\n| Push rejected | `git push --force-with-lease` |\n| gh not authenticated | Tell user to run `gh auth login` |\n| Wrong upstream branch | Use `git rebase upstream/BRANCH` |\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [ ] Branch prepared (created from main if needed)\n- [ ] Changes committed via `/git-commit` (if uncommitted changes existed)\n- [ ] No existing PR for branch (exit if found)\n- [ ] Fetched upstream and rebased successfully\n- [ ] Conflicts resolved\n- [ ] Pushed with `--force-with-lease`\n- [ ] PR created with clear title/body\n\n## Remember\n\n- Always rebase before creating PR\n- Use `--force-with-lease`, not `--force`\n- Don''t auto-install gh CLI - let user do it\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:34:51.923Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Version Control Agents needing automated GitHub pull request management.","zh":"适用于需要自动化 GitHub 拉取请求管理的版本控制代理。","ja":"バージョン管理エージェントが自動化された GitHub プルリクエスト管理を必要とする場合に適しています。","ko":"자동화된 GitHub 풀 리퀘스트 관리가 필요한 버전 제어 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Control de Versiones que necesitan una gestión automatizada de solicitudes de extracción de GitHub.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Contrôle de Version nécessitant une gestion automatisée des demandes d''extraction GitHub.","de":"Perfekt für Version Control Agents, die eine automatisierte GitHub-Pull-Request-Verwaltung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Controle de Versão que precisam de gerenciamento automatizado de solicitações de pull do GitHub.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов контроля версий, нуждающихся в автоматизированном управлении запросами на вытягивание в GitHub.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء إدارة الإصدار الذين يحتاجون إلى إدارة طلبات السحب التلقائي على جيثب."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to streamline GitHub workflows using the gh CLI, resolving conflicts and pushing updates to forks with --force-with-lease, while ensuring a clean and up-to-date repository by rebasing onto upstream/main.","zh":"通过 gh CLI 使用 gh CLI 解决冲突并将更新推送到分支，确保仓库干净且最新，通过重新分支到上游/主分支来解决冲突。","ja":"エージェントが GitHub ワークフローを自動化し、gh CLI を使用してフォークに更新を強制的にプッシュし、リポジトリを最新の状態に維持することを可能にする。","ko":"에이전트가 GitHub 워크플로를 자동화하고 gh CLI를 사용하여 업데이트를 강제로 푸시하고 리포지토리를 최신 상태로 유지할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a optimizar los flujos de trabajo de GitHub utilizando el CLI de gh, resolviendo conflictos y actualizando forks con --force-with-lease, asegurando un repositorio limpio y actualizado mediante rebasado en upstream/main.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''optimiser les flux de travail GitHub en utilisant le CLI gh, en résolvant les conflits et en mettant à jour les forks avec --force-with-lease, tout en garantissant un référentiel propre et à jour en réorganisant sur upstream/main.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, GitHub-Workflows mithilfe des gh-CLI zu optimieren, Konflikte zu lösen und Forks mit --force-with-lease zu aktualisieren, während ein sauberes und aktuelles Repository durch Rebasieren auf upstream/main sichergestellt wird.","pt":"Permite que os agentes simplifiquem os fluxos de trabalho do GitHub usando o gh CLI, resolvendo conflitos e enviando atualizações para bifurcações com --force-with-lease, garantindo um repositório limpo e atualizado ao reorganizar em upstream/main.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью оптимизировать рабочие процессы GitHub с помощью gh CLI, решая конфликты и выталкивая обновления в форки с --force-with-lease, обеспечивая чистоту и актуальность репозитория за счет ребейза на upstream/main.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تبسيط سير عمل جيثب باستخدام واجهة سطر الأوامر gh، وحل النزاعات وإرسال التحديثات إلى الفروع مع --force-with-lease، مع ضمان الحفاظ على مستودع نظيف ومحدّث من خلال إعادة الترتيب في upstream/main."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating pull request creation","Rebasing local branches onto upstream/main","Resolving merge conflicts using git status and porcelain commands"],"zh":["自动化创建拉取请求","重新分支到上游/主分支","使用 git 상태 和_porcelain 命令解析合并冲突"],"ja":["プルリクエストの作成を自動化する","ローカルブランチを上游/メインブランチに再生する","git 状態 と_porcelain コマンドを使用してマージコンフリクトを解決する"],"ko":["자동화된 풀 리퀘스트 생성","로컬 브랜치 재분기 到 업스트림/메인 브랜치","git 상태 및_porcelain 명령을 사용하여 병합 충돌을 해결"],"es":["Automatización de la creación de solicitudes de extracción","Rebasado de ramas locales en upstream/main","Resolución de conflictos de fusión utilizando git status y comandos de porcelana"],"fr":["Automation de la création de demandes d''extraction","Réorganisation de branches locales sur upstream/main","Résolution de conflits de fusion en utilisant git status et des commandes de porcelaine"],"de":["Automatisierung der Erstellung von Pull-Requests","Rebasieren lokaler Zweige auf upstream/main","Auflösung von Merge-Konflikten unter Verwendung von git status und Porzellan-Befehlen"],"pt":["Criação automática de solicitações de pull","Reorganização de branches locais em upstream/main","Resolução de conflitos de mesclagem usando git status e comandos de porcelana"],"ru":["Автоматическое создание запросов на вытягивание","Ребейз локальных веток на upstream/main","Разрешение конфликтов слияния с помощью git status и порцелановых команд"],"ar":["إنشاء طلبات السحب التلقائي","إعادة تنظيم الفروع المحلية في upstream/main","حل نزاعات الدمج باستخدام git status وأوامر البورسلين"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires GitHub repository access","Needs gh CLI installed","Limited to Git version control system"],"zh":["需要 GitHub 仓库访问权限","需要 gh CLI 설치","仅限于 Git 版本控制系统"],"ja":["GitHub リポジトリへのアクセスが必要","gh CLI のインストールが必要","Git 版本管理システムのみ"],"ko":["GitHub 리포지토리 접근 권한 필요","gh CLI 설치 필요","Git 버전 제어 시스템만"],"es":["Requiere acceso al repositorio de GitHub","Necesita el CLI de gh instalado","Limitado al sistema de control de versiones Git"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au référentiel GitHub","Nécessite le CLI gh installé","Limité au système de contrôle de version Git"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf das GitHub-Repository","Benötigt den installierten gh-CLI","Begrenzt auf das Git-versionskontrollsystem"],"pt":["Exige acesso ao repositório do GitHub","Necessita do gh CLI instalado","Limitado ao sistema de controle de versão Git"],"ru":["Требует доступа к репозиторию GitHub","Требует установленного gh CLI","Ограничен системой контроля версий Git"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى مستودع جيثب","يحتاج إلى تثبيت واجهة سطر الأوامر gh","محدود بنظام إدارة الإصدار جيت"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"0c2aa6732a895231102b6c7f1a18925388d3f350613b8f2d5c0a32b7fe421acc","qualityScore":28}');
