lake"],"de":["wie man semantische Ansichten in Snowflake erstellt","KI-Tools für SQL","semantische Ansichten in Snowflake","Alternative zu Tableau","Snowflake vs Redshift","Installation von Snowflake","Konfigurationsanleitung für Snowflake"],"pt":["como usar snowflake","o que é view semântica","ferramentas de ia para sql","snowflake vs aws redshift","instalar snowflake","guia de configuração snowflake","melhorias de desempenho snowflake"],"ru":["как использовать snowflake","что такое семантическое представление","инструменты ИИ для sql","snowflake vs aws redshift","установить snowflake","руководство по настройке snowflake","улучшения производительности snowflake"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام雪花","ما هي العرضية السيميائية","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للsql","snowflake vs aws redshift","تثبيت雪花","دليل إعداد雪花","تحسين أداء雪花"]}},"owner":"MiguelElGallo","repo":"snowflake-semantic-view-skill","repoPath":"MiguelElGallo/snowflake-semantic-view-skill","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.953Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"snowflake-semantic-views","description":"Create, alter, and validate Snowflake semantic views using the Snowflake CLI (`snow`). Use when asked to build or troubleshoot semantic views or semantic layer definitions with CREATE/ALTER SEMANTIC VIEW, to validate semantic view DDL against Snowflake via the CLI, or to guide Snowflake CLI installation and connection setup.","bodyPreview":"# Snowflake Semantic Views\n\n## One-Time Setup\n\n- Verify the Snowflake CLI installation by opening a new terminal and running `snow --help`.\n- If the Snowflake CLI is missing or the user cannot install it, direct them to https://docs.snowflake.com/en/developer-guide/snowflake-cli/installation/installation.\n- Configure a Snowflake connection with `snow connection add` per https://docs.snowflake.com/en/developer-guide/snowflake-cli/connecting/configure-connections#add-a-connection.\n- Use the config","body":"# Snowflake Semantic Views\n\n## One-Time Setup\n\n- Verify the Snowflake CLI installation by opening a new terminal and running `snow --help`.\n- If the Snowflake CLI is missing or the user cannot install it, direct them to https://docs.snowflake.com/en/developer-guide/snowflake-cli/installation/installation.\n- Configure a Snowflake connection with `snow connection add` per https://docs.snowflake.com/en/developer-guide/snowflake-cli/connecting/configure-connections#add-a-connection.\n- Use the configured connection for all validation and execution steps.\n\n## Workflow For Each Semantic View Request\n\n1. Confirm the target database, schema, role, warehouse, and final semantic view name.\n2. Confirm the model follows a star schema (facts with conformed dimensions).\n3. Draft the semantic view DDL using the official syntax:\n   - https://docs.snowflake.com/en/sql-reference/sql/create-semantic-view\n4. Populate synonyms and comments for each dimension, fact, and metric:\n   - Read Snowflake table/view/column comments first (preferred source):\n     - https://docs.snowflake.com/en/sql-reference/sql/comment\n   - If comments or synonyms are missing, ask whether you can create them, whether the user wants to provide text, or whether you should draft suggestions for approval.\n5. Use a SELECT statement with DISTINCT and LIMIT (max 1,000 rows) to discover relationships between fact and dimension tables, identify column data types, and create more meaningful comments and synonyms for the columns.\n6. Create a temporary validation name (for example, append `__tmp_validate`) while keeping the same database and schema.\n7. Always validate by sending the DDL to Snowflake via the Snowflake CLI before finalizing:\n   - Use `snow sql` to execute the statement with the configured connection.\n   - If flags differ by version, check `snow sql --help` and use the connection option shown there.\n8. If validation fails, iterate on the DDL and re-run the validation step until it succeeds.\n9. Apply the final DDL (create or alter) using the real semantic view name.\n10. Run a sample query against the final semantic view to confirm it works as expected. Semantic views use a different SQL syntax, as shown here: https://docs.snowflake.com/en/user-guide/views-semantic/querying#querying-a-semantic-view\nExample:\n\n```SQL\nSELECT * FROM SEMANTIC_VIEW(\n    my_semview_name\n    DIMENSIONS customer.customer_market_segment\n    METRICS orders.order_average_value\n  )\n  ORDER BY customer_market_segment;\n```\n\n11. Clean up any temporary semantic view created during validation.\n\n## Synonyms and Comments (Required)\n\n- Use the semantic view syntax for synonyms and comments:\n\n```\nWITH SYNONYMS [ = ] ( ''synonym'' [ , ... ] )\nCOMMENT = ''comment_about_dim_fact_or_metric''\n```\n\n- Treat synonyms as informational only; do not use them to reference dimensions, facts, or metrics elsewhere.\n- Use Snowflake comments as the preferred and first source for synonyms and comments:\n  - https://docs.snowflake.com/en/sql-reference/sql/comment\n- If Snowflake comments are missing, ask whether you can create them, whether the user wants to provide text, or whether you should draft suggestions for approval.\n- Do not invent synonyms or comments without user approval.\n\n## Validation Pattern (Required)\n\n- Never skip validation. Always execute the DDL against Snowflake with the Snowflake CLI before presenting it as final.\n- Prefer a temporary name for validation to avoid clobbering the real view.\n\n## Example CLI Validation (Template)\n\n```bash\n# Replace placeholders with real values.\nsnow sql -q \"<CREATE OR ALTER SEMANTIC VIEW ...>\" --connection <connection_name>\n```\n\nIf the Snowflake CLI uses a different connection flag in your version, run:\n\n```bash\nsnow sql --help\n```\n\n## Notes\n\n- Treat installation and connection setup as one-time steps, but confirm they are done before the first validation.\n- Keep the final semantic view definition identical to the validated temporary definition except for the name.\n- Do not omit synonyms or comments; consider them required for completeness even if optional in syntax.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:44:52.833Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Data Analysis Agents needing advanced Snowflake semantic view creation and management capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级 Snowflake 语义视图创建和管理功能的数据分析代理。","ja":"高度な Snowflake セマンティック ビューの作成および管理機能を必要とするデータ分析エージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 Snowflake 시맨틱 뷰 생성 및 관리 기능을 필요로 하는 데이터 분석 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Análisis de Datos que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de creación y administración de vistas semánticas de Snowflake.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Analyse de Données ayant besoin de capacités avancées de création et de gestion de vues sémantiques Snowflake.","de":"Perfekt für Data-Analytics-Agents, die erweiterte Funktionen zur Erstellung und Verwaltung von Snowflake-Semantikansichten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise de Dados que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de criação e gerenciamento de vistas semânticas do Snowflake.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов анализа данных, которым необходимы расширенные возможности создания и управления семантическими представлениями Snowflake.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تحليل البيانات التي تحتاج إلى قدرات متقدمة لإنشاء وإدارة العروض الدلالية Snowflake."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create and enhance Snowflake semantic views in SQL, leveraging the Snowflake CLI for seamless connection configuration and query execution, while utilizing SQL for data analysis and visualization.","zh":"赋予代理创建和增强 Snowflake 语义视图的能力，使用 SQL 并利用 Snowflake CLI 进行无缝的连接配置和查询执行，同时使用 SQL 进行数据分析和可视化。","ja":"エージェントが Snowflake セマンティック ビューを作成および強化する機能を付与し、SQL を使用し、Snowflake CLI を利用してシームレスな接続構成およびクエリの実行を可能にし、同時に SQL を使用してデータ分析および視覚化を行う。","ko":"에이전트가 Snowflake 시맨틱 뷰를 생성하고 강화할 수 있는 기능을 부여하며 SQL을 사용하고 Snowflake CLI를 활용하여 무중단 연결 구성 및 쿼리 실행을 가능하게 하며同時に SQL을 사용하여 데이터 분석 및 시각화를 수행합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear y mejorar las vistas semánticas de Snowflake en SQL, aprovechando el CLI de Snowflake para una configuración de conexión y ejecución de consultas sin problemas, mientras utiliza SQL para el análisis y visualización de datos.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer et d''améliorer les vues sémantiques Snowflake en SQL, en exploitant le CLI Snowflake pour une configuration de connexion et une exécution de requêtes sans problème, tout en utilisant SQL pour l''analyse et la visualisation des données.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, Snowflake-Semantikansichten in SQL zu erstellen und zu verbessern, indem sie den Snowflake-CLI für eine nahtlose Konfiguration der Verbindung und die Ausführung von Abfragen nutzen und SQL für Datenanalyse und Visualisierung verwenden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar e aprimorar vistas semânticas do Snowflake em SQL, utilizando o Snowflake CLI para configuração de conexão e execução de consultas sem interrupção, ao mesmo tempo em que utiliza SQL para análise e visualização de dados.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать и улучшать семантические представления Snowflake на SQL, используя Snowflake CLI для бесшовной настройки подключения и выполнения запросов, а также используя SQL для анализа и визуализации данных.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إنشاء وتحسين العروض الدلالية Snowflake باللغة SQL، مستخدمين واجهة سطر أوامر Snowflake لتهيئة الاتصال وتشغيل الاستفسارات بطريقة متواصلة، وفي الوقت نفسه استخدام SQL لتحليل وتصور البيانات."},"useCases":{"en":["Configuring Snowflake connections for secure data access","Creating and managing Snowflake semantic views for advanced data analysis","Optimizing SQL queries for improved performance in Snowflake environments"],"zh":["为安全数据访问配置 Snowflake 连接","为高级数据分析创建和管理 Snowflake 语义视图","优化 SQL 查询以提高 Snowflake 环境中的性能"],"ja":["セキュアなデータ アクセス用の Snowflake 接続を構成する","高度なデータ分析用の Snowflake セマンティック ビューを作成および管理する","Snowflake 環境でのパフォーマンスの向上のための SQL クエリを最適化する"],"ko":["보안 데이터 액세스를 위한 Snowflake 연결 구성","고급 데이터 분석을 위한 Snowflake 시맨틱 뷰 생성 및 관리","Snowflake 환경에서 성능 개선을 위한 SQL 쿼리 최적화"],"es":["Configuración de conexiones de Snowflake para un acceso a datos seguro","Creación y administración de vistas semánticas de Snowflake para un análisis de datos avanzado","Optimización de consultas SQL para un mejor rendimiento en entornos de Snowflake"],"fr":["Configuration des connexions Snowflake pour un accès sécurisé aux données","Création et gestion de vues sémantiques Snowflake pour une analyse de données avancée","Optimisation des requêtes SQL pour améliorer les performances dans les environnements Snowflake"],"de":["Konfiguration von Snowflake-Verbindungen für sicheren Datenzugriff","Erstellung und Verwaltung von Snowflake-Semantikansichten für erweiterte Datenanalyse","Optimierung von SQL-Abfragen für verbesserte Leistung in Snowflake-Umgebungen"],"pt":["Configuração de conexões do Snowflake para acesso seguro aos dados","Criação e gerenciamento de vistas semânticas do Snowflake para análise de dados avançada","Otimização de consultas SQL para melhor desempenho em ambientes Snowflake"],"ru":["Настройка подключений Snowflake для безопасного доступа к данным","Создание и управление семантическими представлениями Snowflake для расширенного анализа данных","Оптимизация запросов SQL для улучшения производительности в средах Snowflake"],"ar":["تهيئة الاتصالات Snowflake للوصول الآمن إلى البيانات","إنشاء وإدارة العروض الدلالية Snowflake لتحليل البيانات المتقدم","تحسين استفسارات SQL لتحسين الأداء في بيئات Snowflake"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Snowflake CLI installation","Needs active Snowflake account and connection configuration","SQL knowledge required for effective use"],"zh":["需要安装 Snowflake CLI","需要有效的 Snowflake 账户和连接配置","需要 SQL 知识以有效使用"],"ja":["Snowflake CLI のインストールが必要","有効な Snowflake アカウントおよび接続構成が必要","効果的な使用には SQL の知識が必要"],"ko":["Snowflake CLI 설치가 필요합니다.","유효한 Snowflake 계정 및 연결 구성이 필요합니다.","有效한 사용을 위해 SQL 지식이 필요합니다."],"es":["Requiere la instalación del CLI de Snowflake","Necesita una cuenta de Snowflake activa y una configuración de conexión","Se requiere conocimiento de SQL para un uso eficaz"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation du CLI Snowflake","Nécessite un compte Snowflake actif et une configuration de connexion","Connaissances en SQL requises pour une utilisation efficace"],"de":["Benötigt die Installation des Snowflake-CLI","Benötigt ein aktives Snowflake-Konto und eine Verbindungskonfiguration","SQL-Kenntnisse erforderlich für eine effektive Verwendung"],"pt":["Requer instalação do Snowflake CLI","Necessita de conta ativa do Snowflake e configuração de conexão","Conhecimento de SQL necessário para uso eficaz"],"ru":["Требует установки Snowflake CLI","Требует активного аккаунта Snowflake и настройки подключения","Знание SQL необходимо для эффективного использования"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت واجهة سطر أوامر Snowflake","يحتاج إلى حساب نشط Snowflake وتهيئة اتصال","معارف SQL ضرورية للاستخدام الفعال"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"18b9f013ff8c02eba6fe59d98a26af07ab0099168f834b21e3ab22f2553bdafb","qualityScore":28}');
