 에이전트는 코드 품질과 개발 효율성을 높이고 Intent-driven의 Claude Code 개발을 지원합니다","es":"El agente use-tdd es un entorno de pruebas para Claude Code que utiliza la Inteligencia Artificial para mejorar la eficiencia","fr":"L''agent use-tdd est un environnement de test pour Claude Code qui utilise l''Intelligence Artificielle pour améliorer l''efficacité","de":"Der use-tdd-Agent ist ein Testumfeld für Claude Code, das Künstliche Intelligenz nutzt, um die Effizienz zu verbessern","pt":"Os agentes de IA para Claude Code com TDD permitem que os desenvolvedores criem aplicativos de forma eficiente e confiável.","ru":"ИИ Агенты для Claude Code с TDD позволяют разработчикам создавать приложения эффективно и надежно.","ar":"يساهم وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي للكلود كود مع TDD في تمكين المطورين من إنشاء التطبيقات بفعالية وموثوقية.","en":"Intent-driven AI agents for Claude Code"},"definition":{"en":"Intent-driven AI agents for Claude Code"},"features":{"zh":["支持Intent-driven的Claude Code开发","提高代码质量和开发效率","使用TDD的方法实现AI代理","支持多种编程语言","易于集成和扩展"],"ja":["Intent-drivenのClaude Code開発をサポート","コードの品質と開発効率を向上","TDDの方法でAIエージェントを実現","複数のプログラミング言語をサポート","容易に統合と拡張が可能"],"ko":["Intent-driven의 Claude Code 개발을 지원","코드 품질과 개발 효율성을 높임","TDD의 방법으로 AI 에이전트를 구현","다양한 프로그래밍 언어를 지원","쉽게 통합과 확장이 가능"],"es":["Pruebas automatizadas con Inteligencia Artificial","Integración con Claude Code","Mejora de la eficiencia en el desarrollo de software","Soporte para desarrollo ágil","Análisis de resultados de pruebas"],"fr":["Tests automatisés avec l''Intelligence Artificielle","Intégration avec Claude Code","Amélioration de l''efficacité dans le développement de logiciels","Support pour le développement agile","Analyse des résultats des tests"],"de":["Automatisierte Tests mit Künstlicher Intelligenz","Integration mit Claude Code","Verbesserung der Effizienz in der Softwareentwicklung","Unterstützung für agiles Entwicklung","Analyse der Testergebnisse"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento de aplicativos com confiança","Testes direcionados para garantir a qualidade do código","Integração com Claude Code","Suporte a linguagens de programação como Python e Node.js","Ferramentas de depuração e análise de código"],"ru":["Разработка приложений с уверенностью","Направленные тесты для обеспечения качества кода","Интеграция с Claude Code","Поддержка языков программирования как Python и Node.js","Инструменты отладки и анализа кода"],"ar":["تطوير التطبيقات بثقة","اختبارات موجهة لضمان جودة الكود","التكامل مع الكلود كود","دعم لغات البرمجة مثل بايثون و نود.جس","أدوات فحص و تحليل الكود"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用TDD的AI智能代理","什么是TDD的AI智能代理","TDD的AI智能代理替代品","TDD的AI智能代理安装","TDD的AI智能代理设置指南","TDD的AI智能代理和React","TDD的AI智能代理和Python"],"ja":["TDDのAIエージェントを使用する方法","TDDのAIエージェントとは","TDDのAIエージェントの代替品","TDDのAIエージェントのインストール","TDDのAIエージェントの設定ガイド","TDDのAIエージェントとReact","TDDのAIエージェントとPython"],"ko":["TDD의 AI 에이전트를 사용하는 방법","TDD의 AI 에이전트란","TDD의 AI 에이전트 대체품","TDD의 AI 에이전트 설치","TDD의 AI 에이전트 설정 가이드","TDD의 AI 에이전트와 React","TDD의 AI 에이전트와 Python"],"es":["cómo usar TDD","qué es un agente de pruebas","alternativa a Jest","TDD vs BDD","instalación de use-tdd","guía de configuración de use-tdd","desarrollo de software ágil"],"fr":["comment utiliser TDD","qu''est-ce qu''un agent de test","alternative à Jest","TDD vs BDD","installation de use-tdd","guide de configuration de use-tdd","développement de logiciel agile"],"de":["wie man TDD verwendet","was ist ein Testagent","Alternative zu Jest","TDD vs BDD","Installation von use-tdd","Konfigurationsanleitung für use-tdd","agile Softwareentwicklung"],"pt":["como usar agentes de IA","o que é TDD"," Claude Code alternative"," Claude Code vs outros","instalar agentes de IA","guia de configuração de agentes de IA","desenvolvimento de aplicativos com agentes de IA"],"ru":["как использовать ИИ Агенты","что такое TDD","ИИ Агенты для Claude Code","Claude Code альтернатива","Claude Code vs другие","установка ИИ Агентов","руководство по настройке ИИ Агентов","разработка приложений с ИИ Агентами"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","ما هو TDD","وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي للكلود كود","بديل الكلود كود","الكلود كود مقابل الآخرين","تثبيت وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","دليل إعداد وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","تطوير التطبيقات مع وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"mtthsnc","repo":"autonome","repoPath":"mtthsnc/autonome","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.974Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"use-tdd","description":"Use when implementing any feature or bugfix, before writing implementation code","bodyPreview":"Write the test first. Watch it fail. Write minimal code to pass.\n\n**Core principle:** If you didn''t watch the test fail, you don''t know if it tests the right thing.\n\n# The Iron Law\n\n```\nNO PRODUCTION CODE WITHOUT A FAILING TEST FIRST\n```\n\nWrite code before the test? Delete it. Start over.\n\n**No exceptions:**\n- Don''t keep it as \"reference\"\n- Don''t \"adapt\" it while writing tests\n- Delete means delete\n\n# Red-Green-Refactor\n\n## RED - Write Failing Test\n\nWrite one minimal test showing what should hap","body":"Write the test first. Watch it fail. Write minimal code to pass.\n\n**Core principle:** If you didn''t watch the test fail, you don''t know if it tests the right thing.\n\n# The Iron Law\n\n```\nNO PRODUCTION CODE WITHOUT A FAILING TEST FIRST\n```\n\nWrite code before the test? Delete it. Start over.\n\n**No exceptions:**\n- Don''t keep it as \"reference\"\n- Don''t \"adapt\" it while writing tests\n- Delete means delete\n\n# Red-Green-Refactor\n\n## RED - Write Failing Test\n\nWrite one minimal test showing what should happen.\n\n**Requirements:**\n- One behavior\n- Clear name\n- Real code (no mocks unless unavoidable)\n\n## Verify RED - Watch It Fail\n\n**MANDATORY. Never skip.**\n\n```bash\nnpm test path/to/test.test.ts\n```\n\nConfirm:\n- Test fails (not errors)\n- Failure message is expected\n- Fails because feature missing (not typos)\n\n**Test passes?** You''re testing existing behavior. Fix test.\n\n## GREEN - Minimal Code\n\nWrite simplest code to pass the test.\n\nDon''t add features, refactor other code, or \"improve\" beyond the test.\n\n## Verify GREEN - Watch It Pass\n\n**MANDATORY.**\n\n```bash\nnpm test path/to/test.test.ts\n```\n\nConfirm:\n- Test passes\n- Other tests still pass\n- Output pristine (no errors, warnings)\n\n**Test fails?** Fix code, not test.\n\n## REFACTOR - Clean Up\n\nAfter green only:\n- Remove duplication\n- Improve names\n- Extract helpers\n\nKeep tests green. Don''t add behavior.\n\n# Why Order Matters\n\n**\"I''ll write tests after to verify it works\"**\n\nTests written after code pass immediately. Passing immediately proves nothing:\n- Might test wrong thing\n- Might test implementation, not behavior\n- Might miss edge cases you forgot\n\nTest-first forces you to see the test fail, proving it actually tests something.\n\n**\"I already manually tested all the edge cases\"**\n\nManual testing is ad-hoc:\n- No record of what you tested\n- Can''t re-run when code changes\n- Easy to forget cases under pressure\n\nAutomated tests are systematic and run the same way every time.\n\n**\"Deleting X hours of work is wasteful\"**\n\nSunk cost fallacy. Your choice now:\n- Delete and rewrite with TDD (X more hours, high confidence)\n- Keep it and add tests after (30 min, low confidence, likely bugs)\n\nThe \"waste\" is keeping code you can''t trust.\n\n**\"TDD is dogmatic, being pragmatic means adapting\"**\n\nTDD IS pragmatic:\n- Finds bugs before commit (faster than debugging after)\n- Prevents regressions (tests catch breaks immediately)\n- Documents behavior (tests show how to use code)\n- Enables refactoring (change freely, tests catch breaks)\n\n**\"Tests after achieve the same goals - it''s spirit not ritual\"**\n\nNo. Tests-after answer \"What does this do?\" Tests-first answer \"What should this do?\"\n\nTests-after are biased by your implementation. You test what you built, not what''s required.\n\nTests-first force edge case brainstorm before implementing.\n\n# Common Rationalizations\n\n| Excuse | Reality |\n|--------|---------|\n| \"Too simple to test\" | Simple code breaks. Test takes 30 seconds. |\n| \"I''ll test after\" | Tests passing immediately prove nothing. |\n| \"Tests after achieve same goals\" | Tests-after = \"what does this do?\" Tests-first = \"what should this do?\" |\n| \"Already manually tested\" | Ad-hoc ≠ systematic. No record, can''t re-run. |\n| \"Deleting X hours is wasteful\" | Sunk cost fallacy. Keeping unverified code is technical debt. |\n| \"Keep as reference\" | You''ll adapt it. That''s testing after. Delete means delete. |\n| \"Need to explore first\" | Fine. Throw away exploration, start with TDD. |\n| \"Test hard = design unclear\" | Listen to test. Hard to test = hard to use. |\n\n# Red Flags - STOP\n\n- Code before test\n- Test after implementation\n- Test passes immediately\n- Can''t explain why test failed\n- Tests added \"later\"\n- \"I already manually tested it\"\n- \"Tests after achieve the same purpose\"\n- \"Keep as reference\" or \"adapt existing code\"\n- \"Already spent X hours, deleting is wasteful\"\n\n**All of these mean: Delete code. Start over with TDD.**\n\n# Verification Checklist\n\nBefore marking work complete:\n\n- [ ] Every new function/method has a test\n- [ ] Watched each test fail before implementing\n- [ ] Each test failed for expected reason (feature missing, not typo)\n- [ ] Wrote minimal code to pass each test\n- [ ] All tests pass\n- [ ] Output pristine (no errors, warnings)\n- [ ] Tests use real code (mocks only if unavoidable)\n- [ ] Edge cases and errors covered\n\nCan''t check all boxes? You skipped TDD. Start over.\n\n# Final Rule\n\n```\nProduction code → test exists and failed first\nOtherwise → not TDD\n```\n\nNo exceptions without your human partner''s permission.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:55:01.534Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Test-Driven Development Agents requiring rigorous testing and validation protocols","zh":"适用于需要严格测试和验证协议的测试驱动开发代理","ja":"厳格なテストと検証プロトコルを必要とするテスト駆動開発エージェントに適しています","ko":"격한 테스트와 검증 프로토콜이 필요한 테스트 주도 개발 에이전트에 적합합니다","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Desarrollo Dirigido por Pruebas que requieren protocolos de prueba y validación rigurosos","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents de Développement Piloté par les Tests nécessitant des protocoles de test et de validation rigoureux","de":"Ideal für Test-Driven Development Agents, die strenge Test- und Validierungsprotokolle erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento Dirigido por Testes que exigem protocolos rigorosos de teste e validação","ru":"Идеально для агентов разработки, управляемой тестированием, требующих строгого тестирования и протоколов проверки","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء التطوير الموجه بالاختبار الذين يتطلبون بروتوكولات اختبار وتحقق صارمة"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to write reliable code using the Red-Green-Refactor methodology, ensuring adherence to the Iron Law of no production code without a failing test first, and leveraging concepts like minimal test-driven development","zh":"赋予代理编写可靠代码的能力，使用红绿重构方法ology，确保遵守没有失败测试就没有生产代码的铁律，并利用最小化测试驱动开发等概念","ja":"Red-Green-Refactor メソッドロジーを使用して信頼性の高いコードを書くエージェントをエンパワーし、失敗テストなしに生産コードを許可しない鉄の法則に従い、最小限のテスト駆動開発などの概念を利用する","ko":"에이전트가 신뢰할 수 있는 코드를 작성하도록 강화하고, 적색-녹색-재구성 방법론을 사용하여, 실패한 테스트 없이 생산 코드를 허용하지 않는 철의 법칙을 준수하며, 최소한의 테스트 주도 개발 등의 개념을 활용함","es":"Habilita a los agentes a escribir código confiable utilizando la metodología Red-Green-Refactor, asegurando el cumplimiento de la Ley de Hierro de que no hay código de producción sin una prueba fallida primero, y aprovechando conceptos como el desarrollo mínimo dirigido por pruebas","fr":"Permet aux agents d''écrire du code fiable en utilisant la méthodologie Red-Green-Refactor, en assurant le respect de la Loi de Fer selon laquelle il n''y a pas de code de production sans un test échoué au préalable, et en exploitant des concepts comme le développement minimal piloté par les tests","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, zuverlässigen Code unter Verwendung der Red-Green-Refactor-Methode zu schreiben, die Einhaltung des Eisernen Gesetzes sicherzustellen, dass es keinen Produktionscode ohne einen vorherigen fehlgeschlagenen Test gibt, und Konzepte wie minimales testgetriebenes Entwicklung nutzen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a escreverem código confiável usando a metodologia Red-Green-Refactor, garantindo a adesão à Lei de Ferro de que nenhum código de produção sem um teste com falha primeiro, e aproveitando conceitos como desenvolvimento dirigido por testes mínimo","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью писать надежный код, используя методологию Red-Green-Refactor, обеспечивая соблюдение Железного закона о том, что нет кода производственной среды без сначала проваленного теста, и использует такие понятия, как минимальное тестирование","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من كتابة код موثوق به باستخدام منهجية Red-Green-Refactor، مما يضمن الالتزام بقانون الحديد الذي لا يسمح بأي код إنتاج بدون اختبار فاشل أولاً، ويتضمن مفاهيم مثل التطوير الموجه بالاختبار الأدنى"},"useCases":{"en":["Writing failing tests to validate code functionality","Refactoring code to improve readability and efficiency","Debugging existing codebases using test-driven development principles"],"zh":["编写失败测试以验证代码功能","重构代码以提高可读性和效率","使用测试驱动开发原则调试现有代码库"],"ja":["コードの機能を検証するために失敗テストを書く","可読性と効率を向上させるためにコードをリファクタリングする","テスト駆動開発の原則を使用して既存のコードベースをデバッグする"],"ko":["코드 기능을 검증하기 위해 실패한 테스트를 작성함","가독성과 효율성을 향상시키기 위해 코드를 재구성함","테스트 주도 개발 원칙을 사용하여 기존 코드베이스를 디버깅함"],"es":["Escribir pruebas fallidas para validar la funcionalidad del código","Refactorizar código para mejorar la legibilidad y la eficiencia","Depurar código existente utilizando principios de desarrollo dirigido por pruebas"],"fr":["Écrire des tests échoués pour valider la fonctionnalité du code","Réorganiser le code pour améliorer la lisibilité et l''efficacité","Déboguer les codes existants en utilisant les principes de développement piloté par les tests"],"de":["Schreiben von fehlgeschlagenen Tests, um die Funktionalität des Codes zu validieren","Refactoring von Code, um Lesbarkeit und Effizienz zu verbessern","Fehlerbehebung von bestehendem Code unter Verwendung von testgetriebenen Entwicklungsprinzipien"],"pt":["Escrever testes com falha para validar a funcionalidade do código","Refatorar o código para melhorar a legibilidade e a eficiência","Depurar código existente usando princípios de desenvolvimento orientado a testes"],"ru":["Написание тестов с неудачей для проверки функциональности кода","Рефакторинг кода для улучшения читаемости и эффективности","Отладка существующего кода с использованием принципов разработки, управляемой тестированием"],"ar":["كتابة اختبارات فاشلة لتحقق من وظيفة الكود","إعادة هيكلة الكود لتحسين القراءة والكفاءة","تصحيح الأعطال في الكود الموجود باستخدام مبادئ التطوير الموجه بالاختبار"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires strict adherence to the Iron Law","No exceptions for production code without prior failing tests","Demands a Red-Green-Refactor development cycle"],"zh":["需要严格遵守铁律","没有失败测试就不允许生产代码的例外","要求红绿重构开发周期"],"ja":["鉄の法則に厳格に従う必要がある","失敗テストなしに生産コードを許可する例外なし","Red-Green-Refactor 開発サイクルを要求する"],"ko":["철의 법칙을 엄격하게 준수해야 함","실패한 테스트 없이 생산 코드를 허용하는 예외 없음","적색-녹색-재구성 개발 주기를 요구함"],"es":["Requiere una estricta adherencia a la Ley de Hierro","No hay excepciones para el código de producción sin pruebas fallidas previas","Exige un ciclo de desarrollo Red-Green-Refactor"],"fr":["Nécessite une stricte adhésion à la Loi de Fer","Pas d''exceptions pour le code de production sans tests échoués préalables","Exige un cycle de développement Red-Green-Refactor"],"de":["Erfordert eine strenge Einhaltung des Eisernen Gesetzes","Keine Ausnahmen für Produktionscode ohne vorherige fehlgeschlagene Tests","Erzwingt einen Red-Green-Refactor-Entwicklungszyklus"],"pt":["Exige adesão estrita à Lei de Ferro","Nenhuma exceção para código de produção sem testes com falha anteriores","Exige um ciclo de desenvolvimento Red-Green-Refactor"],"ru":["Требует строгого соблюдения Железного закона","Нет исключений для кода производственной среды без предварительно проваленных тестов","Требует цикла разработки Red-Green-Refactor"],"ar":["يتطلب اتباع قانون الحديد بشكل صارم","لا استثناءات للكود الإنتاجي بدون اختبارات فاشلة سابقة","يتطلب دورة تطوير Red-Green-Refactor"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"e17cc5b01fc1621ace0ab30d29e0306e1ce743d0dfe3fa1a7dc02306a7fcdc56","qualityScore":28}');
