ll alternative","como usar lintroll","instalar lintroll","guias de configuração do lintroll"],"ru":["инструмент для анализа кода","улучшить качество кода","разработка программного обеспечения","альтернативы lintroll","как использовать lintroll","установить lintroll","руководства по настройке lintroll"],"ar":["أداة تحليل الشيفرة","تحسين جودة الشيفرة","تطوير البرمجيات","بديل lintroll","كيفية استخدام lintroll","تثبيت lintroll","دليل إعدادات lintroll"]}},"owner":"privatenumber","repo":"lintroll","repoPath":"privatenumber/lintroll","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.975Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"lintroll","description":"Opinionated ESLint configuration and CLI for TypeScript, Vue, React, JSON, YAML, and Markdown. Use when linting code, fixing style issues, or configuring ESLint in projects using lintroll.","bodyPreview":"# Lintroll\n\nBatteries-included ESLint with 12+ plugins for TypeScript, Vue, React, JSON, YAML, and Markdown.\n\n## CLI\n\n```bash\nlintroll .                          # Lint directory\nlintroll . --fix                    # Auto-fix\nlintroll . --fix --cache            # Fix with caching\nlintroll --git .                    # Only git-tracked files\nlintroll --git --fix .              # Fix only tracked files\nlintroll --staged --fix             # Pre-commit hook\nlintroll . --node                   # Enabl","body":"# Lintroll\n\nBatteries-included ESLint with 12+ plugins for TypeScript, Vue, React, JSON, YAML, and Markdown.\n\n## CLI\n\n```bash\nlintroll .                          # Lint directory\nlintroll . --fix                    # Auto-fix\nlintroll . --fix --cache            # Fix with caching\nlintroll --git .                    # Only git-tracked files\nlintroll --git --fix .              # Fix only tracked files\nlintroll --staged --fix             # Pre-commit hook\nlintroll . --node                   # Enable Node.js rules\nlintroll . --node=./scripts         # Node.js rules for specific paths\nlintroll . --quiet                  # Errors only (no warnings)\nlintroll . --allow-abbreviation db  # Allow specific abbreviations\n```\n\n## Style Rules\n\n| Rule | Enforced style |\n|------|---------------|\n| Indentation | Tabs |\n| Quotes | Single |\n| Semicolons | Always |\n| Line length | 100 chars max |\n| Trailing commas | Multiline only |\n| Functions | Arrow (except `this`/`arguments`/generators/hoisting) |\n| Types | `type =` over `interface` |\n| Type imports | Separate `import type` from value imports |\n| No `any` | Use `unknown` and narrow |\n| Unused vars | Prefix with `_` (e.g. `_unused`) |\n| No abbreviations | `db` → `database`, `env` → `environment`, `pkg` → `packageJson` |\n| Import extensions | `.js` not `.ts` (unless `allowImportingTsExtensions: true`) |\n| React filenames | PascalCase (`UserProfile.tsx`) |\n\n### Abbreviation Mapping\n\nCommon renames enforced by `unicorn/prevent-abbreviations`:\n\n| Abbreviation | Full name |\n|-------------|-----------|\n| `args` | `arguments_` (reserved word) |\n| `db` | `database` |\n| `env` | `environment` |\n| `pkg` | `packageJson` |\n| `temp` | `temporary` |\n| `res` | `response` |\n| `req` | `request` |\n| `dir` | `directory` |\n| `err` | `error` |\n| `msg` | `message` |\n\nLoop indices `i`, `j` are always allowed. Add more with `--allow-abbreviation`.\n\n## ESLint Config\n\nZero-config:\n\n```js\n// eslint.config.js\nexport { default } from ''lintroll''\n```\n\nCustom:\n\n```js\n// eslint.config.ts\nimport { defineConfig, pvtnbr } from ''lintroll''\n\nexport default defineConfig([\n    { ignores: [''tests/fixtures/**/*''] },\n    ...pvtnbr({\n        node: true,\n        allowAbbreviations: {\n            exactWords: [''i'', ''j''],\n            substrings: [''db'', ''env'']\n        }\n    })\n])\n```\n\nFor full API types, see `node_modules/lintroll/dist/index.d.mts`.\n\n## Auto-Detection\n\n| Feature | Detection |\n|---------|-----------|\n| Vue.js | `*.vue` files present — rules apply automatically |\n| TypeScript | `tsconfig.json` present |\n| Node.js | `.cjs`, `.mts`, `scripts/**`, `bin` entries |\n\n## Ignored by Default\n\n- `node_modules/**`, `dist/**`, `vendor/**`\n- `package-lock.json`, `pnpm-lock.yaml`\n- `*.min.js`, `.vitepress`\n- AI assistant files: `CLAUDE.md`, `.claude/`, `copilot.json`, `.cursorrules`\n\n## JSON/YAML\n\n- package.json keys auto-sorted: `name → version → description → ... → scripts → dependencies → devDependencies`\n- JSON style: tabs, trailing commas, spaces around braces `{ \"key\": \"value\" }`\n\n## Gotchas\n\n- **Abbreviation rules disabled in `.d.ts`** — declaration files follow standard conventions\n- **`.ts` extensions in imports** — use `.js` unless tsconfig has `allowImportingTsExtensions: true`\n- **Markdown code blocks in `skills/` directories** — automatically ignored (not linted as project code)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:55:05.408Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Analysis Agents needing comprehensive TypeScript, Vue, React, JSON, YAML, and Markdown linting capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要全面TypeScript, Vue, React, JSON, YAML和Markdown linting功能的代码分析代理。","ja":"TypeScript, Vue, React, JSON, YAML, Markdownの包括的なlinting機能を必要とするコード分析エージェントに最適です。","ko":"전체적인 TypeScript, Vue, React, JSON, YAML 및 Markdown 린팅 기능이 필요한 코드 분석 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Análisis de Código que necesitan capacidades de análisis de TypeScript, Vue, React, JSON, YAML y Markdown integrales.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Analyse de Code nécessitant des capacités de analyse de TypeScript, Vue, React, JSON, YAML et Markdown complètes.","de":"Perfekt für Code-Analyse-Agents, die umfassende TypeScript-, Vue-, React-, JSON-, YAML- und Markdown-Prüffunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise de Código que necessitam de capacidades de linting abrangentes do TypeScript, Vue, React, JSON, YAML e Markdown.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов анализа кода, требующих всесторонних возможностей проверки TypeScript, Vue, React, JSON, YAML и Markdown.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تحليل الشفرة الذي يحتاج إلى قدرات تحليل شاملة لنظام TypeScript و Vue و React و JSON و YAML و Markdown."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to enforce coding standards with ESLint and 12+ plugins, enabling auto-fixing and caching for efficient code maintenance, utilizing TypeScript, Vue, React, JSON, YAML, and Markdown file formats.","zh":"赋予代理强制执行编码标准的能力，使用ESLint和12+插件，实现自动修复和缓存，用于高效的代码维护，利用TypeScript, Vue, React, JSON, YAML和Markdown文件格式。","ja":"ESLintと12以上のプラグインを使用して、コードの標準を強制実施し、自動修復とキャッシュを可能にし、TypeScript, Vue, React, JSON, YAML, Markdownファイル形式を使用して効率的なコードメンテナンスを実現します。","ko":"ESLint와 12개 이상의 플러그인을 사용하여 코딩 표준을 강제로 적용하고 자동 수정 및 캐싱을 허용하여 TypeScript, Vue, React, JSON, YAML 및 Markdown 파일 형식을 사용한 효율적인 코드 유지 보수를 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes hacer cumplir los estándares de codificación con ESLint y más de 12 plugins, permitiendo la corrección automática y el caché para un mantenimiento de código eficiente, utilizando los formatos de archivo TypeScript, Vue, React, JSON, YAML y Markdown.","fr":"Permet aux agents de faire respecter les normes de codage avec ESLint et plus de 12 plugins, permettant la correction automatique et le cache pour une maintenance de code efficace, en utilisant les formats de fichier TypeScript, Vue, React, JSON, YAML et Markdown.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, Codierungsstandards mit ESLint und mehr als 12 Plugins durchzusetzen, wodurch eine automatische Korrektur und Zwischenspeicherung für eine effiziente Codepflege ermöglicht wird, unter Verwendung der Dateiformate TypeScript, Vue, React, JSON, YAML und Markdown.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a impor padrões de codificação com ESLint e 12+ plugins, permitindo auto-correção e cache para manutenção de código eficiente, utilizando os formatos de arquivo TypeScript, Vue, React, JSON, YAML e Markdown.","ru":"Предоставляет агентам возможность обеспечить соблюдение стандартов кодирования с помощью ESLint и 12+ плагинов, что позволяет выполнять автоматическое исправление и кэширование для эффективного обслуживания кода, используя форматы файлов TypeScript, Vue, React, JSON, YAML и Markdown.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء khảية فرض معايير الترميز باستخدام ESLint و 12+ ملحقات، مما يسمح بإصلاح تلقائي وتخزين مؤقت لصيانة الشفرة الفعالة، باستخدام صيغ الملفات TypeScript و Vue و React و JSON و YAML و Markdown."},"useCases":{"en":["Linting directory structures for code consistency","Auto-fixing syntax errors in TypeScript and JavaScript files","Validating JSON and YAML data formats for correctness"],"zh":["linting目录结构以确保代码一致性","自动修复TypeScript和JavaScript文件中的语法错误","验证JSON和YAML数据格式的正确性"],"ja":["コードの一貫性を確保するためのディレクトリ構造のlinting","TypeScriptとJavaScriptファイルの文法エラーの自動修復","JSONとYAMLデータ形式の正しさの検証"],"ko":["코드 일관성을 유지하기 위한 디렉토리 구조 linting","TypeScript 및 JavaScript 파일의 구문 오류 자동 수정","JSON 및 YAML 데이터 형식의 올바름 검증"],"es":["Análisis de estructuras de directorios para la coherencia del código","Corrección automática de errores de sintaxis en archivos TypeScript y JavaScript","Validación de formatos de datos JSON y YAML para la corrección"],"fr":["Analyse de structures de répertoires pour la cohérence du code","Correction automatique des erreurs de syntaxe dans les fichiers TypeScript et JavaScript","Validation des formats de données JSON et YAML pour la correction"],"de":["Analyse von Verzeichnisstrukturen für die Konsistenz des Codes","Automatische Korrektur von Syntaxfehlern in TypeScript- und JavaScript-Dateien","Validierung von JSON- und YAML-Datiformaten für die Richtigkeit"],"pt":["Análise de estruturas de diretório para consistência de código","Auto-correção de erros de sintaxe em arquivos TypeScript e JavaScript","Validação de formatos de dados JSON e YAML para correção"],"ru":["Анализ структуры директорий для обеспечения согласованности кода","Автоматическое исправление синтаксических ошибок в файлах TypeScript и JavaScript","Проверка форматов данных JSON и YAML на правильность"],"ar":["تحليل هيكل الدليل من أجل الات