s"],"fr":["Intégration avec Discord pour Pokémon Gacha","Capacité add-move pour améliorer l''expérience utilisateur","Utilisation d''outils d''agent IA pour automatiser des tâches","Personnalisation de l''expérience utilisateur","Compatibilité avec plusieurs plateformes"],"de":["Integration mit Discord für Pokémon Gacha","Fähigkeit add-move für verbesserte Benutzererfahrung","Nutzung von AI-Tools für Aufgabenautomatisierung","Anpassung der Benutzererfahrung","Kompatibilität mit mehreren Plattformen"],"pt":["Adicionar a funcionalidade de mover no Pokémon Gacha Discord Bot","Desenvolvido com React e Node.js","Integração com a API do Discord","Suporte a múltiplos comandos","Personalização da experiência do usuário"],"ru":["Добавить функцию перемещения в Pokémon Gacha Discord Bot","Разработано на React и Node.js","Интеграция с API Discord","Поддержка нескольких команд","Настройка пользовательского опыта"],"ar":["إضافة ميزة التحريك في بوت ديسكورد بوكيمون غاشا","تم تطويره باستخدام React و Node.js","التكامل مع واجهة برمجة تطبيقات ديسكورد","دعم أوامر متعددة","تخصيص تجربة المستخدم"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能工具","Discord服务器构建","Pokemon游戏体验","如何使用AI工具","AI工具安装","Discord Bot设置指南"],"ja":["AIエージェント","Discordサーバーの構築","Pokemonゲームの体験","AIツールの使用方法","AIツールのインストール","Discord Botの設定ガイド"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","디스코드 서버 구축","포켓몬 게임 경험","AI 도구 사용 방법","AI 도구 설치","디스코드 봇 설정 가이드"],"es":["cómo usar add-move","qué es un agente de IA","herramientas de agente de IA","alternativa a add-move","add-move vs otros bots","instalación de add-move","guía de configuración de add-move"],"fr":["comment utiliser add-move","qu''est-ce qu''un outil d''agent IA","outils d''agent IA","alternative à add-move","add-move vs autres bots","installation de add-move","guide de configuration de add-move"],"de":["wie man add-move verwendet","was ist ein AI-Tool","AI-Tools","Alternative zu add-move","add-move vs andere Bots","Installation von add-move","Einrichtungsanleitung für add-move"],"pt":["como usar add-move","o que é add-move","add-move vs outras habilidades","guia de instalação do add-move","configuração do add-move","alternativas ao add-move"],"ru":["как использовать add-move","что такое add-move","add-move vs другие способности","руководство по установке add-move","настройка add-move","альтернативы add-move"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام إضافة الحركة","ما هي إضافة الحركة","إضافة الحركة مقابل سمات أخرى","دليل تثبيت إضافة الحركة","إعداد إضافة الحركة","بديلات إضافة الحركة"]}},"owner":"ewei068","repo":"pokestar","repoPath":"ewei068/pokestar","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:11.003Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"add-move","description":"Add new moves to the battle system. Use when implementing attack, status, or support moves for Pokemon.","bodyPreview":"# Adding Moves to Pokestar\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n**Files to modify:**\n\n1. `src/enums/battleEnums.js` - Add `moveIdEnum.YOUR_MOVE` entry (ONLY if not exists)\n2. `src/battle/data/moves.js` - Add the move implementation\n\n**DO NOT** modify other moves or `battleConfig.js` unless explicitly asked.\n\n## Move Structure\n\n```javascript\n[moveIdEnum.MOVE_NAME]: new Move({\n  id: moveIdEnum.MOVE_NAME,\n  name: \"Move Name\",\n  type: pokemonTypes.TYPE,           // FIRE, WATER, GRASS, etc.\n  power: 80,","body":"# Adding Moves to Pokestar\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n**Files to modify:**\n\n1. `src/enums/battleEnums.js` - Add `moveIdEnum.YOUR_MOVE` entry (ONLY if not exists)\n2. `src/battle/data/moves.js` - Add the move implementation\n\n**DO NOT** modify other moves or `battleConfig.js` unless explicitly asked.\n\n## Move Structure\n\n```javascript\n[moveIdEnum.MOVE_NAME]: new Move({\n  id: moveIdEnum.MOVE_NAME,\n  name: \"Move Name\",\n  type: pokemonTypes.TYPE,           // FIRE, WATER, GRASS, etc.\n  power: 80,                         // Base damage (null for non-damaging)\n  accuracy: 100,                     // Hit chance % (null = always hits)\n  cooldown: 3,                       // Turns before reusable\n  targetType: targetTypes.ENEMY,     // ENEMY, ALLY, ANY\n  targetPosition: targetPositions.FRONT, // FRONT, BACK, ANY, SELF, NON_SELF\n  targetPattern: targetPatterns.SINGLE,  // See references/target-patterns.md\n  tier: moveTiers.POWER,             // BASIC, POWER, ULTIMATE\n  damageType: damageTypes.PHYSICAL,  // PHYSICAL, SPECIAL, OTHER\n  description: \"Move description\",\n  execute() { /* implementation */ },\n}),\n```\n\n## Execute Context\n\n**NOTE:** The `execute` function binds `this` to the `MoveInstance.js` `MoveInstance` class, with properties such as:\n\n**Example Properties:**\n\n- `this.source` - User of the move\n- `this.primaryTarget` - Main target selected\n- `this.allTargets` - All affected targets (based on pattern)\n- `this.missedTargets` - Targets that were missed\n- `this.battle` - Battle instance\n- `this.power`, `this.type`, `this.id` - Move properties\n\n## Example Generic Methods\n\nAll generic methods are available in `MoveInstance.js`. These are some common examples:\n\n```javascript\n// Deal damage to all targets\nthis.genericDealAllDamage();\n// Returns { damageInstances: {targetId: damage}, totalDamageDealt: number }\n\n// Custom damage calculation\nthis.genericDealAllDamage({\n  calculateDamageFunction: (args) =>\n    this.source.calculateMoveDamage(args) * 1.5,\n  offTargetDamageMultiplier: 0.5,\n  backTargetDamageMultiplier: 0.7,\n  attackOverride: this.source.getStat(\"def\"),\n});\n\n// Apply status (BURN, PARALYSIS, FROZEN, SLEEP, POISON)\nthis.genericApplyAllStatus({\n  statusId: statusConditions.BURN,\n  probability: 0.3,\n});\n\n// Apply effect (see references/effects.md)\nthis.genericApplyAllEffects({\n  effectId: \"atkUp\",\n  duration: 3,\n  probability: 0.5,\n});\n\n// Single target effect\nthis.genericApplySingleEffect({\n  target: this.primaryTarget,\n  effectId: \"shield\",\n  duration: 3,\n  initialArgs: { shield: 100 },\n});\n\n// Combat readiness\nthis.genericChangeAllCombatReadiness({ amount: 25, action: \"boost\" }); // or \"reduce\"\n\n// Healing\nthis.genericHealAllTargets({ healPercent: 25 });\nthis.genericHealSingleTarget({ target, healAmount: 100 });\n```\n\n## Move Tags\n\nOptional `tags` array for ability interactions:\n\n- `\"punch\"` - Boosted by Iron Fist ability\n- `\"slice\"` - Boosted by Sharpness ability\n- `\"charge\"` - Two-turn move\n\n## Dynamic Move Properties\n\nUse `overrideFields` to change properties based on context:\n\n```javascript\noverrideFields: (options) => {\n  if (options.source?.speciesId === pokemonIdEnum.SPECIAL_FORM) {\n    return { power: 120, description: \"Enhanced version\" };\n  }\n},\n```\n\n## Useful BattlePokemon Methods\n\n- `pokemon.getStat(\"atk\")` - Get effective stat\n- `pokemon.hasType(pokemonTypes.FIRE)` - Check type\n- `pokemon.applyEffect(id, duration, source, initialArgs)`\n- `pokemon.dispellEffect(effectId)` - Remove effect\n- `pokemon.removeStatus()` - Clear status condition\n- `pokemon.dealDamage(amount, target, info)` - Deal damage\n- `pokemon.giveHeal(amount, target, info)` - Heal\n- `pokemon.boostCombatReadiness(source, amount)`\n- `pokemon.getPartyPokemon()` - Get ally array\n- `pokemon.isFainted` - Check if fainted\n\n## References\n\n- `references/target-patterns.md` - Visual guide to target patterns\n- `references/effects.md` - List of all buff/debuff effect IDs\n- `references/pattern-*.md` - Code examples for common move types\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:06:02.076Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents like Claude Code and AutoGPT needing to extend Pokémon Gacha Discord Bot functionality with custom move implementations","zh":"非常适合需要扩展Pokémon Gacha Discord Bot功能以实现自定义动作的AI代理，如Claude Code和AutoGPT","ja":"Claude CodeやAutoGPTのような、Pokémon Gacha Discord Botの機能をカスタム動作実装で拡張する必要があるAIエージェントに最適","ko":"Pokémon Gacha Discord Bot의 기능을 사용자 정의 이동 구현으로 확장해야 하는 Claude Code 및 AutoGPT와 같은 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA como Claude Code y AutoGPT que necesitan ampliar la funcionalidad del bot de Discord Pokémon Gacha con implementaciones de movimientos personalizados","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA comme Claude Code et AutoGPT ayant besoin d''étendre la fonctionnalité du bot Discord Pokémon Gacha avec des implementations de mouvements personnalisées","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agenten wie Claude Code und AutoGPT, die die Funktionalität des Pokémon Gacha Discord-Bots mit benutzerdefinierten Bewegungsimplementierungen erweitern müssen","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de IA como Claude Code e AutoGPT que precisam estender a funcionalidade do Pokémon Gacha Discord Bot com implementações de movimentos personalizados","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, таких как Claude Code и AutoGPT, которым необходимо расширить функциональность бота Pokémon Gacha Discord с помощью пользовательских реализаций движений","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي مثل Claude Code و AutoGPT الذين يحتاجون إلى توسيع وظائف بوت Pokémon Gacha Discord مع تنفيذ حركات مخصصة"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create and integrate new moves into the Pokémon Gacha Discord Bot using JavaScript and enums like moveIdEnum, modifying files such as src/enums/battleEnums.js and src/battle/data/moves.js","zh":"赋予代理创建和集成新的动作到Pokémon Gacha Discord Bot中，使用JavaScript和枚举，如moveIdEnum，修改文件如src/enums/battleEnums.js和src/battle/data/moves.js","ja":"JavaScriptと列挙型（例：moveIdEnum）を使用して、エージェントがPokémon Gacha Discord Botに新しい動作を作成、統合できるようにし、ファイルsuch as src/enums/battleEnums.jsとsrc/battle/data/moves.jsを修正","ko":"JavaScript 및 열거형(예: moveIdEnum)을 사용하여 에이전트가 Pokémon Gacha Discord Bot에 새로운 동작을 생성하고 통합할 수 있도록 하며, src/enums/battleEnums.js 및 src/battle/data/moves.js와 같은 파일을 수정합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes crear e integrar nuevos movimientos en el bot de Discord Pokémon Gacha utilizando JavaScript y enums como moveIdEnum, modificando archivos como src/enums/battleEnums.js y src/battle/data/moves.js","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer et d''intégrer de nouveaux mouvements dans le bot Discord Pokémon Gacha en utilisant JavaScript et des enums comme moveIdEnum, en modifiant des fichiers tels que src/enums/battleEnums.js et src/battle/data/moves.js","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, neue Bewegungen in den Pokémon Gacha Discord-Bot zu erstellen und zu integrieren, indem sie JavaScript und Enums wie moveIdEnum verwenden und Dateien wie src/enums/battleEnums.js und src/battle/data/moves.js modifizieren","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar e integrar novos movimentos ao Pokémon Gacha Discord Bot usando JavaScript e enums como moveIdEnum, modificando arquivos como src/enums/battleEnums.js e src/battle/data/moves.js","ru":"Предоставляет агентам возможность создавать и интегрировать новые движения в бот Pokémon Gacha Discord, используя JavaScript и enums, такие как moveIdEnum, изменяя файлы, такие как src/enums/battleEnums.js и src/battle/data/moves.js","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من إنشاء وتكامل تحركات جديدة إلى بوت Pokémon Gacha Discord باستخدام JavaScript و enums مثل moveIdEnum، وتعديل الملفات مثل src/enums/battleEnums.js و src/battle/data/moves.js"},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing custom move effects","Adding new move types like FIRE or WATER","Debugging move implementation issues in src/battle/data/moves.js"],"zh":["实现自定义动作效果","添加新的动作类型，如FIRE或WATER","在src/battle/data/moves.js中调试动作实现问题"],"ja":["カスタム動作効果の実装","FIREまたはWATERのような新しい動作タイプの追加","src/battle/data/moves.jsでの動作実装の問題をデバッグ"],"ko":["사용자 정의 동작 효과 구현","FIRE 또는 WATER와 같은 새로운 동작 유형 추가","src/battle/data/moves.js에서 동작 구현 문제 디버깅"],"es":["Implementar efectos de movimientos personalizados","Agregar nuevos tipos de movimientos como FUEGO o AGUA","Depurar problemas de implementación de movimientos en src/battle/data/moves.js"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre des effets de mouvements personnalisés","Ajouter de nouveaux types de mouvements comme FEU ou EAU","Déboguer les problèmes d''implémentation de mouvements dans src/battle/data/moves.js"],"de":["Benutzerdefinierte Bewegungseffekte implementieren","Neue Bewegungstypen wie FEUER oder WASSER hinzu