t bei der Konfiguration"],"pt":["Conexão de protocolos diferentes","Uso de um único manipulador Axum","Suporte a gRPC, gRPC-Web e HTTP","Desenvolvimento de aplicações mais eficiente","Integração com outras ferramentas de IA"],"ru":["Подключение разных протоколов","Использование одного обработчика Axum","Поддержка gRPC, gRPC-Web и HTTP","Более эффективная разработка приложений","Интеграция с другими инструментами ИИ"],"ar":["اتصال بروتوكولات مختلفة","استخدام معالج Axum واحد","دعم gRPC و gRPC-Web و HTTP","تطوير تطبيقات أكثر كفاءة","التكامل مع أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي الأخرى"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能代理","submit-issue 技术","Axum 处理器","gRPC连接","gRPC-Web 支持","HTTP 处理","高性能处理","易于集成"],"ja":["AIエージェント","submit-issue 技術","Axum ハンドラー","gRPC接続","gRPC-Web サポート","HTTP 処理","高性能処理","簡単な統合"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","submit-issue 기능","Axum 핸들러","gRPC 연결","gRPC-Web 지원","HTTP 처리","고성능 처리","쉽게 통합"],"es":["herramientas de AI","submit-issue","Axum","gRPC","gRPC-Web","HTTP","cómo usar submit-issue","qué es submit-issue","alternativas a submit-issue","instalación de submit-issue"],"fr":["outils d''IA","submit-issue","Axum","gRPC","gRPC-Web","HTTP","comment utiliser submit-issue","qu''est-ce que submit-issue","alternatives à submit-issue","installation de submit-issue"],"de":["KI-Tools","submit-issue","Axum","gRPC","gRPC-Web","HTTP","wie man submit-issue verwendet","was ist submit-issue","alternativen zu submit-issue","installation von submit-issue"],"pt":["como usar submit-issue","o que é submit-issue","alternativas para Axum","Axum vs outras ferramentas","instalar submit-issue","guia de configuração do submit-issue"],"ru":["как использовать submit-issue","что такое submit-issue","альтернативы Axum","Axum vs другие инструменты","установить submit-issue","руководство по настройке submit-issue"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام submit-issue","ما هو submit-issue","بديلات Axum","Axum مقابل أدوات أخرى","تثبيت submit-issue","دليل إعداد submit-issue"]}},"owner":"washanhanzi","repo":"connectrpc-axum","repoPath":"washanhanzi/connectrpc-axum","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:11.120Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"submit-issue","description":"Handle user questions, feature requests, and bug reports for connectrpc-axum. This skill should be used when users ask questions about the library, request new features, or report bugs. It first attempts to answer using project documentation, verifies bugs with integration tests, and submits GitHub issues when needed.","bodyPreview":"# Submit Issue\n\nHandle user questions, feature requests, and bug reports for the connectrpc-axum project.\n\n## Workflow\n\n### 1. Understand the Request\n\nDetermine the request type:\n- **Question**: User wants to understand how something works\n- **Feature Request**: User wants new functionality\n- **Bug Report**: User believes something is broken\n\n### 2. For Questions - Answer First\n\nBefore suggesting an issue submission, attempt to answer using project documentation:\n\n1. Read `docs/guide/index.md` f","body":"# Submit Issue\n\nHandle user questions, feature requests, and bug reports for the connectrpc-axum project.\n\n## Workflow\n\n### 1. Understand the Request\n\nDetermine the request type:\n- **Question**: User wants to understand how something works\n- **Feature Request**: User wants new functionality\n- **Bug Report**: User believes something is broken\n\n### 2. For Questions - Answer First\n\nBefore suggesting an issue submission, attempt to answer using project documentation:\n\n1. Read `docs/guide/index.md` for getting started and features overview\n2. Read `docs/guide/architecture.md` for internal design and module structure\n3. Check other guides in `docs/guide/` for specific topics (configuration, compression, timeouts, etc.)\n4. Reference the connect-go-reference skill for protocol details\n5. Search the codebase for implementation specifics\n\nIf the question can be answered from documentation, provide the answer and ask if more clarification is needed.\n\n### 3. For Bug Reports - Verify First\n\nBefore submitting a bug report:\n\n1. **Reproduce the issue** - Ask user for reproduction steps if not provided\n2. **Run integration tests** - Use the `/test` skill command\n3. **Check connect-go behavior** - Use connect-go-reference skill to verify expected protocol behavior\n4. **Document findings** - Note whether tests pass/fail and any discrepancies\n\nOnly proceed to issue submission if the bug is verified or plausible.\n\n### 4. Submit to GitHub\n\nWhen issue submission is appropriate, use the `gh` CLI:\n\n```bash\n# For bug reports\ngh issue create \\\n  --repo \"frankgreco/connectrpc-axum\" \\\n  --title \"Bug: <concise description>\" \\\n  --body \"$(cat <<''EOF''\n## Description\n<what''s broken>\n\n## Steps to Reproduce\n1. <step>\n2. <step>\n\n## Expected Behavior\n<what should happen>\n\n## Actual Behavior\n<what happens instead>\n\n## Environment\n- connectrpc-axum version: <version>\n- Rust version: <version>\n\n## Additional Context\n<test results, connect-go comparison, etc.>\nEOF\n)\"\n\n# For feature requests\ngh issue create \\\n  --repo \"frankgreco/connectrpc-axum\" \\\n  --title \"Feature: <concise description>\" \\\n  --body \"$(cat <<''EOF''\n## Description\n<what you want>\n\n## Use Case\n<why you need it>\n\n## Proposed Solution\n<how it might work>\n\n## Alternatives Considered\n<other approaches>\nEOF\n)\"\n```\n\n### 5. Label Issues Appropriately\n\nAdd labels based on issue type:\n- `bug` - For verified bugs\n- `enhancement` - For feature requests\n- `question` - For questions that need discussion\n- `documentation` - For docs improvements\n\n```bash\ngh issue edit <number> --add-label \"bug\"\n```\n\n## Reference Skills\n\n- **connect-go-reference**: Use to verify protocol behavior against official Go implementation\n- **test**: Use to run integration tests and verify bugs\n\n## Documentation References\n\nWhen answering questions, check these docs in order:\n\n1. `docs/guide/index.md` - Getting started, features, quick start\n2. `docs/guide/architecture.md` - Internal design, module structure, request flow\n3. `docs/guide/configuration.md` - Service and handler configuration\n4. `docs/guide/examples.md` - Code examples and usage patterns\n5. Other topic-specific guides in `docs/guide/` (compression, timeouts, tonic integration, etc.)\n6. Codebase search for implementation details\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:39:08.559Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Support Agents handling user inquiries via gRPC, gRPC-Web, and HTTP protocols.","zh":"非常适合处理通过 gRPC、gRPC-Web 和 HTTP 协议的用户查询的支持代理。","ja":"gRPC、gRPC-Web、HTTP プロトコル経由のユーザー照会を処理するサポート エージェントに最適です。","ko":"gRPC, gRPC-Web, HTTP 프로토콜을 통해 사용자 문의를 처리하는 지원 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de soporte que manejan consultas de usuarios a través de gRPC, gRPC-Web y protocolos HTTP.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de support qui gèrent les requêtes des utilisateurs via gRPC, gRPC-Web et les protocoles HTTP.","de":"Perfekt für Supportagenten, die Benutzeranfragen über gRPC, gRPC-Web und HTTP-Protokolle bearbeiten.","pt":"Perfect for Support Agents handling user inquiries via gRPC, gRPC-Web, and HTTP protocols.","ru":"Perfect for Support Agents handling user inquiries via gRPC, gRPC-Web, and HTTP protocols.","ar":"Perfect for Support Agents handling user inquiries via gRPC, gRPC-Web, and HTTP protocols."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to efficiently manage user requests by determining the request type, answering questions using project documentation, and handling feature requests and bug reports for the connectrpc-axum project, leveraging Axum handlers and gRPC protocols.","zh":"通过确定请求类型、使用项目文档回答问题以及使用 Axum 处理程序和 gRPC 协议处理 connectrpc-axum 项目的功能请求和错误报告来赋予代理高效地管理用户请求的能力。","ja":"リクエストの種類を判断し、プロジェクトのドキュメントを使用して質問に回答し、Axum ハンドラーと gRPC プロトコルを使用して connectrpc-axum プロジェクトの機能要求とバグ報告を処理することで、エージェントがユーザー要求を効率的に管理できるようになります。","ko":"요청 유형을 결정하고 프로젝트 문서를 사용하여 질문에 답변하고 Axum 처리기 및 gRPC 프로토콜을 사용