"],"zh":["自动化问题提交工作流程","调试用户报告的错误","生成对常见用户问题的响应"],"ja":["問題提出ワークフローの自動化","ユーザー報告のバグのデバッグ","頻繁なユーザー質問への対応の生成"],"ko":["이슈 제출 워크플로 자동화","사용자 보고된 버그 디버깅","빈번한 사용자 질문에 대한 응답 생성"],"es":["Automatizar flujos de trabajo de presentación de problemas","Depurar errores informados por los usuarios","Generar respuestas a preguntas frecuentes de los usuarios"],"fr":["Automatiser les flux de travail de soumission de problèmes","Déboguer les bogues signalés par les utilisateurs","Générer des réponses aux questions fréquentes des utilisateurs"],"de":["Automatisieren von Arbeitsabläufen für die Fehlermeldung","Debuggen von Benutzerfehlern","Generieren von Antworten auf häufige Benutzerfragen"],"pt":["Automating issue submission workflows","Debugging user-reported bugs","Generating responses to frequent user questions"],"ru":["Automating issue submission workflows","Debugging user-reported bugs","Generating responses to frequent user questions"],"ar":["Automating issue submission workflows","Debugging user-reported bugs","Generating responses to frequent user questions"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to project documentation (e.g., docs/guide/index.md)","Specific to connectrpc-axum project","Limited to handling questions, feature requests, and bug reports"],"zh":["需要访问项目文档（例如 docs/guide/index.md）","特定于 connectrpc-axum 项目","仅限处理问题、功能请求和错误报告"],"ja":["プロジェクト ドキュメント (例: docs/guide/index.md) へのアクセスが必要","connectrpc-axum プロジェクトに固有","質問、機能要求、バグ報告の処理のみ"],"ko":["프로젝트 문서(예: docs/guide/index.md) 액세스가 필요","connectrpc-axum 프로젝트에 특정"," 질문, 기능 요청 및 버그 보고 처리만"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la documentación del proyecto (por ejemplo, docs/guide/index.md)","Específico del proyecto connectrpc-axum","Limitado a la gestión de preguntas, solicitudes de características y informes de errores"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à la documentation du projet (par exemple, docs/guide/index.md)","Spécifique au projet connectrpc-axum","Limité à la gestion des questions, des demandes de fonctionnalités et des rapports de bogue"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf die Projektdokumentation (z. B. docs/guide/index.md)","Spezifisch für das connectrpc-axum-Projekt","Begrenzt auf die Bearbeitung von Fragen, Funktionsanfragen und Fehlerberichten"],"pt":["Requires access to project documentation (e.g., docs/guide/index.md)","Specific to connectrpc-axum project","Limited to handling questions, feature requests, and bug reports"],"ru":["Requires access to project documentation (e.g., docs/guide/index.md)","Specific to connectrpc-axum project","Limited to handling questions, feature requests, and bug reports"],"ar":["Requires access to project documentation (e.g., docs/guide/index.md)","Specific to connectrpc-axum project","Limited to handling questions, feature requests, and bug reports"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"81e9feab83656646a307a23e414edaac90105c448ef7a0364432999fd9307dbc","qualityScore":28}');
