и","Ресурсы для улучшения рабочего процесса","Интеграция с другими ИИ инструментами","Подробная документация и поддержка"],"ar":["مخزن OxCaml العملاق","أدوات تطوير متقدمة","موارد لتحسين تدفق العمل","التكامل مع أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي الأخرى","توثيق مفصل ودعم"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用jsont","什么是OxCaml","jsont替代品","jsont vs 其他工具","jsont安装","jsont设置指南","OxCaml开发工具","AI智能工具"],"ja":["jsontの使い方","OxCamlとは","jsontの代替","jsont vs 他のツール","jsontのインストール","jsontの設定ガイド","OxCaml開発ツール","AIエージェント"],"ko":["jsont 사용 방법","OxCaml이란","jsont 대체품","jsont vs 다른 도구","jsont 설치","jsont 설정 가이드","OxCaml 개발 도구","AI 에이전트"],"es":["herramientas de AI","OxCaml monorepo","desarrollo de proyectos","optimización de la eficiencia","integración con herramientas de desarrollo","seguridad y escalabilidad","cómo utilizar jsont","jsont vs otros agentes de AI"],"fr":["outils d''IA","monorepo OxCaml","développement de projets","optimisation de l''efficacité","intégration avec des outils de développement","sécurité et évolutivité","comment utiliser jsont","jsont vs autres agents d''IA"],"de":["KI-Tools","OxCaml Monorepo","Entwicklung von Projekten","Optimierung der Effizienz","Integration mit Entwicklungstools","Sicherheit und Skalierbarkeit","wie man jsont verwendet","jsont vs andere KI-Agents"],"pt":["ferramentas de ia","monorepo oxcaml","desenvolvimento de software","fluxo de trabalho","jsont alternative","jsont vs outras ferramentas","instalar jsont","guia de configuração jsont"],"ru":["ИИ инструменты","монорепозиторий oxcaml","разработка программного обеспечения","рабочий процесс","jsont альтернатива","jsont vs другие инструменты","установить jsont","руководство по настройке jsont"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","مخزن oxcaml","تطوير البرمجيات","تدفق العمل","بديل jsont","jsont مقابل أدوات أخرى","تثبيت jsont","دليل إعداد jsont"]}},"owner":"avsm","repo":"oxmono","repoPath":"avsm/oxmono","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:11.120Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"jsont","description":"JSON type-safe encoding and decoding using the OCaml jsont library. Use when Claude needs to: define typed JSON codecs for OCaml record types, parse JSON strings to OCaml values, or serialize OCaml values to JSON, or work with nested JSON structures","bodyPreview":"# Jsont JSON Encoding/Decoding\n\n## Dependencies\n\n```dune\n(libraries jsont jsont.bytesrw)\n```\n\n## Core Patterns\n\n### Simple Object Codec\n\nMap a JSON object to an OCaml record using `Jsont.Object.map` with `mem` for required fields:\n\n```ocaml\ntype header = {\n  message_id : string;\n  method_ : string;\n  timestamp : int;\n}\n\nlet header_codec =\n  Jsont.Object.map ~kind:\"header\"\n    (fun message_id method_ timestamp -> { message_id; method_; timestamp })\n  |> Jsont.Object.mem \"messageId\" Jsont.string ~","body":"# Jsont JSON Encoding/Decoding\n\n## Dependencies\n\n```dune\n(libraries jsont jsont.bytesrw)\n```\n\n## Core Patterns\n\n### Simple Object Codec\n\nMap a JSON object to an OCaml record using `Jsont.Object.map` with `mem` for required fields:\n\n```ocaml\ntype header = {\n  message_id : string;\n  method_ : string;\n  timestamp : int;\n}\n\nlet header_codec =\n  Jsont.Object.map ~kind:\"header\"\n    (fun message_id method_ timestamp -> { message_id; method_; timestamp })\n  |> Jsont.Object.mem \"messageId\" Jsont.string ~enc:(fun h -> h.message_id)\n  |> Jsont.Object.mem \"method\" Jsont.string ~enc:(fun h -> h.method_)\n  |> Jsont.Object.mem \"timestamp\" Jsont.int ~enc:(fun h -> h.timestamp)\n  |> Jsont.Object.finish\n```\n\n### Optional Fields\n\nUse `opt_mem` for optional JSON fields. The constructor receives `''a option`:\n\n```ocaml\ntype config = {\n  name : string;\n  timeout : int;  (* default if missing *)\n}\n\nlet config_codec =\n  Jsont.Object.map ~kind:\"config\"\n    (fun name timeout_opt ->\n      { name; timeout = Option.value ~default:30 timeout_opt })\n  |> Jsont.Object.mem \"name\" Jsont.string ~enc:(fun c -> c.name)\n  |> Jsont.Object.opt_mem \"timeout\" Jsont.int ~enc:(fun c -> Some c.timeout)\n  |> Jsont.Object.finish\n```\n\n### Skip Unknown Fields\n\nUse `skip_unknown` before `finish` to ignore extra JSON fields (tolerant parsing):\n\n```ocaml\nlet tolerant_codec =\n  Jsont.Object.map ~kind:\"data\" (fun id -> { id })\n  |> Jsont.Object.mem \"id\" Jsont.string ~enc:(fun d -> d.id)\n  |> Jsont.Object.skip_unknown  (* ignore extra fields *)\n  |> Jsont.Object.finish\n```\n\n### Nested Objects\n\nCompose codecs for nested structures:\n\n```ocaml\ntype request = { header : header; payload : payload }\n\nlet request_codec payload_codec =\n  Jsont.Object.map ~kind:\"request\" (fun header payload -> { header; payload })\n  |> Jsont.Object.mem \"header\" header_codec ~enc:(fun r -> r.header)\n  |> Jsont.Object.mem \"payload\" payload_codec ~enc:(fun r -> r.payload)\n  |> Jsont.Object.finish\n```\n\n### Lists\n\nUse `Jsont.list` for JSON arrays:\n\n```ocaml\ntype response = { items : item list }\n\nlet response_codec =\n  Jsont.Object.map ~kind:\"response\" (fun items -> { items })\n  |> Jsont.Object.mem \"items\" (Jsont.list item_codec) ~enc:(fun r -> r.items)\n  |> Jsont.Object.finish\n```\n\n### String Maps\n\nUse `Jsont.Object.as_string_map` for objects with dynamic keys:\n\n```ocaml\nmodule String_map = Map.Make(String)\n\n(* JSON: {\"key1\": \"value1\", \"key2\": \"value2\"} *)\nlet string_map_codec = Jsont.Object.as_string_map Jsont.string\n\n(* JSON: {\"group1\": [...], \"group2\": [...]} *)\nlet groups_codec = Jsont.Object.as_string_map (Jsont.list item_codec)\n```\n\n### Empty Object\n\nFor payloads that don''t carry data:\n\n```ocaml\nlet empty_payload_codec : unit Jsont.t =\n  Jsont.Object.map ~kind:\"empty\" ()\n  |> Jsont.Object.skip_unknown\n  |> Jsont.Object.finish\n```\n\n### Custom Value Mapping\n\nUse `Jsont.map` to transform between types:\n\n```ocaml\ntype device_type = Sonos | Meross | Other\n\nlet device_from_string =\n  Jsont.map ~kind:\"device_type\"\n    ~dec:(function \"sonos\" -> Sonos | \"meross\" -> Meross | _ -> Other)\n    ~enc:(function Sonos -> \"sonos\" | Meross -> \"meross\" | Other -> \"other\")\n    Jsont.string\n```\n\n### Polymorphic Decoding with `any`\n\nHandle multiple JSON shapes for backwards compatibility:\n\n```ocaml\n(* Device can be string (old format) or object (new format) *)\nlet device_compat_codec =\n  Jsont.any ~kind:\"device\"\n    ~dec_string:device_from_string_codec  (* handles \"192.168.1.1\" *)\n    ~dec_object:device_object_codec       (* handles {\"ip\": \"...\", \"type\": \"...\"} *)\n    ~enc:(fun _ -> device_object_codec)   (* always encode as object *)\n    ()\n```\n\n### Null Values\n\nUse `Jsont.null` for endpoints returning null:\n\n```ocaml\n(* For DELETE endpoints that return null on success *)\nmatch delete http ~sw token endpoint (Jsont.null ()) with\n| Ok () -> ...\n```\n\n### Generic JSON\n\nUse `Jsont.json` to preserve arbitrary JSON:\n\n```ocaml\ntype characteristic = {\n  iid : int;\n  value : Jsont.json option;  (* preserve any JSON value *)\n}\n\nlet char_codec =\n  Jsont.Object.map ~kind:\"char\" (fun iid value -> { iid; value })\n  |> Jsont.Object.mem \"iid\" Jsont.int ~enc:(fun c -> c.iid)\n  |> Jsont.Object.opt_mem \"value\" Jsont.json ~enc:(fun c -> c.value)\n  |> Jsont.Object.finish\n```\n\n## Encoding and Decoding\n\nUse `Jsont_bytesrw` for string-based encoding/decoding:\n\n```ocaml\n(* Decode JSON string to OCaml value *)\nlet decode codec s = Jsont_bytesrw.decode_string codec s\n(* Returns: (''a, Jsont.Error.t) result *)\n\n(* Encode OCaml value to JSON string *)\nlet encode codec v =\n  match Jsont_bytesrw.encode_string codec v with\n  | Ok s -> s\n  | Error _ -> \"{}\"  (* fallback for encoding errors *)\n\n(* Usage *)\nmatch Jsont_bytesrw.decode_string config_codec json_string with\n| Ok config -> (* use config *)\n| Error e -> (* handle error *)\n\nmatch Jsont_bytesrw.encode_string config_codec config with\n| Ok json_str -> (* send json_str *)\n| Error _ -> (* handle error *)\n```\n\n## Common Helpers\n\nDefine module-level helpers for cleaner code:\n\n```ocaml\nlet decode codec s = Jsont_bytesrw.decode_string codec s\n\nlet encode codec v =\n  match Jsont_bytesrw.encode_string codec v with\n  | Ok s -> s\n  | Error _ -> \"\"\n```\n\n## Base Types Reference\n\n| OCaml Type | Jsont Codec | JSON Type |\n|------------|-------------|-----------|\n| `string` | `Jsont.string` | string |\n| `int` | `Jsont.int` | number |\n| `float` | `Jsont.number` | number |\n| `bool` | `Jsont.bool` | boolean |\n| `''a list` | `Jsont.list codec` | array |\n| `''a option` | `Jsont.option codec` | value or null |\n| `unit` | `Jsont.null ()` | null |\n| generic | `Jsont.json` | any JSON |\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Always use `~kind`**: Provide descriptive kind names for better error messages\n2. **Use `skip_unknown` for external APIs**: Be tolerant of extra fields from third-party services\n3. **Prefer `opt_mem` with defaults**: Handle missing fields gracefully with `Option.value ~default:`\n4. **Compose small codecs**: Build complex structures from simple, reusable codecs\n5. **Define helper functions**: Create `decode`/`encode` helpers at module level for cleaner usage\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:39:08.708Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for OCaml-based Agents needing robust JSON encoding and decoding capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要强大的JSON编码和解码能力的OCaml-based Agents。","ja":"OCamlベースのエージェントが堅牢なJSONエンコードとデコード機能を必要とする場合に最適。","ko":"강력한 JSON 인코딩 및 디코딩 기능이 필요한 OCaml 기반 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes basados en OCaml que necesitan capacidades de codificación y decodificación JSON robustas.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents basés sur OCaml nécessitant des capacités de codage et de décodage JSON robustes.","de":"Perfekt für auf OCaml basierende Agents, die robuste JSON-Codier- und Decodierfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes baseados em OCaml que necessitam de capacidades robustas de codificação e decodificação JSON.","ru":"Идеально для агентов на основе OCaml, требующих надежных возможностей кодирования и декодирования JSON.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذين يعتمدون على OCaml الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات JSON قوية للتشفير وفك التشفير."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to seamlessly map JSON objects to OCaml records using Jsont.Object.map, enabling efficient data serialization with libraries like jsont and jsont.bytesrw.","zh":"赋予代理无缝地将JSON对象映射到OCaml记录，使用Jsont.Object.map，实现与jsont和jsont.bytesrw等库的高效数据序列化。","ja":"エージェントがJSONオブジェクトをOCamlレコードにシームレスにマッピングできるようにし、Jsont.Object.mapを使用して、jsontやjsont.bytesrwなどのライブラリとともに効率的なデータシリアライズを実現します。","ko":"에이전트가 JSON 객체를 OCaml 레코드에无缝하게 매핑할 수 있도록 하여 Jsont.Object.map을 사용하고 jsont 및 jsont.bytesrw와 같은 라이브러리와 함께 효율적인 데이터 직렬화를 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a asignar objetos JSON a registros OCaml de forma transparente utilizando Jsont.Object.map, lo que permite una serialización de datos eficiente con bibliotecas como jsont y jsont.bytesrw.","fr":"Permet aux agents de mapper des objets JSON à des enregistrements OCaml de manière transparente en utilisant Jsont.Object.map, ce qui permet une sérialisation de données efficace avec des bibliothèques comme jsont et jsont.bytesrw.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, JSON-Objekte nahtlos auf OCaml-Records zu abbilden, indem Jsont.Object.map verwendet wird, was eine effiziente Datenserialisierung mit Bibliotheken wie jsont und jsont.bytesrw ermöglicht.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a mapear objetos JSON para registros OCaml de forma transparente, utilizando Jsont.Object.map, permitindo a serialização de dados eficiente com bibliotecas como jsont e jsont.bytesrw.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью бесшовного сопоставления объектов JSON с записями OCaml, используя Jsont.Object.map, что позволяет эффективно выполнять сериализацию данных с помощью библиотек, таких как jsont и jsont.bytesrw.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من сопоставة كائنات JSON مع سجلات OCaml بشكل متوافق باستخدام Jsont.Object.map، وتمكين تحويل البيانات بشكل فعال باستخدام مكتبا