page-cms","beste Praktiken für push-page-cms"],"pt":["como usar push-page-cms","o que é push-page-cms","push-page-cms vs outros frameworks","instalar push-page-cms","guia de configuração do push-page-cms","desenvolvimento web em JavaScript","ferramentas de desenvolvimento web","melhores práticas de desenvolvimento web"],"ru":["как использовать push-page-cms","что такое push-page-cms","push-page-cms vs другие фреймворки","установить push-page-cms","руководство по настройке push-page-cms","веб-разработка на JavaScript","инструменты веб-разработки","лучшие практики веб-разработки"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام push-page-cms","ما هو push-page-cms","push-page-cms مقابل إطارات عمل أخرى","تثبيت push-page-cms","دليل إعداد push-page-cms","تطوير الويب باستخدام JS","أدوات تطوير الويب","أفضل الممارسات لتطوير الويب"]}},"owner":"shishiv30","repo":"pure","repoPath":"shishiv30/pure","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-26T13:18:49.139Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"push-page-cms","description":"Posts page data into the Pure CMS pages table and optionally updates header comp links. Use when adding a new dynamic page, pushing page content to CMS, or ensuring a page link appears in the header nav.","bodyPreview":"# Push Page Data to CMS and Update Header Links\n\nUse this workflow when you add a new dynamic page (served at `/page/:key`) and want its content in the CMS and a nav link in the header.\n\n## How dynamic pages work\n\n| Item | Value |\n|------|--------|\n| Route | `GET /page/:key` (e.g. `/page/index`, `/page/about`) |\n| Config | `server/configs/page.js` — fetches by key |\n| CMS page name | `page${key}`.toLowerCase() (e.g. `index` → `pageindex`) |\n| Page data file | `data/page/<name>.js` (e.g. `data/pa","body":"# Push Page Data to CMS and Update Header Links\n\nUse this workflow when you add a new dynamic page (served at `/page/:key`) and want its content in the CMS and a nav link in the header.\n\n## How dynamic pages work\n\n| Item | Value |\n|------|--------|\n| Route | `GET /page/:key` (e.g. `/page/index`, `/page/about`) |\n| Config | `server/configs/page.js` — fetches by key |\n| CMS page name | `page${key}`.toLowerCase() (e.g. `index` → `pageindex`) |\n| Page data file | `data/page/<name>.js` (e.g. `data/page/index.js`, `data/page/ai-trend.js` for key `ai-trend`) — default export: array of sections |\n| Header comp key | `header` — link shape: `{ id, text, path, order, parentId }`; path for page = `/page/<key>` |\n\nMain app fetches: `GET {cmsUrl}/api/pages/content/{pageName}` and `GET {cmsUrl}/api/comp/public/header`.\n\n---\n\n## Step 1: Post page data to CMS\n\n**Script (recommended):** `cms/scripts/seed-and-sync.js`\n\nSeeds local DB from `data/page/*.js` (pages from `pagePath` in `data/page/header.js`) and `data/theme.js`, then syncs to remote CMS.\n\n```bash\n# From repo root\nnode cms/scripts/seed-and-sync.js [--local-only] [CMS_URL] [CMS_EMAIL] [CMS_PASSWORD]\n```\n\n- `--local-only` — Seed local DB only.\n- **With credentials** — Seeds local, then syncs to remote via API.\n\n**Without script:** Use CMS API (admin auth): `POST /api/pages` — body: `{ name, title, type: \"json\", data, meta, status }`. Page name = key (e.g. `index`, `ai-trend`). Add page key to `pagePath` in `data/page/header.js` for seed-and-sync to include it.\n\n---\n\n## Step 2: Update header comp with the new link\n\nIf you use `--update-header`, the script:\n\n1. Reads current header comp (API or DB).\n2. Ensures there is a link with `path: ''/page/<key>''`; adds one if missing (text = page title or key, order = after existing).\n3. Writes the updated links back to the comp `header`.\n\n**Manual update:** Edit `data/page/header.js` to add a link, then run `node cms/scripts/seed-and-sync.js` to sync.\n\n---\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [ ] Page data file exists (e.g. `data/page<key>.js` or `data/page/<name>.js`) with default export = section array.\n- [ ] Add page to `pagePath` in `data/page/header.js`, add `data/page/<key>.js`, run `node cms/scripts/seed-and-sync.js`.\n- [ ] Main app has `CMS_URL` set so it can fetch the page and header from CMS.\n\n---\n\n## Reference\n\n- Dynamic page route and config: `server/routes/page.js`, `server/configs/page.js`\n- Page section order and helpers: `helpers/pageData.js` (`arrayToPageData`, `PAGE_SECTIONS_ORDER`)\n- Seed and sync: `cms/scripts/seed-and-sync.js`; header and pages: `data/page/header.js`\n- CMS pages API: `cms/routes/pages.js` (POST /api/pages, PUT /api/pages/:id)\n- CMS comp API: `cms/routes/comp.js` (GET /api/comp/public/:key, POST /api/comp)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-26T15:06:12.166Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing dynamic page integration with Content Management Systems (CMS) via pure JavaScript frameworks","zh":"非常适合需要与内容管理系统（CMS）通过纯JavaScript框架进行动态页面集成的前端代理","ja":"フロントエンドエージェントがコンテンツ管理システム（CMS）とpure JavaScriptフレームワークを使用しての動的ページ統合を必要とする場合に最適","ko":"프론트엔드 에이전트가 콘텐츠 관리 시스템(CMS)과 순수 자바스크립트 프레임워크를 사용한 동적 페이지 통합을 필요로 하는 경우에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes Frontend que necesitan integración de página dinámica con Sistemas de Gestión de Contenido (CMS) a través de frameworks de JavaScript puro","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend qui nécessitent une intégration de page dynamique avec des Systèmes de Gestion de Contenu (CMS) via des frameworks JavaScript purs","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die eine dynamische Seitenintegration mit Content-Management-Systemen (CMS) über reine JavaScript-Frameworks benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de integração de página dinâmica com Sistemas de Gerenciamento de Conteúdo (CMS) via frameworks JavaScript puros","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, которым необходима динамическая интеграция страниц с системами управления контентом (CMS) через чистые фреймворки JavaScript","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم الذي يحتاج إلى دمج صفحة ديناميكي مع أنظمة إدارة المحتوى (CMS) عبر إطارات جافاسكريبت نقية"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to push dynamic page data to CMS and update header links using pure JavaScript, facilitating seamless integration with server configurations and CMS page naming conventions, while leveraging route parameters like `GET /page/:key`","zh":"赋予代理推送动态页面数据到CMS并更新头部链接的能力，使用纯JavaScript实现，促进与服务器配置和CMS页面命名约定的无缝集成，同时利用诸如`GET /page/:key`的路由参数","ja":"エージェントがpure JavaScriptを使用してCMSに動的ページデータをプッシュし、ヘッダーリンクを更新する機能を提供し、サーバー設定やCMSのページ命名規約とのシームレスな統合を促進し、`GET /page/:key`などのルートパラメータを活用","ko":"에이전트가 순수 자바스크립트를 사용하여 CMS에 동적 페이지 데이터를 푸시하고 헤더 링크를 업데이트하는 기능을 제공하며, 서버 설정 및 CMS 페이지命명 규약과 시ーム리스하게 통합하고 `GET /page/:key`와 같은 라우트 파라미터를 활용","es":"Habilita a los agentes a enviar datos de página dinámica a CMS y actualizar enlaces de encabezado utilizando JavaScript puro, lo que facilita una integración sin problemas con configuraciones de servidor y convenciones de nombres de páginas de CMS, al mismo tiempo que aprovecha parámetros de ruta como `GET /page/:key`","fr":"Permet aux agents de transmettre des données de page dynamiques à CMS et de mettre à jour les liens d''en-tête en utilisant JavaScript pur, facilitant ainsi une intégration transparente avec les configurations de serveur et les conventions de nommage de pages CMS, tout en exploitant les paramètres de route tels que `GET /page/:key`","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, dynamische Seiten-Daten an CMS zu übertragen und Kopfzeilen-Links mithilfe von reinem JavaScript zu aktualisieren, wodurch eine nahtlose Integration mit Server-Konfigurationen und CMS-Seiten-Namenskonventionen ermöglicht wird, während gleichzeitig Routen-Parameter wie `GET /page/:key` genutzt werden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a enviar dados de página dinâmica para o CMS e atualizar links de cabeçalho usando JavaScript puro, facilitando a integração transparente com configurações de servidor e convenções de nomenclatura de páginas do CMS, aproveitando parâmetros de rota como `GET /page/:key`","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью отправлять динамические данные страницы в CMS и обновлять ссылки в заголовке, используя чистый JavaScript, обеспечивая бесшовную интеграцию с настройками сервера и соглашениями о命名овании страниц CMS, используя параметры маршрута, такие как `GET /page/:key`","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من دفع بيانات صفحة ديناميكي إلى نظام إدارة المحتوى وتحديث روابط الرأس باستخدام جافاسكريبت نقي، وتسهيل التكامل السلس مع إعدادات الخادم وأسماء صفحات نظام إدارة المحتوى، واستخدام معلمات المسار مثل `GET /page/:key`"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating CMS page updates for new dynamic pages","Generating nav links in the header for newly added pages","Updating page data files in the `data/page` directory","Configuring server settings in `server/configs/page.js` for dynamic page fetching"],"zh":["自动为新动态页面更新CMS页面","在头部生成新页面的导航链接","更新`data/page`目录中的页面数据文件","在`server/configs/page.js`中配置服务器设置以获取动态页面"],"ja":["新しい動的ページのためのCMSページを自動更新する","新しいページのナビゲーションリンクをヘッダーに生成する","`data/page`ディレクトリ内のページデータファイルを更新する","動的ページの取得のための`server/configs/page.js`内のサーバー設定を構成する"],"ko":["새로운 동적 페이지에 대한 CMS 페이지를 자동으로 업데이트하는 것","새로운 페이지에 대한 네비게이션 링크를 헤더에 생성하는 것","`data/page` 디렉토리 내의 페이지 데이터 파일을 업데이트하는 것","동적 페이지를 가져오는 것을 위한 `server/configs/page.js` 내의 서버 설정을 구성하는 것"],"es":["Automatizar actualizaciones de páginas CMS para nuevas páginas dinámicas","Generar enlaces de navegación en el encabezado para páginas recién agregadas","Actualizar archivos de datos de página en el directorio `data/page`","Configurar ajustes de servidor en `server/configs/page.js` para la recuperación de páginas dinámicas"],"fr":["Automatiser les mises à jour de pages CMS pour les nouvelles pages dynamiques","Générer des liens de navigation dans l''en-tête pour les pages récemment ajoutées","Mettre à jour les fichiers de données de page dans le répertoire `data/page`","Configurer les paramètres de serveur dans `server/configs/page.js` pour la récupération de pages dynamiques"],"de":["Automatisieren von CMS-Seiten-Updates für neue dynamische Seiten","Erzeugen von Navigationslinks im Kopfzeilenbereich für neu hinzugefügte Seiten","Aktualisieren von Seiten-Daten-Dateien im Verzeichnis `data/page`","Konfigurieren von Server-Einstellungen in `server/configs/page.js` für das Abrufen dynamischer Seiten"],"pt":["Automatizar atualizações de páginas do CMS para novas páginas dinâmicas","Gerar links de navegação no cabeçalho para páginas novas","Atualizar arquivos de dados de página no diretório `data/page`","Configurar configurações do servidor em `server/configs/page.js` para busca de páginas dinâmicas"],"ru":["Автоматизировать обновления страниц CMS для новых динамических страниц","Генерировать ссылки навигации в заголовке для новых страниц","Обновлять файлы данных страницы в директории `data/page`","Настроить настройки сервера в `server/configs/page.js` для динамической загрузки страниц"],"ar":["توفير تحديثات صفحات نظام إدارة المحتوى تلقائيًا لصفحات ديناميكية جديدة","توليد روابط الملاحة في الرأس لصفحات جديدة","تحديث ملفات بيانات الصفحة في الدليل `data/page`","تكوين إعدادات الخادم في `server/configs/page.js` لاسترجاع صفحات ديناميكية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires pure JavaScript environment","Dependent on server configuration files like `server/configs/page.js`","Limited to dynamic pages served at `/page/:key` route"],"zh":["需要纯JavaScript环境","依赖于服务器配置文件，如`server/configs/page.js`","仅限于在`/page/:key`路由下提供的动态页面"],"ja":["pure JavaScript環境が必要","サーバー設定ファイル（例：`server/configs/page.js`）に依存する","`/page/:key`ルートで提供される動的ページのみに限定される"],"ko":["순수 자바스크립트 환경이 필요","서버 설정 파일(예: `server/configs/page.js`)에 의존","`/page/:key` 라우트에서 제공되는 동적 페이지에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere un entorno de JavaScript puro","Depende de archivos de configuración de servidor como `server/configs/page.js`","Limitado a páginas dinámicas servidas en la ruta `/page/:key`"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement JavaScript pur","Dépend de fichiers de configuration de serveur tels que `server/configs/page.js`","Limité aux pages dynamiques servies à la route `/page/:key`"],"de":["Benötigt eine reine JavaScript-Umgebung","Hängt von Server-Konfigurationsdateien wie `server/configs/page.js` ab","Begrenzt auf dynamische Seiten, die unter der Route `/page/:key` serviert werden"],"pt":["Requer ambiente JavaScript puro","Dependente de arquivos de configuração do servidor como `server/configs/page.js`","Limitado a páginas dinâmicas servidas na rota `/page/:key`"],"ru":["Требуется чистая среда JavaScript","Зависит от файлов настроек сервера, таких как `server/configs/page.js`","Ограничен динамическими страницами, обслуживаемыми на маршруте `/page/:key`"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة جافاسكريبت نقي","يعتمد على ملفات تكوين الخادم مثل `server/configs/page.js`","محدود بصفحات ديناميكية متوفرة في المسار `/page/:key`"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"71f1045b6539d0b2842ed2e8fe9fd9a7c3b115cb80b65bd70fb15d3ddb07bc9a","qualityScore":28}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('tolitius/salvador/game', 'community', 'tolitius', 'salvador', 'tolitius/salvador', 'game', 12, 2, 27, '2026-02-11T22:13:52Z', '2026-02-26T08:34:29.349Z', 'd7d16b7d353691e1fb655d58ee0d5fe79eb0cf08ac63022200a08d92634541c5', '{"id":"tolitius/salvador/game","name":"game","description":{"zh":"使用AI智能游戏开发工具，创建粒子宇宙，体验从量子层面到宏观世界的游戏开发。通过对粒子和力学的模拟，开发者可以创建更加真实的游戏世界","ja":"AIエージェントを使用してゲーム開発を実現。クォークからレプトンまで、粒子宇宙を体験することで、開発者はよりリアルなゲーム世界を作成できる","ko":"AI 게임 개발 도구를 사용하여 쿼크부터 레프톤까지의 게임 개발을 경험하세요. 개발자는 粒子와 力学을 시뮬레이션하여 더욱 真實な 게임 세계를 만들 수 있습니다","es":"La herramienta de IA ''game'' te permite visualizar el universo de manera detallada, desde quarks hasta leptones. Aprende a utilizar esta tecnología innovadora.","fr":"L''outil d''IA ''game'' vous permet de visualiser l''univers de manière détaillée, des quarks aux leptons. Apprenez à utiliser cette technologie innovante.","de":"Das KI-Tool ''game'' ermöglicht es Ihnen, das Universum detailliert zu visualisieren, von Quarks bis hin zu Leptonen. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie diese innovative Technologie nutzen können.","pt":"O skill game é uma ferramenta de IA que permite visualizar o universo de forma detalhada, quark a quark, lepton a lepton. Aprenda como usar essa tecnologia","ru":"ИИ Агент skill game позволяет визуализировать Вселенную по-новому, кварк за кварком, лептон за лептоном. Узнайте, как использовать эту технологию","ar":"أداة الذكاء الاصطناعي مهارة اللعبة تسمح لك باستكشاف الكون بطريقة فريدة، كوارك بعد كوارك، ليبتون بعد ليبتون. تعرف على كيفية استخدام هذه التكنولوجيا","en":"visualize the universe: quark by quark, lepton by lepton"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI智能游戏开发：粒子宇宙","ja":"AIエージェントによるゲーム開発：クォークからレプトンまで","ko":"AI 게임 개발: 쿼크부터 레프톤까지","es":"Herramientas de IA: Visualiza el universo con ''game''","fr":"Outils d''IA: Visualisez l''univers avec ''game''","de":"KI-Tools: Visualisieren Sie das Universum mit ''game''","pt":"Ferramentas de IA: Visualize o Universo com o Skill Game","ru":"ИИ Агенты: Визуализируйте Вселенную с Помощью Skill Game","ar":"أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي: استكشف الكون مع مهارة اللعبة","en":"game"},"description":{"zh":"使用AI智能游戏开发工具，创建粒子宇宙，体验从量子层面到宏观世界的游戏开发。通过对粒子和力学的模拟，开发者可以创建更加真实的游戏世界","ja":"AIエージェントを使用してゲーム開発を実現。クォークからレプトンまで、粒子宇宙を体験することで、開発者はよりリアルなゲーム世界を作成できる","ko":"AI 게임 개발 도구를 사용하여 쿼크부터 레프톤까지의 게임 개발을 경험하세요. 개발자는 粒子와 力学을 시뮬레이션하여 더욱 真實な 게임 세계를 만들 수 있습니다","es":"La herramienta de IA ''game'' te permite visualizar el universo de manera detallada, desde quarks hasta leptones. Aprende a utilizar esta tecnología innovadora.","fr":"L''outil d''IA ''game'' vous permet de visualiser l''univers de manière détaillée, des quarks aux leptons. Apprenez à utiliser cette technologie innovante.","de":"Das KI-Tool ''game'' ermöglicht es Ihnen, das Universum detailliert zu visualisieren, von Quarks bis hin zu Leptonen. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie diese innovative Te...","pt":"O skill game é uma ferramenta de IA que permite visualizar o universo de forma detalhada, quark a quark, lepton a lepton. Aprenda como usar essa tecnologia","ru":"ИИ Агент skill game позволяет визуализировать Вселенную по-новому, кварк за кварком, лептон за лептоном. Узнайте, как использовать эту технологию","ar":"أداة الذكاء الاصطناعي مهارة اللعبة تسمح لك باستكشاف الكون بطريقة فريدة، كوارك بعد كوارك، ليبتون بعد ليبتون. تعرف على كيفية استخدام هذه التكنولوجيا","en":"visualize the universe: quark by quark, lepton by lepton"},"definition":{"en":"visualize the universe: quark by quark, lepton by lepton"},"features":{"zh":["使用AI智能技术创建游戏","模拟粒子和力学","创建真实的游戏世界","支持多种游戏引擎","易于使用的开发工具"],"ja":["AIエージェントを使用してゲーム開発を実現","クォークからレプトンまでの粒子宇宙をシミュレート","よりリアルなゲーム世界を作成","複数のゲームエンジンをサポート","開発者向けのユーザーフレンドリーなツール"],"ko":["AI 게임 개발 도구를 사용하여 게임 개발","쿼크부터 레프톤까지의 粒子와 力学을 시뮬레이션","より 真實な 게임 세계를 만들 수 있습니다","複数의 게임 엔진을 지원","개발자向け의 사용하기 쉬운 도구"],"es":["Visualización detallada del universo","Análisis de quarks y leptones","Tecnología de IA innovadora","Interfaz de usuario intuitiva","Compatibilidad con múltiples plataformas"],"fr":["Visualisation détaillée de l''univers","Analyse des quarks et des leptons","Technologie d''IA innovante","Interface utilisateur intuitive","Compatibilité avec plusieurs plateformes"],"de":["Detaillierte Visualisierung des Universums","Analyse von Quarks und Leptonen","Innovative KI-Technologie","Intuitive Benutzeroberfläche","Kompatibilität mit mehreren Plattformen"],"pt":["Visualização detalhada do universo","Análise de partículas subatômicas","Integração com tecnologias de IA","Interface de usuário intuitiva","Suporte a múltiplos formatos de dados"],"ru":["Детальная визуализация Вселенной","Анализ субатомных частиц","Интеграция с технологиями ИИ","Интуитивный интерфейс пользователя","Поддержка нескольких форматов данных"],"ar":["استكشاف الكون بطريقة فريدة","تحليل الجسيمات دون الذرية","التكامل مع تكنولوجيا الذكاء الاصطناعي","واجهة المستخدم البسيطة","دعم صيغ بيانات متعددة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能游戏开发","游戏开发工具","粒子宇宙","游戏引擎","AI游戏开发教程","游戏开发框架","AI游戏开发工具比较","游戏开发最佳实践"],"ja":["AIエージェント","ゲーム開発ツール","クォークからレプトンまで","ゲームエンジン","AIゲーム開発ガイド","ゲーム開発フレームワーク","AIゲーム開発ツール比較","ゲーム開発ベストプラクティス"],"ko":["AI 게임 개발","게임 개발 도구","쿼크부터 레프톤까지","게임 엔진","AI 게임 개발 가이드","게임 개발 프레임워크","AI 게임 개발 도구 비교","게임 개발 베스트 프랙티스"],"es":["herramientas de IA","visualización del universo","quarks y leptones","tecnología innovadora","cómo utilizar game","game vs otras herramientas de IA","instalación de game","guía de configuración de game"],"fr":["outils d''IA","visualisation de l''univers","quarks et leptons","technologie innovante","comment utiliser game","game vs autres outils d''IA","installation de game","guide de configuration de game"],"de":["KI-Tools","Visualisierung des Universums","Quarks und Leptonen","innovative Technologie","wie man game verwendet","game vs andere KI-Tools","Installation von game","Konfigurationsanleitung für game"],"pt":["ferramentas de ia","visualizar o universo","skill game","ia para desenvolvedores","como usar skill game","alternativas ao skill game","skill game vs outros ia","instalar skill game","guia de configuração do skill game"],"ru":["ИИ Агенты","визуализировать Вселенную","skill game","ИИ для разработчиков","как использовать skill game","альтернативы skill game","skill game vs другие ИИ","установить skill game","руководство по настройке skill game"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","استكشاف الكون","مهارة اللعبة","الذكاء الاصطناعي للمطورين","كيفية استخدام مهارة اللعبة","بديلات مهارة اللعبة","مهارة اللعبة مقابل أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي الأخرى","تثبيت مهارة اللعبة","دليل إعداد مهارة اللعبة"]}},"owner":"tolitius","repo":"salvador","repoPath":"tolitius/salvador","stars":12,"forks":2,"updatedAt":"2026-02-11T22:13:52Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"game","description":"Autonomous browser game agent. Analyzes game concept, implements with KAPLAY.js (2D) or Three.js (3D), playtests in headless browser, critiques gameplay/mechanics, fixes, and launches the result.","bodyPreview":"# Game Agent\nUse this skill to create browser-based games using KAPLAY.js (2D) or Three.js (3D) with a focus on **playable mechanics, clear feedback, and polished feel**.\n\n## Workflow\nFollow this **strict loop** when asked to create a game:\n\n### Phase 1: Bootstrap\n1. **Check Context**: If `package.json` is missing, run `bash .claude/skills/game/scripts/setup.sh`.\n2. **Scaffold**: Ensure `index.html` and `src/game.js` exist (or inline in index.html).\n3. **Read API Reference**:\n   - For 2D games:","body":"# Game Agent\nUse this skill to create browser-based games using KAPLAY.js (2D) or Three.js (3D) with a focus on **playable mechanics, clear feedback, and polished feel**.\n\n## Workflow\nFollow this **strict loop** when asked to create a game:\n\n### Phase 1: Bootstrap\n1. **Check Context**: If `package.json` is missing, run `bash .claude/skills/game/scripts/setup.sh`.\n2. **Scaffold**: Ensure `index.html` and `src/game.js` exist (or inline in index.html).\n3. **Read API Reference**:\n   - For 2D games: Read `references/kaplay-ref.md` for KAPLAY API.\n   - For 3D games: Read `references/threejs-ref.md` for Three.js API.\n   - For FPS games: Read `references/fps-patterns.md` for pointer lock, hit detection, enemy AI.\n4. **Read Game Patterns**: Read `references/game-patterns.md` for architecture patterns.\n5. **Read Game Systems**: Read `references/game-systems.md` for difficulty scaling, scoring, persistence, and UI patterns.\n6. **Read Visual Assets**: Read `references/visual-assets.md` for procedural sprites, palettes, and visual effects.\n\n### Phase 1.5: Game Design Analysis (Before Coding!)\n\nThis game needs to be **playable and fun** from the first iteration.\nTherefore, define the core loop before writing any code.\n\nBefore writing any code, decompose the game:\n\n1. **Identify the Core Mechanic**: What is the ONE thing the player does repeatedly?\n   - Strip away everything else first\n   - This mechanic must be satisfying on its own\n   - Examples: jump, shoot, match, dodge, collect, solve\n\n2. **Define the Challenge**: What makes it difficult?\n   - Timing? Precision? Resource management? Puzzle solving?\n   - How does difficulty progress?\n   - What''s the failure state?\n\n3. **Establish the Feedback Loop**:\n   - **Input**: What does the player press/click/drag?\n   - **Response**: What happens immediately? (must feel < 100ms)\n   - **Outcome**: Success or failure indication\n   - **Reward/Penalty**: Score change, sound, visual effect\n\n4. **Scope to Minimum Viable Game (MVG)**:\n   - ONE level or endless mode\n   - ONE enemy type or obstacle  \n   - ONE player ability\n   - Win AND lose conditions\n   - Can be expanded later, but MVG must work first\n\n5. **Research the Domain** (for educational/simulation games):\n   - Look up actual facts (angles, counts, formulas, rules)\n   - Don''t guess scientific/mathematical details\n   - See `references/physics-constants.md` for common values\n\n### Phase 1.6: Game Feel Principles\n\n6. **Juice**: The game must feel alive and responsive.\n   - **Input Response**: Every input produces immediate visual/audio feedback\n   - **Screen Shake**: On impacts, collisions, explosions - use `shake(intensity)`\n   - **Flash**: Brief color flash on damage or success - use `flash(color, duration)`\n   - **Particles**: On deaths, pickups, actions (spawn small objects with `lifespan`)\n   - **Squash & Stretch**: Scale objects on jumps, bounces, movements\n\n7. **Clarity**: The player must always understand:\n   - Where they are (player position obvious, distinct color/shape)\n   - What they can do (affordances clear)\n   - What hurts them (dangers visually distinct - red, spiky, animated)\n   - What helps them (pickups/goals highlighted - gold, glowing, animated)\n   - Current state (score, lives, progress visible in HUD)\n\n8. **Pacing**: Control the rhythm\n   - Moments of tension followed by release\n   - Difficulty curves, not walls\n   - Rest points between challenges\n   - Even endless games need rhythm variation (spawn rate waves)\n\n9. **Polish Details**:\n   - Title/start screen with game name and controls\n   - Pause functionality (P key or Escape)\n   - Restart on game over (R key)\n   - Score or progress display (top-left, `fixed()` for HUD)\n   - Control hints visible (\"Arrow keys: Move | Space: Jump\")\n\n### Phase 1.7: Physics & Reachability Validation\n\n**CRITICAL**: Validate that game physics allow the player to accomplish required actions.\n\n16. **Test Core Movement**: Before finalizing level/game design:\n    - Can the player reach all required locations?\n    - Can the player avoid all avoidable hazards?\n    - Does movement feel responsive (not sluggish or twitchy)?\n    - Are speeds balanced (player vs enemies vs projectiles)?\n\n17. **Validate With Math**: For physics-based games, calculate limits:\n    - Movement range per second = speed × time\n    - Jump/launch height = (force)² / (2 × gravity)\n    - Projectile range = speed × lifetime\n    - **If design requires X, verify physics allow X**\n\n18. **Common Physics Pitfalls**:\n    - Targets placed beyond movement range\n    - Gaps larger than jump/dash distance\n    - Enemies faster than player can react\n    - Timers shorter than required actions\n    - **Always prototype movement before building levels**\n\n### Phase 1.8: Visual Polish (Before Coding!)\n\n**CRITICAL**: Games must look polished from the first iteration. No \"sticks and boxes.\"\n\n**Quality Bar**: Ask yourself - \"Would someone pay $5 for this?\" If not, it''s not ready.\n\n10. **Choose a Color Palette**: Select from `visual-assets.md` palettes:\n    - `PASTEL` - friendly, casual games\n    - `PICO8` - retro pixel art feel\n    - `ENDESGA` - modern indie aesthetic\n    - `NEON` - cyberpunk, arcade style\n\n11. **Generate PREMIUM Procedural Sprites**: Every sprite needs MULTIPLE layers of polish:\n    - **Player/Hero**: outer glow + multi-stop gradient + shadow + character details (eyes, expression) + highlights\n    - **Collectibles**: glow aura + metallic/shiny gradient + inner detail + shine streak + sparkle accents\n    - **Enemies/Hazards**: danger glow + gradient body + expressive features + shadow + distinguishing details\n    - **Environment** (platforms, walls, tiles): surface texture + body gradient + edge highlights + shadow + structural details\n    - **Projectiles/Effects**: core glow + color gradient + trail suggestion + bright center\n    - **NEVER use bare `rect()`, `circle()`, `polygon()` for visible game objects**\n    - **\"Has a gradient\" is NOT enough** - premium sprites have 5+ visual layers\n    - See `visual-assets.md` for the universal sprite layer checklist\n\n12. **Create Gradient Background**: Flat backgrounds look cheap.\n    - Use `makeGradientBg()` with palette colors\n    - Add subtle stars/dots for depth\n    - Consider parallax layers for side-scrollers\n\n13. **Add Idle Animations**: Static objects feel dead.\n    - Coins: `addFloat()` - gentle bobbing\n    - Player: `addBreathing()` - subtle scale pulse\n    - Enemies: combine breathing + slight movement\n    - Pickups: `addSpin()` or glow pulse\n\n14. **Plan Particle Effects**: Every interaction needs MULTIPLE feedback layers:\n    - **Positive events** (collect, score, win): particle burst + floating text (+1, +100) + screen flash + UI reaction + small shake\n    - **Negative events** (damage, death, lose): explosion particles + screen shake + color flash + UI feedback\n    - **Movement events** (jump, dash, land, turn): directional particles + object deformation (squash/stretch/spin)\n    - **Ambient atmosphere**: floating particles + twinkling/pulsing background elements\n    - **Projectiles/Actions**: spawn flash + trail particles + impact burst\n    - **One effect is NOT enough** - premium feedback stacks 3+ effects per action\n\n15. **Establish Z-Index Hierarchy**: Proper layering adds depth.\n    - Background: z(-100)\n    - Platforms: z(0)\n    - Pickups: z(10)\n    - Enemies: z(20)\n    - Player: z(30)\n    - Particles: z(50)\n    - HUD: z(100) + fixed()\n\n### Phase 2: Autonomous Loop (The \"Work\")\nRepeat this cycle until the game is **Playable and Polished**:\n\n1. **Implement/Refine**: Write game code.\n   * *Constraint*: Use KAPLAY.js for 2D (default), Three.js only if 3D is explicitly needed.\n   * *Constraint*: Single HTML file with CDN imports (no build step for player).\n   * *Constraint*: **Color Palette**: Use a predefined palette from `visual-assets.md` (PASTEL, PICO8, ENDESGA, NEON).\n   * *Constraint*: **No Bare Primitives**: NEVER use `rect()`, `circle()`, `polygon()` for game objects. Use procedural sprites from `visual-assets.md`.\n   * *Constraint*: **Gradient Background**: Always use `makeGradientBg()` instead of flat `background` color.\n   * *Constraint*: **Idle Animations**: All game objects must have subtle animations (float, breathe, pulse, spin).\n   * *Constraint*: **Particle Effects**: Every collision/pickup must spawn particles using `burstParticles()` or `deathExplosion()`.\n   * *Constraint*: **Z-Index Layering**: Use proper z-index hierarchy (BG:-100, platforms:0, pickups:10, enemies:20, player:30, particles:50, HUD:100).\n   * *Constraint*: **Game Loop**: Use KAPLAY''s `onUpdate()` for continuous logic. Never use `noLoop()`.\n   * *Constraint*: **Input Handling**: Use KAPLAY''s `onKeyPress`, `onKeyDown`, `isKeyDown`.\n   * *Constraint*: **Collision**: Use `area()` component and `onCollide()` for interactions.\n   * *Constraint*: **Canvas sizing**: 800x600 or 16:9 aspect ratio.\n   * *Constraint*: **State Management**: Use KAPLAY scenes for menu/play/gameover states.\n   * *Constraint*: **HUD**: Use `fixed()` and `z(100)` for UI that ignores camera.\n   * *Constraint*: **Controls Display**: Show control hints on screen at all times.\n   * *Constraint*: **Keyboard Handling**: Use `onKeyPress(\"space\", ...)` not raw DOM events for game input.\n\n2. **Playtest**: Run `node playtest.js`\n   - Captures screenshots at t=0, t=2s, t=5s\n   - Simulates basic inputs (arrow keys, space, click)\n   - Checks console for errors\n   - Extracts game state variables if exposed\n\n3. **Critique**:\n   * **Logs**: Are there JavaScript errors?\n   * **Visual Audit**: Open *all* generated screenshots (`playtest-screenshots/`) and evaluate:\n     * **Does it run?**: Is there movement/change between frames?\n     * **Input Response**: Did simulated input cause visible change?\n     * **Readability**: Is text/HUD legible? Good contrast?\n     * **Composition**: Is game area centered? Nothing cut off?\n     * **State Changes**: Can you see game progressing (score changing, objects moving)?\n   * **Visual Quality Audit** (CRITICAL - no sticks and boxes!):\n     * **No bare primitives?**: Are all objects using procedural sprites with gradients/details?\n     * **Gradient background?**: Is the background a gradient (not flat color)?\n     * **Objects alive?**: Do coins bob, player breathe, objects animate?\n     * **Particles present?**: Are there particle effects on interactions?\n     * **Color harmony?**: Is a consistent palette used throughout?\n     * **Visual depth?**: Are z-indexes creating proper layering?\n     * **Glow/highlights?**: Do important objects (coins, player) have visual emphasis?\n   * **Gameplay Audit** (mental simulation):\n     * Is the core mechanic present and functional?\n     * Is there a clear goal?\n     * Is there a failure state?\n     * Would a player understand what to do without external instructions?\n\n4. **Decide**:\n   * *Errors?* → Fix code → **Repeat**.\n   * *Static/Frozen?* → Fix game loop, ensure `onUpdate` runs → **Repeat**.\n   * *No Input Response?* → Fix input handlers, check key names → **Repeat**.\n   * *Missing Feedback?* → Add juice (shake, flash, particles) → **Repeat**.\n   * *Unclear Goal?* → Add visual indicators, HUD elements → **Repeat**.\n   * *No Win/Lose?* → Implement end conditions → **Repeat**.\n   * *Unreadable Text?* → Increase font size, add contrast → **Repeat**.\n   * *Bare rectangles/circles?* → Replace with procedural sprites → **Repeat**.\n   * *Flat background?* → Add gradient background → **Repeat**.\n   * *Static objects?* → Add idle animations (float, breathe) → **Repeat**.\n   * *No particles?* → Add burst/explosion effects → **Repeat**.\n   * *Playable, Clear, Responsive & Visually Polished?* → **Proceed to Phase 3**.\n\n### Phase 3: Presentation (The \"Launch\")\nOnce the loop is complete and the game is polished:\n1. **Launch**: Run `npx vite --open`.\n2. **Notify**: Tell the user:\n   - \"Game is ready!\"\n   - \"Controls: [List all controls]\"\n   - \"Goal: [One sentence on how to win/play]\"\n\n---\n\n## Technology Selection\n\n| Request Type | Framework | Template |\n|-------------|-----------|----------|\n| 2D game (default) | KAPLAY.js | `templates/kaplay-2d.html` |\n| 3D game (explicit) | Three.js | `templates/threejs-3d.html` |\n| FPS / first-person shooter | Three.js | `templates/threejs-fps.html` |\n| Ultra-simple (quiz, flashcard) | Vanilla Canvas | `templates/canvas-minimal.html` |\n\n**Decision rule**:\n- Use KAPLAY for most 2D games (platformer, top-down, puzzle, etc.)\n- Use `threejs-fps.html` for first-person shooters, DOOM-likes, or any game requiring pointer lock + mouse look\n- Use `threejs-3d.html` for third-person 3D games, 3D puzzles, or non-shooter 3D experiences\n- FPS indicators: \"first-person\", \"FPS\", \"shooter\", \"DOOM\", \"Wolfenstein\", \"gun\", \"pointer lock\"\n\n---\n\n## File References\n- **KAPLAY API**: See `references/kaplay-ref.md` for component list and patterns\n- **Visual Assets**: See `references/visual-assets.md` for procedural sprites, color palettes, animations, and particle effects\n- **Three.js API**: See `references/threejs-ref.md` for 3D setup\n- **FPS Patterns**: See `references/fps-patterns.md` for pointer lock, hit detection, enemy AI, weapon rendering\n- **Game Systems**: See `references/game-systems.md` for difficulty scaling, scoring, persistence, UI patterns\n- **Game Patterns**: See `references/game-patterns.md` for architecture (state machines, ECS, proc-gen)\n- **Physics Constants**: See `references/physics-constants.md` for educational accuracy\n\n---\n\n## Common Pitfalls (Avoid These)\n\n### Gameplay Pitfalls\n1. **No game loop**: Forgetting `onUpdate()` results in static screen\n2. **Wrong key names**: Use `\"space\"` not `\"Space\"`, `\"left\"` not `\"ArrowLeft\"` in KAPLAY\n3. **Missing `area()`**: Objects won''t collide without the `area()` component\n4. **Missing `body()`**: Objects won''t fall or respond to physics without `body()`\n5. **HUD moves with camera**: Use `fixed()` component for UI elements\n6. **No scenes**: Putting everything in global scope - use `scene()` for states\n7. **Forgetting `go()`**: Must call `go(\"sceneName\")` to start the first scene\n8. **Text too small**: Default text size is often too small - use 20+ for HUD\n9. **No restart**: Player stuck at game over - always add R to restart\n10. **Missing `opacity()` for `lifespan()`**: The `lifespan` component requires `opacity()` to be present on the object\n11. **Unreachable goals**: ALWAYS verify physics allow completing required actions. If player must reach X, calculate whether movement/jump/projectile range allows it.\n12. **Variable name `rgb` conflicts with KAPLAY**: Never use `const rgb = ...` as it shadows KAPLAY''s `rgb()` function. Use `const c = hexToRgb(...)` instead.\n\n### Visual Pitfalls (CRITICAL)\n13. **Bare primitives**: Using `rect()`, `circle()`, `polygon()` for game objects looks terrible - use procedural sprites\n14. **Flat backgrounds**: `background: [r,g,b]` looks cheap - use `makeGradientBg()` with texture/particles\n15. **Static objects**: Game objects sitting motionless feel dead - add idle animations (`addFloat()`, `addBreathing()`, `addSpin()`)\n16. **No particles**: Interactions without visual feedback are unsatisfying - add particle bursts on all events\n17. **Random colors**: Picking colors without a palette creates visual chaos - use PASTEL, PICO8, ENDESGA, or NEON\n18. **No z-index**: Everything at same layer looks flat - use proper z-index hierarchy (-100 to 100)\n19. **No glow/outline**: Important objects don''t stand out - add glow/aura to key game objects\n20. **Bean for everything**: `loadBean()` is a placeholder, not a finished sprite - create proper procedural sprites\n21. **\"Good enough\" sprites**: A sprite with ONE gradient is functional, not premium. Premium = 5+ layers (glow + gradient + highlight + shadow + detail)\n22. **Single-effect feedback**: One particle burst is weak. Premium = stacked effects (particles + text + flash + shake + UI reaction)\n23. **No movement deformation**: Objects moving without squash/stretch/rotation feel stiff - add deformation on velocity changes\n24. **No impact particles**: Collisions and surface contacts without particles lack weight - add particles on all physical interactions\n25. **No floating text**: Score changes without visible \"+N\" text miss dopamine feedback - show value changes visually\n\n### FPS-Specific Pitfalls\n26. **Pointer lock not recovering**: After alt-tab or focus loss, pointer lock is lost. ALWAYS re-request on focus/click events.\n27. **Enemies shoot through walls**: Must check line of sight (step along ray) before allowing enemy attacks.\n28. **Enemies spawn in walls**: Validate spawn positions against collision map; use fallback positions if invalid.\n29. **3D hit detection for 2D gameplay**: Classic FPS uses 2D XZ-plane distance with cone-of-fire, ignoring Y axis.\n30. **Weapon drawn sideways**: FPS weapons should point forward (barrel vertical), not left-to-right like a side view.\n31. **No weapon feedback**: Always add recoil animation (move down/up) and muzzle flash on fire.\n32. **Static enemy sprites**: Animate walk (leg movement) and shoot (arms raised) states with canvas texture updates.\n33. **AI too aggressive**: Balance detection range, attack rate, and damage. First-time playability > difficulty.\n34. **Score counts down during play**: Live score should ONLY increase. Time bonuses calculated at end, only if mission succeeded.\n35. **Time bonus on failure**: Speed bonus should only be awarded when the player wins, not on death.\n36. **Floating point stat display**: Always use `Math.floor()` for health, armor, score display to avoid \"99.7\" health.\n37. **Modal UI not interactive**: Game over screen must have proper `pointer-events: auto` and exit pointer lock.\n\n---\n\n## Known Warnings (Safe to Ignore)\n\n- **Puppeteer ARM64 warning**: On Apple Silicon Macs, you may see a \"Degraded performance warning\" about Chrome/Rosetta. This is expected and does not affect playtest functionality.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-26T08:34:29.349Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Interactive Web Agents requiring immersive 2D and 3D game development capabilities using KAPLAY.js and Three.js","zh":"适合需要使用 KAPLAY.js 和 Three.js 进行沉浸式 2D 和 3D 游戏开发的交互式 Web 代理","ja":"KAPLAY.js と Three.js を使用したインタラクティブな 2D および 3D ゲーム開発機能を必要とする Web エージェントに最適","ko":"KAPLAY.js와 Three.js를 사용하여 몰입감 있는 2D 및 3D 게임 개발 기능이 필요한 인터랙티브 웹 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para Agentes Web Interactivos que requieren capacidades de desarrollo de juegos 2D y 3D inmersivos utilizando KAPLAY.js y Three.js","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents Web interactifs nécessitant des capacités de développement de jeux 2D et 3D immersifs utilisant KAPLAY.js et Three.js","de":"Ideal für interaktive Web-Agenten, die immersive 2D- und 3D-Spiele-Entwicklungsfähigkeiten unter Verwendung von KAPLAY.js und Three.js erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Web Interativos que requerem capacidades de desenvolvimento de jogos imersivos 2D e 3D usando KAPLAY.js e Three.js","ru":"Идеально подходит для Интерактивных Веб-Агентов, требующих иммерсивных возможностей разработки 2D и 3D игр с использованием KAPLAY.js и Three.js","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء التفاعليين على الويب الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات تطوير ألعاب 2D و 3D الغامرة باستخدام KAPLAY.js و Three.js"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create engaging browser-based games with playable mechanics, clear feedback, and polished feel, leveraging JavaScript and HTML5 for a seamless user experience, utilizing libraries like KAPLAY.js for 2D and Three.js for 3D graphics","zh":"赋予代理创建引人入胜的基于浏览器的游戏的能力，具有可玩的机制、清晰的反馈和精致的感觉，利用 JavaScript 和 HTML5 实现无缝的用户体验，利用像 KAPLAY.js 的库进行 2D 和 Three.js 进行 3D 图形渲染","ja":"エージェントが JavaScript と HTML5 を使用してシームレスなユーザー エクスペリエンスを提供し、KAPLAY.js などのライブラリを使用して 2D および Three.js を使用して 3D グラフィックスをレンダリングすることで、遊べるメカニズム、明確なフィードバック、および磨かれた感覚を持つブラウザーベースのゲームを作成できるようにする","ko":"JavaScript와 HTML5를 사용하여無결점의 사용자 경험을 제공하고, KAPLAY.js와 같은 라이브러리를 사용하여 2D와 Three.js를 사용하여 3D 그래픽스를 렌더링함으로써, 재생 가능한 메커니즘, 명확한 피드백 및 다듬어진 감각을 갖춘 브라우저 기반 게임을 만들 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 부여","es":"Permite a los agentes crear juegos basados en el navegador con mecánicas jugables, retroalimentación clara y una sensación pulida, aprovechando JavaScript y HTML5 para una experiencia de usuario sin interrupciones, utilizando bibliotecas como KAPLAY.js para gráficos 2D y Three.js para gráficos 3D","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des jeux basés sur le navigateur avec des mécaniques jouables, une rétroaction claire et une sensation polie, en exploitant JavaScript et HTML5 pour une expérience utilisateur sans interruption, en utilisant des bibliothèques comme KAPLAY.js pour les graphiques 2D et Three.js pour les graphiques 3D","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, browserbasierte Spiele mit spielbaren Mechaniken, klarer Rückmeldung und einem polierten Gefühl zu erstellen, indem JavaScript und HTML5 für eine nahtlose Benutzererfahrung genutzt werden, unter Verwendung von Bibliotheken wie KAPLAY.js für 2D-Grafiken und Three.js für 3D-Grafiken","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar jogos baseados em navegador atraentes com mecânicas jogáveis, feedback claro e sensação polida, aproveitando JavaScript e HTML5 para uma experiência de usuário sem interrupções, utilizando bibliotecas como KAPLAY.js para gráficos 2D e Three.js para gráficos 3D","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать увлекательные браузерные игры с играбельными механиками, четкой обратной связью и отполированным ощущением, используя JavaScript и HTML5 для бесшовного пользовательского опыта, используя библиотеки seperti KAPLAY.js для 2D и Three.js для 3D графики","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من إنشاء ألعاب متوافرة على المتصفح ممتعة مع آليات قابلة للعب وآلية للتعليقات الواضحة وشعور متقن، واستغلال JavaScript و HTML5 من أجل تجربة مستخدم عديمة الفجوات، واستخدام مكتبات مثل KAPLAY.js للرسومات 2D و Three.js للرسومات 3D"},"useCases":{"en":["Developing interactive 2D games with KAPLAY.js","Building immersive 3D experiences with Three.js","Designing game prototypes with clear feedback mechanisms"],"zh":["使用 KAPLAY.js 开发交互式 2D 游戏","使用 Three.js 构建沉浸式 3D 体验","设计具有清晰反馈机制的游戏原型"],"ja":["KAPLAY.js を使用してインタラクティブな 2D ゲームを開発する","Three.js を使用して没入感のある 3D 体験を構築する","明確なフィードバック メカニズムを備えたゲームのプロトタイプを設計する"],"ko":["KAPLAY.js를 사용하여 인터랙티브 2D 게임 개발","Three.js를 사용하여 몰입감 있는 3D 경험 구축","명확한 피드백 메커니즘을 갖춘 게임 프로토타입 설계"],"es":["Desarrollar juegos interactivos 2D con KAPLAY.js","Crear experiencias inmersivas 3D con Three.js","Diseñar prototipos de juegos con mecanismos de retroalimentación claros"],"fr":["Développer des jeux interactifs 2D avec KAPLAY.js","Créer des expériences immersives 3D avec Three.js","Concevoir des prototypes de jeux avec des mécanismes de rétroaction clairs"],"de":["Interaktive 2D-Spiele mit KAPLAY.js entwickeln","Immersive 3D-Erfahrungen mit Three.js erstellen","Spielprototypen mit klarer Rückmeldungsmechanik entwerfen"],"pt":["Desenvolver jogos interativos 2D com KAPLAY.js","Construir experiências imersivas 3D com Three.js","Projetar protótipos de jogos com mecanismos de feedback claros"],"ru":["Разработка интерактивных 2D игр с KAPLAY.js","Создание иммерсивных 3D опытов с Three.js","Проектирование прототипов игр с четкими механизмами обратной связи"],"ar":["تطوير ألعاب تفاعلية 2D مع KAPLAY.js","بناء تجارب 3D الغامرة مع Three.js","تصميم نماذج أولية لألعاب مع آليات للتعليقات الواضحة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires JavaScript and HTML5 compatibility","Dependent on KAPLAY.js for 2D and Three.js for 3D rendering","Needs `package.json` and specific file structure for setup"],"zh":["需要 JavaScript 和 HTML5 兼容性","依赖 KAPLAY.js 进行 2D 渲染和 Three.js 进行 3D 渲染","需要 `package.json` 和特定的文件结构进行设置"],"ja":["JavaScript と HTML5 の互換性が必要","2D レンダリングのために KAPLAY.js と 3D レンダリングのために Three.js に依存","セットアップのために `package.json` と特定のファイル構造が必要"],"ko":["JavaScript와 HTML5 호환성이 필요","2D 렌더링을 위한 KAPLAY.js와 3D 렌더링을 위한 Three.js에 의존","설정하기 위한 `package.json`와 특정 파일 구조가 필요"],"es":["Requiere compatibilidad con JavaScript y HTML5","Dependiente de KAPLAY.js para renderizado 2D y Three.js para renderizado 3D","Necesita `package.json` y una estructura de archivo específica para la configuración"],"fr":["Nécessite la compatibilité avec JavaScript et HTML5","Dépend de KAPLAY.js pour le rendu 2D et Three.js pour le rendu 3D","Nécessite `package.json` et une structure de fichier spécifique pour la configuration"],"de":["Benötigt JavaScript- und HTML5-Kompatibilität","Abhängig von KAPLAY.js für 2D-Rendering und Three.js für 3D-Rendering","Benötigt `package.json` und eine bestimmte Dateistruktur für die Einrichtung"],"pt":["Exige compatibilidade com JavaScript e HTML5","Dependente de KAPLAY.js para renderização 2D e Three.js para renderização 3D","Necessita de `package.json` e estrutura de arquivo específica para configuração"],"ru":["Требует совместимости с JavaScript и HTML5","Зависит от KAPLAY.js для рендеринга 2D и Three.js для рендеринга 3D","Требует `package.json` и конкретной структуры файлов для настройки"],"ar":["يتطلب توافقًا مع JavaScript و HTML5","يعتمد على KAPLAY.js لترndering 2D و Three.js لترndering 3D","يحتاج إلى `package.json` وهيكل ملف معين لإعداد"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"d7d16b7d353691e1fb655d58ee0d5fe79eb0cf08ac63022200a08d92634541c5","qualityScore":27}');
