","en":"google-calendar-automation"},"description":{"zh":"Google 日历自动化 AI 工具是由 anicca 开发的，可以帮助开发者简化工作流程","ja":"Google カレンダー自動化 AI エージェントは、anicca によって開発された開発者のワークフローを簡素化するツールです","ko":"구글 캘린더 자동화 AI 에이전트는 anicca에서 개발한 개발자용 워크플ロー 최적화 도구입니다","es":"La automatización de Google Calendar con Agentes de IA de anicca permite una mayor eficiencia y productividad. Descubre cómo","fr":"L''automation de Google Calendar avec les Outils d''IA d''anicca permet une plus grande efficacité et productivité. Découvrez comment","de":"Die Automatisierung von Google Calendar mit KI Agenten von anicca ermöglicht eine höhere Effizienz und Produktivität. Erfahren Sie, wie","pt":"A automatização do Google Calendar com ferramentas de IA permite agendar compromissos e eventos de forma eficiente","ru":"Автоматизация Google Календаря с помощью ИИ Агентов позволяет эффективно планировать встречи и события","ar":"تتيح لك تautomation التقويم جوجل باستخدام أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي جدولة الاجتماعات والأحداث بفعالية","en":"Products built by anicca. "},"definition":{"en":"Products built by anicca. "},"features":{"zh":["自动化日历事件","简化工作流程","提高生产力","支持 Google 日历 API","易于集成"],"ja":["カレンダーイベントの自動化","ワークフローの簡素化","生産性の向上","Google カレンダー API のサポート","簡単な統合"],"ko":["캘린더 이벤트 자동화","워크플ロー 최적화","생산성 향상","구글 캘린더 API 지원","쉽게 통합"],"es":["Integración con Google Calendar","Automatización de tareas y eventos","Programación de recordatorios y notificaciones","Optimización de flujos de trabajo","Compatibilidad con múltiples plataformas"],"fr":["Intégration avec Google Calendar","Automatisation de tâches et d''événements","Planification de rappels et de notifications","Optimisation de flux de travail","Compatibilité avec plusieurs plateformes"],"de":["Integration mit Google Calendar","Automatisierung von Aufgaben und Ereignissen","Planung von Erinnerungen und Benachrichtigungen","Optimierung von Workflows","Kompatibilität mit mehreren Plattformen"],"pt":["Integração com o Google Calendar","Agendamento automático de compromissos","Notificações personalizadas","Análise de produtividade","Integração com outras ferramentas de IA"],"ru":["Интеграция с Google Календарем","Автоматическое планирование встреч","Персонализированные уведомления","Анализ производительности","Интеграция с другими ИИ Агентами"],"ar":["التكامل مع التقويم جوجل","جدولة تautomation للاجتماعات","إشعارات مخصصة","تحليل الإنتاجية","التكامل مع أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي الأخرى"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Google 日历自动化","AI 工具","anicca","如何使用 Google 日历自动化","Google 日历自动化教程","Google 日历 API","自动化工作流程","提高生产力"],"ja":["Google カレンダー自動化","AI エージェント","anicca","Google カレンダー自動化の使い方","Google カレンダー自動化チュートリアル","Google カレンダー API","ワークフローの自動化","生産性の向上"],"ko":["구글 캘린더 자동화","AI 에이전트","anicca","구글 캘린더 자동화 사용법","구글 캘린더 자동화 튜토리얼","구글 캘린더 API","워크플ロー 자동화","생산성 향상"],"es":["cómo usar Agentes de IA","automatización de Google Calendar","alternativas a Zapier","Google Calendar vs Microsoft Exchange","instalación de Agentes de IA","guía de configuración de Google Calendar"],"fr":["comment utiliser les Outils d''IA","automation de Google Calendar","alternatives à Zapier","Google Calendar vs Microsoft Exchange","installation des Outils d''IA","guide de configuration de Google Calendar"],"de":["wie man KI Agenten verwendet","Automatisierung von Google Calendar","Alternativen zu Zapier","Google Calendar vs Microsoft Exchange","Installation von KI Agenten","Anleitung zur Konfiguration von Google Calendar"],"pt":["como usar o Google Calendar","o que é automatização de calendário","ferramentas de IA para calendário","alternativas ao Google Calendar","Guia de instalação do Google Calendar","configuração do Google Calendar"],"ru":["как использовать Google Календарь","что такое автоматизация календаря","инструменты ИИ для календаря","альтернативы Google Календаря","Руководство по установке Google Календаря","настройка Google Календаря"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام التقويم جوجل","ما هي تautomation التقويم","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للتقويم","بديلات التقويم جوجل","دليل تثبيت التقويم جوجل","ضبط التقويم جوجل"]}},"owner":"Daisuke134","repo":"anicca-products","repoPath":"Daisuke134/anicca-products","stars":4,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-28T14:30:47Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"google-calendar-automation","description":"Automate Google Calendar events, scheduling, availability checks, and attendee management via Rube MCP (Composio). Create events, find free slots, manage attendees, and list calendars programmatically.","bodyPreview":"# Google Calendar Automation via Rube MCP\n\nAutomate Google Calendar workflows including event creation, scheduling, availability checks, attendee management, and calendar browsing through Composio''s Google Calendar toolkit.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Rube MCP must be connected (RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS available)\n- Active Google Calendar connection via `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` with toolkit `googlecalendar`\n- Always call `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS` first to get current tool schemas\n\n## Setup\n\n**Get Rube MCP**: Add `","body":"# Google Calendar Automation via Rube MCP\n\nAutomate Google Calendar workflows including event creation, scheduling, availability checks, attendee management, and calendar browsing through Composio''s Google Calendar toolkit.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Rube MCP must be connected (RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS available)\n- Active Google Calendar connection via `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` with toolkit `googlecalendar`\n- Always call `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS` first to get current tool schemas\n\n## Setup\n\n**Get Rube MCP**: Add `https://rube.app/mcp` as an MCP server in your client configuration. No API keys needed — just add the endpoint and it works.\n\n\n1. Verify Rube MCP is available by confirming `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS` responds\n2. Call `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` with toolkit `googlecalendar`\n3. If connection is not ACTIVE, follow the returned auth link to complete Google OAuth\n4. Confirm connection status shows ACTIVE before running any workflows\n\n## Core Workflows\n\n### 1. Create and Manage Events\n\n**When to use**: User wants to create, update, or delete calendar events\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `GOOGLECALENDAR_LIST_CALENDARS` - Identify target calendar ID [Prerequisite]\n2. `GOOGLECALENDAR_GET_CURRENT_DATE_TIME` - Get current time with proper timezone [Optional]\n3. `GOOGLECALENDAR_FIND_FREE_SLOTS` - Check availability before booking [Optional]\n4. `GOOGLECALENDAR_CREATE_EVENT` - Create the event [Required]\n5. `GOOGLECALENDAR_PATCH_EVENT` - Update specific fields of an existing event [Alternative]\n6. `GOOGLECALENDAR_UPDATE_EVENT` - Full replacement update of an event [Alternative]\n7. `GOOGLECALENDAR_DELETE_EVENT` - Delete an event [Optional]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `calendar_id`: Use ''primary'' for main calendar, or specific calendar ID\n- `start_datetime`: ISO 8601 format ''YYYY-MM-DDTHH:MM:SS'' (NOT natural language)\n- `timezone`: IANA timezone name (e.g., ''America/New_York'', NOT ''EST'' or ''PST'')\n- `event_duration_hour`: Hours (0+)\n- `event_duration_minutes`: Minutes (0-59 only; NEVER use 60+)\n- `summary`: Event title\n- `attendees`: Array of email addresses (NOT names)\n- `location`: Free-form text for event location\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- `start_datetime` must be ISO 8601; natural language like ''tomorrow'' is rejected\n- `event_duration_minutes` max is 59; use `event_duration_hour=1` instead of `event_duration_minutes=60`\n- `timezone` must be IANA identifier; abbreviations like ''EST'', ''PST'' are NOT valid\n- `attendees` only accepts email addresses, not names; resolve names first\n- Google Meet link creation defaults to true; may fail on personal Gmail accounts (graceful fallback)\n- Organizer is auto-added as attendee unless `exclude_organizer=true`\n\n### 2. List and Search Events\n\n**When to use**: User wants to find or browse events on their calendar\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `GOOGLECALENDAR_LIST_CALENDARS` - Get available calendars [Prerequisite]\n2. `GOOGLECALENDAR_FIND_EVENT` - Search by title/keyword with time bounds [Required]\n3. `GOOGLECALENDAR_EVENTS_LIST` - List events in a time range [Alternative]\n4. `GOOGLECALENDAR_EVENTS_INSTANCES` - List instances of a recurring event [Optional]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `query` / `q`: Free-text search (matches summary, description, location, attendees)\n- `timeMin`: Lower bound (RFC3339 with timezone offset, e.g., ''2024-01-01T00:00:00-08:00'')\n- `timeMax`: Upper bound (RFC3339 with timezone offset)\n- `singleEvents`: true to expand recurring events into instances\n- `orderBy`: ''startTime'' (requires singleEvents=true) or ''updated''\n- `maxResults`: Results per page (max 2500)\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- **Timezone warning**: UTC timestamps (ending in ''Z'') don''t align with local dates; use local timezone offsets instead\n- Example: ''2026-01-19T00:00:00Z'' covers 2026-01-18 4pm to 2026-01-19 4pm in PST\n- Omitting `timeMin`/`timeMax` scans the full calendar and can be slow\n- `pageToken` in response means more results; paginate until absent\n- `orderBy=''startTime''` requires `singleEvents=true`\n\n### 3. Manage Attendees and Invitations\n\n**When to use**: User wants to add, remove, or update event attendees\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `GOOGLECALENDAR_FIND_EVENT` or `GOOGLECALENDAR_EVENTS_LIST` - Find the event [Prerequisite]\n2. `GOOGLECALENDAR_PATCH_EVENT` - Add attendees (replaces entire attendees list) [Required]\n3. `GOOGLECALENDAR_REMOVE_ATTENDEE` - Remove a specific attendee by email [Required]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `event_id`: Unique event identifier (opaque string, NOT the event title)\n- `attendees`: Full list of attendee emails (PATCH replaces entire list)\n- `attendee_email`: Email to remove\n- `send_updates`: ''all'', ''externalOnly'', or ''none''\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- `event_id` is a technical identifier, NOT the event title; always search first to get the ID\n- `PATCH_EVENT` attendees field replaces the entire list; include existing attendees to avoid removing them\n- Attendee names cannot be resolved; always use email addresses\n- Use `GMAIL_SEARCH_PEOPLE` to resolve names to emails before managing attendees\n\n### 4. Check Availability and Free/Busy Status\n\n**When to use**: User wants to find available time slots or check busy periods\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `GOOGLECALENDAR_LIST_CALENDARS` - Identify calendars to check [Prerequisite]\n2. `GOOGLECALENDAR_GET_CURRENT_DATE_TIME` - Get current time with timezone [Optional]\n3. `GOOGLECALENDAR_FIND_FREE_SLOTS` - Find free intervals across calendars [Required]\n4. `GOOGLECALENDAR_FREE_BUSY_QUERY` - Get raw busy periods for computing gaps [Fallback]\n5. `GOOGLECALENDAR_CREATE_EVENT` - Book a confirmed slot [Required]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `items`: List of calendar IDs to check (e.g., [''primary''])\n- `time_min`/`time_max`: Query interval (defaults to current day if omitted)\n- `timezone`: IANA timezone for interpreting naive timestamps\n- `calendarExpansionMax`: Max calendars (1-50)\n- `groupExpansionMax`: Max members per group (1-100)\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- Maximum span ~90 days per Google Calendar freeBusy API limit\n- Very long ranges or inaccessible calendars yield empty/invalid results\n- Only calendars with at least freeBusyReader access are visible\n- Free slots responses may normalize to UTC (''Z''); check offsets\n- `GOOGLECALENDAR_FREE_BUSY_QUERY` requires RFC3339 timestamps with timezone\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### ID Resolution\n- **Calendar name -> calendar_id**: `GOOGLECALENDAR_LIST_CALENDARS` to enumerate all calendars\n- **Event title -> event_id**: `GOOGLECALENDAR_FIND_EVENT` or `GOOGLECALENDAR_EVENTS_LIST`\n- **Attendee name -> email**: `GMAIL_SEARCH_PEOPLE`\n\n### Timezone Handling\n- Always use IANA timezone identifiers (e.g., ''America/Los_Angeles'')\n- Use `GOOGLECALENDAR_GET_CURRENT_DATE_TIME` to get current time in user''s timezone\n- When querying events for a local date, use timestamps with local offset, NOT UTC\n- Example: ''2026-01-19T00:00:00-08:00'' for PST, NOT ''2026-01-19T00:00:00Z''\n\n### Pagination\n- `GOOGLECALENDAR_EVENTS_LIST` returns `nextPageToken`; iterate until absent\n- `GOOGLECALENDAR_LIST_CALENDARS` also paginates; use `page_token`\n\n## Known Pitfalls\n\n- **Natural language dates**: NOT supported; all dates must be ISO 8601 or RFC3339\n- **Timezone mismatch**: UTC timestamps don''t align with local dates for filtering\n- **Duration limits**: `event_duration_minutes` max 59; use hours for longer durations\n- **IANA timezones only**: ''EST'', ''PST'', etc. are NOT valid; use ''America/New_York''\n- **Event IDs are opaque**: Always search to get event_id; never guess or construct\n- **Attendees as emails**: Names cannot be used; resolve with GMAIL_SEARCH_PEOPLE\n- **PATCH replaces attendees**: Include all desired attendees in the array, not just new ones\n- **Conference limitations**: Google Meet may fail on personal accounts (graceful fallback)\n- **Rate limits**: High-volume searches can trigger 403/429; throttle between calls\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Task | Tool Slug | Key Params |\n|------|-----------|------------|\n| List calendars | `GOOGLECALENDAR_LIST_CALENDARS` | `max_results` |\n| Create event | `GOOGLECALENDAR_CREATE_EVENT` | `start_datetime`, `timezone`, `summary` |\n| Update event | `GOOGLECALENDAR_PATCH_EVENT` | `calendar_id`, `event_id`, fields to update |\n| Delete event | `GOOGLECALENDAR_DELETE_EVENT` | `calendar_id`, `event_id` |\n| Search events | `GOOGLECALENDAR_FIND_EVENT` | `query`, `timeMin`, `timeMax` |\n| List events | `GOOGLECALENDAR_EVENTS_LIST` | `calendarId`, `timeMin`, `timeMax` |\n| Recurring instances | `GOOGLECALENDAR_EVENTS_INSTANCES` | `calendarId`, `eventId` |\n| Find free slots | `GOOGLECALENDAR_FIND_FREE_SLOTS` | `items`, `time_min`, `time_max`, `timezone` |\n| Free/busy query | `GOOGLECALENDAR_FREE_BUSY_QUERY` | `timeMin`, `timeMax`, `items` |\n| Remove attendee | `GOOGLECALENDAR_REMOVE_ATTENDEE` | `event_id`, `attendee_email` |\n| Get current time | `GOOGLECALENDAR_GET_CURRENT_DATE_TIME` | `timezone` |\n| Get calendar | `GOOGLECALENDAR_GET_CALENDAR` | `calendar_id` |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-01T05:21:01.261Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Productivity Agents needing advanced Google Calendar workflow automation capabilities via Rube MCP","zh":"适合需要高级Google Calendar工作流自动化能力的生产力代理，通过Rube MCP实现","ja":"Rube MCPを介して高度なGoogle Calendarワークフロー自動化機能を必要とする生産性エージェントに最適","ko":"Rube MCP를 통해 고급 Google Calendar 워크플로 자동화 기능이 필요한 생산성 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de productividad que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de automatización de flujo de trabajo de Google Calendar a través de Rube MCP","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de productivité ayant besoin de capacités avancées d''automatisation de workflow Google Calendar via Rube MCP","de":"Perfekt für Produktivitätsagenten, die erweiterte Google Calendar-Workflownautomatisierungsfähigkeiten via Rube MCP benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Produtividade que precisam de capacidades avançadas de automação de fluxo de trabalho do Google Calendar via Rube MCP","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов продуктивности, которым необходимы расширенные возможности автоматизации рабочего процесса Google Calendar через Rube MCP","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الإنتاجية الذين يحتاجون إلى مميزات متقدمة لتحسين سير عمل جوجل كالندر عبر Rube MCP"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate Google Calendar workflows, including event creation, scheduling, availability checks, attendee management, and calendar browsing through Composio''s Google Calendar toolkit, utilizing RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS and RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS","zh":"赋予代理自动化Google Calendar工作流的能力，包括事件创建、调度、可用性检查、出席者管理和日历浏览，通过Composio的Google Calendar工具包，使用RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS和RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS","ja":"エージェントにGoogle Calendarワークフローを自動化する能力を与え、イベントの作成、スケジューリング、可用性の確認、出席者の管理、およびカレンダーの閲覧をComposioのGoogle Calendarツールキットを使用して実行し、RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLSとRUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONSを利用","ko":"에이전트에게 Google Calendar 워크플로를 자동화할 수 있는 능력을 부여하며, Composio의 Google Calendar 툴킷을 사용하여 이벤트 생성, 스케줄링, 가용성 확인, 참석자 관리 및 캘린더 브라우징을 수행하며, RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS 및 RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS를 활용","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar flujos de trabajo de Google Calendar, incluyendo la creación de eventos, programación, verificaciones de disponibilidad, gestión de asistentes y navegación por el calendario a través de la herramienta de Google Calendar de Composio, utilizando RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS y RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser les flux de travail Google Calendar, y compris la création d''événements, la planification, les vérifications de disponibilité, la gestion des participants et la navigation dans le calendrier via l''outil de Google Calendar de Composio, en utilisant RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS et RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Google Calendar-Workflows zu automatisieren, einschließlich Erstellung von Ereignissen, Terminplanung, Verfügbarkeitsprüfungen, Teilnehmerverwaltung und Kalenderbrowsing durch Composios Google Calendar-Toolkit, unter Verwendung von RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS und RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar fluxos de trabalho do Google Calendar, incluindo criação de eventos, agendamento, verificações de disponibilidade, gerenciamento de participantes e navegação pelo calendário por meio da ferramenta de calendário do Google da Composio, utilizando RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS e RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать рабочие процессы Google Calendar, включая создание событий, планирование, проверку доступности, управление участниками и просмотр календаря с помощью инструмента календаря Google от Composio, используя RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS и RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من تutomation سير عمل جوجل كالندر، بما في ذلك إنشاء الأحداث، والجدولة، وعمليات التحقق من التوفر، وإدارة الحضور، والملاحة في التقويم من خلال أداة جوجل كالندر من Composio، باستخدام RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS و RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating event creation and scheduling","Managing attendee lists and availability checks","Browsing and searching Google Calendar events"],"zh":["自动化事件创建和调度","管理出席者列表和可用性检查","浏览和搜索Google Calendar事件"],"ja":["イベントの作成とスケジューリングの自動化","出席者のリストと可用性の確認の管理","Google Calendarイベントの閲覧と検索"],"ko":["이벤트 생성 및 스케줄링 자동화","참석자 목록 및 가용성 확인 관리","Google Calendar 이벤트 브라우징 및 검색"],"es":["Automatización de la creación y programación de eventos","Gestión de listas de asistentes y verificaciones de disponibilidad","Navegación y búsqueda de eventos de Google Calendar"],"fr":["Automatisation de la création et de la planification d''événements","Gestion des listes de participants et vérifications de disponibilité","Navigation et recherche d''événements Google Calendar"],"de":["Automatisierung der Erstellung und Terminplanung von Ereignissen","Verwaltung von Teilnehmerlisten und Verfügbarkeitsprüfungen","Navigieren und Suchen von Google Calendar-Ereignissen"],"pt":["Automatizar a criação e agendamento de eventos","Gerenciar listas de participantes e verificações de disponibilidade","Navegar e pesquisar eventos do Google Calendar"],"ru":["Автоматизировать создание и планирование событий","Управлять списками участников и проверками доступности","Просматривать и искать события Google Calendar"],"ar":["توفير تautomation لإنشاء الأحداث والجدولة","إدارة قوائم الحضور والتحقق من التوفر","الملاحة والبحث في أحداث جوجل كالندر"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Rube MCP connection with RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS available","Active Google Calendar connection via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS with toolkit googlecalendar required","Dependent on Composio''s Google Calendar toolkit"],"zh":["需要Rube MCP连接，且RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS可用","需要通过RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS的Google Calendar连接，且toolkit googlecalendar必需","依赖于Composio的Google Calendar工具包"],"ja":["Rube MCP接続が必要であり、RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLSが利用可能","RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONSを介したGoogle Calendar接続が必要であり、toolkit googlecalendarが必須","ComposioのGoogle Calendarツールキットに依存"],"ko":["Rube MCP 연결이 필요하며, RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS가 사용 가능해야 함","RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS를 통해 Google Calendar 연결이 필요하며, toolkit googlecalendar가 필수임","Composio의 Google Calendar 툴킷에 의존"],"es":["Requiere conexión Rube MCP con RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS disponible","Conexión activa de Google Calendar a través de RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS con la herramienta googlecalendar requerida","Dependiente de la herramienta de Google Calendar de Composio"],"fr":["Nécessite une connexion Rube MCP avec RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS disponible","Connexion active Google Calendar via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS avec l''outil googlecalendar requis","Dépendant de l''outil de Google Calendar de Composio"],"de":["Benötigt Rube MCP-Verbindung mit verfügbarer RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS","Aktive Google Calendar-Verbindung via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS mit dem Toolkit googlecalendar erforderlich","Abhängig von Composios Google Calendar-Toolkit"],"pt":["Requer conexão Rube MCP com RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS disponível","Conexão ativa do Google Calendar via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS com toolkit googlecalendar necessário","Dependente da ferramenta de calendário do Google da Composio"],"ru":["Требуется подключение Rube MCP с доступными RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS","Активное подключение Google Calendar через RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS с необходимым инструментом googlecalendar","Зависит от инструмента календаря Google от Composio"],"ar":["يتطلب اتصال Rube MCP مع RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS المتاحة","اتصال نشط لجوجل كالندر عبر RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS مع أداة googlecalendar المطلوبة","يعتمد على أداة جوجل كالندر من Composio"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"9d9cca2dfeb40c59100fb1f856667178da3da4e31eab6e371c8db53776d5b553","qualityScore":27}');
