 et Node.js"],"de":["Simulation von Arbeitsabläufen mit Kanban","Definition des Status ''fertig'' für Aufgaben","Analyse der Effizienz mit KI-Tools","Verbesserung der Produktivität durch Simulationen","Integration mit Entwicklungstools wie React und Node.js"],"pt":["Simulação de Kanban para melhorar a produtividade","Definição de concluído personalizada para cada projeto","Análise de fluxo de trabalho para identificar gargalos","Integração com ferramentas de gerenciamento de projetos","Relatórios detalhados para acompanhar o progresso"],"ru":["Симуляция Kanban для улучшения производительности","Пользовательское определение готовности для каждого проекта","Анализ потока работы для выявления瓶кеcks","Интеграция с инструментами управления проектами","Подробные отчеты для отслеживания прогресса"],"ar":["محاكاة الكانبان لتحسين الإنتاجية","تعريف الإنجاز مخصص لكل مشروع","تحليل تدفق العمل لتحديد العوائق","التكامل مع أدوات إدارة المشاريع","تقارير مفصلة لمتابعة التقدم"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能工具","Kanban模拟器","项目完成标准","团队协作","项目管理优化","如何使用Kanban","Kanban模拟器替代品","Definition-of-Done安装","Definition-of-Done设置指南"],"ja":["AIエージェント","カンバンシミュレーター","プロジェクト完成基準","チームコラボレーション","プロジェクト管理の最適化","カンバンの使い方","カンバンシミュレーターの代替","Definition-of-Doneのインストール","Definition-of-Doneの設定ガイド"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","Kanban 시뮬레이터","프로젝트 완료 기준","팀 협업","프로젝트 관리 최적화","Kanban의 사용법","Kanban 시뮬레이터 대체","정의된 완료의 설치","정의된 완료의 설정 가이드"],"es":["herramientas de AI para desarrollo","definición de listo en proyectos","simulador Kanban para flujos de trabajo","cómo utilizar herramientas de AI en proyectos","mejora de la productividad con AI","alternativas a Trello para simulación de flujos de trabajo","instalación de herramientas de AI para desarrollo","guias de configuración para herramientas de AI"],"fr":["outils d''IA pour le développement","définition de terminé dans les projets","simulateur Kanban pour les flux de travail","comment utiliser des outils d''IA dans les projets","amélioration de la productivité avec l''IA","alternatives à Trello pour la simulation de flux de travail","installation d''outils d''IA pour le développement","guides de configuration pour les outils d''IA"],"de":["KI-Tools für die Entwicklung","Definition of Done in Projekten","Kanban-Simulator für Arbeitsabläufe","wie man KI-Tools in Projekten verwendet","Verbesserung der Produktivität mit KI","Alternativen zu Trello für die Simulation von Arbeitsabläufen","Installation von KI-Tools für die Entwicklung","Konfigurationsanleitungen für KI-Tools"],"pt":["o que é definição de concluído","ferramentas de ia para kanban","simulação de kanban","definição de concluído em gerenciamento de projetos","melhorias de produtividade com kanban","alternativas para ferramentas de kanban","guias de instalação de ferramentas de kanban"],"ru":["что такое определение готовности","инструменты ии для канбан","симуляция канбан","определение готовности в управлении проектами","улучшение производительности с помощью канбан","альтернативы инструментам канбан","руководства по установке инструментов канбан"],"ar":["ما هو تعريف الإنجاز","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للكانبان","محاكاة الكانبان","تعريف الإنجاز في إدارة المشاريع","تحسين الإنتاجية باستخدام الكانبان","بديل أدوات الكانبان","دليل تثبيت أدوات الكانبان"]}},"owner":"agnaldo4j","repo":"kanban_vision_api_iex","repoPath":"agnaldo4j/kanban_vision_api_iex","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-24T14:49:04Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"definition-of-done","description":">","bodyPreview":"# Definition of Done — Platform Downstream\n\n> **Golden Rule**: If any checkbox below is not checked, it is not done.\n> Quality, security, and predictability for B2B/B2C come from fully meeting this DoD.\n> If something prevented compliance, identify it and fix it so the next delivery is compliant.\n\n---\n\n## How to use this skill\n\nWhen asked to finish, close, or mark a task as done:\n\n1. Go through each section below.\n2. For each item, confirm it was done or explicitly state why it is N/A.\n3. If any","body":"# Definition of Done — Platform Downstream\n\n> **Golden Rule**: If any checkbox below is not checked, it is not done.\n> Quality, security, and predictability for B2B/B2C come from fully meeting this DoD.\n> If something prevented compliance, identify it and fix it so the next delivery is compliant.\n\n---\n\n## How to use this skill\n\nWhen asked to finish, close, or mark a task as done:\n\n1. Go through each section below.\n2. For each item, confirm it was done or explicitly state why it is N/A.\n3. If any item is missing, implement it or flag it before closing.\n4. Never silently skip a section.\n\n---\n\n## 1. Contract, Traceability and Origin\n\n- [ ] Item entered through official channels with origin and service class defined:\n  `Feature/Outcome` | `Bug/Incident` | `Risk/Compliance` | `Tech Debt` | `Discovery/Experiment`\n- [ ] Problem or hypothesis is clear, with target metric/SLO and success criteria defined.\n- [ ] End-to-end traceability confirmed: `ticket ↔ branch/commits/PR ↔ build ↔ deploy ↔ business event/feature flag`\n\n---\n\n## 2. Technical Quality and Tests\n\n- [ ] **Unit tests** written: fast, deterministic, given–when–then, covering success and error paths.\n- [ ] **Integration/contract tests** written for every boundary (DB, APIs, queues) — OpenAPI/AsyncAPI/CDC updated.\n- [ ] **Regression test** added if this is a bug fix (test that would have caught the bug).\n- [ ] Code is simple, readable, and reviewed. Complexity and hotspots are under control.\n\n---\n\n## 3. Versioning and Backward Compatibility\n\n- [ ] Additive changes kept in the same version. Breaking changes only in a major version with migration path.\n- [ ] OpenAPI/AsyncAPI and changelog updated. Deprecated fields marked with a defined sunset window.\n- [ ] Gateway/routing by version and flags ready for safe transition.\n\n---\n\n## 4. Security and Compliance\n\n- [ ] Security scans completed (SCA / SAST / Secrets) — manually or via CI. Secrets rotated, minimum access principle applied.\n- [ ] Test data is reproducible and free of sensitive PII.\n- [ ] Incident response runbook updated if applicable.\n\n---\n\n## 5. Enablement and CI/CD\n\n- [ ] Local environment runs with a single command and is in parity with CI/staging.\n- [ ] CI pipeline green: build, tests, contracts, security. **No flaky tests allowed.**\n- [ ] Feature flags / Dark Launch / Branch by Abstraction applied when the delivery is phased or incomplete.\n\n---\n\n## 6. Observability and Alerts\n\n- [ ] Metrics, logs, and traces instrumented (golden signals: latency, traffic, errors, saturation).\n- [ ] Dashboards published per domain/version/feature.\n- [ ] Alerts configured: high signal, low noise — triggered by user impact or SLO breach.\n- [ ] Each alert points to a runbook with clear actions and rollback steps.\n\n---\n\n## 7. Performance, Reliability and Risk\n\n- [ ] Functional and performance limits defined. Circuit breakers, rate limiting, and timeouts in place.\n- [ ] Risks mapped and mitigated (Plan A/B, canary/blue-green when applicable).\n- [ ] High-risk items do not go to production without proportional mitigation.\n\n---\n\n## 8. Safe Deploy and Rollback\n\n- [ ] Release strategy defined (canary / blue-green / gradual) — separate from deployment.\n- [ ] Rollback plan tested and reversible. Health checks are reliable.\n\n---\n\n## 9. Documentation and Communication\n\n- [ ] README / operational how-to updated. Decisions recorded (RFC when needed).\n- [ ] Final communication posted in the official channel with summary, links (PR, docs, dashboards) and next steps.\n\n---\n\n## 10. Bug-Specific Criteria (OPON — escalated bugs)\n\n*Apply only to items flagged as OPON (bugs escalated from Online Operations).*\n\n- [ ] Classified and prioritized by impact (SLO / revenue / risk).\n- [ ] Fix deployed to production within **15 calendar days** from triage acceptance.\n- [ ] Post-deploy observability of the case confirmed and lightweight root-cause analysis completed.\n- [ ] SLA violation metric updated.\n\n---\n\n## 11. Post-Deploy and Closure\n\n- [ ] Production verification done: dashboards and alerts show no anomalies.\n- [ ] Telemetry confirms expected outcome (business event fired, metric moved as expected).\n- [ ] Flow is stable: item is not aging in any stage, no avoidable debt left for the next person.\n- [ ] **All criteria above met → Done.**\n\n---\n\n## Quick reference — common failure modes\n\n| Skipped item | Risk |\n|---|---|\n| No unit tests | Regression in next change, harder to refactor |\n| No integration test for DB/API boundary | Silent contract break in production |\n| No feature flag for incomplete feature | Unfinished work exposed to users |\n| No observability | Blind in production, high MTTR |\n| No rollback plan | Cannot recover fast from bad deploy |\n| Breaking change without versioning | Downstream services break silently |\n| Bug closed without regression test | Same bug ships again |\n| OPON bug over 15 days | SLA violation, escalation required |"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-26T13:14:17.827Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Task Management Agents needing strict completion criteria and quality assurance protocols","zh":"Perfect for Task Management Agents needing strict completion criteria and quality assurance protocols","ja":"Perfect for Task Management Agents needing strict completion criteria and quality assurance protocols","ko":"Perfect for Task Management Agents needing strict completion criteria and quality assurance protocols","es":"Ideal para agentes de gestión de tareas que requieren criterios de finalización estrictos y protocolos de aseguramiento de la calidad","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de gestion de tâches nécessitant des critères de réalisation stricts et des protocoles d''assurance qualité","de":"Perfekt für Task-Management-Agents, die strenge Abgeschlossenheitskriterien und Qualitäts-sicherungsprotokolle benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Gerenciamento de Tarefas que necessitam de critérios de conclusão estritos e protocolos de garantia de qualidade","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов управления задачами, которым необходимы строгие критерии завершения и протоколы обеспечения качества","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء إدارة المهام الذين يحتاجون إلى معايير إكمال صارمة وبروتوكولات ضمان الجودة"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to enforce a rigorous Definition of Done, ensuring quality, security, and predictability in B2B/B2C deliveries by leveraging Kanban simulators and checkbox validation protocols","zh":"Empowers agents to enforce a rigorous Definition of Done, ensuring quality, security, and predictability in B2B/B2C deliveries by leveraging Kanban simulators and checkbox validation protocols","ja":"Empowers agents to enforce a rigorous Definition of Done, ensuring quality, security, and predictability in B2B/B2C deliveries by leveraging Kanban simulators and checkbox validation protocols","ko":"Empowers agents to enforce a rigorous Definition of Done, ensuring quality, security, and predictability in B2B/B2C deliveries by leveraging Kanban simulators and checkbox validation protocols","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aplicar una definición rigurosa de finalización, asegurando la calidad, la seguridad y la previsibilidad en entregas B2B/B2C mediante simuladores Kanban y protocolos de validación de casillas de verificación","fr":"Permet aux agents d''appliquer une définition rigoureuse de la fin, assurant la qualité, la sécurité et la prévisibilité dans les livraisons B2B/B2C en exploitant des simulateurs Kanban et des protocoles de validation de cases à cocher","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, eine strenge Definition von Fertigstellung durchzusetzen, um Qualität, Sicherheit und Vorhersehbarkeit in B2B/B2C-Lieferungen sicherzustellen, indem Kanban-Simulatoren und Checkbox-Validierungsprotokolle eingesetzt werden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a aplicar uma definição rigorosa de Concluído, garantindo qualidade, segurança e previsibilidade nas entregas B2B/B2C, aproveitando simuladores Kanban e protocolos de validação de caixas de seleção","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью применять строгое определение Готово, обеспечивая качество, безопасность и предсказуемость в доставках B2B/B2C, используя симуляторы Kanban и протоколы проверки флажков","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تطبيق تعريف متقن للانتهاء، مما يضمن الجودة والأمان والقابلية للتوقع في التوصيلات التجارية إلى العملاء والتجارية إلى التجارية باستخدام محاكي Kanban وبروتوكولات التحقق من الصندوق"},"useCases":{"en":["Validating task completion against predefined criteria","Ensuring compliance with quality and security standards","Identifying and addressing non-compliant deliveries"],"zh":["Validating task completion against predefined criteria","Ensuring compliance with quality and security standards","Identifying and addressing non-compliant deliveries"],"ja":["Validating task completion against predefined criteria","Ensuring compliance with quality and security standards","Identifying and addressing non-compliant deliveries"],"ko":["Validating task completion against predefined criteria","Ensuring compliance with quality and security standards","Identifying and addressing non-compliant deliveries"],"es":["Validar la finalización de tareas contra criterios predefinidos","Asegurar el cumplimiento de los estándares de calidad y seguridad","Identificar y abordar entregas no conformes"],"fr":["Valider la fin des tâches contre des critères prédéfinis","Assurer le respect des normes de qualité et de sécurité","Identifier et traiter les livraisons non conformes"],"de":["Überprüfen des Aufgabenabschlusses gegen vordefinierte Kriterien","Sicherstellen der Einhaltung von Qualitäts- und Sicherheitsstandards","Identifizieren und Ansprechen nicht konformer Lieferungen"],"pt":["Validar a conclusão da tarefa contra critérios predefinidos","Garantir conformidade com normas de qualidade e segurança","Identificar e abordar entregas não conformes"],"ru":["Проверять завершение задачи против заранее определенных критериев","Обеспечивать соблюдение стандартов качества и безопасности","Определять и устранять неконформные доставки"],"ar":["التحقق من إكمال المهمة ضد المعايير المحددة مسبقًا","ضمان الامتثال لمعايير الجودة والأمن","تحديد وتحسين التوصيلات غير المتوافقة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires explicit confirmation of each completion criterion","Dependent on accurate Kanban simulator outputs"],"zh":["Requires explicit confirmation of each completion criterion","Dependent on accurate Kanban simulator outputs"],"ja":["Requires explicit confirmation of each completion criterion","Dependent on accurate Kanban simulator outputs"],"ko":["Requires explicit confirmation of each completion criterion","Dependent on accurate Kanban simulator outputs"],"es":["Requiere confirmación explícita de cada criterio de finalización","Depende de resultados precisos de simuladores Kanban"],"fr":["Nécessite une confirmation explicite de chaque critère de fin","Dépend de sorties précises de simulateurs Kanban"],"de":["Benötigt explizite Bestätigung jedes Abgeschlossenheitskriteriums","Hängt von genauen Ausgaben von Kanban-Simulatoren ab"],"pt":["Exige confirmação explícita de cada critério de conclusão","Depende de saídas precisas de simuladores Kanban"],"ru":["Требует явного подтверждения каждого критерия завершения","Зависит от точных выходных данных симуляторов Kanban"],"ar":["يتطلب تأكيدًا صريحًا لكل معيار إكمال","يعتمد على مخرجات دقيقة لمحاكي Kanban"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"5002afec616ac0a08df319d5900f0115f1956ed8ebaabf5a96fc08988e43ffd7","qualityScore":27}');
