dungen mit minimalem Overhead","Optimieren Sie die Leistung Ihrer Anwendungen","Vereinfachen Sie den Entwicklungsprozess","Verbessern Sie die Benutzererfahrung","Kompatibel mit den meisten React-Bibliotheken"],"pt":["Criação de aplicativos React com baixo overhead","Abordagem eficiente para desenvolver aplicações React","Suporte a React","Código aberto","Fácil integração"],"ru":["Создание приложений React с минимальными накладными расходами","Эффективный подход к разработке приложений React","Поддержка React","Открытый код","Легкая интеграция"],"ar":["إنشاء تطبيقات React مع الحد الأدنى من العبء الإضافي","نهج فعال لتطوير تطبيقات React","دعم React","مفتوح المصدر","إضافة سهلة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用Shared Model Refactor","什么是React应用优化","Shared Model Refactor教程","React应用性能优化","Shared Model Refactor安装","React应用开发框架","Shared Model Refactor vs其他框架","如何提高React应用效率"],"ja":["Shared Model Refactorの使用方法","Reactアプリの最適化とは","Shared Model Refactorチュートリアル","Reactアプリのパフォーマンス最適化","Shared Model Refactorのインストール","Reactアプリ開発フレームワーク","Shared Model Refactorと他のフレームワークの比較","Reactアプリの効率を向上させる方法"],"ko":["Shared Model Refactor 사용법","리액트 애플리케이션 최적화란","Shared Model Refactor 튜토리얼","리액트 애플리케이션 성능 최적화","Shared Model Refactor 설치","리액트 애플리케이션 개발 프레임워크","Shared Model Refactor와 다른 프레임워크 비교","리액트 애플리케이션 효율성 향상 방법"],"es":["herramientas de AI para React","cómo usar shared-model-refactor","qué es shared-model-refactor","shared-model-refactor vs create-react-app","instalación de shared-model-refactor","guía de configuración de shared-model-refactor","alternativas a shared-model-refactor","mejores prácticas para shared-model-refactor"],"fr":["outils d''IA pour React","comment utiliser shared-model-refactor","qu''est-ce que shared-model-refactor","shared-model-refactor vs create-react-app","installation de shared-model-refactor","guide de configuration de shared-model-refactor","alternatives à shared-model-refactor","meilleures pratiques pour shared-model-refactor"],"de":["KI-Tools für React","wie man shared-model-refactor verwendet","was ist shared-model-refactor","shared-model-refactor vs create-react-app","installation von shared-model-refactor","konfigurationsanleitung für shared-model-refactor","alternativen zu shared-model-refactor","best practices für shared-model-refactor"],"pt":["como usar shared-model-refactor","o que é shared-model-refactor","shared-model-refactor alternativa","shared-model-refactor vs create-react-app","instalar shared-model-refactor","guia de configuração do shared-model-refactor"],"ru":["как использовать shared-model-refactor","что такое shared-model-refactor","альтернатива shared-model-refactor","shared-model-refactor vs create-react-app","установить shared-model-refactor","руководство по настройке shared-model-refactor"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام shared-model-refactor","ما هو shared-model-refactor","بديل shared-model-refactor","shared-model-refactor مقابل create-react-app","تثبيت shared-model-refactor","دليل إعداد shared-model-refactor"]}},"owner":"jts599","repo":"QuickApp","repoPath":"jts599/QuickApp","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-22T23:17:28Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"shared-model-refactor","description":"Refactor shared server/client TypeScript contracts into a common models directory and eliminate cross-boundary imports (for example client importing server classes). Use when client code depends on server module exports for types or when generated client code needs DTO/view-data/method contracts without bundling server implementation files.","bodyPreview":"# Shared Model Refactor\n\nRefactor code so server and client both import shared contracts from `sampleImplementation/models/` instead of importing each other.\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. Find boundary violations.\n- Run:\n  - `rg -n \"from [''\\\"].*server/|from [''\\\"].*client/\" sampleImplementation src test -S`\n- Identify client imports from `sampleImplementation/server/*` and server imports from `sampleImplementation/client/*`.\n\n2. Identify movable symbols.\n- Move only pure contracts:\n  - interfaces\n  - type ali","body":"# Shared Model Refactor\n\nRefactor code so server and client both import shared contracts from `sampleImplementation/models/` instead of importing each other.\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. Find boundary violations.\n- Run:\n  - `rg -n \"from [''\\\"].*server/|from [''\\\"].*client/\" sampleImplementation src test -S`\n- Identify client imports from `sampleImplementation/server/*` and server imports from `sampleImplementation/client/*`.\n\n2. Identify movable symbols.\n- Move only pure contracts:\n  - interfaces\n  - type aliases\n  - enums/constants used as DTO/schema contracts\n- Do not move implementation/runtime code:\n  - decorated classes\n  - business logic\n  - DB/network utilities\n\n3. Create model files.\n- Place extracted contracts in `sampleImplementation/models/`.\n- Use feature-based files (for example `sampleImplementation/models/sampleView.ts`).\n- Keep files side-effect free.\n\n4. Update imports.\n- Update server and client to import contracts from `sampleImplementation/models/*`.\n- For NodeNext, use explicit `.js` extensions in TS imports.\n- Prefer `import type` for type-only imports.\n\n5. Update client generation templates/runtime.\n- Ensure generated client code imports contracts from `models/`, not server class modules.\n- If generator currently infers types via server class imports, switch generation to explicit model imports per controller.\n\n6. Regenerate generated client files.\n- Run generation command(s) after template changes.\n\n7. Validate.\n- Run:\n  - `npm run typecheck`\n  - `npm test`\n  - `cd sampleImplementation && npm run build`\n- Confirm no client file imports from `sampleImplementation/server/*`.\n\n## File Organization Rules\n\n- `sampleImplementation/models/` is the only shared contract boundary.\n- Server code may import from `models/` and `src/`.\n- Client code may import from `models/` and `src/client` runtime APIs.\n- Client code must not import from `sampleImplementation/server/`.\n\n## Refactor Heuristics\n\n- Keep model names aligned with domain language.\n- Split large contract files by feature, not by type-kind.\n- Do not duplicate contracts in both server and client.\n- If a contract is only used on one side, keep it local.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- Zero cross-boundary implementation imports between `server/` and `client/`.\n- Shared DTO/view-data/method contracts live under `sampleImplementation/models/`.\n- Generated client output compiles and no longer depends on server class imports.\n- Full typecheck/tests/build pass.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-27T04:06:29.668Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Refactoring Agents needing to minimize overhead in React applications","zh":"非常适合需要在React应用程序中最小化开销的代码重构代理","ja":"Reactアプリケーションでオーバーヘッドを最小限に抑える必要があるコードリファクタリングエージェントに最適","ko":"React 애플리케이션에서 오버헤드를 최소화해야 하는 코드 리팩토링 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Refactorización de Código que necesitan minimizar la sobrecarga en aplicaciones React","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Réfactoration de Code nécessitant une minimisation de la surcharge dans les applications React","de":"Perfekt für Code-Refactoring-Agents, die die Overhead in React-Anwendungen minimieren müssen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Refatoração de Código que precisam minimizar o overhead em aplicações React","ru":"Идеально для агентов рефакторинга кода, которым необходимо минимизировать overhead в приложениях React","ar":"مثالي لعميل استعادة بناء الكود الذي يحتاج إلى تقليل الحمل الزائد في تطبيقات React"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to refactor code for shared contracts, utilizing `sampleImplementation/models/` and optimizing imports for server and client, leveraging React and rg for efficient boundary violation identification and movable symbol detection","zh":"赋予代理重构代码用于共享契约的能力，利用`sampleImplementation/models/`，并针对服务器和客户端优化导入，利用React和rg进行高效的边界违规识别和可移动符号检测","ja":"エージェントが共有契約のコードをリファクタリングできるようにし、`sampleImplementation/models/`を利用し、サーバーとクライアントのインポートを最適化し、Reactとrgを使用して効率的な境界違反の検出と可動シンボルの検出を行う","ko":"에이전트가 공유 계약의 코드를 리팩토링할 수 있도록 하며, `sampleImplementation/models/`를 활용하고 서버와 클라이언트의 가져오기를 최적화하며 React와 rg를 사용하여 효율적인 경계 위반 식별 및 이동 가능한 기호 감지","es":"Empodera a los agentes para refactorizar el código para contratos compartidos, utilizando `sampleImplementation/models/` y optimizando las importaciones para servidor y cliente, aprovechando React y rg para una identificación eficiente de violaciones de límites y detección de símbolos movibles","fr":"Permet aux agents de refactoriser le code pour les contrats partagés, en utilisant `sampleImplementation/models/` et en optimisant les importations pour le serveur et le client, en exploitant React et rg pour une identification efficace des violations de limites et de détection de symboles mobiles","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, den Code für gemeinsame Verträge zu refaktorisieren, indem `sampleImplementation/models/` verwendet und die Importe für Server und Client optimiert werden, und zwar unter Ausnutzung von React und rg für eine effiziente Erkennung von Grenzverletzungen und beweglicher Symbolerkennung","pt":"Habilita os agentes a refatorar o código para contratos compartilhados, utilizando `sampleImplementation/models/` e otimizando as importações para servidor e cliente, aproveitando React e rg para identificação eficiente de violações de limite e detecção de símbolos móveis","ru":"Позволяет агентам рефакторить код для общих контрактов, используя `sampleImplementation/models/` и оптимизируя импорты для сервера и клиента, используя React и rg для эффективной идентификации нарушений границ и обнаружения подвижных символов","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إعادة هيكلة الكود لمواصفات مشتركة، باستخدام `sampleImplementation/models/` وضبط الاستيرادات للخادم والعميل، واستخدام React و rg للكشف الفعال عن انتهاكات الحدود واكتشاف الرموز المتحركة"},"useCases":{"en":["Refactoring React codebases for minimal overhead","Identifying boundary violations in server and client imports","Migrating pure contracts to shared models"],"zh":["为最小化开销而重构React代码库","在服务器和客户端导入中识别边界违规","将纯合同迁移到共享模型"],"ja":["最小のオーバーヘッドでReactコードベースをリファクタリングする","サーバーとクライアントのインポートで境界違反を識別する","純粋な契約を共有モデルに移行する"],"ko":["최소한의 오버헤드로 React 코드베이스를 리팩토링하는 것","서버와 클라이언트의 가져오기에서 경계 위반을 식별","순수 계약을 공유 모델로 마이그레이션"],"es":["Refactorización de bases de código React para una sobrecarga mínima","Identificación de violaciones de límites en importaciones de servidor y cliente","Migración de contratos puros a modelos compartidos"],"fr":["Réfactoration de bases de code React pour une surcharge minimale","Identification de violations de limites dans les importations de serveur et de client","Migration de contrats purs vers des modèles partagés"],"de":["Refaktorisierung von React-Codebasen für minimale Overhead","Identifizierung von Grenzverletzungen in Server- und Client-Importen","Migration von reinen Verträgen zu gemeinsamen Modellen"],"pt":["Refatoração de código React para overhead mínimo","Identificação de violações de limite em importações de servidor e cliente","Migração de contratos puros para modelos compartilhados"],"ru":["Рефакторинг кода React для минимизации overhead","Обнаружение нарушений границ в импортах сервера и клиента","Миграция чистых контрактов в общие модели"],"ar":["إعادة هيكلة الكود React لتحميل زائد أدنى","تحديد انتهاكات الحدود في استيرادات الخادم والعميل","هجرة المواصفات النقية إلى نماذج مشتركة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires React application setup","Limited to JavaScript and React ecosystem","Needs rg for efficient code searching"],"zh":["需要React应用程序设置","仅限于JavaScript和React生态系统","需要rg进行高效的代码搜索"],"ja":["Reactアプリケーションの設定が必要","JavaScriptとReactエコシステムのみに限定される","効率的なコード検索にはrgが必要"],"ko":["React 애플리케이션 설정이 필요","JavaScript와 React 생태계로만 제한","효율적인 코드 검색을 위해 rg가 필요"],"es":["Requiere configuración de aplicación React","Limitado a JavaScript y ecosistema React","Necesita rg para una búsqueda de código eficiente"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration d''application React","Limité à JavaScript et à l''écosystème React","Nécessite rg pour une recherche de code efficace"],"de":["Benötigt React-Anwendungskonfiguration","Begrenzt auf JavaScript und React-Ökosystem","Benötigt rg für eine effiziente Code-Suche"],"pt":["Exige configuração de aplicação React","Limitado ao ecossistema JavaScript e React","Necessita de rg para busca de código eficiente"],"ru":["Требует настройки приложения React","Ограничен экосистемой JavaScript и React","Требует rg для эффективного поиска кода"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد تطبيق React","محدود بنظام JavaScript و React","يحتاج إلى rg للبحث الفعال عن الكود"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"6be48008c697d4398d15706db0ab049ad1e753a0139123d7c695e0db77fb2ae1","qualityScore":27}');
