vs GitHub Copilot","installation de frontend-slides","guide de configuration de frontend-slides"],"de":["KI-Tools für die Entwicklung","wie man GitHub Copilot verwendet","was ist frontend-slides","Alternativen zu GitHub Copilot","frontend-slides vs GitHub Copilot","Installation von frontend-slides","Konfigurationsanleitung für frontend-slides"],"pt":["ferramentas de ia para desenvolvimento","github copilot alternative","como usar github copilot","o que é frontend-slides","desenvolvimento frontend com ia","instalação do frontend-slides","guias de configuração do frontend-slides"],"ru":["инструменты ИИ для разработки","альтернативы github copilot","как использовать github copilot","что такое frontend-slides","разработка frontend с ИИ","установка frontend-slides","руководства по настройке frontend-slides"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للتطوير","بديل ل GitHub Copilot","كيفية استخدام GitHub Copilot","ما هي frontend-slides","تطوير الأمامي مع الذكاء الاصطناعي","تثبيت frontend-slides","دلائل إعداد frontend-slides"]}},"owner":"j7-dev","repo":"everything-github-copilot","repoPath":"j7-dev/everything-github-copilot","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:52:30Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"frontend-slides","description":"Create stunning, animation-rich HTML presentations from scratch or by converting PowerPoint files. Use when the user wants to build a presentation, convert a PPT/PPTX to web, or create slides for a talk/pitch. Helps non-designers discover their aesthetic through visual exploration rather than abstract choices.","bodyPreview":"# Frontend Slides\n\nCreate zero-dependency, animation-rich HTML presentations that run entirely in the browser.\n\nInspired by the visual exploration approach showcased in work by [zarazhangrui](https://github.com/zarazhangrui).\n\n## When to Activate\n\n- Creating a talk deck, pitch deck, workshop deck, or internal presentation\n- Converting `.ppt` or `.pptx` slides into an HTML presentation\n- Improving an existing HTML presentation''s layout, motion, or typography\n- Exploring presentation styles with a","body":"# Frontend Slides\n\nCreate zero-dependency, animation-rich HTML presentations that run entirely in the browser.\n\nInspired by the visual exploration approach showcased in work by [zarazhangrui](https://github.com/zarazhangrui).\n\n## When to Activate\n\n- Creating a talk deck, pitch deck, workshop deck, or internal presentation\n- Converting `.ppt` or `.pptx` slides into an HTML presentation\n- Improving an existing HTML presentation''s layout, motion, or typography\n- Exploring presentation styles with a user who does not know their design preference yet\n\n## Non-Negotiables\n\n1. **Zero dependencies**: default to one self-contained HTML file with inline CSS and JS.\n2. **Viewport fit is mandatory**: every slide must fit inside one viewport with no internal scrolling.\n3. **Show, don''t tell**: use visual previews instead of abstract style questionnaires.\n4. **Distinctive design**: avoid generic purple-gradient, Inter-on-white, template-looking decks.\n5. **Production quality**: keep code commented, accessible, responsive, and performant.\n\nBefore generating, read `STYLE_PRESETS.md` for the viewport-safe CSS base, density limits, preset catalog, and CSS gotchas.\n\n## Workflow\n\n### 1. Detect Mode\n\nChoose one path:\n- **New presentation**: user has a topic, notes, or full draft\n- **PPT conversion**: user has `.ppt` or `.pptx`\n- **Enhancement**: user already has HTML slides and wants improvements\n\n### 2. Discover Content\n\nAsk only the minimum needed:\n- purpose: pitch, teaching, conference talk, internal update\n- length: short (5-10), medium (10-20), long (20+)\n- content state: finished copy, rough notes, topic only\n\nIf the user has content, ask them to paste it before styling.\n\n### 3. Discover Style\n\nDefault to visual exploration.\n\nIf the user already knows the desired preset, skip previews and use it directly.\n\nOtherwise:\n1. Ask what feeling the deck should create: impressed, energized, focused, inspired.\n2. Generate **3 single-slide preview files** in `.ecc-design/slide-previews/`.\n3. Each preview must be self-contained, show typography/color/motion clearly, and stay under roughly 100 lines of slide content.\n4. Ask the user which preview to keep or what elements to mix.\n\nUse the preset guide in `STYLE_PRESETS.md` when mapping mood to style.\n\n### 4. Build the Presentation\n\nOutput either:\n- `presentation.html`\n- `[presentation-name].html`\n\nUse an `assets/` folder only when the deck contains extracted or user-supplied images.\n\nRequired structure:\n- semantic slide sections\n- a viewport-safe CSS base from `STYLE_PRESETS.md`\n- CSS custom properties for theme values\n- a presentation controller class for keyboard, wheel, and touch navigation\n- Intersection Observer for reveal animations\n- reduced-motion support\n\n### 5. Enforce Viewport Fit\n\nTreat this as a hard gate.\n\nRules:\n- every `.slide` must use `height: 100vh; height: 100dvh; overflow: hidden;`\n- all type and spacing must scale with `clamp()`\n- when content does not fit, split into multiple slides\n- never solve overflow by shrinking text below readable sizes\n- never allow scrollbars inside a slide\n\nUse the density limits and mandatory CSS block in `STYLE_PRESETS.md`.\n\n### 6. Validate\n\nCheck the finished deck at these sizes:\n- 1920x1080\n- 1280x720\n- 768x1024\n- 375x667\n- 667x375\n\nIf browser automation is available, use it to verify no slide overflows and that keyboard navigation works.\n\n### 7. Deliver\n\nAt handoff:\n- delete temporary preview files unless the user wants to keep them\n- open the deck with the platform-appropriate opener when useful\n- summarize file path, preset used, slide count, and easy theme customization points\n\nUse the correct opener for the current OS:\n- macOS: `open file.html`\n- Linux: `xdg-open file.html`\n- Windows: `start \"\" file.html`\n\n## PPT / PPTX Conversion\n\nFor PowerPoint conversion:\n1. Prefer `python3` with `python-pptx` to extract text, images, and notes.\n2. If `python-pptx` is unavailable, ask whether to install it or fall back to a manual/export-based workflow.\n3. Preserve slide order, speaker notes, and extracted assets.\n4. After extraction, run the same style-selection workflow as a new presentation.\n\nKeep conversion cross-platform. Do not rely on macOS-only tools when Python can do the job.\n\n## Implementation Requirements\n\n### HTML / CSS\n\n- Use inline CSS and JS unless the user explicitly wants a multi-file project.\n- Fonts may come from Google Fonts or Fontshare.\n- Prefer atmospheric backgrounds, strong type hierarchy, and a clear visual direction.\n- Use abstract shapes, gradients, grids, noise, and geometry rather than illustrations.\n\n### JavaScript\n\nInclude:\n- keyboard navigation\n- touch / swipe navigation\n- mouse wheel navigation\n- progress indicator or slide index\n- reveal-on-enter animation triggers\n\n### Accessibility\n\n- use semantic structure (`main`, `section`, `nav`)\n- keep contrast readable\n- support keyboard-only navigation\n- respect `prefers-reduced-motion`\n\n## Content Density Limits\n\nUse these maxima unless the user explicitly asks for denser slides and readability still holds:\n\n| Slide type | Limit |\n|------------|-------|\n| Title | 1 heading + 1 subtitle + optional tagline |\n| Content | 1 heading + 4-6 bullets or 2 short paragraphs |\n| Feature grid | 6 cards max |\n| Code | 8-10 lines max |\n| Quote | 1 quote + attribution |\n| Image | 1 image constrained by viewport |\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n- generic startup gradients with no visual identity\n- system-font decks unless intentionally editorial\n- long bullet walls\n- code blocks that need scrolling\n- fixed-height content boxes that break on short screens\n- invalid negated CSS functions like `-clamp(...)`\n\n## Related ECC Skills\n\n- `frontend-patterns` for component and interaction patterns around the deck\n- `liquid-glass-design` when a presentation intentionally borrows Apple glass aesthetics\n- `e2e-testing` if you need automated browser verification for the final deck\n\n## Deliverable Checklist\n\n- presentation runs from a local file in a browser\n- every slide fits the viewport without scrolling\n- style is distinctive and intentional\n- animation is meaningful, not noisy\n- reduced motion is respected\n- file paths and customization points are explained at handoff\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T04:00:19.193Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents needing to create interactive, animation-rich HTML presentations that run entirely in the browser.","zh":"非常适合需要创建交互式、动画丰富的HTML演示文档的AI代理，这些文档可以完全在浏览器中运行。","ja":"ブラウザ内で完全に実行されるインタラクティブでアニメーション豊かなHTMLプレゼンテーションを作成する必要があるAIエージェントに最適です。","ko":"브라우저 내에서 완전히 실행되는 상호 작용형, 애니메이션豊かな HTML 프레젠테이션을 생성해야 하는 AI 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA que necesitan crear presentaciones interactivas y ricas en animación en HTML que se ejecutan completamente en el navegador.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA ayant besoin de créer des présentations interactives et riches en animation en HTML qui s''exécutent entièrement dans le navigateur.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die interaktive, animationsreiche HTML-Präsentationen erstellen müssen, die komplett im Browser ausgeführt werden.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA que precisam criar apresentações interativas e ricas em animações em HTML que funcionam totalmente no navegador.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, которым необходимо создавать интерактивные, анимированные презентации HTML, которые работают полностью в браузере.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الأي أي الذي يحتاج إلى إنشاء عروض تقديمية تفاعلية وغنية بالرسوم المتحركة في HTML تعمل بالكامل في المتصفح."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate zero-dependency, animation-rich HTML presentations using HTML, enabling the creation of engaging talk decks, pitch decks, and internal presentations with improved layout, motion, and typography, all while supporting conversion from .ppt or .pptx formats.","zh":"赋予代理创建零依赖、动画丰富的HTML演示文档的能力，使用HTML，实现创建引人入胜的演讲稿、推销稿和内部演示文档，具有改进的布局、动作和排版，同时支持从.ppt或.pptx格式转换。","ja":"HTMLを使用して、ゼロ依存のアニメーション豊かなHTMLプレゼンテーションを作成するエージェントを可能にし、レイアウト、モーション、タイポグラフィーが改善された魅力的なトークデッキ、ピッチデッキ、内部プレゼンテーションを作成できるようにし、.pptまたは.pptx形式からの変換もサポートします。","ko":"HTML을 사용하여 의존성 없는 애니메이션豊かな HTML 프레젠테이션을 생성할 수 있는 에이전트를 가능하게 하여, 레이아웃, 모션, 타이포그래피가 개선된 매력적인 토크 데크, 피치 데크, 내부 프레젠테이션을 생성할 수 있으며, .ppt 또는 .pptx 형식에서 변환하는 것도 지원합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar presentaciones en HTML ricas en animación y sin dependencias utilizando HTML, lo que permite la creación de decks de presentación atractivos, decks de presentación y presentaciones internas con un diseño mejorado, movimiento y tipografía, todo mientras se admite la conversión desde formatos .ppt o .pptx.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des présentations HTML riches en animation et sans dépendance en utilisant HTML, ce qui permet de créer des présentations de conférence engageantes, des présentations de vente et des présentations internes avec une mise en page, un mouvement et une typographie améliorés, le tout en prenant en charge la conversion à partir des formats .ppt ou .pptx.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, Zero-Abhängigkeits-, animationsreiche HTML-Präsentationen mit HTML zu generieren, wodurch die Erstellung von ansprechenden Vortrags-Decks, Pitch-Decks und internen Präsentationen mit verbessertem Layout, Bewegung und Typografie ermöglicht wird, und zwar bei gleichzeitiger Unterstützung der Konvertierung aus .ppt- oder .pptx-Formaten.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar apresentações de HTML ricas em animações e sem dependências, usando HTML, permitindo a criação de decks de apresentação atraentes, decks de apresentação e apresentações internas com layout, movimento e tipografia melhorados, além de suportar a conversão de formatos .ppt ou .pptx.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать презентации HTML с нулевой зависимостью и богатыми анимациями, используя HTML, что позволяет создавать привлекательные докладные, презентационные и внутренние презентации с улучшенным макетом, движением и типографией, а также поддерживает преобразование из форматов .ppt или .pptx.","ar":"تمكن العملاء من توليد عروض تقديمية غنية بالرسوم المتحركة وبدون تبعيات باستخدام HTML، مما يسمح بإنشاء عروض تقديمية جذابة وملفتة وذات تصميم داخلي مع تحسينات في التصميم والحركة والطباعة، بالإضافة إلى دعم التحويل من تنسيقات .ppt أو .pptx."},"useCases":{"en":["Creating interactive talk decks with animation-rich slides","Converting .pptx files to HTML presentations for web deployment","Enhancing existing HTML presentations with advanced motion and typography"],"zh":["使用动画丰富的幻灯片创建交互式演讲稿","将.pptx文件转换为HTML演示文档以部署到Web","使用高级动作和排版来增强现有的HTML演示文档"],"ja":["アニメーション豊かなスライドを使用してインタラクティブなトークデッキを作成する",".pptxファイルをHTMLプレゼンテーションに変換してWebにデプロイする","高級なモーションとタイポグラフィーを使用して既存のHTMLプレゼンテーションを強化する"],"ko":["애니메이션豊かな 슬라이드를 사용하여 상호 작용형 토크 데크를 생성하는 것",".pptx 파일을 HTML 프레젠테이션으로 변환하여 웹에 배포하는 것","고급 모션과 타이포그래피를 사용하여 기존의 HTML 프레젠테이션을 강화하는 것"],"es":["Creación de decks de presentación interactivos con diapositivas ricas en animación","Conversión de archivos .pptx a presentaciones HTML para implementación web","Mejora de presentaciones HTML existentes con movimiento y tipografía avanzados"],"fr":["Création de présentations de conférence interactives avec des diapositives riches en animation","Conversion de fichiers .pptx en présentations HTML pour un déploiement web","Amélioration de présentations HTML existantes avec un mouvement et une typographie avancés"],"de":["Erstellung interaktiver Vortrags-Decks mit animationsreichen Folien","Konvertierung von .pptx-Dateien in HTML-Präsentationen für die Webbereitstellung","Verbesserung bestehender HTML-Präsentationen mit fortschrittlichem Bewegungs- und Typografie-Design"],"pt":["Criar decks de apresentação interativos com slides ricos em animações","Converter arquivos .pptx em apresentações de HTML para implantação na web","Melhorar apresentações de HTML existentes com movimento e tipografia avançados"],"ru":["Создание интерактивных докладных с анимированными слайдами","Преобразование файлов .pptx в презентации HTML для веб-развертывания","Улучшение существующих презентаций HTML с помощью продвинутого движения и типографии"],"ar":["إنشاء عروض تقديمية تفاعلية مع شرائح غنية بالرسوم المتحركة","تحويل ملفات .pptx إلى عروض تقديمية HTML لنشرها على الويب","تحسين عروض تقديمية HTML موجودة مع حركة وطباعة متقدمة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires browser compatibility for HTML presentations","Limited to frontend presentation development"],"zh":["需要浏览器兼容性来运行HTML演示文档","仅限前端演示文档开发"],"ja":["HTMLプレゼンテーションを実行するためのブラウザーの互換性が必要","フロントエンドプレゼンテーション開発のみ"],"ko":["HTML 프레젠테이션을 실행하기 위한 브라우저 호환성이 필요","프론트엔드 프레젠테이션 개발만"],"es":["Requiere compatibilidad del navegador para presentaciones HTML","Limitado al desarrollo de presentaciones frontend"],"fr":["Nécessite une compatibilité du navigateur pour les présentations HTML","Limité au développement de présentations frontend"],"de":["Benötigt Browser-Kompatibilität für HTML-Präsentationen","Befristet auf die Entwicklung von Frontend-Präsentationen"],"pt":["Exige compatibilidade do navegador para apresentações de HTML","Limitado ao desenvolvimento de apresentações de frontend"],"ru":["Требует совместимости браузера для презентаций HTML","Ограничен разработкой презентаций frontend"],"ar":["يتطلب توافق المتصفح مع عروض تقديمية HTML","محدود بتطوير عروض تقديمية واجهة المستخدم"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"da378954096f51844ab9214d6ae30f317d7f5373af41fbc7e989d20518adb9b8","qualityScore":27}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('aboustayyef/InfraRead/livewire-development', 'community', 'aboustayyef', 'InfraRead', 'aboustayyef/InfraRead', 'livewire-development', 52, 6, 26, '2026-02-17T11:16:52Z', '2026-02-28T12:48:05.122Z', '67f18b250f9b57e2e4b30f45f05f8ccb2f8e67a11e98b57bff9a01467dff54df', '{"id":"aboustayyef/InfraRead/livewire-development","name":"livewire-development","description":{"zh":"Livewire开发是一种自托管网页订阅阅读器和同步服务，使用Laravel和VueJs构建。它支持Bulma和Minimal设计，提供简洁的阅读体验","ja":"Livewire開発は、LaravelとVueJsで構築されたセルフホスト型Webフィードリーダーと同期サービスです。BulmaとMinimalデザインをサポートし、シンプルな読み込み体験を提供します","ko":"Livewire 개발은 Laravel과 VueJs로 구축된 셀프 호스팅 웹 피드 리더와 동기화 서비스입니다. Bulma와 Minimal 디자인을 지원하며, 심플한 읽기 경험을 제공합니다","es":"Livewire es una herramienta de lectura de feed web autónoma construida con Laravel y VueJs, que ofrece una solución minimalista para leer y sincronizar feeds web.","fr":"Livewire est un lecteur de flux web autonome basé sur Laravel et VueJs, offrant une solution minimaliste pour lire et synchroniser les flux web.","de":"Livewire ist ein selbstgehosteter Web-Feed-Reader mit Laravel und VueJs, der eine minimalistische Lösung zum Lesen und Synchronisieren von Web-Feeds bietet.","pt":"Livewire é um leitor de feed web autossuficiente construído com Laravel e VueJs, oferecendo recursos de sincronização para desenvolvedores.","ru":"Livewire - это самодостаточный веб-ридер ленты, построенный на Laravel и VueJs, предлагающий функции синхронизации для разработчиков.","ar":"Livewire هو قارئ ويب إعلامي مستضاف ذاتيًا مبني على Laravel و VueJs، يقدم ميزات التزامن للمطورين.","en":"A Self-Hosted Web Feed Reader and Sync Service Built with Laravel and VueJs"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"AIエージェント：Laravel和VueJs的自托管网页订阅阅读器和同步服务","ja":"AIエージェント：LaravelとVueJsのセルフホスト型Webフィードリーダーと同期サービス","ko":"AI 에이전트: Laravel과 VueJs의 셀프 호스팅 웹 피드 리더와 동기화 서비스","es":"Desarrollo de Livewire: Herram