feed","instalar livewire","guia de configuração do livewire","desenvolvimento de aplicativos web com livewire","livewire e laravel","livewire e vuejs"],"ru":["как использовать livewire","что такое livewire","альтернативы для livewire","livewire vs другие читатели ленты","установить livewire","руководство по настройке livewire","разработка веб-приложений с livewire","livewire и laravel","livewire и vuejs"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام livewire","ما هو livewire","بديلات ل livewire","livewire مقابل قراء أخرى","تثبيت livewire","دليل إعداد livewire","تطوير تطبيقات الويب مع livewire","livewire و laravel","livewire و vuejs"]}},"owner":"aboustayyef","repo":"InfraRead","repoPath":"aboustayyef/InfraRead","stars":52,"forks":6,"updatedAt":"2026-02-17T11:16:52Z","topics":["bulma","laravel","minimal","rss-reader","unread","vuejs","webapp"],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"livewire-development","description":">-","bodyPreview":"# Livewire Development\n\n## When to Apply\n\nActivate this skill when:\n- Creating new Livewire components\n- Modifying existing component state or behavior\n- Debugging reactivity or lifecycle issues\n- Writing Livewire component tests\n- Adding Alpine.js interactivity to components\n- Working with wire: directives\n\n## Documentation\n\nUse `search-docs` for detailed Livewire 3 patterns and documentation.\n\n## Basic Usage\n\n### Creating Components\n\nUse the `php artisan make:livewire [Posts\\CreatePost]` Artis","body":"# Livewire Development\n\n## When to Apply\n\nActivate this skill when:\n- Creating new Livewire components\n- Modifying existing component state or behavior\n- Debugging reactivity or lifecycle issues\n- Writing Livewire component tests\n- Adding Alpine.js interactivity to components\n- Working with wire: directives\n\n## Documentation\n\nUse `search-docs` for detailed Livewire 3 patterns and documentation.\n\n## Basic Usage\n\n### Creating Components\n\nUse the `php artisan make:livewire [Posts\\CreatePost]` Artisan command to create new components.\n\n### Fundamental Concepts\n\n- State should live on the server, with the UI reflecting it.\n- All Livewire requests hit the Laravel backend; they''re like regular HTTP requests. Always validate form data and run authorization checks in Livewire actions.\n\n## Livewire 3 Specifics\n\n### Key Changes From Livewire 2\n\nThese things changed in Livewire 3, but may not have been updated in this application. Verify this application''s setup to ensure you follow existing conventions.\n- Use `wire:model.live` for real-time updates, `wire:model` is now deferred by default.\n- Components now use the `App\\Livewire` namespace (not `App\\Http\\Livewire`).\n- Use `$this->dispatch()` to dispatch events (not `emit` or `dispatchBrowserEvent`).\n- Use the `components.layouts.app` view as the typical layout path (not `layouts.app`).\n\n### New Directives\n\n- `wire:show`, `wire:transition`, `wire:cloak`, `wire:offline`, `wire:target` are available for use.\n\n### Alpine Integration\n\n- Alpine is now included with Livewire; don''t manually include Alpine.js.\n- Plugins included with Alpine: persist, intersect, collapse, and focus.\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### Component Structure\n\n- Livewire components require a single root element.\n- Use `wire:loading` and `wire:dirty` for delightful loading states.\n\n### Using Keys in Loops\n\n<code-snippet name=\"Wire Key in Loops\" lang=\"blade\">\n\n@foreach ($items as $item)\n    <div wire:key=\"item-{{ $item->id }}\">\n        {{ $item->name }}\n    </div>\n@endforeach\n\n</code-snippet>\n\n### Lifecycle Hooks\n\nPrefer lifecycle hooks like `mount()`, `updatedFoo()` for initialization and reactive side effects:\n\n<code-snippet name=\"Lifecycle Hook Examples\" lang=\"php\">\n\npublic function mount(User $user) { $this->user = $user; }\npublic function updatedSearch() { $this->resetPage(); }\n\n</code-snippet>\n\n## JavaScript Hooks\n\nYou can listen for `livewire:init` to hook into Livewire initialization:\n\n<code-snippet name=\"Livewire Init Hook Example\" lang=\"js\">\n\ndocument.addEventListener(''livewire:init'', function () {\n    Livewire.hook(''request'', ({ fail }) => {\n        if (fail && fail.status === 419) {\n            alert(''Your session expired'');\n        }\n    });\n\n    Livewire.hook(''message.failed'', (message, component) => {\n        console.error(message);\n    });\n});\n\n</code-snippet>\n\n## Testing\n\n<code-snippet name=\"Example Livewire Component Test\" lang=\"php\">\n\nLivewire::test(Counter::class)\n    ->assertSet(''count'', 0)\n    ->call(''increment'')\n    ->assertSet(''count'', 1)\n    ->assertSee(1)\n    ->assertStatus(200);\n\n</code-snippet>\n\n<code-snippet name=\"Testing Livewire Component Exists on Page\" lang=\"php\">\n\n$this->get(''/posts/create'')\n    ->assertSeeLivewire(CreatePost::class);\n\n</code-snippet>\n\n## Common Pitfalls\n\n- Forgetting `wire:key` in loops causes unexpected behavior when items change\n- Using `wire:model` expecting real-time updates (use `wire:model.live` instead in v3)\n- Not validating/authorizing in Livewire actions (treat them like HTTP requests)\n- Including Alpine.js separately when it''s already bundled with Livewire 3"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-28T12:48:05.122Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Full-Stack Agents needing advanced Laravel and VueJs development capabilities for building dynamic web applications","zh":"适合需要高级Laravel和VueJs开发能力的全栈代理，用于构建动态Web应用程序","ja":"LaravelとVueJsの高度な開発機能を必要とするフルスタックエージェントに適しています。動的なWebアプリケーションを構築するために","ko":"고급 Laravel 및 VueJs 개발 기능이 필요한 풀스택 에이전트에게 적합합니다. 동적 웹 애플리케이션을 구축하는 데 적합합니다","es":"Perfecto para Agentes Full-Stack que necesitan capacidades de desarrollo avanzadas de Laravel y VueJs para construir aplicaciones web dinámicas","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Full-Stack nécessitant des capacités de développement avancées Laravel et VueJs pour la création d''applications web dynamiques","de":"Perfekt für Full-Stack-Agents, die erweiterte Laravel- und VueJs-Entwicklungsfähigkeiten für den Bau dynamischer Webanwendungen benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Full-Stack que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de desenvolvimento Laravel e VueJs para construir aplicações web dinâmicas","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Full-Stack, которым необходимы расширенные возможности разработки Laravel и VueJs для создания динамических веб-приложений","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء كامل الحزمة الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات متقدمة في تطوير Laravel و VueJs لبناء تطبيقات الويب الديناميكية"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create and manage Livewire components, leveraging Laravel and VueJs for robust and interactive web feed readers and sync services, utilizing wire: directives and Alpine.js interactivity","zh":"赋予代理创建和管理Livewire组件的能力，利用Laravel和VueJs构建强大且交互的Web feed读取器和同步服务，使用wire：指令和Alpine.js交互","ja":"エージェントがLivewireコンポーネントを作成して管理できるようにし、LaravelとVueJsを使用して強力でインタラクティブなWebフィードリーダーと同期サービスを構築します。wire：ディレクティブとAlpine.jsのインタラクティビティを利用","ko":"에이전트가 Livewire 컴포넌트를 생성하고 관리할 수 있도록 하며, Laravel 및 VueJs를 사용하여 강력하고 상호 작용하는 웹 피드 리더 및 동기화 서비스를 구축합니다. wire：지시문 및 Alpine.js 상호 작용을 사용","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear y gestionar componentes de Livewire, aprovechando Laravel y VueJs para lectores de feeds web robustos e interactivos y servicios de sincronización, utilizando directivas wire: y la interactividad de Alpine.js","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer et de gérer des composants Livewire, en exploitant Laravel et VueJs pour des lecteurs de flux Web robustes et interactifs et des services de synchronisation, en utilisant des directives wire: et l''interactivité d''Alpine.js","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, Livewire-Komponenten zu erstellen und zu verwalten, indem Laravel und VueJs für robuste und interaktive Web-Feed-Reader und Synchronisierungsdienste genutzt werden, unter Verwendung von wire:-Direktiven und Alpine.js-Interaktivität","pt":"Permite que os agentes criem e gerenciem componentes Livewire, aproveitando Laravel e VueJs para leitores de feed de web robustos e interativos e serviços de sincronização, utilizando diretrizes wire: e interatividade Alpine.js","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать и управлять компонентами Livewire, используя Laravel и VueJs для создания прочных и интерактивных веб-каналов и синхронизационных сервисов, используя директивы wire: и интерактивность Alpine.js","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من إنشاء وإدارة مكونات Livewire، مستفيدة من Laravel و VueJs لإنشاء قراء تلقيم الويب القوية والتفاعلية وخدمات التزامن، باستخدام توجيهات wire: والتفاعل Alpine.js"},"useCases":{"en":["Creating new Livewire components with php artisan make:livewire","Debugging reactivity or lifecycle issues in existing components","Writing comprehensive Livewire component tests","Adding Alpine.js interactivity to enhance component functionality","Working with wire: directives for seamless data synchronization"],"zh":["使用php artisan make：livewire创建新的Livewire组件","调试现有组件中的响应性或生命周期问题","编写Livewire组件的综合测试","将Alpine.js交互添加到增强组件功能","使用wire：指令实现无缝数据同步"],"ja":["php artisan make：livewireを使用して新しいLivewireコンポーネントを作成する","既存のコンポーネントの反応性またはライフサイクルの問題をデバッグする","Livewireコンポーネントの包括的なテストを書く","コンポーネントの機能を強化するためにAlpine.jsのインタラクティビティを追加する","wire：ディレクティブを使用してシームレスなデータ同期を実現する"],"ko":["php artisan make：livewire를 사용하여 새로운 Livewire 컴포넌트를 생성","기존 컴포넌트의 반응성 또는 생애주기 문제를 디버깅","Livewire 컴포넌트의 포괄적인 테스트를 작성","컴포넌트의 기능을 강화하기 위해 Alpine.js 상호 작용을 추가","wire：지시문을 사용하여 무중단 데이터 동기화를 구현"],"es":["Crear nuevos componentes de Livewire con php artisan make:livewire","Depurar problemas de reactividad o ciclo de vida en componentes existentes","Escribir pruebas de componentes de Livewire exhaustivas","Agregar interactividad de Alpine.js para mejorar la funcionalidad del componente","Trabajar con directivas wire: para una sincronización de datos sin problemas"],"fr":["Créer de nouveaux composants Livewire avec php artisan make:livewire","Déboguer les problèmes de réactivité ou de cycle de vie dans les composants existants","Rédiger des tests de composants Livewire complets","Ajouter une interactivité Alpine.js pour améliorer la fonctionnalité du composant","Travailler avec des directives wire: pour une synchronisation de données sans problème"],"de":["Erstellen neuer Livewire-Komponenten mit php artisan make:livewire","Fehler bei Reaktivität oder Lebenszyklus in bestehenden Komponenten debuggen","Umfassende Livewire-Komponententests schreiben","Alpine.js-Interaktivität hinzufügen, um die Funktionalität des Komponenten zu verbessern","Arbeiten mit wire:-Direktiven für eine reibungslose Datensynchronisation"],"pt":["Criar novos componentes Livewire com php artisan make:livewire","Depurar problemas de reatividade ou ciclo de vida em componentes existentes","Escrever testes abrangentes para componentes Livewire","Adicionar interatividade Alpine.js para melhorar a funcionalidade do componente","Trabalhar com diretrizes wire: para sincronização de dados sem interrupção"],"ru":["Создавать новые компоненты Livewire с помощью php artisan make:livewire","Отлаживать проблемы реактивности или жизненного цикла в существующих компонентах","Писать всесторонние тесты для компонентов Livewire","Добавлять интерактивность Alpine.js для улучшения функциональности компонента","Работать с директивами wire: для бесшовной синхронизации данных"],"ar":["إنشاء مكونات Livewire جديدة باستخدام php artisan make:livewire","تصحيح أخطاء التفاعل أو دورة الحياة في المكونات الحالية","كتابة اختبارات شاملة للمكونات Livewire","إضافة تفاعل Alpine.js لتحسين وظيفة المكون","العمل مع توجيهات wire: من أجل التزامن السلس للبيانات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Laravel and VueJs setup","Limited to Livewire 3 patterns and documentation","Needs php artisan command-line interface access"],"zh":["需要Laravel和VueJs的设置","仅限Livewire 3模式和文档","需要php artisan命令行接口访问"],"ja":["LaravelとVueJsの設定が必要","Livewire 3パターンとドキュメントに限定","php artisanコマンドラインインターフェイスへのアクセスが必要"],"ko":["Laravel 및 VueJs 설정이 필요","Livewire 3 패턴 및 문서에 국한","php artisan 명령줄 인터페이스 액세스가 필요"],"es":["Requiere configuración de Laravel y VueJs","Limitado a patrones y documentación de Livewire 3","Requiere acceso a la interfaz de línea de comandos de php artisan"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration Laravel et VueJs","Limité aux modèles et à la documentation de Livewire 3","Nécessite un accès à l''interface de ligne de commande php artisan"],"de":["Benötigt Laravel- und VueJs-Setup","Begrenzt auf Livewire-3-Muster und -Dokumentation","Benötigt Zugriff auf die php-artisan-Kommandozeilenoberfläche"],"pt":["Requer configuração Laravel e VueJs","Limitado a padrões e documentação Livewire 3","Necessita acesso à interface de linha de comando php artisan"],"ru":["Требует настройки Laravel и VueJs","Ограничен шаблонами и документацией Livewire 3","Требует доступа к командной строке php artisan"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد Laravel و VueJs","محدود بنمطز ووثائق Livewire 3","يتطلب الوصول إلى واجهة سطر الأوامر php artisan"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"67f18b250f9b57e2e4b30f45f05f8ccb2f8e67a11e98b57bff9a01467dff54df","qualityScore":26}');
