thon 개발","특정 사용자 감시","메시지 및 미디어 캡처","주기적인 보고서 생성","SQLite 데이터베이스","명령줄 인터페이스","Telegram 감시 개발 사용법"],"es":["herramientas de IA para monitoreo de Telegram","cómo usar telegram-watch-dev","alternativas a telegram-watch-dev","telegram-watch-dev vs otros monitores de Telegram","instalación de telegram-watch-dev","guía de configuración de telegram-watch-dev","monitoreo de Telegram con Python","uso de Telethon para monitorear Telegram"],"fr":["outils IA pour la surveillance de Telegram","comment utiliser telegram-watch-dev","alternatives à telegram-watch-dev","telegram-watch-dev vs autres moniteurs de Telegram","installation de telegram-watch-dev","guide de configuration de telegram-watch-dev","surveillance de Telegram avec Python","utilisation de Telethon pour surveiller Telegram"],"de":["KI-Tools für die Überwachung von Telegram","wie man telegram-watch-dev verwendet","Alternativen zu telegram-watch-dev","telegram-watch-dev vs andere Überwachungstools für Telegram","Installation von telegram-watch-dev","Konfigurationsanleitung für telegram-watch-dev","Überwachung von Telegram mit Python","Verwendung von Telethon zur Überwachung von Telegram"],"pt":["como usar telegram-watch-dev","o que é telethon","alternativas para telegram-watch-dev","telegram-watch-dev vs telethon","instalar telegram-watch-dev","guia de configuração do telegram-watch-dev"],"ru":["как использовать телеграм-часы","что такое telethon","альтернативы для телеграм-часов","телеграм-часы vs telethon","установка телеграм-часов","руководство по настройке телеграм-часов"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام أداة مراقبة تليجرام","ما هو تيليثون","بديلات لأداة مراقبة تليجرام","أداة مراقبة تليجرام مقابل تيليثون","تثبيت أداة مراقبة تليجرام","دليل إعداد أداة مراقبة تليجرام"]}},"owner":"o1xhack","repo":"telegram-watch","repoPath":"o1xhack/telegram-watch","stars":7,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-13T08:45:30Z","topics":["cli","monitoring","privacy","python","reporting","selfhosted","sqlite","telegram","telegram-client","telethon","watcher"],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"telegram-watch-dev","description":"Develop telegram-watch using a requirements-first workflow (Draft -> Approved -> Implementing -> Done) with minimal, testable changes.","bodyPreview":"When using this skill, ALWAYS follow this workflow:\n\n0) Requirements workflow is mandatory (no exceptions)\n- Source of truth: `docs/requests/`\n- Intake: `docs/inbox.md`\n- Template: `docs/templates/REQ_TEMPLATE.md`\n\n1) Before coding: pick work from Approved requests\n- List `docs/requests/` and find requirements with `Status: Approved`.\n- If multiple exist, choose the lowest-numbered / smallest-scope one unless the user specifies an ID.\n\n2) If there is NO Approved request\n- Read `docs/inbox.md` (i","body":"When using this skill, ALWAYS follow this workflow:\n\n0) Requirements workflow is mandatory (no exceptions)\n- Source of truth: `docs/requests/`\n- Intake: `docs/inbox.md`\n- Template: `docs/templates/REQ_TEMPLATE.md`\n\n1) Before coding: pick work from Approved requests\n- List `docs/requests/` and find requirements with `Status: Approved`.\n- If multiple exist, choose the lowest-numbered / smallest-scope one unless the user specifies an ID.\n\n2) If there is NO Approved request\n- Read `docs/inbox.md` (if present) and/or the user’s latest message.\n- Create ONE new Draft requirement file:\n  - Path: `docs/requests/REQ-YYYYMMDD-###-slug.md`\n  - Content: must follow `docs/templates/REQ_TEMPLATE.md`\n  - Set `Status: Draft`\n- STOP after creating the Draft and ask the user to approve it.\n- Do NOT implement anything until the user confirms approval (Status becomes Approved).\n\n3) When starting implementation of an Approved request\n- Update the chosen REQ:\n  - `Status: Approved` -> `Status: Implementing`\n  - Add a short plan in the REQ (2–6 bullets max).\n- Implement the request strictly as written; avoid unrelated refactors.\n\n4) Build order for MVP code work\n- Implement in this order: `doctor` -> `once` -> `run`.\n\n4.1) README localization rule\n- Any time you add or update content in `README.md`, you must apply the same change (or equivalent translation) to every localized README (`README.zh-Hans.md`, `README.zh-Hant.md`, `README.ja.md`). Language switch links at the top must also stay in sync.\n\n5) After each change set, run validations\n- python -m telegram_watch doctor --config config.toml\n- python -m telegram_watch once --config config.toml --since 10m\n\n6) Completion protocol\n- Ensure all Acceptance Criteria in the REQ and `ACCEPTANCE.md` are satisfied.\n- Update the REQ:\n  - Tick the acceptance checkboxes\n  - Add “What changed” (files touched + brief rationale)\n  - `Status: Implementing` -> `Status: Done`\n\n7) Security / open-source hygiene (never violate)\n- Never print or commit secrets (api_hash, phone, session).\n- Ensure `.gitignore` excludes: `config.toml`, `*.session`, `data/`, `reports/`.\n- Keep data local by default; do not add cloud dependencies unless explicitly approved.\n\n8) Commit protocol\n- When the user says “commit”, always include both a summary and a description in the commit message.\n- Use this format:\n  - `git commit -m \"SUMMARY\" -m \"DETAILS\"`\n  - SUMMARY: short, action-oriented, and specific.\n  - DETAILS: 2–6 bullets or sentences describing key changes, ordered by importance.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-26T08:36:09.105Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Social Media Monitoring Agents requiring advanced Telegram data capture and analysis capabilities powered by Telethon","zh":"适用于需要高级 Telegram 数据捕获和分析能力的社交媒体监控代理，powered by Telethon","ja":"Telethon を使用した高度な Telegram データのキャプチャおよび分析機能を必要とするソーシャルメディアモニタリングエージェントに最適","ko":"Telethon을 사용한 고급 Telegram 데이터 캡처 및 분석 기능을 요구하는 소셜 미디어 모니터링 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Monitoreo de Medios Sociales que requieren capacidades avanzadas de captura y análisis de datos de Telegram impulsadas por Telethon","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents de Surveillance des Médias Sociaux nécessitant des capacités de capture et d''analyse de données Telegram avancées alimentées par Telethon","de":"Ideal für Social Media Monitoring Agenten, die erweiterte Telegram-Datenerfassungs- und Analysefunktionen benötigen, die von Telethon angetrieben werden","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Monitoramento de Mídia Social que exigem capacidades avançadas de captura e análise de dados do Telegram impulsionadas pelo Telethon","ru":"Идеально для агентов мониторинга социальных сетей, требующих передовых возможностей сбора и анализа данных Telegram, работающих на Telethon","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء مراقبة وسائل الإعلام الاجتماعية التي تتطلب قدرات متقدمة لالتقاط البيانات وتحليلها في تليجرام مدعومة من Telethon"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to monitor specific Telegram users and channels, capturing messages and media into SQLite databases and generating periodic HTML reports via Telethon, leveraging SQLite for data storage and HTML for report generation","zh":"赋予代理监控特定 Telegram 用户和频道的能力，捕获消息和媒体到 SQLite 数据库，并通过 Telethon 生成周期性的 HTML 报告，利用 SQLite 进行数据存储和 HTML 进行报告生成","ja":"Telethon を使用して、特定の Telegram ユーザーとチャンネルを監視し、メッセージとメディアを SQLite データベースにキャプチャし、周期的な HTML レポートを生成するエージェントをエンパワーメントします。SQLite を使用したデータストレージと HTML を使用したレポート生成を活用","ko":"Telethon을 사용하여 특정 Telegram 사용자와 채널을 모니터링하고, 메시지와 미디어를 SQLite 데이터베이스에 캡처하여 주기적인 HTML 보고서를 생성하는 에이전트를 강화합니다. SQLite를 사용한 데이터 저장소와 HTML을 사용한 보고서 생성을 활용","es":"Habilita a los agentes para monitorear usuarios y canales de Telegram específicos, capturando mensajes y medios en bases de datos SQLite y generando informes periódicos HTML a través de Telethon, aprovechando SQLite para el almacenamiento de datos y HTML para la generación de informes","fr":"Permet aux agents de surveiller des utilisateurs et des canaux Telegram spécifiques, en capturant des messages et des médias dans des bases de données SQLite et en générant des rapports HTML périodiques via Telethon, en exploitant SQLite pour le stockage de données et HTML pour la génération de rapports","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, bestimmte Telegram-Benutzer und -Kanäle zu überwachen, Nachrichten und Medien in SQLite-Datenbanken zu erfassen und periodische HTML-Berichte über Telethon zu generieren, indem SQLite für die DatenSpeicherung und HTML für die Berichtsgenerierung genutzt wird","pt":"Habilita os agentes a monitorar usuários e canais específicos do Telegram, capturando mensagens e mídia em bancos de dados SQLite e gerando relatórios HTML periódicos via Telethon, utilizando SQLite para armazenamento de dados e HTML para geração de relatórios","ru":"Позволяет агентам мониторить конкретных пользователей и каналы Telegram, захватывая сообщения и медиа в базы данных SQLite и генерируя периодические отчеты HTML через Telethon, используя SQLite для хранения данных и HTML для генерации отчетов","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من مراقبة مستخدمي تليجرام والقنوات المحددة، والتقاط الرسائل ووسائل الإعلام في قواعد بيانات SQLite وتوليد تقارير HTML دورية عبر Telethon، واستخدام SQLite لتخزين البيانات و HTML لتوليد التقارير"},"useCases":{"en":["Monitoring target groups for specific keywords","Capturing and analyzing user-generated media in Telegram channels","Generating periodic HTML reports for social media insights"],"zh":["监控目标群组中的特定关键词","捕获和分析 Telegram 频道中的用户生成媒体","为社交媒体洞察生成周期性的 HTML 报告"],"ja":["特定のキーワードを含むターゲットグループの監視","Telegram チャンネル内のユーザー生成メディアのキャプチャおよび分析","ソーシャルメディアの洞察を得るために周期的な HTML レポートを生成"],"ko":["특정 키워드를 포함하는 대상 그룹의 모니터링","Telegram 채널 내의 사용자 생성 미디어의 캡처 및 분석","소셜 미디어의 통찰력을 얻기 위해 주기적인 HTML 보고서를 생성"],"es":["Monitoreo de grupos objetivo para palabras clave específicas","Captura y análisis de medios generados por usuarios en canales de Telegram","Generación de informes periódicos HTML para información de medios sociales"],"fr":["Surveillance de groupes cibles pour des mots-clés spécifiques","Capture et analyse de médias générés par les utilisateurs dans les canaux Telegram","Génération de rapports HTML périodiques pour les informations de médias sociaux"],"de":["Überwachung von Zielgruppen für bestimmte Schlüsselwörter","Erfassung und Analyse von benutzergenerierten Medien in Telegram-Kanälen","Generierung von periodischen HTML-Berichten für Social-Media-Einblicke"],"pt":["Monitoramento de grupos-alvo para palavras-chave específicas","Captura e análise de mídia gerada por usuários em canais do Telegram","Geração de relatórios HTML periódicos para insights de mídia social"],"ru":["Мониторинг целевых групп для конкретных ключевых слов","Захват и анализ пользовательской медиа в каналах Telegram","Генерация периодических отчетов HTML для социальных медиа-инсайтов"],"ar":["مراقبة المجموعات المستهدفة للكلمات الرئيسية المحددة","التقاط وتحليل الوسائط التي ينشئها المستخدمون في قنوات تليجرام","توليد تقارير HTML دورية لأفكار وسائل الإعلام الاجتماعية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Telethon library","SQLite database setup needed","Must follow specific workflow for request approval and intake"],"zh":["需要 Telethon 库","需要设置 SQLite 数据库","必须遵循特定的工作流程进行请求批准和接收"],"ja":["Telethon ライブラリが必要","SQLite データベースのセットアップが必要","特定のワークフローに従ってリクエストの承認と受信を行う必要がある"],"ko":["Telethon 라이브러리가 필요","SQLite 데이터베이스 설정이 필요","특정 워크플로우를 따라 요청 승인 및 수신을 수행해야 함"],"es":["Requiere la biblioteca Telethon","Configuración de base de datos SQLite necesaria","Debe seguir un flujo de trabajo específico para la aprobación y recepción de solicitudes"],"fr":["Nécessite la bibliothèque Telethon","Configuration de base de données SQLite nécessaire","Doit suivre un flux de travail spécifique pour l''approbation et la réception des demandes"],"de":["Benötigt die Telethon-Bibliothek","SQLite-Datenbank-Setup erforderlich","Muss einem bestimmten Workflow für die Anfragegenehmigung und -entgegennahme folgen"],"pt":["Requer a biblioteca Telethon","Configuração do banco de dados SQLite necessária","Deve seguir um fluxo de trabalho específico para aprovação e intake de solicitação"],"ru":["Требуется библиотека Telethon","Необходима настройка базы данных SQLite","Должно следовать определенному рабочему процессу для утверждения и приема запроса"],"ar":["يتطلب مكتبة Telethon","تكوين قاعدة بيانات SQLite ضروري","يجب اتباع سير عمل محدد للموافقة والاستلام الطلب"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"25b838c2495257daa4f55e0974b32aacd795fa4de5cdbd0c64142ede56a9db6f","qualityScore":26}');
