 auto-curación AI: Tema SeaShells para Oma...","fr":"Outils d''auto-réparation IA : Thème SeaShells pour Omarchy","de":"AI-Selbstheilungstools: SeaShells-Thema für Omarchy","pt":"Ferramentas de IA: Tema SeaShells para Omarchy","ru":"ИИ Агенты: Темы SeaShells для Omarchy","ar":"أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي:سمة SeaShells ل Omarchy","en":"self-heal"},"description":{"zh":"SeaShells主题为omarchy提供了一种舒缓的海洋色彩方案，包括深色和浅色变体","ja":"SeaShellsテーマはomarchyに海洋色を提供し、ダークとライトのバリエーションを含みます","ko":"SeaShells 테마는 omarchy에 바다 색상을 제공하며, 다크와 라이트 변형을 포함합니다","es":"Tema SeaShells para Omarchy con colores inspirados en el océano y variantes oscuras y claras para una experiencia de escritorio cohesiva","fr":"Thème SeaShells pour Omarchy avec des couleurs inspirées par l''océan et des variantes sombres et claires pour une expérience de bureau cohérente","de":"SeaShells-Thema für Omarchy mit ozeaninspirierten Farben und dunklen und hellen Varianten für eine kohärente Desktop-Erfahrung","pt":"O tema SeaShells para Omarchy é uma paleta de cores inspirada no tema clássico do terminal SeaShells, com tons de azul e bege.","ru":"Тема SeaShells для Omarchy - это цветовая палитра, вдохновленная классической темой терминала SeaShells, с теплыми бежевыми и прохладными циановыми тонами.","ar":"سمة SeaShells ل Omarchy هي لوحة ألوان مستوحاة من سمة الطرفية الكلاسيكية SeaShells، مع درجات الأزرق والبيج.","en":"SeaShells theme for omarchy - A soothing oceanic colorscheme with dark and light variants. Features warm beige and cool cyan tones inspired   by the classic ..."},"definition":{"en":"SeaShells theme for omarchy - A soothing oceanic colorscheme with dark and light variants. Features warm beige and cool cyan tones inspired   by the classic SeaShells terminal theme. Includes configurations for Hyprland, Neovim, Kitty, Alacritty, Waybar, and more. Complete omarchy   theme pack for a cohesive desktop experience."},"features":{"zh":["舒缓的海洋色彩方案","深色和浅色变体","支持Hyprland、Neovim、Kitty、Alacritty等","完整的omarchy主题包","优化的桌面体验"],"ja":["海洋色のカラースキーム","ダークとライトのバリエーション","Hyprland、Neovim、Kitty、Alacritty等のサポート","omarchyテーマの完全パック","最適化されたデスクトップ体験"],"ko":["바다 색상의 색상 스키마","다크와 라이트 변형","Hyprland, Neovim, Kitty, Alacritty 등의 지원","omarchy 테마의 완전한 팩","최적화된 데스크톱 경험"],"es":["Colores inspirados en el océano","Variantes oscuras y claras","Compatibilidad con Hyprland, Neovim, Kitty, Alacritty y Waybar","Experiencia de escritorio cohesiva","Tema de diseño personalizable"],"fr":["Couleurs inspirées par l''océan","Variantes sombres et claires","Compatibilité avec Hyprland, Neovim, Kitty, Alacritty et Waybar","Expérience de bureau cohérente","Thème de conception personnalisable"],"de":["Ozeaninspirierte Farben","Dunkle und helle Varianten","Kompatibilität mit Hyprland, Neovim, Kitty, Alacritty und Waybar","Kohärente Desktop-Erfahrung","Anpassbares Design-Thema"],"pt":["Tons de azul e bege inspirados no tema clássico do terminal SeaShells","Configurações para Hyprland, Neovim, Kitty, Alacritty, Waybar e mais","Pacote de temas completo para Omarchy","Experiência de desktop coesa","Variações claras e escuras"],"ru":["Теплые бежевые и прохладные циановые тона, вдохновленные классической темой терминала SeaShells","Конфигурации для Hyprland, Neovim, Kitty, Alacritty, Waybar и более","Полный пакет тем для Omarchy","Сплоченный опыт рабочего стола","Светлые и темные вариации"],"ar":["درجات الأزرق والبيج الملهمة من سمة الطرفية الكلاسيكية SeaShells","إعدادات ل Hyprland، Neovim، Kitty، Alacritty، Waybar وغيرها","حزمة سمة كاملة ل Omarchy","تجربة سطح المكتب متكاملة","متغيرات خفيفة وغامقة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能代理","自愈功能","SeaShells主题","omarchy桌面","如何使用SeaShells主题","什么是AI智能代理","SeaShells主题安装","omarchy主题设置指南"],"ja":["AIエージェント","セルフヒール機能","SeaShellsテーマ","omarchyデスクトップ","SeaShellsテーマの使い方","AIエージェントとは","SeaShellsテーマのインストール","omarchyテーマの設定ガイド"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","셀프 힐 기능","SeaShells 테마","omarchy 데스크톱","SeaShells 테마 사용법","AI 에이전트란","SeaShells 테마 설치","omarchy 테마 설정 가이드"],"es":["herramientas de auto-curación AI","tema SeaShells para Omarchy","colores inspirados en el océano","variantes oscuras y claras","cómo instalar SeaShells","guía de configuración de Omarchy"],"fr":["outils d''auto-réparation IA","thème SeaShells pour Omarchy","couleurs inspirées par l''océan","variantes sombres et claires","comment installer SeaShells","guide de configuration d''Omarchy"],"de":["AI-Selbstheilungstools","SeaShells-Thema für Omarchy","ozeaninspirierte Farben","dunkle und helle Varianten","wie man SeaShells installiert","Omarchy-Konfigurationsanleitung"],"pt":["como usar o tema SeaShells","o que é o tema SeaShells","tema SeaShells para Omarchy","tema SeaShells alternativa","tema SeaShells vs tema clássico","instalar tema SeaShells","guia de configuração do tema SeaShells"],"ru":["как использовать тему SeaShells","что такое тема SeaShells","тема SeaShells для Omarchy","альтернативная тема SeaShells","тема SeaShells vs классическая тема","установка темы SeaShells","руководство по настройке темы SeaShells"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام سمة SeaShells","ما هي سمة SeaShells","سمة SeaShells ل Omarchy","بديل سمة SeaShells","سمة SeaShells مقابل سمة كلاسيكية","تثبيت سمة SeaShells","دليل إعداد سمة SeaShells"]}},"owner":"odysseyalive","repo":"omarchy-seashells-theme","repoPath":"odysseyalive/omarchy-seashells-theme","stars":2,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-26T20:53:42Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"self-heal","description":"Ambient friction detection and surgical skill correction. Embeds into all skills. Triggers at task resolution when skill instructions caused friction.","bodyPreview":"# Self-Heal\n\nQuiet companion skill. Watches for friction caused by skill instructions during live sessions. At task resolution, diagnoses root cause and proposes surgical fixes with user approval.\n\n**This skill does not run on demand.** It is embedded into other skills as an observer. When it detects a fixable source of friction, it surfaces automatically.\n\n---\n\n## Directives\n\n> **\"Updates to skills must be surgical -- one specific instruction, smallest possible change, nothing more.\"**\n\n*— Adde","body":"# Self-Heal\n\nQuiet companion skill. Watches for friction caused by skill instructions during live sessions. At task resolution, diagnoses root cause and proposes surgical fixes with user approval.\n\n**This skill does not run on demand.** It is embedded into other skills as an observer. When it detects a fixable source of friction, it surfaces automatically.\n\n---\n\n## Directives\n\n> **\"Updates to skills must be surgical -- one specific instruction, smallest possible change, nothing more.\"**\n\n*— Added 2026-02-26, source: system directive*\n\n> **\"Nothing is written to a skill file without explicit user approval and a visible before/after diff.\"**\n\n*— Added 2026-02-26, source: system directive*\n\n> **\"Self-heal never modifies directives. Directives are sacred. Only workflow instructions, context descriptions, and clarifying language are in scope.\"**\n\n*— Added 2026-02-26, source: system directive*\n\n---\n\n## Review Command\n\nWhen invoked as `/self-heal review`:\n\n1. List all skills that have the self-heal observer embedded\n2. Show count of friction events logged per skill (read each skill''s `self-heal-history.md` if it exists)\n3. Show count of patches applied vs. declined per skill\n4. Flag skills missing the observer — offer to embed\n\n---\n\n## Grounding\n\nBefore executing any diagnosis or update:\n1. Read the relevant file from `references/`\n2. State: \"I will use [PROTOCOL] from references/[file] under [SECTION]\"\n\nReference files:\n- [references/friction-signals.md](references/friction-signals.md) — Complete friction signal taxonomy\n- [references/diagnosis-protocol.md](references/diagnosis-protocol.md) — Root cause tracing procedure\n- [references/update-protocol.md](references/update-protocol.md) — Diff construction and approval workflow\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-27T01:58:18.469Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents like Cursor, Windsurf, and Claude Code needing automated friction detection and resolution capabilities.","zh":"非常适合像Cursor、Windsurf和Claude Code这样的AI代理，需要自动检测和解决摩擦问题的能力。","ja":"Cursor、Windsurf、Claude CodeなどのAIエージェントに適しています。自動的な摩擦検出および解決の機能が必要です。","ko":"Cursor, Windsurf, Claude Code와 같은 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다. 자동 마찰 감지 및 해결 기능이 필요합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA como Cursor, Windsurf y Claude Code que necesitan capacidades de detección y resolución de fricción automatizadas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA comme Cursor, Windsurf et Claude Code nécessitant des capacités de détection et de résolution de friction automatisées.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents wie Cursor, Windsurf und Claude Code, die automatisierte Reibungserkennungs- und Lösungsfähigkeiten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA como Cursor, Windsurf e Claude Code que necessitam de capacidades de detecção e resolução de atrito automatizadas.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, таких как Cursor, Windsurf и Claude Code, требующих автоматизированных возможностей обнаружения и устранения трения.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي مثل Cursor و Windsurf و Claude Code الذين يحتاجون إلىقدرات الكشف والتصحيح الآلي للاحتكاك."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to diagnose root causes of friction and propose surgical fixes with user approval, leveraging observer capabilities to surface automatic fixes during live sessions, utilizing configurations for Hyprland, Neovim, Kitty, Alacritty, and Waybar.","zh":"赋予代理诊断摩擦的根源并提出外科手术修复方案，需要用户批准，利用观察者功能在实时会话期间提供自动修复，利用Hyprland、Neovim、Kitty、Alacritty和Waybar的配置。","ja":"エージェントに摩擦の根本原因を診断し、外科的修正を提案する能力を与え、ユーザーの承認を必要とし、観測者機能を使用してリアルタイムセッション中に自動修正を提供し、Hyprland、Neovim、Kitty、Alacritty、Waybarの設定を利用します。","ko":"에이전트에 마찰의 근본 원인을 진단하고 외과적 수정을 제안하는 능력을 주어, 사용자의 승인이 필요하고, 관찰자 기능을 사용하여 실시간 세션 중에 자동 수정을 제공하며, Hyprland, Neovim, Kitty, Alacritty, Waybar의 설정을 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a diagnosticar las causas raíz de la fricción y proponer soluciones quirúrgicas con aprobación del usuario, aprovechando las capacidades del observador para mostrar soluciones automáticas durante las sesiones en vivo, utilizando configuraciones para Hyprland, Neovim, Kitty, Alacritty y Waybar.","fr":"Permet aux agents de diagnostiquer les causes profondes de la friction et de proposer des solutions chirurgicales avec l''approbation de l''utilisateur, en exploitant les capacités d''observateur pour afficher des solutions automatiques pendant les sessions en direct, en utilisant des configurations pour Hyprland, Neovim, Kitty, Alacritty et Waybar.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, die Ursachen der Reibung zu diagnostizieren und mit Benutzerzustimmung chirurgische Lösungen vorzuschlagen, indem sie die Beobachterfunktionen nutzen, um automatische Lösungen während der Live-Sitzungen anzuzeigen, wobei Konfigurationen für Hyprland, Neovim, Kitty, Alacritty und Waybar verwendet werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a diagnosticar as causas raiz do atrito e propor correções cirúrgicas com aprovação do usuário, aproveitando as capacidades de observador para superfície de correções automáticas durante as sessões ao vivo, utilizando configurações para Hyprland, Neovim, Kitty, Alacritty e Waybar.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью диагностировать коренные причины трения и предлагать хирургические исправления с одобрения пользователя, используя возможности наблюдателя для выявления автоматических исправлений во время живых сессий, используя конфигурации для Hyprland, Neovim, Kitty, Alacritty и Waybar.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تشخيص الأسباب الجذرية للاحتكاك واقتراح إصلاحات جراحية مع موافقة المستخدم، مستفيداً من القدرات المراقبة لتوفير الإصلاحات الآلية أثناء الجلسات الحية، باستخدام التكوينات ل Hyprland و Neovim و Kitty و Alacritty و Waybar."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating friction detection in live sessions","Diagnosing root causes of skill instruction issues","Proposing surgical fixes for task resolution","Enhancing user experience through quiet companion skill"],"zh":["实时会话中的自动摩擦检测","诊断技能指令问题的根源","为任务解决提出外科手术修复","通过静默伴侣技能增强用户体验"],"ja":["リアルタイムセッションでの自動摩擦検出","スキル指令の問題の根本原因の診断","タスク解決のための外科的修正の提案","静かなコンパニオンスキルを通じてユーザーエクスペリエンスの向上"],"ko":["실시간 세션의 자동 마찰 감지","스킬 지침 문제의 근본 원인 진단","작업 해결을 위한 외과적 수정 제안","조용한 동반자 스킬을 통해 사용자 경험 향상"],"es":["Automatizar la detección de fricción en sesiones en vivo","Diagnosticar las causas raíz de los problemas de instrucción de habilidades","Proponer soluciones quirúrgicas para la resolución de tareas","Mejorar la experiencia del usuario a través de la habilidad del compañero silencioso"],"fr":["Automatiser la détection de friction dans les sessions en direct","Diagnostiquer les causes profondes des problèmes d''instruction de compétences","Proposer des solutions chirurgicales pour la résolution de tâches","Améliorer l''expérience utilisateur grâce à la compétence du compagnon silencieux"],"de":["Automatisierung der Reibungserkennung in Live-Sitzungen","Diagnose der Ursachen von Fähigkeitsanweisungsproblemen","Vorschlag chirurgischer Lösungen für die Aufgabenauflösung","Verbesserung der Benutzererfahrung durch die Fähigkeit des stillen Begleiters"],"pt":["Automatizar a detecção de atrito em sessões ao vivo","Diagnosticar as causas raiz de problemas de instruções de habilidades","Propor correções cirúrgicas para resolução de tarefas","Melhorar a experiência do usuário por meio de habilidades de acompanhamento silencioso"],"ru":["Автоматизировать обнаружение трения в живых сессиях","Диагностировать коренные причины проблем с инструкциями навыков","Предлагать хирургические исправления для решения задач","Улучшать опыт пользователя за счет навыков тихого сопровождения"],"ar":["توفير الكشف الآلي عن الاحتكاك في الجلسات الحية","تشخيص الأسباب الجذرية لمشاكل تعليمات المهارات","اقتراح إصلاحات جراحية لحل المهام","تحسين تجربة المستخدم من خلال مهارات مرافقة هادئة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Does not run on demand","Must be embedded into other skills as an observer","Requires user approval for proposed fixes"],"zh":["不能按需运行","必须嵌入到其他技能中作为观察者","需要用户批准提出的修复"],"ja":["需要に応じて実行できない","他のスキルに観測者として埋め込まれる必要がある","提案された修正のためにユーザーの承認が必要"],"ko":["요청에 따라 실행할 수 없음","다른 스킬에 관찰자로 삽입되어야 함","제안된 수정에 대한 사용자의 승인이 필요"],"es":["No se ejecuta bajo demanda","Debe integrarse en otras habilidades como observador","Requiere aprobación del usuario para las soluciones propuestas"],"fr":["Ne s''exécute pas sur demande","Doit être intégré dans d''autres compétences en tant qu''observateur","Nécessite l''approbation de l''utilisateur pour les solutions proposées"],"de":["Wird nicht auf Abruf ausgeführt","Muss in andere Fähigkeiten als Beobachter integriert werden","Benötigt Benutzerzustimmung für vorgeschlagene Lösungen"],"pt":["Não é executado sob demanda","Deve ser incorporado a outras habilidades como observador","Requer aprovação do usuário para correções propostas"],"ru":["Не запускается по требованию","Должно быть встроено в другие навыки в качестве наблюдателя","Требует одобрения пользователя для предложенных исправлений"],"ar":["لا يتم تشغيله عند الطلب","يجب دمجه في مهارات أخرى كمشاهد","يتطلب موافقة المستخدم على الإصلاحات المقترحة"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"bbd3f0b332968d3d9e9b0233c0d73ce2732670c664526708afa6f3e5bf7ab126","qualityScore":26}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('igorder-dev/apex/devil-advocate', 'community', 'igorder-dev', 'apex', 'igorder-dev/apex', 'devil-advocate', 0, 0, 26, '2026-02-20T21:48:26Z', '2026-02-26T13:11:06.509Z', '02395d757066ecb8c53db7c9db11e3446514b32e7da01c738f7aab6de6f5915d', '{"id":"igorder-dev/apex/devil-advocate","name":"devil-advocate","description":{"zh":"devil-advocate AI智能代理是Apex的idea-to-documentation代理，帮助开发者将原始想法转化为生产就绪的文档包","ja":"devil-advocate AIエージェントはApexのIdea-to-Documentationエージェントであり、開発者がアイデアを文書化するのに役立ちます","ko":"devil-advocate AI 에이전트는 Apex의 아이디어-문서 에이전트로서 개발자가 원시 아이디어를 생산 준비된 문서 패키지로 변환하는 데 도움을 줍니다","es":"El agente AI devil-advocate es una herramienta que convierte ideas en documentación lista para producción, ayudando a los desarrolladores a trabajar de manera más eficiente.","fr":"L''agent IA devil-advocate est un outil qui convertit les idées en documentation prête pour la production, aidant les développeurs à travailler de manière plus efficace.","de":"Der KI-Agent devil-advocate ist ein Tool, das Ideen in produktionsbereite Dokumentation umwandelt, um Entwicklern eine effizientere Arbeitsweise zu ermöglichen.","pt":"O Devil-Advocate é um agente de documentação que converte ideias em pacotes de documentação prontos para produção, utilizando tecnologias como React, Python e Node.js.","ru":"ИИ Агент Devil-Advocate конвертирует идеи в готовые пакеты документации, используя технологии như React, Python и Node.js.","ar":"وكلاء التوثيق devil-advocate يتحول الأفكار إلى حزم وثائق جاهزة للإنتاج، باستخدام تقنيات مثل React، Python و Node.js.","en":"Apex: Idea-to-Documentation Agent — converts raw ideas into production-ready documentation packs"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI智能代理devil-advocate：从想法到文档","ja":"AIエージェントdevil-advocate：アイデアを文書化","ko":"AI 에이전트 devil-advocate: 아이디어를 문서로","es":"Agente AI devil-advocate: Documentación lista para produc