,"다양한 문서 형식을 지원","사용하기 쉬운 인터페이스","팀 협력을 지원"],"es":["Conversión de ideas en documentación lista para producción","Automatización de la documentación","Integración con herramientas de desarrollo","Compatibilidad con múltiples formatos de documentación","Interfaz de usuario intuitiva"],"fr":["Conversion d''idées en documentation prête pour la production","Automatisation de la documentation","Intégration avec les outils de développement","Compatibilité avec plusieurs formats de documentation","Interface utilisateur intuitive"],"de":["Umwandlung von Ideen in produktionsbereite Dokumentation","Automatisierung der Dokumentation","Integration mit Entwicklungstools","Kompatibilität mit mehreren Dokumentationsformaten","Benutzerfreundliche Oberfläche"],"pt":["Conversão de ideias em documentação pronta para produção","Integração com tecnologias como React, Python e Node.js","Criação de pacotes de documentação personalizados","Suporte a múltiplos formatos de documentação","Interface de usuário intuitiva e fácil de usar"],"ru":["Конвертация идей в готовые пакеты документации","Интеграция с технологиями seperti React, Python и Node.js","Создание индивидуальных пакетов документации","Поддержка нескольких форматов документации","Интуитивно понятный и простой в использовании интерфейс"],"ar":["تحويل الأفكار إلى حزم وثائق جاهزة للإنتاج","التكامل مع تقنيات مثل React، Python و Node.js","إنشاء حزم وثائق مخصصة","دعم عدة صيغ للوثائق","واجهة مستخدم متوافق وسهلة الاستخدام"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能代理","devil-advocate","idea-to-documentation","开发效率","文档包","如何使用devil-advocate","devil-advocate安装","devil-advocate替代品"],"ja":["AIエージェント","devil-advocate","Idea-to-Documentation","開発効率","文書化","devil-advocateの使い方","devil-advocateのインストール","devil-advocateの代替"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","devil-advocate","아이디어-문서","개발 효율성","문서 패키지","devil-advocate 사용법","devil-advocate 설치","devil-advocate 대체"],"es":["agente AI","herramienta de documentación","automatización de documentación","desarrollo de software","documentación técnica","guias de uso","instalación de herramientas","configuración de herramientas"],"fr":["agent IA","outil de documentation","automatisation de la documentation","développement de logiciels","documentation technique","guides d''utilisation","installation d''outils","configuration d''outils"],"de":["KI-Agent","Dokumentationswerkzeug","Automatisierung der Dokumentation","Software-Entwicklung","technische Dokumentation","Benutzerhandbücher","Installation von Tools","Konfiguration von Tools"],"pt":["como usar o devil-advocate","o que é um agente de documentação","devil-advocate vs competidores","instalar o devil-advocate","guia de configuração do devil-advocate","ferramentas de ia para documentação","desenvolvimento de software com devil-advocate"],"ru":["как использовать ИИ Агент devil-advocate","что такое ИИ Агент документации","devil-advocate vs конкуренты","установить ИИ Агент devil-advocate","руководство по настройке devil-advocate","инструменты ИИ для документации","разработка программного обеспечения с devil-advocate"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام وكلاء التوثيق devil-advocate","ما هو وكلاء التوثيق","devil-advocate vs المنافسين","تثبيت وكلاء التوثيق devil-advocate","دليل إعداد وكلاء التوثيق devil-advocate","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للتوثيق","تنمية البرمجيات مع وكلاء التوثيق devil-advocate"]}},"owner":"igorder-dev","repo":"apex","repoPath":"igorder-dev/apex","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-20T21:48:26Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"devil-advocate","description":">","bodyPreview":"# Devil''s Advocate Analysis (Enhanced)\n\nWhen performing devil''s advocate analysis, follow this structured approach:\n\n## Trigger Conditions\nActivate this skill when:\n- A technology choice is being made (database, framework, hosting, etc.)\n- An architectural decision is being documented in an ADR\n- A build-vs-buy decision arises\n- The user is confident in an approach that has non-obvious risks\n- Feature prioritization involves significant tradeoffs\n- **After every document generation** (automatic","body":"# Devil''s Advocate Analysis (Enhanced)\n\nWhen performing devil''s advocate analysis, follow this structured approach:\n\n## Trigger Conditions\nActivate this skill when:\n- A technology choice is being made (database, framework, hosting, etc.)\n- An architectural decision is being documented in an ADR\n- A build-vs-buy decision arises\n- The user is confident in an approach that has non-obvious risks\n- Feature prioritization involves significant tradeoffs\n- **After every document generation** (automatic — scope critique)\n\n## Analysis Structure\n\n### Level 1: Decision Critique\n\n#### 1. Steel-man the current position\nBefore attacking, present the BEST case for the current choice. This shows fairness and ensures the critique is against a strong version of the argument.\n\n#### 2. Identify the three biggest risks\nFor each risk:\n- **Probability**: How likely is this to happen? (cite evidence)\n- **Impact**: What happens if it does?\n- **Detectability**: Will we know before it''s too late?\n- **Mitigation**: Can we reduce the risk while keeping the choice?\n\n#### 3. Name the best alternative\nNot a strawman — the genuine best alternative approach. Explain when it would be the right choice.\n\n#### 4. Identify reversibility\n- **Easily reversible**: Low-cost to change later → proceed with less analysis\n- **Costly to reverse**: Significant migration → more analysis warranted\n- **Irreversible**: Permanent commitment → maximum scrutiny required\n\n#### 5. Deliver verdict\nAlways end with a clear, actionable recommendation. Never leave the user in analysis paralysis.\n\n### Level 2: Scope Critique (Run after every document)\nAsk these SPECIFIC questions:\n- **\"What did we FORGET?\"** — actively search for missing requirements\n- **\"What breaks when this fails?\"** — failure mode analysis\n- **\"What does the user need that they didn''t ask for?\"** — implicit requirements\n- **\"What would a regulatory auditor / security researcher / angry customer flag?\"**\n\n### Level 3: \"First Day on the Job\" Test\nImagine a developer reading this doc pack on Day 1:\n- Can they set up the project without asking questions?\n- Do they know which doc to read for which task?\n- Is there a clear path from \"I just cloned the repo\" to \"I deployed my first change\"?\n- Are gotchas and non-obvious constraints highlighted?\n\n## Minimum Gaps Rule\nThe devil''s advocate MUST identify at least 2 potential gaps or concerns per document.\nIf you genuinely can''t find any, state: \"No gaps identified — this document is comprehensive.\"\nThis forces active gap-seeking rather than rubber-stamping.\n\n## Tone\n- Respectful but direct\n- Evidence-based, not opinion-based\n- Acknowledge when the current choice IS the best option\n- Never artificially inflate risks to seem thorough\n- Focus on SCOPE gaps (what''s missing?) not just DECISION quality (is this the right choice?)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-26T13:11:06.509Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Critical Thinking Agents needing structured risk assessment and decision-making capabilities in technology choices, architectural decisions, and feature prioritization.","zh":"适合需要结构化风险评估和决策能力的批判性思维代理，特别是在技术选择、架构决策和功能优先级方面。","ja":"批判的思考エージェントが技術の選択、建築上の決定、機能の優先順位において構造化されたリスク評価と意思決定機能を必要とする場合に適しています。","ko":"기술 선택, 아키텍처 결정 및 기능 우선 순위에서 구조화된 위험 평가 및 의사 결정 기능이 필요한 비판적 사고 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de Pensamiento Crítico que necesitan una evaluación de riesgos estructurada y capacidades de toma de decisiones en elecciones tecnológicas, decisiones arquitectónicas y priorización de características.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de Pensée Critique nécessitant une évaluation des risques structurée et des capacités de prise de décision dans les choix technologiques, les décisions architecturales et la priorisation des fonctionnalités.","de":"Ideal für Critical Thinking Agents, die eine strukturierte Risikobewertung und Entscheidungskapazitäten bei Technologieauswahlen, Architekturentscheidungen und Feature-Priorisierung benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Pensamento Crítico que necessitam de avaliação de risco estruturada e capacidades de tomada de decisões em escolhas tecnológicas, decisões arquiteturais e priorização de recursos, utilizando React, Python, CLI, API e outros frameworks.","ru":"Идеально для Агентов Критического Мышления, требующих структурированной оценки риска и возможностей принятия решений при выборе технологий, архитектурных решений и определении приоритетов функций, используя React, Python, CLI, API и другие фреймворки.","ar":"مثالية لعمليات التفكير النقدي التي تحتاج إلى تقييم مخاطر منظم وقدرات اتخاذ القرارات في الخيارات التكنولوجية والقرارات المعمارية وتحديد أولويات الميزات، باستخدام React و Python و CLI و API وأطر عمل أخرى."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to perform thorough devil''s advocate analysis using trigger conditions, including technology choices, architectural decisions, and build-vs-buy decisions, while considering non-obvious risks and significant tradeoffs in ADR documentation and automatic document generation.","zh":"赋予代理执行彻底的反对派分析，包括技术选择、架构决策和自建与购买决策，考虑到非明显的风险和ADR文档以及自动文档生成中的重大权衡。","ja":"技術の選択、建築上の決定、ビルド対買い決策を含む徹底的なデビルズアドボケート分析をエージェントに実行させることができます。ADR文書および自動文書生成における非明らかなリスクや重大なトレードオフも考慮されます。","ko":"기술 선택, 아키텍처 결정 및 빌드 대 구매 결정 등을 포함한 철저한 반대파 분석을 에이전트가 수행할 수 있도록 합니다. ADR 문서 및 자동 문서 생성에서 명백하지 않은 위험 및重大한 트레이드 오프도 고려됩니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a realizar un análisis exhaustivo de abogado del diablo utilizando condiciones de activación, incluyendo elecciones tecnológicas, decisiones arquitectónicas y decisiones de construcción versus compra, considerando riesgos no obvios y compensaciones significativas en la documentación ADR y la generación automática de documentos.","fr":"Permet aux agents de réaliser une analyse approfondie de l''avocat du diable en utilisant des conditions de déclenchement, notamment les choix technologiques, les décisions architecturales et les décisions de construction versus achat, en tenant compte des risques non évidents et des compromis significatifs dans la documentation ADR et la génération automatique de documents.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, eine gründliche Teufelsanwalt-Analyse unter Verwendung von Triggerbedingungen durchzuführen, einschließlich Technologieauswahlen, Architekturentscheidungen und Build-vs-Buy-Entscheidungen, unter Berücksichtigung nicht offensichtlicher Risiken und wesentlicher Kompromisse in der ADR-Dokumentation und der automatischen Dokumentenerzeugung.","pt":"Habilite os agentes a realizar uma análise completa de advogado do diabo usando condições de acionamento, incluindo escolhas tecnológicas, decisões arquiteturais e decisões de construção versus compra, considerando riscos não óbvios e compromissos significativos na documentação ADR e geração automática de documentos.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проводить тщательный анализ адвоката дьявола с использованием условий срабатывания, включая выбор технологий, архитектурные решения и решения о построении или покупке, учитывая неочевидные риски и значительные компромиссы в документации ADR и автоматической генерации документов.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من إجراء تحليل شامل لمحامي الشيطان باستخدام شروط التفعيل، بما في ذلك الخيارات التكنولوجية والقرارات المعمارية و القرارات بين البناء والشراء، مع مراعاة المخاطر غير الواضحة والتنازلات الكبيرة في توثيق ADR وتوليد المستندات التلقائي."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating risk assessments in ADR documentation","Generating alternative solutions for build-vs-buy decisions","Debugging non-obvious risks in feature prioritization","Validating architectural decisions with thorough analysis"],"zh":["自动化ADR文档中的风险评估","为自建与购买决策生成替代解决方案","在功能优先级中调试非明显的风险","使用彻底的分析验证架构决策"],"ja":["ADR文書におけるリスク評価の自動化","ビルド対買い決策のための代替ソリューションの生成","機能優先順位における非明らかなリスクのデバッグ","徹底的な分析によるアーキテクチャ上の決定の検証"],"ko":["ADR 문서의 위험 평가 자동화","빌드 대 구매 결정의 대안 솔루션 생성","기능 우선 순위의 명백하지 않은 위험 디버깅","철저한 분석을 통한 아키텍처 결정 검증"],"es":["Automatización de evaluaciones de riesgos en la documentación ADR","Generación de soluciones alternativas para decisiones de construcción versus compra","Depuración de riesgos no obvios en la priorización de características","Validación de decisiones arquitectónicas con un análisis exhaustivo"],"fr":["Automatisation des évaluations de risques dans la documentation ADR","Génération de solutions alternatives pour les décisions de construction versus achat","Débogage des risques non évidents dans la priorisation des fonctionnalités","Validation des décisions architecturales avec une analyse approfondie"],"de":["Automatisierung von Risikobewertungen in der ADR-Dokumentation","Erzeugung von alternativen Lösungen für Build-vs-Buy-Entscheidungen","Fehlerbehebung nicht offensichtlicher Risiken bei der Priorisierung von Features","Validierung von Architekturentscheidungen mit einer gründlichen Analyse"],"pt":["Automatizar avaliações de risco na documentação ADR","Gerar soluções alternativas para decisões de construção versus compra","Depurar riscos não óbvios na priorização de recursos","Validar decisões arquiteturais com análise completa"],"ru":["Автоматизировать оценку риска в документации ADR","Генерировать альтернативные решения для решений о построении или покупке","Отлаживать неочевидные риски при определении приоритетов функций","Проверять архитектурные решения с помощью тщательного анализа"],"ar":["تحسين تقييم المخاطر في توثيق ADR","إنتاج حلول بديلة للقرارات بين البناء والشراء","تصحيح أخطاء المخاطر غير الواضحة في تحديد أولويات الميزات","التحقق من صحة القرارات المعمارية من خلال التحليل الشامل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires explicit trigger conditions","Limited to decision-making and risk assessment contexts","Needs integration with document generation pipelines"],"zh":["需要显式的触发条件","仅限于决策和风险评估的背景","需要与文档生成管道集成"],"ja":["明示的なトリガー条件が必要","意思決定およびリスク評価のコンテキストのみ","文書生成パイプラインとの統合が必要"],"ko":["명시적인 트리거 조건이 필요","의사 결정 및 위험 평가의 컨텍스트만","문서 생성 파이프라인과 통합이 필요"],"es":["Requiere condiciones de activación explícitas","Limitado a contextos de toma de decisiones y evaluación de riesgos","Necesita integración con pipelines de generación de documentos"],"fr":["Nécessite des conditions de déclenchement explicites","Limité aux contextes de prise de décision et d''évaluation des risques","Nécessite une intégration avec les pipelines de génération de documents"],"de":["Benötigt explizite Triggerbedingungen","Begrenzt auf Entscheidungs- und Risikobewertungskontexte","Benötigt eine Integration mit Dokumentenerzeugungspipelines"],"pt":["Exige condições de acionamento explícitas","Limitado a contextos de tomada de decisões e avaliação de riscos","Necessita de integração com pipelines de geração de documentos"],"ru":["Требует явных условий срабатывания","Ограничен контекстами принятия решений и оценки риска","Требует интеграции с конвейерами генерации документов"],"ar":["يتطلب شروط تفعيل صريحة","محدود بالسياقات المتعلقة باتخاذ القرارات وتقييم المخاطر","يحتاج إلى تكامل مع خطوط أنابيب توليد المستندات"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"02395d757066ecb8c53db7c9db11e3446514b32e7da01c738f7aab6de6f5915d","qualityScore":26}');
