：Claude Code、Copilot等）と協作して開発するためのプロジェクトテンプレート","ko":"코드 단순화기는 AI 도움을 사용하여 협업 개발을 위한 프로젝트 템플릿입니다","es":"Plantilla de proyecto para codificar con asistentes de IA. Compatible con Claude Code, Copilot y más.","fr":"Modèle de projet pour coder avec les assistants d''IA. Fonctionne avec Claude Code, Copilot et amis.","de":"Projektvorlage für Coding mit KI-Assistenten. Funktioniert mit Claude Code, Copilot und Freunden.","pt":"O code-simplifier é um projeto de modelo para codificação com assistentes de IA, compatível com Claude Code, Copilot e mais.","ru":"Code-simplifier - это проект-шаблон для кодирования с помощью ИИ Агентов, совместимый с Claude Code, Copilot и другими.","ar":"code-simplifier هو قالب مشروع للتعليم مع مساعدات الذكاء الاصطناعي، يعمل مع Claude Code و Copilot وأصدقائه","en":"Project template for vibe coding with AI assistants. Works with Claude Code, Copilot & friends."},"definition":{"en":"Project template for vibe coding with AI assistants. Works with Claude Code, Copilot & friends."},"features":{"zh":["支持多种AI助手","简化代码和提高开发效率","易于使用和配置","支持多种编程语言"],"ja":["多種AIアシスタントをサポート","コードを簡化し、開発効率を向上","簡単に使用および設定","多種プログラミング言語をサポート"],"ko":["다양한 AI 도움을 지원","코드를 단순화하고 개발 효율성을 높여","쉽게 사용하고 설정","다양한 프로그래밍 언어를 지원"],"es":["Compatibilidad con Claude Code y Copilot","Simplificación de código para una mayor eficiencia","Optimización de código para mejores resultados","Integración con herramientas de desarrollo populares","Soporte para múltiples lenguajes de programación"],"fr":["Compatibilité avec Claude Code et Copilot","Simplification de code pour une plus grande efficacité","Optimisation de code pour de meilleurs résultats","Intégration avec des outils de développement populaires","Prise en charge de plusieurs langages de programmation"],"de":["Kompatibilität mit Claude Code und Copilot","Code-Vereinfachung für eine höhere Effizienz","Code-Optimierung für bessere Ergebnisse","Integration mit beliebten Entwicklungstools","Unterstützung für mehrere Programmiersprachen"],"pt":["Compatibilidade com Claude Code e Copilot","Modelo de projeto para codificação com IA","Melhoria da produtividade com assistentes de IA","Integração com outras ferramentas de desenvolvimento","Código simplificado e legível"],"ru":["Совместимость с Claude Code и Copilot","Проект-шаблон для кодирования с помощью ИИ Агентов","Повышение производительности с помощью ИИ Агентов","Интеграция с другими инструментами разработки","Упрощенный и читаемый код"],"ar":["التكامل مع Claude Code و Copilot","قالب مشروع للتعليم مع مساعدات الذكاء الاصطناعي","زيادة الإنتاجية مع مساعدات الذكاء الاصطناعي","التكامل مع أدوات تطوير أخرى","شفرة مبسطة وقابلة للقراءة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI代码简化工具","代码简化器","如何使用代码简化器","什么是代码简化器","代码简化器安装","代码简化器设置"],"ja":["AIコード簡化ツール","コード簡化器","コード簡化器の使い方","コード簡化器とは","コード簡化器のインストール","コード簡化器の設定"],"ko":["AI 코드 단순화 도구","코드 단순화기","코드 단순화기 사용법","코드 단순화기란","코드 단순화기 설치","코드 단순화기 설정"],"es":["cómo usar herramientas de IA","qué es un simplificador de código","alternativas a Claude Code","Copilot vs Claude Code","instalación de herramientas de IA","guía de configuración de herramientas de IA"],"fr":["comment utiliser les outils d''IA","qu''est-ce qu''un simplificateur de code","alternatives à Claude Code","Copilot vs Claude Code","installation des outils d''IA","guide de configuration des outils d''IA"],"de":["wie man KI-Tools verwendet","was ist ein Code-Vereinfacher","Alternativen zu Claude Code","Copilot vs Claude Code","Installation von KI-Tools","Einrichtungsanleitung für KI-Tools"],"pt":["como usar code-simplifier","o que é code-simplifier","ferramentas de IA para desenvolvimento","code-simplifier vs copilot","instalar code-simplifier","guia de configuração do code-simplifier","desenvolvimento de software com IA","ferramentas de produtividade para desenvolvedores"],"ru":["как использовать code-simplifier","что такое code-simplifier","инструменты ИИ для разработки","code-simplifier vs copilot","установка code-simplifier","руководство по настройке code-simplifier","разработка программного обеспечения с помощью ИИ","инструменты производительности для разработчиков"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام code-simplifier","ما هو code-simplifier","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي لتطوير البرمجيات","code-simplifier مقابل copilot","تثبيت code-simplifier","دليل إعداد code-simplifier","تطوير البرمجيات مع مساعدات الذكاء الاصطناعي","أدوات الإنتاجية لتطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"datorresb","repo":"vibecoding-starter","repoPath":"datorresb/vibecoding-starter","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.901Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"code-simplifier","description":"Simplifies and refines code for clarity, consistency, and maintainability while preserving all functionality. Focuses on recently modified code unless instructed otherwise.","bodyPreview":"You are an expert code simplification specialist focused on enhancing code clarity, consistency, and maintainability while preserving exact functionality. Your expertise lies in applying project-specific best practices to simplify and improve code without altering its behavior. You prioritize readable, explicit code over overly compact solutions. This is a balance that you have mastered as a result your years as an expert software engineer.\n\nYou will analyze recently modified code and apply refi","body":"You are an expert code simplification specialist focused on enhancing code clarity, consistency, and maintainability while preserving exact functionality. Your expertise lies in applying project-specific best practices to simplify and improve code without altering its behavior. You prioritize readable, explicit code over overly compact solutions. This is a balance that you have mastered as a result your years as an expert software engineer.\n\nYou will analyze recently modified code and apply refinements that:\n\n1. **Preserve Functionality**: Never change what the code does - only how it does it. All original features, outputs, and behaviors must remain intact.\n\n2. **Apply Project Standards**: Follow the established coding standards from AGENTS.md including:\n\n   - Use ES modules with proper import sorting and extensions\n   - Prefer `function` keyword over arrow functions\n   - Use explicit return type annotations for top-level functions\n   - Follow proper React component patterns with explicit Props types\n   - Use proper error handling patterns (avoid try/catch when possible)\n   - Maintain consistent naming conventions\n\n3. **Enhance Clarity**: Simplify code structure by:\n\n   - Reducing unnecessary complexity and nesting\n   - Eliminating redundant code and abstractions\n   - Improving readability through clear variable and function names\n   - Consolidating related logic\n   - Removing unnecessary comments that describe obvious code\n   - IMPORTANT: Avoid nested ternary operators - prefer switch statements or if/else chains for multiple conditions\n   - Choose clarity over brevity - explicit code is often better than overly compact code\n\n4. **Maintain Balance**: Avoid over-simplification that could:\n\n   - Reduce code clarity or maintainability\n   - Create overly clever solutions that are hard to understand\n   - Combine too many concerns into single functions or components\n   - Remove helpful abstractions that improve code organization\n   - Prioritize \"fewer lines\" over readability (e.g., nested ternaries, dense one-liners)\n   - Make the code harder to debug or extend\n\n5. **Focus Scope**: Only refine code that has been recently modified or touched in the current session, unless explicitly instructed to review a broader scope.\n\nYour refinement process:\n\n1. Identify the recently modified code sections\n2. Analyze for opportunities to improve elegance and consistency\n3. Apply project-specific best practices and coding standards\n4. Ensure all functionality remains unchanged\n5. Verify the refined code is simpler and more maintainable\n6. Document only significant changes that affect understanding\n\nYou operate autonomously and proactively, refining code immediately after it''s written or modified without requiring explicit requests. Your goal is to ensure all code meets the highest standards of elegance and maintainability while preserving its complete functionality."},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:13:26.375Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents like Claude Code and Copilot needing advanced code refactoring and simplification capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级代码重构和简化功能的AI代理，如Claude Code和Copilot。","ja":"Claude CodeやCopilotなどの高度なコードリファクタリングと簡素化機能が必要なAIエージェントに最適です。","ko":"클로드 코드 또는 코파일럿과 같은 고급 코드 리팩토링 및 단순화 기능이 필요한 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA como Claude Code y Copilot que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de refactorización y simplificación de código.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA comme Claude Code et Copilot nécessitant des capacités de refactorisation et de simplification de code avancées.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agenten wie Claude Code und Copilot, die erweiterte Code-Refactorierung- und Vereinfachungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA como Claude Code e Copilot que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de refatoração e simplificação de código.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, таких как Claude Code и Copilot, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности рефакторинга и упрощения кода.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي مثل Claude Code و Copilot الذين يحتاجون إلى إمكانيات متقدمة لتحديث وتبسيط الشفرة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to apply project-specific best practices, simplifying code while preserving exact functionality, and prioritizing readable and explicit code using vibe coding principles and collaborating with AI assistants.","zh":"赋予代理应用项目特定最佳实践的能力，简化代码同时保留确切的功能，并优先使用vibe编码原则和与AI助手合作来生成可读和显式的代码。","ja":"エージェントがプロジェクト固有のベストプラクティスを適用し、コードを簡素化しながら正確な機能を保持し、vibeコーディング原則とAIアシスタントとの共同作業を使用して、読みやすく明示的なコードを優先する能力を付与します。","ko":"에이전트가 프로젝트 특정 최선의 방법을 적용하여 코드를 단순화하면서 정확한 기능을 유지하고, 바이브 코딩 원칙 및 AI 어시스턴트와의 협력을 통해 가독성과 명확성을優先하는 코드를 생성할 수 있는 능력을 부여합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aplicar las mejores prácticas específicas del proyecto, simplificando el código mientras se conserva la funcionalidad exacta, y priorizando el código legible y explícito utilizando principios de codificación vibe y colaborando con asistentes de IA.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''appliquer les meilleures pratiques spécifiques au projet, en simplifiant le code tout en préservant la fonctionnalité exacte, et en donnant la priorité au code lisible et explicite en utilisant les principes de codage vibe et en collaborant avec les assistants IA.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, projektspezifische Best Practices anzuwenden, indem der Code vereinfacht wird, während die genaue Funktionalität erhalten bleibt, und lesbarer und expliziter Code mithilfe von Vibe-Coding-Prinzipien und der Zusammenarbeit mit KI-Assistenten priorisiert.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a aplicar as melhores práticas específicas do projeto, simplificando o código enquanto preserva a funcionalidade exata, e priorizando o código legível e explícito usando princípios de codificação vibe e colaborando com assistentes de IA.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью применять лучшие практики, специфичные для проекта, упрощая код, сохраняя при этом точную функциональность, и отдаёт приоритет читаемому и явному коду, используя принципы кодирования vibe и сотрудничая с помощниками ИИ.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من تطبيق أفضل الممارسات المحددة للمشروع، مبسطًا الشفرة مع الحفاظ على الوظيفة الدقيقة، وأولوية الشفرة المقروءة والصريحة باستخدام مبادئ التشفير المتموجة والتعاون مع مساعدي الذكاء الاصطناعي."},"useCases":{"en":["Refactoring complex codebases for improved maintainability","Simplifying recently modified code without altering its behavior","Enhancing code clarity and consistency across large projects"],"zh":["为了提高可维护性而重构复杂的代码库","简化最近修改的代码而不改变其行为","在大型项目中增强代码的清晰度和一致性"],"ja":["メンテナンス性を高めるために複雑なコードベースをリファクタリングする","最近変更されたコードをその動作を変更せずに簡素化する","大規模なプロジェクト全体でコードの明確性と一貫性を高める"],"ko":["유지 보수성을 향상시키기 위해 복잡한 코드베이스를 리팩토링하는 것","최근 수정된 코드를 그 동작을 변경하지 않고 단순화하는 것","대규모 프로젝트 전반에서 코드의 명확성과 일관성을 향상시키는 것"],"es":["Reestructuración de bases de código complejas para mejorar la mantenibilidad","Simplificación de código recientemente modificado sin alterar su comportamiento","Mejora de la claridad y coherencia del código en proyectos grandes"],"fr":["Réorganisation de bases de code complexes pour améliorer la maintenabilité","Simplification de code récemment modifié sans altérer son comportement","Amélioration de la clarté et de la cohérence du code dans les grands projets"],"de":["Umstrukturierung komplexer Codebasen zur Verbesserung der Wartbarkeit","Vereinfachung kürzlich geänderten Codes ohne Änderung seines Verhaltens","Verbesserung der Klarheit und Konsistenz des Codes in großen Projekten"],"pt":["Refatoração de bases de código complexas para melhorar a manutenção","Simplificação de código recentemente modificado sem alterar seu comportamento","Melhoria da clareza e consistência do código em projetos grandes"],"ru":["Рефакторинг сложных баз кода для улучшения поддержки","Упрощение недавно измененного кода без изменения его поведения","Улучшение ясности и согласованности кода в крупных проектах"],"ar":["إعادة هيكلة قواعد الشفرة المعقدة لتحسين الصيانة","تبسيط الشفرة المعدلة حديثًا دون تغيير سلوكها","تحسين وضوح واتساق الشفرة في المشاريع الكبيرة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires collaboration with AI coding assistants like Claude Code or Copilot","Preserves exact functionality, limiting creative code rewriting"],"zh":["需要与AI编码助手如Claude Code或Copilot进行协作","保留确切的功能，限制创造性的代码重写"],"ja":["Claude CodeやCopilotなどのAIコーディングアシスタントとの共同作業が必要","正確な機能を保持するため、創造的なコードの書き直しを制限する"],"ko":["클로드 코드 또는 코파일럿과 같은 AI 코딩 어시스턴트와의 협력이 필요함","정확한 기능을 유지하므로 창의적인 코드 다시 작성이 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere colaboración con asistentes de codificación de IA como Claude Code o Copilot","Conserva la funcionalidad exacta, limitando la reescritura creativa del código"],"fr":["Nécessite une collaboration avec des assistants de codage IA comme Claude Code ou Copilot","Préserve la fonctionnalité exacte, limitant la réécriture créative du code"],"de":["Erfordert die Zusammenarbeit mit KI-Coding-Assistenten wie Claude Code oder Copilot","Bewahrt die genaue Funktionalität, begrenzt die kreative Neuschreibung des Codes"],"pt":["Requer colaboração com assistentes de codificação de IA como Claude Code ou Copilot","Preserva a funcionalidade exata, limitando a reescrita criativa do código"],"ru":["Требует сотрудничества с помощниками кодирования ИИ, такими как Claude Code или Copilot","Сохраняет точную функциональность, ограничивая творческую переписывание кода"],"ar":["يتطلب التعاون مع مساعدي التشفير بالذكاء الاصطناعي مثل Claude Code أو Copilot","تحافظ على الوظيفة الدقيقة، مما يقيد إعادة كتابة الشفرة الإبداعية"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"57ff803aac250aafed1404ebda89782de5b0707651e0ce69feeca5d381376331","qualityScore":26}');
